(5300181, 772418, 84124, '<td valign="top">Why can''t my mornings start with that view??? :-)  Nice, serene, makes me want to be there...</td>', 'Why can''t my mornings start with that view??? :-)  Nice, serene, makes me want to be there...', '2009-03-11 00:05:46.000000', NULL, 1),
