(5300223, 771657, 98339, '<td valign="top">a little small on your sizing, the building in the center is cut off...but then there might have been something in the way...excellent panoramic view</td>', 'a little small on your sizing, the building in the center is cut off...but then there might have been something in the way...excellent panoramic view', '2009-03-11 00:09:27.000000', NULL, 1),
