(5300805, 771858, 44453, '<td valign="top">I''m always amazed by the number of air show photos that get entered here (I''ve never been to one and I don''t know anybody who has) and they are nearly unremarkable.  This however is amazing, there is a real sense of movement, the composition is compelling and the light is remarkable.  gets a 8 from me!</td>', 'I''m always amazed by the number of air show photos that get entered here (I''ve never been to one and I don''t know anybody who has) and they are nearly unremarkable.  This however is amazing, there is a real sense of movement, the composition is compelling and the light is remarkable.  gets a 8 from me!', '2009-03-11 00:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300806, 772307, 37845, '<td valign="top">Really cool glow around the palm in this.</td>', 'Really cool glow around the palm in this.', '2009-03-11 00:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300807, 772119, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and interesting shot. I love the pov, the composition and the details and textures, especially on the boat''s hull,</td>', 'Beautiful and interesting shot. I love the pov, the composition and the details and textures, especially on the boat''s hull,', '2009-03-11 00:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300809, 771423, 98339, '<td valign="top">Sorry, personally this doesn''t appeal to me</td>', 'Sorry, personally this doesn''t appeal to me', '2009-03-11 00:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300810, 771076, 63633, '<td valign="top">A time when childhood could still be dangerous and exhilarating. Looks like such fun!</td>', 'A time when childhood could still be dangerous and exhilarating. Looks like such fun!', '2009-03-11 00:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300811, 770235, 37252, '<td valign="top">pretty colors. I think the contrast around the eye could have been boosted a little to bring emphasis, but I can also appreciate that you may have wanted to show the bird just as he/she truly appears</td>', 'pretty colors. I think the contrast around the eye could have been boosted a little to bring emphasis, but I can also appreciate that you may have wanted to show the bird just as he/she truly appears', '2009-03-11 00:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300812, 771792, 31664, '<td valign="top">Good use of DOF.  nice composition</td>', 'Good use of DOF.  nice composition', '2009-03-11 00:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300813, 770231, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow wonderful shot.  The lighting is so prefect! I hope you have a copy of this blown up and hung in your home!</td>', 'Wow wonderful shot.  The lighting is so prefect! I hope you have a copy of this blown up and hung in your home!', '2009-03-11 00:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300814, 771157, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice action shot</td>', 'nice action shot', '2009-03-11 00:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300815, 771176, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great capture of flight. I like the colour and the dof.</td>', 'Great capture of flight. I like the colour and the dof.', '2009-03-11 00:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5300816, 772130, 37845, '<td valign="top">Intriguing. This portrait looks like it has a story behind it... the skin art, the jewelry, and the headdress. Nice shot.</td>', 'Intriguing. This portrait looks like it has a story behind it... the skin art, the jewelry, and the headdress. Nice shot.', '2009-03-11 00:49:19.000000', NULL, 1);
