(5300892, 772570, 83313, '<td valign="top">Wish I had some of these near me. Wonderful reflections and low clouds here. One nitpick, though. You should have used the full 720 pixels allowed for one direction. That extra 120 pixels would have gained you a lot more detail in this nice scene.</td>', 'Wish I had some of these near me. Wonderful reflections and low clouds here. One nitpick, though. You should have used the full 720 pixels allowed for one direction. That extra 120 pixels would have gained you a lot more detail in this nice scene.', '2009-03-11 00:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
