(5300915, 771720, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love the old country feel of this.  I can''t tell if the guy is feeding the swans or not, they don''t seem to be attracted to him.  Minor nit-pick is the tail of the front swan is cut off.  It may have been better to crop above it''s head and enlarge it all more.</td>', 'I love the old country feel of this.  I can''t tell if the guy is feeding the swans or not, they don''t seem to be attracted to him.  Minor nit-pick is the tail of the front swan is cut off.  It may have been better to crop above it''s head and enlarge it all more.', '2009-03-11 00:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
