(5301080, 771587, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like the color and metallic feel of this</td>', 'I like the color and metallic feel of this', '2009-03-11 01:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5301082, 770510, 97166, '<td valign="top">The palace was beautiful.  As he sat down in front of his easel, his pastels laid out beside him, he smiled a sad little smile.  Mankind was capable of such beauty sometimes, so why was it that they were also so capable of ugliness?  How could one gaze at something like this, created as a monument to imagination and other-worldly power, and then go off and start and fight in the constant wars that humanity seemed always to be engaged in?<br/> <br/>He sighed and shook his head.  Perhaps there was no answer.  Perhaps humanity needed the ugly in order to appreciate the beauty even more.  It was not for him to decide.<br/> <br/>For him, his only decision was in how exactly to capture this beauty and make it his own.<br/> <br/>He began to sketch.</td>', 'The palace was beautiful.  As he sat down in front of his easel, his pastels laid out beside him, he smiled a sad little smile.  Mankind was capable of such beauty sometimes, so why was it that they were also so capable of ugliness?  How could one gaze at something like this, created as a monument to imagination and other-worldly power, and then go off and start and fight in the constant wars that humanity seemed always to be engaged in? He sighed and shook his head.  Perhaps there was no answer.  Perhaps humanity needed the ugly in order to appreciate the beauty even more.  It was not for him to decide. For him, his only decision was in how exactly to capture this beauty and make it his own. He began to sketch.', '2009-03-11 01:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5301083, 770541, 100687, '<td valign="top">The colors are so captivating. I love this!</td>', 'The colors are so captivating. I love this!', '2009-03-11 01:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
