(5301110, 772385, 97166, '<td valign="top">He clung there with a silly grin on his face, thinking about the hour before.  Truly, sometimes, life was grand and the decisions we make improve it no end.  For him, the decision to propose to the love of his life was returned with a positivity and happiness that set his heart afire and his face aglow.<br/> <br/>He clung there with a silly grin on his face, on top of the world.</td>', 'He clung there with a silly grin on his face, thinking about the hour before.  Truly, sometimes, life was grand and the decisions we make improve it no end.  For him, the decision to propose to the love of his life was returned with a positivity and happiness that set his heart afire and his face aglow. He clung there with a silly grin on his face, on top of the world.', '2009-03-11 01:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
