(5301299, 772771, 97166, '<td valign="top">They thought they knew what it was all about.  It was simple geology. Molton rock under pressure in the deeps of the earth, being pushed to the surface, and finding whatever means it could to escape.<br/> <br/>Perfectly natural, they said.<br/> <br/>They couldn''t have been more wrong.<br/> <br/>One day, the evil force that kept pushing to escape its confines and prison in the darkest places of our planet would be free, and its reaching fingers of fiery death would destroy us all.<br/> <br/>Another finger moved ever so slowly towards that day, and this time it eventually burned out, cooled too quickly.  Today was not that day.<br/> <br/>No, but it was coming.</td>', 'They thought they knew what it was all about.  It was simple geology. Molton rock under pressure in the deeps of the earth, being pushed to the surface, and finding whatever means it could to escape. Perfectly natural, they said. They couldn''t have been more wrong. One day, the evil force that kept pushing to escape its confines and prison in the darkest places of our planet would be free, and its reaching fingers of fiery death would destroy us all. Another finger moved ever so slowly towards that day, and this time it eventually burned out, cooled too quickly.  Today was not that day. No, but it was coming.', '2009-03-11 01:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
