(5301351, 772542, 97166, '<td valign="top">She glanced and tilted her head and gave him that grin that told him one thing, and one thing only. <br/> <br/>Did he really want to continue this ''discussion''?  Well, did he?<br/> <br/>He gazed at her and saw the look in her eye just then and decided.<br/> <br/>No, he really didn''t.</td>', 'She glanced and tilted her head and gave him that grin that told him one thing, and one thing only.  Did he really want to continue this ''discussion''?  Well, did he? He gazed at her and saw the look in her eye just then and decided. No, he really didn''t.', '2009-03-11 01:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
