(5301385, 770579, 97166, '<td valign="top">He was having such a great day, rolling and playing in this fantastic white fluffy stuff.  Cool to the touch, and so fun to snap at.  He danced and barked and ...<br/> <br/>... stopped dead as his ears picked up the unmistakable sound of Timmy, in trouble once again!  He perked up his ears, looked off in the direction of the faint cries for help and knew that his fun in the snow was over.<br/> <br/>Now, now it was time for action.</td>', 'He was having such a great day, rolling and playing in this fantastic white fluffy stuff.  Cool to the touch, and so fun to snap at.  He danced and barked and ... ... stopped dead as his ears picked up the unmistakable sound of Timmy, in trouble once again!  He perked up his ears, looked off in the direction of the faint cries for help and knew that his fun in the snow was over. Now, now it was time for action.', '2009-03-11 01:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
