(5301476, 772762, 97166, '<td valign="top">Their love would last a lifetime, or so they insisted.  They were young, and vigorous, and full of happiness and joy.  Their future was bright, their present built on solid foundations, their past a thing of wonderful memory.<br/> <br/>Yet love has a funny way of defying even the best of our intentions, and a lifetime is a long time indeed.<br/> <br/>Yet it never hurts to try, and the journey, no matter how long, shall be filled with story and adventure.</td>', 'Their love would last a lifetime, or so they insisted.  They were young, and vigorous, and full of happiness and joy.  Their future was bright, their present built on solid foundations, their past a thing of wonderful memory. Yet love has a funny way of defying even the best of our intentions, and a lifetime is a long time indeed. Yet it never hurts to try, and the journey, no matter how long, shall be filled with story and adventure.', '2009-03-11 01:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
