(5301547, 772538, 97166, '<td valign="top">He had mere seconds to react, and growled in surprise and shock, flattening his head to brace for the shock.<br/> <br/>*PANG!* The frying pan smote him cleanly, leaving a bruised bump and dazing him completely.<br/> <br/>"I told you to take out the garbage last night Henry!" yelled his wife.<br/> <br/>Henry rubbed his sore head and muttered under his breath.  His mother had warned him not to marry her, but he hadn''t listened, and now his life was just a series of being beaten by a Tigress with a Frying Pan.  He grumbled to himself and walked off to take the garbage out.  <br/> <br/>Some tiger he turned out to be.</td>', 'He had mere seconds to react, and growled in surprise and shock, flattening his head to brace for the shock. *PANG!* The frying pan smote him cleanly, leaving a bruised bump and dazing him completely. "I told you to take out the garbage last night Henry!" yelled his wife. Henry rubbed his sore head and muttered under his breath.  His mother had warned him not to marry her, but he hadn''t listened, and now his life was just a series of being beaten by a Tigress with a Frying Pan.  He grumbled to himself and walked off to take the garbage out.   Some tiger he turned out to be.', '2009-03-11 01:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
