(5302319, 770595, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I love the reflected colors and masts.  The clouds really help define the horizon, and the center "aisle"  breaks up the grouping into pleasing shapes.  Top 100!</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I love the reflected colors and masts.  The clouds really help define the horizon, and the center "aisle"  breaks up the grouping into pleasing shapes.  Top 100!', '2009-03-11 02:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
