(5303265, 771686, 90624, '<td valign="top">so intently looking at you!</td>', 'so intently looking at you!', '2009-03-11 05:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303266, 772523, 3746, '<td valign="top">OK, let me point out the good things first. The composition is great, although I would of either trimmed a bit more off the left or left a bit more on the right, just to even it up a bit. Those puppy-dog eyes defintely add an extra mark overall :) - The sharpness on the eyes is good, I have two labradors and I know getting the whole head in focus is a pain as they have such long noses!<br/> <br/>The negatives are the exposure is a bit low, I can see this was shot without flash and notice a bit of noise in the areas with no detail, but that cant be helped.<br/> <br/>A nice shot overall. well done.</td>', 'OK, let me point out the good things first. The composition is great, although I would of either trimmed a bit more off the left or left a bit more on the right, just to even it up a bit. Those puppy-dog eyes defintely add an extra mark overall :) - The sharpness on the eyes is good, I have two labradors and I know getting the whole head in focus is a pain as they have such long noses! The negatives are the exposure is a bit low, I can see this was shot without flash and notice a bit of noise in the areas with no detail, but that cant be helped. A nice shot overall. well done.', '2009-03-11 05:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303267, 772204, 90624, '<td valign="top">wow must be big!</td>', 'wow must be big!', '2009-03-11 05:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
