(5303270, 772724, 49109, '<td valign="top">good sharpness and exposure. looks slightly tilted to the right. color balance is a bit off, reds and greens where there should be more yellowish tones</td>', 'good sharpness and exposure. looks slightly tilted to the right. color balance is a bit off, reds and greens where there should be more yellowish tones', '2009-03-11 05:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
