(5303728, 772421, 26681, '<td valign="top">Wow! Amazingly creepy...</td>', 'Wow! Amazingly creepy...', '2009-03-11 06:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303729, 772732, 70661, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I always love the yellow fields with the blue sky.</td>', 'Beautiful! I always love the yellow fields with the blue sky.', '2009-03-11 06:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303732, 770753, 72950, '<td valign="top">Good Idea!!</td>', 'Good Idea!!', '2009-03-11 06:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303733, 772385, 70661, '<td valign="top">Colors are great. Makes me smile!</td>', 'Colors are great. Makes me smile!', '2009-03-11 06:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303734, 771892, 26681, '<td valign="top">Indeed! :)</td>', 'Indeed! :)', '2009-03-11 06:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303736, 772444, 26681, '<td valign="top">God''s brush. ;) Very nice pic.</td>', 'God''s brush. ;) Very nice pic.', '2009-03-11 06:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303738, 771879, 44751, '<td valign="top">He''s looking reasonably cranky!  Nice tones and good judgement to resist the temptation to over contrast which has resulted in a nice tonal range. 7. :)</td>', 'He''s looking reasonably cranky!  Nice tones and good judgement to resist the temptation to over contrast which has resulted in a nice tonal range. 7. :)', '2009-03-11 06:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303739, 772193, 28710, '<td valign="top">I like the ''hidden gem'' aspect of this. I don''t like the oversharpening. I like the rest of the processing though, especially the colors.</td>', 'I like the ''hidden gem'' aspect of this. I don''t like the oversharpening. I like the rest of the processing though, especially the colors.', '2009-03-11 06:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303742, 772253, 70661, '<td valign="top">Looks like a great place to go sit and think. Would have been better with a more interesting sky. Looks over-sharpened with the white edges on the tree.</td>', 'Looks like a great place to go sit and think. Would have been better with a more interesting sky. Looks over-sharpened with the white edges on the tree.', '2009-03-11 06:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303743, 770386, 26681, '<td valign="top">Wow - One of my favourites so far! Hope it does well!</td>', 'Wow - One of my favourites so far! Hope it does well!', '2009-03-11 06:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303744, 770257, 70661, '<td valign="top">Wow! Great capture!</td>', 'Wow! Great capture!', '2009-03-11 06:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303745, 772060, 44751, '<td valign="top">This is a good subject with plenty of potential.  I think that the crop is perhaps too narrow and looses some effect as a result. Good luck. 5.</td>', 'This is a good subject with plenty of potential.  I think that the crop is perhaps too narrow and looses some effect as a result. Good luck. 5.', '2009-03-11 06:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303746, 772209, 44751, '<td valign="top">I''m not good at picking HDRs, but i think this this is perhaps one?  It has a nice absence of nasty dark contrast and I just love the drama in the sky.  Great colouring without being over the top, also.  Great job: 7.</td>', 'I''m not good at picking HDRs, but i think this this is perhaps one?  It has a nice absence of nasty dark contrast and I just love the drama in the sky.  Great colouring without being over the top, also.  Great job: 7.', '2009-03-11 06:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303747, 772250, 76600, '<td valign="top">I think I know who this is for!!! great capture. 10 from me.</td>', 'I think I know who this is for!!! great capture. 10 from me.', '2009-03-11 06:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303748, 772087, 22689, '<td valign="top">There''s a sun burning inside this flower !<br/>Nice vibrant colors!<br/>I understand the difficulty of the edition with the halos when applying the sharpening, there is a great tutorial by Brad about this <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/tutorial.php?TUTORIAL_ID=80" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">link here</a>.<br/>Also another crop could have improved the impact.<br/>My vote : 8 .</td>', 'There''s a sun burning inside this flower !Nice vibrant colors!I understand the difficulty of the edition with the halos when applying the sharpening, there is a great tutorial by Brad about this link here.Also another crop could have improved the impact.My vote : 8 .', '2009-03-11 06:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303750, 772547, 44751, '<td valign="top">Nice leading line/vanishing point and use of sepia tone.  Not quite enough interest in the subject to really grab me.  Good luck: 5.</td>', 'Nice leading line/vanishing point and use of sepia tone.  Not quite enough interest in the subject to really grab me.  Good luck: 5.', '2009-03-11 06:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303751, 772645, 47294, '<td valign="top">Very interesting candid photo and excellent use of selective desat.  Massive tonal range to the point where detail is lost on dark images like the two men in the left of the frame but the top of the building in the centre of the frame is almost blown.  Great story, I looked at this for ages, best of luck.</td>', 'Very interesting candid photo and excellent use of selective desat.  Massive tonal range to the point where detail is lost on dark images like the two men in the left of the frame but the top of the building in the centre of the frame is almost blown.  Great story, I looked at this for ages, best of luck.', '2009-03-11 06:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303753, 770252, 76600, '<td valign="top">My kind of a shot!! 10</td>', 'My kind of a shot!! 10', '2009-03-11 06:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303754, 772728, 28710, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was a strawberry, but it''s not. I''m really not sure what it is. very interesting visually though.<br/> <br/>looks like there are some resizing artifacts and jaggies. I don''t really care about that though, so no points deducted for that.</td>', 'At first I thought this was a strawberry, but it''s not. I''m really not sure what it is. very interesting visually though. looks like there are some resizing artifacts and jaggies. I don''t really care about that though, so no points deducted for that.', '2009-03-11 06:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303756, 772168, 70661, '<td valign="top">So beautiful! Very rich colors!</td>', 'So beautiful! Very rich colors!', '2009-03-11 06:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303757, 772736, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice scenery, natural looking colors, but focal point is not clear, no subject to rest the eyes upon</td>', 'nice scenery, natural looking colors, but focal point is not clear, no subject to rest the eyes upon', '2009-03-11 06:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303758, 770996, 89341, '<td valign="top">Great cloud line in this shot, love the mountain poking out</td>', 'Great cloud line in this shot, love the mountain poking out', '2009-03-11 06:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303759, 772569, 76600, '<td valign="top">feel good. I wish you had more color in there . 8</td>', 'feel good. I wish you had more color in there . 8', '2009-03-11 06:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303760, 770985, 89341, '<td valign="top">makes for quite a cool abstract shot</td>', 'makes for quite a cool abstract shot', '2009-03-11 06:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303762, 770313, 44751, '<td valign="top">Nice moody image with good story telling.  Nice use of b&amp;w and contrast.  Wish the cars weren''t so modern (but what can you do! and not that I would take that into account for voting purposes either.  Just one of those "Oh, but what if...." kind of thoughts). Good luck: 7.</td>', 'Nice moody image with good story telling.  Nice use of b&w and contrast.  Wish the cars weren''t so modern (but what can you do! and not that I would take that into account for voting purposes either.  Just one of those "Oh, but what if...." kind of thoughts). Good luck: 7.', '2009-03-11 06:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303763, 772703, 28710, '<td valign="top">I like the effect created by the puffy seed heads in the brush.</td>', 'I like the effect created by the puffy seed heads in the brush.', '2009-03-11 06:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303764, 771444, 49109, '<td valign="top">strange colors, probably fill flash when white balance was set to tungsten. crop is too close IMO</td>', 'strange colors, probably fill flash when white balance was set to tungsten. crop is too close IMO', '2009-03-11 06:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303765, 771961, 89341, '<td valign="top">great vivid colours, I like how they fill the frame as lots of balloon shots are just small dots in the distance</td>', 'great vivid colours, I like how they fill the frame as lots of balloon shots are just small dots in the distance', '2009-03-11 06:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
