(5303774, 770184, 49109, '<td valign="top">you pushed contrast and saturation too far here. compsoition is unfortunate, the background rather distracts - could also have been avoided with less DOF</td>', 'you pushed contrast and saturation too far here. compsoition is unfortunate, the background rather distracts - could also have been avoided with less DOF', '2009-03-11 06:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303775, 771588, 44751, '<td valign="top">What a location!  Would love to hear the story behind this shot.  Beautiful colour, clarity and composition.  just a really captivating image.  Good luck: 10.</td>', 'What a location!  Would love to hear the story behind this shot.  Beautiful colour, clarity and composition.  just a really captivating image.  Good luck: 10.', '2009-03-11 06:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303776, 771863, 89341, '<td valign="top">great fun group portrait</td>', 'great fun group portrait', '2009-03-11 06:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303777, 770850, 22459, '<td valign="top">lovely minimalist image.</td>', 'lovely minimalist image.', '2009-03-11 06:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303778, 772352, 94235, '<td valign="top">A difficult shot nicely captured.  Well done.</td>', 'A difficult shot nicely captured.  Well done.', '2009-03-11 06:34:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303779, 772422, 89341, '<td valign="top">great point of view and very nice b&amp;w conversion</td>', 'great point of view and very nice b&w conversion', '2009-03-11 06:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303780, 770506, 47294, '<td valign="top">The foreground looks out of focus, a wider apeture would have helped this, (unless this was your intention?)  The boats make for an almost leading lines but we are to perpendicular to the natural line the rear of the boats make.  The reflections the boats make in the water is very nice.  Best of luck.</td>', 'The foreground looks out of focus, a wider apeture would have helped this, (unless this was your intention?)  The boats make for an almost leading lines but we are to perpendicular to the natural line the rear of the boats make.  The reflections the boats make in the water is very nice.  Best of luck.', '2009-03-11 06:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303782, 770285, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice clear capture with a pleasant bokeh. Well shot.</td>', 'Nice clear capture with a pleasant bokeh. Well shot.', '2009-03-11 06:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303783, 770380, 28710, '<td valign="top">I get the distinct impression from this that you avoided overdoing the colors. They are exactly the right intensity.</td>', 'I get the distinct impression from this that you avoided overdoing the colors. They are exactly the right intensity.', '2009-03-11 06:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303784, 772215, 89341, '<td valign="top">very nice rays of light</td>', 'very nice rays of light', '2009-03-11 06:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303788, 772770, 70661, '<td valign="top">Great colors. Love the reflection.</td>', 'Great colors. Love the reflection.', '2009-03-11 06:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303790, 772742, 89341, '<td valign="top">Nice low pov, looking up gives a nice feel to this</td>', 'Nice low pov, looking up gives a nice feel to this', '2009-03-11 06:35:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303791, 771720, 49109, '<td valign="top">too busy, my eyes keep wandering around. contrast is too high, lights are blown</td>', 'too busy, my eyes keep wandering around. contrast is too high, lights are blown', '2009-03-11 06:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303792, 772760, 47294, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, the marbles almost seem to be travelling in space.  I like the colours and the negative space.  Best of luck.</td>', 'Interesting photo, the marbles almost seem to be travelling in space.  I like the colours and the negative space.  Best of luck.', '2009-03-11 06:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303793, 770145, 28710, '<td valign="top">That''s a great bit of refraction on the face of the orange.</td>', 'That''s a great bit of refraction on the face of the orange.', '2009-03-11 06:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303794, 772573, 44751, '<td valign="top">A nice shot with some great colour.  Sometimes i see a photo that i can only describe the processing as "muddy" and I''m not really sure how to explain what i mean by that with this shot but i think the heavy black foreground and darkness of the clouds has resulted in that feeling for me.  The orange and blue have loads of potential but in the end it just feels too heavy.  Good luck: 5.</td>', 'A nice shot with some great colour.  Sometimes i see a photo that i can only describe the processing as "muddy" and I''m not really sure how to explain what i mean by that with this shot but i think the heavy black foreground and darkness of the clouds has resulted in that feeling for me.  The orange and blue have loads of potential but in the end it just feels too heavy.  Good luck: 5.', '2009-03-11 06:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5303797, 770500, 49109, '<td valign="top">good contrast and color; had cropped a bit closer; overall a bit soft</td>', 'good contrast and color; had cropped a bit closer; overall a bit soft', '2009-03-11 06:36:43.000000', NULL, 1);
