(5304368, 772523, 28710, '<td valign="top">You know, I don''t like dogs. I find them dirty, stinky, annoying and stupid.<br/> <br/>But this shot got me to go ''awww, what an adorable friend''. This dog displays none of the things I usually attribute to dogs that make me dislike dogs. <br/> <br/>So I''m going to give this a nice meaty score for the subject, and push it up for the skill of the photographer. <br/> <br/>Attention to color, texture, lighting, contrast, tone, image depth, composition and final crop are all things that display skill in that department.</td>', 'You know, I don''t like dogs. I find them dirty, stinky, annoying and stupid. But this shot got me to go ''awww, what an adorable friend''. This dog displays none of the things I usually attribute to dogs that make me dislike dogs.  So I''m going to give this a nice meaty score for the subject, and push it up for the skill of the photographer.  Attention to color, texture, lighting, contrast, tone, image depth, composition and final crop are all things that display skill in that department.', '2009-03-11 08:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
