(5304508, 772588, 28710, '<td valign="top">Lots of interesting shapes there.<br/> <br/>Give the pic a minute and there''s tons to fill the eye. Thematic repetition in the triangles of the building/reflection, prow of the boat and lines of the ropes. Also on circles on the barrel and in the weeds (and in the prow of the boat on the right).<br/> <br/>It is not a balanced composition and it suits the imbalance very well.<br/> <br/>I''m going to punch this up a bit higher than my initial response because I chose to gave it a few extra moments and it was worth it.</td>', 'Lots of interesting shapes there. Give the pic a minute and there''s tons to fill the eye. Thematic repetition in the triangles of the building/reflection, prow of the boat and lines of the ropes. Also on circles on the barrel and in the weeds (and in the prow of the boat on the right). It is not a balanced composition and it suits the imbalance very well. I''m going to punch this up a bit higher than my initial response because I chose to gave it a few extra moments and it was worth it.', '2009-03-11 08:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
