(5304844, 771435, 43463, '<td valign="top">The colors are absolutely stunning and the scene captured is captivating. The swarm of birds doing their aerial dance must have been really something to see at that moment of time! Shame that the image size restrictions are such that we cannot get lost in more detail by looking at (forgive the pun) the bigger picture. To me, I get drawn in not just from the colors but also from the two swarms of birds roll in and out across the sky just like the motion of the waves lapping at the shoreline. Wonderful photo and beautifully captured!</td>', 'The colors are absolutely stunning and the scene captured is captivating. The swarm of birds doing their aerial dance must have been really something to see at that moment of time! Shame that the image size restrictions are such that we cannot get lost in more detail by looking at (forgive the pun) the bigger picture. To me, I get drawn in not just from the colors but also from the two swarms of birds roll in and out across the sky just like the motion of the waves lapping at the shoreline. Wonderful photo and beautifully captured!', '2009-03-11 08:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5304845, 772512, 28710, '<td valign="top">And that''s what we call "effective selective desaturation".<br/> <br/>And there''s lots for the eye to see that isn''t in the horseshoe, but the glow is what gives us reason to linger.</td>', 'And that''s what we call "effective selective desaturation". And there''s lots for the eye to see that isn''t in the horseshoe, but the glow is what gives us reason to linger.', '2009-03-11 08:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
