(5304919, 771883, 43463, '<td valign="top">I absolutely LOVE the emotion captured here! This has such a happy, good vibe to it! This gentleman displays a zest for life as he is over the moon happy with joy in his leap in the air and clicking his heels. Great action and emotion captured in this composition. Love how we see some sand being kicked up from his shoes. The B&amp;W processing is great with a superb balance of tones. The silhouette of the man is perfect. This is a wonderfully emotive shot - thank you for sharing it. It made me smile.</td>', 'I absolutely LOVE the emotion captured here! This has such a happy, good vibe to it! This gentleman displays a zest for life as he is over the moon happy with joy in his leap in the air and clicking his heels. Great action and emotion captured in this composition. Love how we see some sand being kicked up from his shoes. The B&W processing is great with a superb balance of tones. The silhouette of the man is perfect. This is a wonderfully emotive shot - thank you for sharing it. It made me smile.', '2009-03-11 08:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
