(5305033, 772016, 43463, '<td valign="top">I have to say...I positively love the emotion &amp; symbolism captured in this photo! The young boy, wheelchair bound, is determined to ''catch'' all that life has to offer. He does NOT let his condition limit him in life. He shows us a positive attitude and a fishing rod he is ready to push the boundaries to reach for and capture the stars. The warm hues of the orange and gold sky complements the warm mood and positive message that this photo captures. I also love the choice of having the young child in silhouette with no individual identifying features for it gives us, the viewers, the understanding that this can be anybody...anyone can reach for and catch their dreams if they only try. Wonderfully captured and wonderfully done.</td>', 'I have to say...I positively love the emotion & symbolism captured in this photo! The young boy, wheelchair bound, is determined to ''catch'' all that life has to offer. He does NOT let his condition limit him in life. He shows us a positive attitude and a fishing rod he is ready to push the boundaries to reach for and capture the stars. The warm hues of the orange and gold sky complements the warm mood and positive message that this photo captures. I also love the choice of having the young child in silhouette with no individual identifying features for it gives us, the viewers, the understanding that this can be anybody...anyone can reach for and catch their dreams if they only try. Wonderfully captured and wonderfully done.', '2009-03-11 08:52:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5305034, 772754, 100064, '<td valign="top">Not liking the editing but the subjects are darling!</td>', 'Not liking the editing but the subjects are darling!', '2009-03-11 08:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
