(5305166, 772297, 43463, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful, stunning shot. Love the timing of the capture that has this young chimp playfully hamming it up for the camera. Even though these two primates do not speak it is their expressions and actions that speak to us. This is the banter I see between them. He looks like he is trying very much to get the attention of the adult chimpanzee. The young one''s hand is stretched out ready to grab the chin of the adult and say "Hey! Pay attention to me!" The adult however has the typical adult expression (and I can identify with this:-) ) of "Hang on! Just a minute there is something that I need to look into". Great lighting, great detail, great colors, and great mood capture - 9</td>', 'What a wonderful, stunning shot. Love the timing of the capture that has this young chimp playfully hamming it up for the camera. Even though these two primates do not speak it is their expressions and actions that speak to us. This is the banter I see between them. He looks like he is trying very much to get the attention of the adult chimpanzee. The young one''s hand is stretched out ready to grab the chin of the adult and say "Hey! Pay attention to me!" The adult however has the typical adult expression (and I can identify with this:-) ) of "Hang on! Just a minute there is something that I need to look into". Great lighting, great detail, great colors, and great mood capture - 9', '2009-03-11 09:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
