(5305247, 771290, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love those bold yellow and black colors of the balloons as they rise over the stark desert landscape! The balloons add color and added interest to the scenic desert landscape. Love the rugged terrain and the interesting mountainscape of the desert. And there rising just above the ridges are these beautiful balloons as they begin there flight. This must have been absolutly stunning to watch! The colors are great, the details stunning, and composition wonderfully captured!</td>', 'Wow! Love those bold yellow and black colors of the balloons as they rise over the stark desert landscape! The balloons add color and added interest to the scenic desert landscape. Love the rugged terrain and the interesting mountainscape of the desert. And there rising just above the ridges are these beautiful balloons as they begin there flight. This must have been absolutly stunning to watch! The colors are great, the details stunning, and composition wonderfully captured!', '2009-03-11 09:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5305248, 772072, 88492, '<td valign="top">It makes you look a second and then a third time, love the heels balanced on the edge of the water.<br/>Looks like she could fly away.</td>', 'It makes you look a second and then a third time, love the heels balanced on the edge of the water.Looks like she could fly away.', '2009-03-11 09:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
