(5305322, 772397, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is an absolutely stunning photo of one of the many lovely views to be found at the Grand Canyon. It is beautiful there is it not;-) I love the colors! The red of the canyon rock is vibrant and bold. The shape and color of the river as it bends in a horseshoe curve around the center rock spire adds tremendous visual impact as our eye is captivated by this breathtaking view. Is this a spring or near the ''rainy'' season for you have the additional lovely view and splash of color of the green that rims around the edge of the river? Great colors, lighting, detail and well-composed shot - thank you for sharing this.</td>', 'Wow! This is an absolutely stunning photo of one of the many lovely views to be found at the Grand Canyon. It is beautiful there is it not;-) I love the colors! The red of the canyon rock is vibrant and bold. The shape and color of the river as it bends in a horseshoe curve around the center rock spire adds tremendous visual impact as our eye is captivated by this breathtaking view. Is this a spring or near the ''rainy'' season for you have the additional lovely view and splash of color of the green that rims around the edge of the river? Great colors, lighting, detail and well-composed shot - thank you for sharing this.', '2009-03-11 09:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5305324, 772107, 81530, '<td valign="top">Indiana Jones meets car commercial.</td>', 'Indiana Jones meets car commercial.', '2009-03-11 09:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5305325, 772446, 52854, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!</td>', 'Cool shot!', '2009-03-11 09:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
