(5305466, 771322, 43463, '<td valign="top">I stand here looking on at majesty of the snow-capped mountains as they push their way through the clouds. The spires of rock that catapult to the sky from the snow peaks to the grey/black stone to the ''zen temple'' like tower of red rocks seen near offers a stunning view and majesty of the earth''s natural treasures. This must have been stunning to see and just sit there to watch and contemplate. A very awe inspiring shot. The colors and the details in this composition is just wonderful to see. Thanks for sharing this beautiful photo.</td>', 'I stand here looking on at majesty of the snow-capped mountains as they push their way through the clouds. The spires of rock that catapult to the sky from the snow peaks to the grey/black stone to the ''zen temple'' like tower of red rocks seen near offers a stunning view and majesty of the earth''s natural treasures. This must have been stunning to see and just sit there to watch and contemplate. A very awe inspiring shot. The colors and the details in this composition is just wonderful to see. Thanks for sharing this beautiful photo.', '2009-03-11 09:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
