(5305524, 772132, 88822, '<td valign="top">i wish this was done with a wider lens so you can see the rest of the buildings and not just the tops.  great colors... looks almost cartoonish.</td>', 'i wish this was done with a wider lens so you can see the rest of the buildings and not just the tops.  great colors... looks almost cartoonish.', '2009-03-11 09:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
