(5305718, 770793, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry of the bridge and reflection.  I gave this a 6, but would have gone 7 or 8 if the lower left boat part had been addressed.  Did you consider cropping this (bringing the bottom up)?  The symmetry could have been perfected by balancing the blue above and below the bridge.  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the symmetry of the bridge and reflection.  I gave this a 6, but would have gone 7 or 8 if the lower left boat part had been addressed.  Did you consider cropping this (bringing the bottom up)?  The symmetry could have been perfected by balancing the blue above and below the bridge.  Just some observations.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-03-11 09:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
