(5305782, 772716, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image.  Nice tonal range and a great candidate for B/W.  Subject seems a bit too centered IMO.  Seeing some halos around the lighthouse and man in chair that take away somewhat.</td>', 'This is a very nice image.  Nice tonal range and a great candidate for B/W.  Subject seems a bit too centered IMO.  Seeing some halos around the lighthouse and man in chair that take away somewhat.', '2009-03-11 09:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5305783, 770189, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow! What a stunning and mesmerizing view that opens up before this red-robed wizard! This soooo reminds me of the swell of music and the majesty of the mountain views in the Lighting of the Beacons scene in the LOTR''s movies. ARH!!! Look what you made me do now:-) I stepped away to put my LOTR Return of the King soundtrack in the stereo...something that I have not done since I helped a friend with writing some material for his book (yes, fantasy based:-) ) O.K. back to the picture now that I have music to accompany it:-) Love the mist that blankets the mountains. The lone figure standing upon the rocky outcrop to survey the ''misty'' mountains conjures a truly fantasical view of a magical realm. Thank you for sharing this gem and filling my morning with some wonderful music to fit the scene:-)</td>', 'Wow! What a stunning and mesmerizing view that opens up before this red-robed wizard! This soooo reminds me of the swell of music and the majesty of the mountain views in the Lighting of the Beacons scene in the LOTR''s movies. ARH!!! Look what you made me do now:-) I stepped away to put my LOTR Return of the King soundtrack in the stereo...something that I have not done since I helped a friend with writing some material for his book (yes, fantasy based:-) ) O.K. back to the picture now that I have music to accompany it:-) Love the mist that blankets the mountains. The lone figure standing upon the rocky outcrop to survey the ''misty'' mountains conjures a truly fantasical view of a magical realm. Thank you for sharing this gem and filling my morning with some wonderful music to fit the scene:-)', '2009-03-11 09:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5305785, 772196, 100064, '<td valign="top">Not enough focus and to many distractions but nice expression.</td>', 'Not enough focus and to many distractions but nice expression.', '2009-03-11 09:47:58.000000', NULL, 1),
