(5305868, 770912, 43463, '<td valign="top">Absolutely captivating view of this majestic work of man! Love the play of colors on the surface of the water - tis almost like glass. The lighting is stunning with lots of beautiful detail on the bridge. Sometimes night scenes with lights on the bridges have the lights little more than blobs of light but there is such wonderful detail here and some absolutely stunning star patterns of light that adorn the bridge in beauty. The pillons in the foreground add some additional visual interest for they are like another pathway that runs on the lower right diagonal while the bridge has the leading lines pathway that runs across the center half of the image. A beautiful and lovely nighttime scene.</td>', 'Absolutely captivating view of this majestic work of man! Love the play of colors on the surface of the water - tis almost like glass. The lighting is stunning with lots of beautiful detail on the bridge. Sometimes night scenes with lights on the bridges have the lights little more than blobs of light but there is such wonderful detail here and some absolutely stunning star patterns of light that adorn the bridge in beauty. The pillons in the foreground add some additional visual interest for they are like another pathway that runs on the lower right diagonal while the bridge has the leading lines pathway that runs across the center half of the image. A beautiful and lovely nighttime scene.', '2009-03-11 09:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
