(5305965, 770903, 52500, '<td valign="top">I like the nice warm tones and the scene in general, but the tilt doesn''t work for me.  I find that I''m just tilting my head to make it level.  Still, it''s a cool shot.  I really like the tiny little green plant/tree thing right down at the bottom.</td>', 'I like the nice warm tones and the scene in general, but the tilt doesn''t work for me.  I find that I''m just tilting my head to make it level.  Still, it''s a cool shot.  I really like the tiny little green plant/tree thing right down at the bottom.', '2009-03-11 09:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
