(5306066, 770960, 28710, '<td valign="top">lovely picture. The colors and grain give this a strong mid 1970''s feel for me. I wasn''t even alive then. Weird huh? I guess that means that it contributes to the pic overall.<br/> <br/>If you didn''t want the grain, be sure to ask in the forums about ''Neat Image''. We''d be happy to help you figure that out if you want. Sometimes there''s nothing at all wrong with leaving it in, but it will probably affect your score.</td>', 'lovely picture. The colors and grain give this a strong mid 1970''s feel for me. I wasn''t even alive then. Weird huh? I guess that means that it contributes to the pic overall. If you didn''t want the grain, be sure to ask in the forums about ''Neat Image''. We''d be happy to help you figure that out if you want. Sometimes there''s nothing at all wrong with leaving it in, but it will probably affect your score.', '2009-03-11 10:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
