(5306074, 770839, 65234, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like a friendly wave :-O  Could use a bit more contrast, maybe.  The tones are a little soft for the power of the waves.</td>', 'Doesn''t look like a friendly wave :-O  Could use a bit more contrast, maybe.  The tones are a little soft for the power of the waves.', '2009-03-11 10:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
