(5306240, 772549, 43463, '<td valign="top">Dusk...the day has come to an end and all work has been set aside. Time to surface and take a stroll - to breathe in the fresh air and relax away the tensions of the day. This is what the picture speaks to me. A wonderful capture that shows the beauty of the bay. The two people in silhouette taking a stroll on this scenic shoreline could be anyone - an easy way for us to project ourselves into the scene and take a stroll ourselves. Love the B&amp;W tones too for it heightens the mood and feel.</td>', 'Dusk...the day has come to an end and all work has been set aside. Time to surface and take a stroll - to breathe in the fresh air and relax away the tensions of the day. This is what the picture speaks to me. A wonderful capture that shows the beauty of the bay. The two people in silhouette taking a stroll on this scenic shoreline could be anyone - an easy way for us to project ourselves into the scene and take a stroll ourselves. Love the B&W tones too for it heightens the mood and feel.', '2009-03-11 10:15:30.000000', NULL, 1),
