(5306443, 772492, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great capture, I like the fact you used the coin so we can really appreciate the frog''s size.</td>', 'Great capture, I like the fact you used the coin so we can really appreciate the frog''s size.', '2009-03-11 10:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5306444, 772385, 43463, '<td valign="top">Happy colors and happy frog! The colors really are bold and vibrant against the backdrop of the white. Sunshine yellow of the daisy and the meadow green of the frog and the stem not to mention the bold reds/oranges/and purples of this little climbing frog that really stand out. Love the pose of this little frog - he seems to be very playful scampering up to the flower and taking a glance our way. I know that it is normally how they hold there mouths but he seems to be cracking a smile at us as he does what he loves best - climbing...trees, flowers, etc, etc...Lastly I love the level of sharp details we see here - the textured bumps of the belly of the frog are tack sharp and we even see some texture detail on the flower stem!</td>', 'Happy colors and happy frog! The colors really are bold and vibrant against the backdrop of the white. Sunshine yellow of the daisy and the meadow green of the frog and the stem not to mention the bold reds/oranges/and purples of this little climbing frog that really stand out. Love the pose of this little frog - he seems to be very playful scampering up to the flower and taking a glance our way. I know that it is normally how they hold there mouths but he seems to be cracking a smile at us as he does what he loves best - climbing...trees, flowers, etc, etc...Lastly I love the level of sharp details we see here - the textured bumps of the belly of the frog are tack sharp and we even see some texture detail on the flower stem!', '2009-03-11 10:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5306446, 772108, 81530, '<td valign="top">I find the image a little busy overall.</td>', 'I find the image a little busy overall.', '2009-03-11 10:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
