(5306576, 771040, 28710, '<td valign="top">AHHH she''s giving me the CRAZY EYE! heh. Maybe I''ve voted on too many images for the night.<br/> <br/>I really like the composition of this and the intriguing yellow BG. The pedestrian in the back isn''t distracting, but does add some interest.<br/> <br/>I gave this a 6, but as soon as I left for the next pic, I knew I had made a mistake and came back to bump it up a bit.</td>', 'AHHH she''s giving me the CRAZY EYE! heh. Maybe I''ve voted on too many images for the night. I really like the composition of this and the intriguing yellow BG. The pedestrian in the back isn''t distracting, but does add some interest. I gave this a 6, but as soon as I left for the next pic, I knew I had made a mistake and came back to bump it up a bit.', '2009-03-11 10:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
