(5306755, 770462, 52500, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I like the color and the exposure.  Very cool to see a bit of motion blur on the propellers, too.  I think the shot would benefit from the removal of a few little spots (sensor dust?), and I wish you would have given us a 720 version.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I like the color and the exposure.  Very cool to see a bit of motion blur on the propellers, too.  I think the shot would benefit from the removal of a few little spots (sensor dust?), and I wish you would have given us a 720 version.', '2009-03-11 10:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
