(5306760, 772487, 31535, '<td valign="top">Cute, but I think a more square crop without all the white on the left would provide better composition.</td>', 'Cute, but I think a more square crop without all the white on the left would provide better composition.', '2009-03-11 10:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5306761, 771737, 17148, '<td valign="top">Love the blue cold feel. 8</td>', 'Love the blue cold feel. 8', '2009-03-11 10:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5306763, 772098, 43463, '<td valign="top">Oh yes indeed!!!! What a rush this ride is - and the capture on their faces is absolutely great!!! Love the motion blur we see in the backdrop for it imparts to us the sense of motion - a very fast rush as this ride zooms by. The kids and the carriage portion of the ride are in perfect sharp focus which gives the viewers the joy of seeing the expressions of the riders as they cackle and gickle and laugh with a mix of glee and fear as they speed on by. A well timed and absolutely great action shot with a great people shot of these two kids having a great time. This is not an easy capture so I can appreciate it even more that you got the timing and focus so spot on. A great capture, thanks for sharing this.</td>', 'Oh yes indeed!!!! What a rush this ride is - and the capture on their faces is absolutely great!!! Love the motion blur we see in the backdrop for it imparts to us the sense of motion - a very fast rush as this ride zooms by. The kids and the carriage portion of the ride are in perfect sharp focus which gives the viewers the joy of seeing the expressions of the riders as they cackle and gickle and laugh with a mix of glee and fear as they speed on by. A well timed and absolutely great action shot with a great people shot of these two kids having a great time. This is not an easy capture so I can appreciate it even more that you got the timing and focus so spot on. A great capture, thanks for sharing this.', '2009-03-11 10:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5306765, 770996, 81530, '<td valign="top">What a spectacular view. I''m sure it was amazing to see in person.</td>', 'What a spectacular view. I''m sure it was amazing to see in person.', '2009-03-11 10:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
