(5306879, 770255, 43463, '<td valign="top">What a great ''statement'' photo that reflects upon the state of human beings in this century. Amazing how with so many technological advances that we have a tiny fully portable communications device that we can be so disconnected from our surroundings and other people. Love this capture of so many people talking on their cell phones ''connecting'' with people distant at a remote location while each and every one of them are seperated by distance from each other and not noticing or looking at anyone in the room. Ironic - they are connected but disconnected and that is such a poignant statement in this composition that comes in so loud and clear. You have a great eye to spot this or if posed you realized your idea beautifully and with much gravitas. I also like the B&amp;W for a color version I feel would mute the message by distracting the viewer with colors. I also want to complement you on the wonderful dynamic B&amp;W tones I see here. Well done all around.</td>', 'What a great ''statement'' photo that reflects upon the state of human beings in this century. Amazing how with so many technological advances that we have a tiny fully portable communications device that we can be so disconnected from our surroundings and other people. Love this capture of so many people talking on their cell phones ''connecting'' with people distant at a remote location while each and every one of them are seperated by distance from each other and not noticing or looking at anyone in the room. Ironic - they are connected but disconnected and that is such a poignant statement in this composition that comes in so loud and clear. You have a great eye to spot this or if posed you realized your idea beautifully and with much gravitas. I also like the B&W for a color version I feel would mute the message by distracting the viewer with colors. I also want to complement you on the wonderful dynamic B&W tones I see here. Well done all around.', '2009-03-11 10:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5306881, 770485, 83686, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on being part of this 1000th challenge on DPC. Keep up the good work!!</td>', 'Congratulations on being part of this 1000th challenge on DPC. Keep up the good work!!', '2009-03-11 10:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
