(5306886, 772154, 52500, '<td valign="top">Great shot technically and good work on the eyes.  It doesn''t really speak to me, though.  Mostly I get the impression that she has no idea what a camera is.  I think it would work better for me if she was actually looking at the back of the camera as if it were digital.</td>', 'Great shot technically and good work on the eyes.  It doesn''t really speak to me, though.  Mostly I get the impression that she has no idea what a camera is.  I think it would work better for me if she was actually looking at the back of the camera as if it were digital.', '2009-03-11 10:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
