(5307156, 771575, 35804, '<td valign="top">It seems so strange to see them there...my heart jumped when I my eyes caught them. It''s interesting how an everyday sort of candid takes on a new power when something that once was is no longer. And the fact that everyone in the foreground is looking away from them, but a man in black somewhat further away seems to be staring at me, somehow adds to the impact for me. It reminds us how things can change in an instant.</td>', 'It seems so strange to see them there...my heart jumped when I my eyes caught them. It''s interesting how an everyday sort of candid takes on a new power when something that once was is no longer. And the fact that everyone in the foreground is looking away from them, but a man in black somewhat further away seems to be staring at me, somehow adds to the impact for me. It reminds us how things can change in an instant.', '2009-03-11 11:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
