(5307484, 771586, 83845, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!</td>', 'Nice capture!', '2009-03-11 11:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307486, 772314, 35804, '<td valign="top">It''s such a strange image, strange enough to stop me in my tracks. I''m not certain if this is suppose to be a tender moment or not. We see babies, and the brain automatically wants to think awwww and cuteness...but this isn''t. The wee one is being held with but one hand, almost like one holds a melon. And whom I assume is the father seems bored, if he can be read at all. There is an absence of tenderness, at least the sort of the tenderness that the general audience comes to expect in a parent/child image. Very intriguing photograph.</td>', 'It''s such a strange image, strange enough to stop me in my tracks. I''m not certain if this is suppose to be a tender moment or not. We see babies, and the brain automatically wants to think awwww and cuteness...but this isn''t. The wee one is being held with but one hand, almost like one holds a melon. And whom I assume is the father seems bored, if he can be read at all. There is an absence of tenderness, at least the sort of the tenderness that the general audience comes to expect in a parent/child image. Very intriguing photograph.', '2009-03-11 11:45:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307487, 770289, 44825, '<td valign="top">Nice shot very peaceful</td>', 'Nice shot very peaceful', '2009-03-11 11:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307488, 771255, 49109, '<td valign="top">well seen, but the camera settings obviously were not proper for that situation - image has a purplish cast, lights are blown. could also be sharper</td>', 'well seen, but the camera settings obviously were not proper for that situation - image has a purplish cast, lights are blown. could also be sharper', '2009-03-11 11:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307489, 770324, 88822, '<td valign="top">great reflections, great composition. great shot</td>', 'great reflections, great composition. great shot', '2009-03-11 11:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307490, 772764, 66193, '<td valign="top">cats love windows!  I always wonder what is going through their minds.  Do they wish there were outside?  Are they looking for prey?  Looking for excitement from their boring lives of sleeping and eating?  Cat equivalent of TV?  anyway, I like the silhouette and the minimal tones.  would work well in a high contrast challenge.</td>', 'cats love windows!  I always wonder what is going through their minds.  Do they wish there were outside?  Are they looking for prey?  Looking for excitement from their boring lives of sleeping and eating?  Cat equivalent of TV?  anyway, I like the silhouette and the minimal tones.  would work well in a high contrast challenge.', '2009-03-11 11:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307491, 772074, 44825, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but perhaps a little dark?</td>', 'Nice shot but perhaps a little dark?', '2009-03-11 11:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307493, 770256, 44825, '<td valign="top">Very nice</td>', 'Very nice', '2009-03-11 11:46:06.000000', NULL, 1);
