(5307580, 770581, 102394, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The pose looks natural, he looks relaxed and has a dreamy expression.  My only suggestion would be to deepen the shadows a bit.  The light is so bright it''s teetering on washing him out a bit.  I think you need more darker tones to make him pop.</td>', 'I like this shot.  The pose looks natural, he looks relaxed and has a dreamy expression.  My only suggestion would be to deepen the shadows a bit.  The light is so bright it''s teetering on washing him out a bit.  I think you need more darker tones to make him pop.', '2009-03-11 11:52:11.000000', NULL, 1),
