(5307734, 771840, 56109, '<td valign="top">The first thing that came to mind was this <a href="//image.maniadb.com/images/album/137/137555_1_f.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Jack Johnson</a> album cover. Who doesn''t like a stand-alone tree? I really like the detail in the thousands of small branches and how they are nicely amplified by the choice of silhouette. I also like your choice of keeping a minimal foreground, but just enough to keep interest. Great shot.</td>', 'The first thing that came to mind was this Jack Johnson album cover. Who doesn''t like a stand-alone tree? I really like the detail in the thousands of small branches and how they are nicely amplified by the choice of silhouette. I also like your choice of keeping a minimal foreground, but just enough to keep interest. Great shot.', '2009-03-11 12:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
