(5307861, 770678, 81530, '<td valign="top">Love all the detail on the frog and the log. They have such interesting looking ears.</td>', 'Love all the detail on the frog and the log. They have such interesting looking ears.', '2009-03-11 12:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307862, 772719, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow! Love the composition of this photo. You have the sweep of natural stone going across the top portion of the image while there is a lovely sweep of clouds that wash over this desert scene. Love the old Anasazi ruins you see here with the time worn Kiva. Natural beauty and the story of man and our ancient past, love the imagery you present us here. To me that stone arch is symbolic of how nature will eventually erode and cover over what man builds. Here the stone arch ''appears'' like it is a wave ready to crash over what is left of the kiva. The B&amp;W tones are very lovely. Well done and well presented.</td>', 'Wow! Love the composition of this photo. You have the sweep of natural stone going across the top portion of the image while there is a lovely sweep of clouds that wash over this desert scene. Love the old Anasazi ruins you see here with the time worn Kiva. Natural beauty and the story of man and our ancient past, love the imagery you present us here. To me that stone arch is symbolic of how nature will eventually erode and cover over what man builds. Here the stone arch ''appears'' like it is a wave ready to crash over what is left of the kiva. The B&W tones are very lovely. Well done and well presented.', '2009-03-11 12:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5307863, 772175, 58452, '<td valign="top">A little wizard huh? Cute image.</td>', 'A little wizard huh? Cute image.', '2009-03-11 12:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
