(5308202, 772240, 70000, '<td valign="top">If there was selective desaturation applied to this, it was not the strongest decision in my opinion. The stripe of red commands so much attention that it is hard to appreciate the composition as a whole. Instead of making her stick it, it may have been more interesting to have to look around for her a bit.</td>', 'If there was selective desaturation applied to this, it was not the strongest decision in my opinion. The stripe of red commands so much attention that it is hard to appreciate the composition as a whole. Instead of making her stick it, it may have been more interesting to have to look around for her a bit.', '2009-03-11 12:46:23.000000', NULL, 1),
