(5308227, 770421, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wonderful! The colors are kind of wonky, but that might have been a deliberate attempt to capture the mixed emotions that must come within this situation. It may have been a more commanding photo in bw, but I won''t deny that this is a very well composed, well lit photo that tells a really interesting story.</td>', 'Wonderful! The colors are kind of wonky, but that might have been a deliberate attempt to capture the mixed emotions that must come within this situation. It may have been a more commanding photo in bw, but I won''t deny that this is a very well composed, well lit photo that tells a really interesting story.', '2009-03-11 12:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
