(5308238, 770355, 70000, '<td valign="top">Sao Paulo! I have been there! The rain is a VERY cool touch. It takes a cliche photo opportunity and makes it so much more interesting.</td>', 'Sao Paulo! I have been there! The rain is a VERY cool touch. It takes a cliche photo opportunity and makes it so much more interesting.', '2009-03-11 12:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
