(5309036, 772473, 13390, '<td valign="top">I love the dynamic range here. Great detail and composition gives me the feeling like I am sitting right where you were when it was taken. I think a human element would have made this near perfect. Well shot, an image to be proud of.</td>', 'I love the dynamic range here. Great detail and composition gives me the feeling like I am sitting right where you were when it was taken. I think a human element would have made this near perfect. Well shot, an image to be proud of.', '2009-03-11 13:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5309037, 772042, 43463, '<td valign="top">You have captured some really beautiful details and stunning colors seen on this passion flower. I have seen these flowers up close and they really are exotic and beautiful to look upon. I like how you composed the shot such that the center portion of the flower is at the diagonal; seeming rising up and touching the top right corner. That adds alot of visual interest to this floral shot. The colors really pop visually off of that dark background.</td>', 'You have captured some really beautiful details and stunning colors seen on this passion flower. I have seen these flowers up close and they really are exotic and beautiful to look upon. I like how you composed the shot such that the center portion of the flower is at the diagonal; seeming rising up and touching the top right corner. That adds alot of visual interest to this floral shot. The colors really pop visually off of that dark background.', '2009-03-11 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5309038, 770985, 88822, '<td valign="top">great shot</td>', 'great shot', '2009-03-11 13:36:39.000000', NULL, 1),
