(5309603, 770514, 15711, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful shot.  Reminds me of a favorite child hood poem<br/> <br/>The north wind doth blow<br/>and we shall have snow<br/>but what will poor robin do then?<br/>He''ll sit in the barn<br/>and keep himself warm<br/>and hide his head under his wing<br/>poor thing<br/> <br/>Although this is a cardinal, it made me remember a happy time with my mom read that poem to me. The movement of the snow and her touch of crimson is lovely against the arched steel gray of the "perch."</td>', 'Such a beautiful shot.  Reminds me of a favorite child hood poem The north wind doth blowand we shall have snowbut what will poor robin do then?He''ll sit in the barnand keep himself warmand hide his head under his wingpoor thing Although this is a cardinal, it made me remember a happy time with my mom read that poem to me. The movement of the snow and her touch of crimson is lovely against the arched steel gray of the "perch."', '2009-03-11 14:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5309604, 772222, 98339, '<td valign="top">what a spectacular place, really great exposure, your shot "glows"...</td>', 'what a spectacular place, really great exposure, your shot "glows"...', '2009-03-11 14:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
