(5309631, 771580, 41802, '<td valign="top">Interesting movement, it creates a nice action shot.</td>', 'Interesting movement, it creates a nice action shot.', '2009-03-11 14:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5309632, 771048, 15711, '<td valign="top">This certainly has a timeless quality. I feel like I stepped into another era. I love the lack of true highlights. Great composition with the juxtaposed dad and son. the clouds and shadowy mountaintop make for a wonderful backdrop.</td>', 'This certainly has a timeless quality. I feel like I stepped into another era. I love the lack of true highlights. Great composition with the juxtaposed dad and son. the clouds and shadowy mountaintop make for a wonderful backdrop.', '2009-03-11 14:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5309633, 772578, 30861, '<td valign="top">Oh, good GRIEF! What a bedraggled goat! *That* part I love. But I honestly can''t believe you''re being well-served by the extreme gaussian blur you''ve thrown onto that wonderful sky...</td>', 'Oh, good GRIEF! What a bedraggled goat! *That* part I love. But I honestly can''t believe you''re being well-served by the extreme gaussian blur you''ve thrown onto that wonderful sky...', '2009-03-11 14:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5309634, 772292, 81530, '<td valign="top">The darkness works really well here since the rest of the image has lots of contrast. Awesome.</td>', 'The darkness works really well here since the rest of the image has lots of contrast. Awesome.', '2009-03-11 14:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5309635, 771915, 98339, '<td valign="top">the only problem with taking underwater (or through the glass) shots is that it is hard to not loose the colors and tones...for the most part they seem to always be "murky"</td>', 'the only problem with taking underwater (or through the glass) shots is that it is hard to not loose the colors and tones...for the most part they seem to always be "murky"', '2009-03-11 14:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
