(5310007, 772435, 29490, '<td valign="top">I find the dark shape in the lower left interesting.  Is it a shadow?  Is it Mom?  Dad?  Why am I drawn to it?  I don''t know, but now it''s like a piece of lettuce in your job-interviewer''s teeth, something you can''t take your eyes off.  My eyes go there, I pull them to the rest of the photo, then they go back to the (shadow?mom?dad?drapes?paper?reflection?).<br/> <br/>It''s not as bad as the above may lead you to think, it''s just that now that it has registered in my brain I want to know - but it''s not a major distraction.<br/> <br/>In fact - this is a nicely captured portrait, this is a wall hanger.  Nice colors, too!</td>', 'I find the dark shape in the lower left interesting.  Is it a shadow?  Is it Mom?  Dad?  Why am I drawn to it?  I don''t know, but now it''s like a piece of lettuce in your job-interviewer''s teeth, something you can''t take your eyes off.  My eyes go there, I pull them to the rest of the photo, then they go back to the (shadow?mom?dad?drapes?paper?reflection?). It''s not as bad as the above may lead you to think, it''s just that now that it has registered in my brain I want to know - but it''s not a major distraction. In fact - this is a nicely captured portrait, this is a wall hanger.  Nice colors, too!', '2009-03-11 15:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
