(5310156, 771321, 29490, '<td valign="top">Oh my - a nice and lonely bench, a subject that sings to the soul.<br/> <br/>Interesting composition with the walkway leading to the bench and not the view from the bench, nor the bench itself, as the main frame filler.<br/> <br/>Walk up and sit a spell.  Sit a spell then walk down the trail.  <br/> <br/>Let me rest, let me sit, let me talk with loved ones current, past, and passed -- yes benches can sing to the soul.<br/> <br/>Your processing adds quite nicely to the scene.  Tied (so far) for my highest mark in scoring this challenge.</td>', 'Oh my - a nice and lonely bench, a subject that sings to the soul. Interesting composition with the walkway leading to the bench and not the view from the bench, nor the bench itself, as the main frame filler. Walk up and sit a spell.  Sit a spell then walk down the trail.   Let me rest, let me sit, let me talk with loved ones current, past, and passed -- yes benches can sing to the soul. Your processing adds quite nicely to the scene.  Tied (so far) for my highest mark in scoring this challenge.', '2009-03-11 15:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
