(5310388, 772526, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for Yosemite Valley pictures.  I love this park.  Great falls shot framed by the trees.  The wide angle lens tilted up causes converging verticals.  It may be desirable but if you wanted to avoid it you could shoot horizontally, assuming you don''t have a lens shifter, and then crop the bottom.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for Yosemite Valley pictures.  I love this park.  Great falls shot framed by the trees.  The wide angle lens tilted up causes converging verticals.  It may be desirable but if you wanted to avoid it you could shoot horizontally, assuming you don''t have a lens shifter, and then crop the bottom.', '2009-03-11 15:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5310389, 771000, 88822, '<td valign="top">great image</td>', 'great image', '2009-03-11 15:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
