(5310401, 770703, 15711, '<td valign="top">The dust of the red clay has given it the same color as the mountain. Nice complimentary colors with that and the vivid cobalt sky. I like it.  Good mix of nature and manmade - yet they all tie in together nicely.</td>', 'The dust of the red clay has given it the same color as the mountain. Nice complimentary colors with that and the vivid cobalt sky. I like it.  Good mix of nature and manmade - yet they all tie in together nicely.', '2009-03-11 15:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
