(5310566, 772149, 30982, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile!  This, to me, is a huge hunk of what photography should be about - that moment where the camera catches something quite genuine and unrehearsed.  Definitely a keeper.</td>', 'This makes me smile!  This, to me, is a huge hunk of what photography should be about - that moment where the camera catches something quite genuine and unrehearsed.  Definitely a keeper.', '2009-03-11 15:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
