(5310570, 771894, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh what a terrific shot. I love how she''s just taking it all in. I don''t get a sense of diva at all, but just her pure joy of that moment in the sun.  The whiskers make the shot. :~) Thanks for putting a smile on my face.</td>', 'Oh what a terrific shot. I love how she''s just taking it all in. I don''t get a sense of diva at all, but just her pure joy of that moment in the sun.  The whiskers make the shot. :~) Thanks for putting a smile on my face.', '2009-03-11 15:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5310571, 772171, 81530, '<td valign="top">What a friendly smile.</td>', 'What a friendly smile.', '2009-03-11 15:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5310572, 772407, 59276, '<td valign="top">love the b&amp;w....nice and sharpe</td>', 'love the b&w....nice and sharpe', '2009-03-11 15:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
