(5310607, 770631, 43463, '<td valign="top">Let the winds gather in your sails and take ya to some beautiful locals with golden beaches and lush tropical vegetation. And if you have a fear of heights just don''t look down from the crow''s nest:-) Look forward. Glad I can enjoy the view from the safety of the ground. I like how the white of the sails contrast wonderfully off of the deep, deep blues of the ocean waters. Tis a shame though that the same breeze that was billowing the four bottom sails also blew the top one into the scene that can be seen in the lower bottom left corner. The composition improves even more had that not been there because then it becomes a study in appealing shapes and colors as the billowing triangles cut across the cobalt blue waters.</td>', 'Let the winds gather in your sails and take ya to some beautiful locals with golden beaches and lush tropical vegetation. And if you have a fear of heights just don''t look down from the crow''s nest:-) Look forward. Glad I can enjoy the view from the safety of the ground. I like how the white of the sails contrast wonderfully off of the deep, deep blues of the ocean waters. Tis a shame though that the same breeze that was billowing the four bottom sails also blew the top one into the scene that can be seen in the lower bottom left corner. The composition improves even more had that not been there because then it becomes a study in appealing shapes and colors as the billowing triangles cut across the cobalt blue waters.', '2009-03-11 15:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5310608, 770311, 68769, '<td valign="top">Nice selective desat to bring out the hand-heart. nicely accomplished.</td>', 'Nice selective desat to bring out the hand-heart. nicely accomplished.', '2009-03-11 15:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5310609, 772385, 15711, '<td valign="top">Talk about commercial appeal!!  I can see this as a printr, a card, a motivational poster. Really darling.</td>', 'Talk about commercial appeal!!  I can see this as a printr, a card, a motivational poster. Really darling.', '2009-03-11 15:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5310610, 772320, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a charming and delightful fellow!  His cheerful attitude completely overrides the bland day - he creates light of his own, it seems.  Fun, fun shot!</td>', 'What a charming and delightful fellow!  His cheerful attitude completely overrides the bland day - he creates light of his own, it seems.  Fun, fun shot!', '2009-03-11 15:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
