(5310623, 772198, 80096, '<td valign="top">Geezz, I hope not. ;-) This is a wonderful capture and very reminiscent of turn-of-the-century imagery. I love the subtle hint of red in the roof and the way you captured the falling snow. There''s a lot of movement in this image. Very well done! 10</td>', 'Geezz, I hope not. ;-) This is a wonderful capture and very reminiscent of turn-of-the-century imagery. I love the subtle hint of red in the roof and the way you captured the falling snow. There''s a lot of movement in this image. Very well done! 10', '2009-03-11 16:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
