(5310682, 772465, 30982, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like something you''d expect in a world long since flooded - the doors used to be those serving trucks but no longer as the water keeps rising...  The blue toning adds to a sort of apocalyptic feel of sorts.</td>', 'This almost looks like something you''d expect in a world long since flooded - the doors used to be those serving trucks but no longer as the water keeps rising...  The blue toning adds to a sort of apocalyptic feel of sorts.', '2009-03-11 16:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
