(5310705, 772694, 97166, '<td valign="top">"Freddie!" His mother yelled, and he looked up sharply, a slight guilty look on his face.  "Did you eat the Fly Cookies I just baked!?"   She looked at him accusingly.<br/> <br/>"No Momf! My bone knowf whaf joo tawkfin abouft!" <br/> <br/>He tried to grin, and crumbs and bits of wing spilled from the corners of his mouth, yet still he tried to look innocent.  It was a losing cause. <br/> <br/>He went to bed without supper, that night.</td>', '"Freddie!" His mother yelled, and he looked up sharply, a slight guilty look on his face.  "Did you eat the Fly Cookies I just baked!?"   She looked at him accusingly. "No Momf! My bone knowf whaf joo tawkfin abouft!"  He tried to grin, and crumbs and bits of wing spilled from the corners of his mouth, yet still he tried to look innocent.  It was a losing cause.  He went to bed without supper, that night.', '2009-03-11 16:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
