(5311407, 770850, 43463, '<td valign="top">Simple and elegantly minimalistic. The lone cow stands there in the snowstorm. The bleak, stark surroundings show it is indeed very lonely but the whiteout also speaks of freezing cold. The cow seems to look at us/me/you and wonder what the heck is he/she doing out here?!?!?!:-) That lone fence post that we see here also seems to be ''signaling'' the number "one". One cow all alone and one lone fence post with no others in sight.</td>', 'Simple and elegantly minimalistic. The lone cow stands there in the snowstorm. The bleak, stark surroundings show it is indeed very lonely but the whiteout also speaks of freezing cold. The cow seems to look at us/me/you and wonder what the heck is he/she doing out here?!?!?!:-) That lone fence post that we see here also seems to be ''signaling'' the number "one". One cow all alone and one lone fence post with no others in sight.', '2009-03-11 16:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5311408, 770704, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great processing and shot!</td>', 'Great processing and shot!', '2009-03-11 16:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
