(5311676, 770284, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very inviting on two fronts - on the left, that lovely light and field with the mist beyond, on the right, the road taking us along the line of trees.  Interesting that these two directions do not detract from each other.  And I quite like the shadows and how they fade as you step further into the mist.</td>', 'Very inviting on two fronts - on the left, that lovely light and field with the mist beyond, on the right, the road taking us along the line of trees.  Interesting that these two directions do not detract from each other.  And I quite like the shadows and how they fade as you step further into the mist.', '2009-03-11 17:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
