(5311898, 772147, 97166, '<td valign="top">As she stood there contemplating whether to join them or not, her hand came up to touch her chin, in an almost unconscious gesture.  She saw them there, playing, laughing, having such fun, but still she hesitated.  She had never been one to just join.  Always she had hesitated. Always she felt a pang in the depths of her stomach, a reluctance, an anxiety.  What would they think of her? What if she did something wrong?  What if they laughed at her?  <br/> <br/>So the children played, and so she continued to stand on the sidelines, but one of them turned to her then, and smiled, and she smiled back, and he waved at her to join them, and shyly, slowly, she did.</td>', 'As she stood there contemplating whether to join them or not, her hand came up to touch her chin, in an almost unconscious gesture.  She saw them there, playing, laughing, having such fun, but still she hesitated.  She had never been one to just join.  Always she had hesitated. Always she felt a pang in the depths of her stomach, a reluctance, an anxiety.  What would they think of her? What if she did something wrong?  What if they laughed at her?   So the children played, and so she continued to stand on the sidelines, but one of them turned to her then, and smiled, and she smiled back, and he waved at her to join them, and shyly, slowly, she did.', '2009-03-11 17:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5311899, 772148, 88822, '<td valign="top">well composed and very dreamy shot</td>', 'well composed and very dreamy shot', '2009-03-11 17:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
