(5311902, 770863, 88136, '<td valign="top">this  could be a magazine ad for that building, its very well done. great contrast and lighting, the shadows are perfect. even the clouds contribute nicely. oh, and my fav, leading lines</td>', 'this  could be a magazine ad for that building, its very well done. great contrast and lighting, the shadows are perfect. even the clouds contribute nicely. oh, and my fav, leading lines', '2009-03-11 17:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
