(5311967, 770541, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow excellent colors.  I love the reflection in the water as well.</td>', 'Wow excellent colors.  I love the reflection in the water as well.', '2009-03-11 17:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5311968, 770481, 74979, '<td valign="top">lovely model in a sweet setting, I like that gaze away from the camera.  What is  also great is how you didn''t use a lot of PS "tricks" (not obviously anyway) and so, let her natural beauty &amp; the moment through.  I would clean her stray hairs up during the shoot next time, that''s my inconsequential little pic (realize you could have in PS but not for this set of rules...)<br/>If you''re not a professional, you should/could be!  :)<br/> <br/><b><i>ETA: nice finish in such an overwhelmingly large &amp; talented group of contenders!!  you should be feeling good about this one...your work is unique!</i></b><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-20 07:48:59.</i></td>', 'lovely model in a sweet setting, I like that gaze away from the camera.  What is  also great is how you didn''t use a lot of PS "tricks" (not obviously anyway) and so, let her natural beauty & the moment through.  I would clean her stray hairs up during the shoot next time, that''s my inconsequential little pic (realize you could have in PS but not for this set of rules...)If you''re not a professional, you should/could be!  :) ETA: nice finish in such an overwhelmingly large & talented group of contenders!!  you should be feeling good about this one...your work is unique!', '2009-03-11 17:35:20.000000', '2009-03-20 07:48:59.000000', 1),
(5311969, 772646, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Great use of selective desat.</td>', 'LOL.  Great use of selective desat.', '2009-03-11 17:35:20.000000', NULL, 1),
