(5312227, 772645, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is one of those images that I hope people stop to let their eyes wander around in.  I love in the almost anachronistic feel of the shiny new car parked in the middle of a very old street.  The animal in front just makes the whole image.  Also, I am generally not a fan of selective desat but here it just works - it doesn''t bonk you on the head screaming "I''m the only thing in color" but just very nicely and quietly highlights the context.  Very well done.</td>', 'This is one of those images that I hope people stop to let their eyes wander around in.  I love in the almost anachronistic feel of the shiny new car parked in the middle of a very old street.  The animal in front just makes the whole image.  Also, I am generally not a fan of selective desat but here it just works - it doesn''t bonk you on the head screaming "I''m the only thing in color" but just very nicely and quietly highlights the context.  Very well done.', '2009-03-11 17:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
