(5312365, 770764, 47852, '<td valign="top">Something about the focus makes it hard for me to get a sense of scale here, the people almost look like dolls at first.  A unique setting though, and lots of interesting textures and shapes to explore.</td>', 'Something about the focus makes it hard for me to get a sense of scale here, the people almost look like dolls at first.  A unique setting though, and lots of interesting textures and shapes to explore.', '2009-03-11 18:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312366, 772738, 29009, '<td valign="top">The lighting is very harsh here.  Generally, elbows aren''t the best thing to have as a focal point/on the rule of thirds.  Keep working on the lighting, and pay attention to wrinkles in backgrounds for a finished look.</td>', 'The lighting is very harsh here.  Generally, elbows aren''t the best thing to have as a focal point/on the rule of thirds.  Keep working on the lighting, and pay attention to wrinkles in backgrounds for a finished look.', '2009-03-11 18:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
