(5312398, 772239, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp with good use of a slow shutter to create blur.  A bit of dodging on the path of the ball might have made this stronger.  Otherwise, they could be dancing.  :)</td>', 'Nice and sharp with good use of a slow shutter to create blur.  A bit of dodging on the path of the ball might have made this stronger.  Otherwise, they could be dancing.  :)', '2009-03-11 18:05:27.000000', NULL, 1),
