(5312402, 772168, 21304, '<td valign="top">Awesome! The border works great here. The sky is just stunning. I wish the ''land'' part of the photo had a little bit more on the left side, but also creates a neat change from the rocky right. 8 from me.</td>', 'Awesome! The border works great here. The sky is just stunning. I wish the ''land'' part of the photo had a little bit more on the left side, but also creates a neat change from the rocky right. 8 from me.', '2009-03-11 18:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
