(5312412, 772109, 102024, '<td valign="top">Not sure if it was the post processing or the in camera noise reduction, but the image feels rather soft.  Details in the hair seem lost and the eyes look very deep, but definition is also a bit lost.  That being said, this is a nice portrait with a good DOF.</td>', 'Not sure if it was the post processing or the in camera noise reduction, but the image feels rather soft.  Details in the hair seem lost and the eyes look very deep, but definition is also a bit lost.  That being said, this is a nice portrait with a good DOF.', '2009-03-11 18:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
