(5312604, 772473, 102024, '<td valign="top">You know, normally I''d say this is over processed, but I think it works rather well with this image.  The trees are really drawn out, yet sort of flattened at the same time.  The colors are strong and the slight variations of texture in the water add depth in the foreground.</td>', 'You know, normally I''d say this is over processed, but I think it works rather well with this image.  The trees are really drawn out, yet sort of flattened at the same time.  The colors are strong and the slight variations of texture in the water add depth in the foreground.', '2009-03-11 18:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312605, 771673, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; I can see something like this as a postcard.  The Jefferson Memorial is really gleaming!  Maybe a bit too much in comparison to the rest of the distant buildings/monuments.</td>', 'Nice composition; I can see something like this as a postcard.  The Jefferson Memorial is really gleaming!  Maybe a bit too much in comparison to the rest of the distant buildings/monuments.', '2009-03-11 18:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
