(5312658, 771537, 96751, '<td valign="top">My fave child shot so far.  Great imagery between the sweet innocent face and the sharp barbs.  Great work.</td>', 'My fave child shot so far.  Great imagery between the sweet innocent face and the sharp barbs.  Great work.', '2009-03-11 18:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
