(5312664, 772448, 43088, '<td valign="top">Difficult shot. A couple of things. First, the wires in the background, while they do frame the subject, are really more of a distraction here. Second, I would like if possible to see more detail (focus/ sharpness) on the seed parts of the flower. The stem is in clear focus but the top seems blury.  The fluffs are pretty soft so it is a bit hard to be dure. I definately like you putting the sun behind it.</td>', 'Difficult shot. A couple of things. First, the wires in the background, while they do frame the subject, are really more of a distraction here. Second, I would like if possible to see more detail (focus/ sharpness) on the seed parts of the flower. The stem is in clear focus but the top seems blury.  The fluffs are pretty soft so it is a bit hard to be dure. I definately like you putting the sun behind it.', '2009-03-11 18:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312665, 772592, 80096, '<td valign="top">Good stop-action shot, excellent detail and lighting! Very natural effect, resembles an oil painting. 9</td>', 'Good stop-action shot, excellent detail and lighting! Very natural effect, resembles an oil painting. 9', '2009-03-11 18:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
