(5312675, 770249, 102315, '<td valign="top">I like this one. The graininess gives the feeling of hard work even though she is smiling.</td>', 'I like this one. The graininess gives the feeling of hard work even though she is smiling.', '2009-03-11 18:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
