(5312677, 770687, 102315, '<td valign="top">My first to vote on and I love it. I have never seen such a beautiful butterfly. My first vote in this challenge is a 10.</td>', 'My first to vote on and I love it. I have never seen such a beautiful butterfly. My first vote in this challenge is a 10.', '2009-03-11 18:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312679, 772195, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wow, look at the beautiful details you can see from the individual feathers on the wings to the soft downy texture of the brown/grey feathers just above the wing...and ice crystals on the tree branch!!! The splash of color with that bold red head on the finch brings some vibrancy to a cold winter scene. Love that you also caught some nice catchlight in the eye as well as the bokeh of the winter branches in the backdrop that complete this winter scene.</td>', 'Wow, look at the beautiful details you can see from the individual feathers on the wings to the soft downy texture of the brown/grey feathers just above the wing...and ice crystals on the tree branch!!! The splash of color with that bold red head on the finch brings some vibrancy to a cold winter scene. Love that you also caught some nice catchlight in the eye as well as the bokeh of the winter branches in the backdrop that complete this winter scene.', '2009-03-11 18:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312680, 772325, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely golden tones.  Horizon is tilted but not enough to make it look intentional to me.</td>', 'Lovely golden tones.  Horizon is tilted but not enough to make it look intentional to me.', '2009-03-11 18:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
