(5312693, 772537, 43088, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the guy in red is doing, but I like teh "snapshot" look and the compsition.  Based on the glow on his face I though he may be looking at his phone, but that is on the table. A laptop maybe? The whole thing is a mystery. Which I think is good.</td>', 'Not sure what the guy in red is doing, but I like teh "snapshot" look and the compsition.  Based on the glow on his face I though he may be looking at his phone, but that is on the table. A laptop maybe? The whole thing is a mystery. Which I think is good.', '2009-03-11 18:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
