(5312762, 772233, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the lighting to separate the black on black.  Interesting concept to put the figure in an androgynous outfit in this pose.  Nice work.  The background is distracting me a bit from the message.  Ordinarily I''d give this a mid score because of the messy-looking background, but here I sense an attempt to convey a message and fine attention to storytelling, so I will bump to 7 for creative effort.</td>', 'Nice job with the lighting to separate the black on black.  Interesting concept to put the figure in an androgynous outfit in this pose.  Nice work.  The background is distracting me a bit from the message.  Ordinarily I''d give this a mid score because of the messy-looking background, but here I sense an attempt to convey a message and fine attention to storytelling, so I will bump to 7 for creative effort.', '2009-03-11 18:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
