(5312786, 771871, 43463, '<td valign="top">Some may not like the hues for it is too orange/golden tones, but I do. Why? The hues are warm colors and the warm glow captured here along with the resting butterfly (painted lady?) really give a sense of warm summer days with the occasional soft cool breeze. It is soft in detail but for this composition it is very fitting - for it is the softness that adds to the magical  dreamy feel to this composition. The colors and soft focus really helps capture that mood of a dreamy summer day. Well done.</td>', 'Some may not like the hues for it is too orange/golden tones, but I do. Why? The hues are warm colors and the warm glow captured here along with the resting butterfly (painted lady?) really give a sense of warm summer days with the occasional soft cool breeze. It is soft in detail but for this composition it is very fitting - for it is the softness that adds to the magical  dreamy feel to this composition. The colors and soft focus really helps capture that mood of a dreamy summer day. Well done.', '2009-03-11 18:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
