(5312842, 771272, 58457, '<td valign="top">Funny with the fake flower.  Nice butterflies...  The boked has some funky shapes...</td>', 'Funny with the fake flower.  Nice butterflies...  The boked has some funky shapes...', '2009-03-11 18:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312843, 771043, 102315, '<td valign="top">Great shot. The colors match the brute strength of the battleship perfectly.</td>', 'Great shot. The colors match the brute strength of the battleship perfectly.', '2009-03-11 18:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312844, 771977, 97166, '<td valign="top">They had spent hours so far, doing their best. Up and down the mountain, drawing the lines, spelling out their message. <br/> <br/>Only time would tell if they had been successful, and as they put the final touches on the secret language that only they could know, they glanced to the sky and waited.  <br/> <br/>With a flash, the ship that hung there responded, and it was good.<br/> <br/>They had saved their world from a disaster that none but themselves, would ever know.</td>', 'They had spent hours so far, doing their best. Up and down the mountain, drawing the lines, spelling out their message.  Only time would tell if they had been successful, and as they put the final touches on the secret language that only they could know, they glanced to the sky and waited.   With a flash, the ship that hung there responded, and it was good. They had saved their world from a disaster that none but themselves, would ever know.', '2009-03-11 18:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312845, 771787, 43088, '<td valign="top">Cool light painting!</td>', 'Cool light painting!', '2009-03-11 18:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312846, 771153, 43463, '<td valign="top">It one EVER wondered what the details of a robber fly looks like, this is an excellent photo to demonstrate it! As much as I do not like flies, I can fully appreciate all the details seen on this capture. Wow, just look at the individual hairs on it''s legs and face - who knew it was ''bearded''?:-) And the details in the compound eyes - you can literally count the dots in its eyes! Fabulous macro capture - hats off to you for patience to get this shot. Flying insects rarely stay fixed for long so you probably had seconds to get the focus right.</td>', 'It one EVER wondered what the details of a robber fly looks like, this is an excellent photo to demonstrate it! As much as I do not like flies, I can fully appreciate all the details seen on this capture. Wow, just look at the individual hairs on it''s legs and face - who knew it was ''bearded''?:-) And the details in the compound eyes - you can literally count the dots in its eyes! Fabulous macro capture - hats off to you for patience to get this shot. Flying insects rarely stay fixed for long so you probably had seconds to get the focus right.', '2009-03-11 18:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312847, 771260, 32345, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and colors</td>', 'Great perspective and colors', '2009-03-11 18:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
