(5312859, 772682, 29009, '<td valign="top">I hope this doesn''t get killed in scoring, I really do.  It''s beautiful and timeless, and you were right to enter this true Hidden Gem.  :)</td>', 'I hope this doesn''t get killed in scoring, I really do.  It''s beautiful and timeless, and you were right to enter this true Hidden Gem.  :)', '2009-03-11 18:48:07.000000', NULL, 1),
