(5312863, 770255, 102315, '<td valign="top">Fast paced world. With everyone on the phone I had to look twice. I thought they were all the same person at first glance. This should be in a "how business get''s done" type ad.</td>', 'Fast paced world. With everyone on the phone I had to look twice. I thought they were all the same person at first glance. This should be in a "how business get''s done" type ad.', '2009-03-11 18:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312864, 772493, 97166, '<td valign="top">So they gathered, the men that had fought for their country so many times. The men that gave of themselves, that sacrificed so much.  They gathered, and they paid tribute, and then their heart-rending rendition of "Over the Rainbow" went off without a hitch, and hearts the world over were warmed.</td>', 'So they gathered, the men that had fought for their country so many times. The men that gave of themselves, that sacrificed so much.  They gathered, and they paid tribute, and then their heart-rending rendition of "Over the Rainbow" went off without a hitch, and hearts the world over were warmed.', '2009-03-11 18:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312865, 771712, 102315, '<td valign="top">So cute</td>', 'So cute', '2009-03-11 18:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5312866, 770255, 32872, '<td valign="top">What a statement you''ve made about our society!  I love your image.</td>', 'What a statement you''ve made about our society!  I love your image.', '2009-03-11 18:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
