(5312922, 772292, 43088, '<td valign="top">Now this is some very cool light! Curious about the source of light on the pier/ road.  An HDR it looks like?</td>', 'Now this is some very cool light! Curious about the source of light on the pier/ road.  An HDR it looks like?', '2009-03-11 18:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
