(5313395, 772291, 44611, '<td valign="top">I noted this as a thumbnail in my initial run through, and am disappointed that at this size it doesn''t live up to my expectations.  I love the interaction between the two puffins, but think this could be sharper and find the blurring in the fg and bg distracting.  That said I bet they''re not easy to capture, so well done.</td>', 'I noted this as a thumbnail in my initial run through, and am disappointed that at this size it doesn''t live up to my expectations.  I love the interaction between the two puffins, but think this could be sharper and find the blurring in the fg and bg distracting.  That said I bet they''re not easy to capture, so well done.', '2009-03-11 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
