(5313684, 771966, 66515, '<td valign="top">I would sooo tempted to call this Moona Lisa. But that would be cheesy. :) <br/> <br/>Fun capture and one that I''m sure will be memorable for most people.</td>', 'I would sooo tempted to call this Moona Lisa. But that would be cheesy. :)  Fun capture and one that I''m sure will be memorable for most people.', '2009-03-11 19:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5313685, 771086, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier now coming back to leave comments. Love all the sharp details seen in this wind kissed dandelion. Great macro shot. I can clearly see and ''feel'' the downy softness of this plants white soft spokes. The black backdrop really allow the white hues of the dandelion to step up and take center stage for it visually pops off the page.</td>', 'Voted earlier now coming back to leave comments. Love all the sharp details seen in this wind kissed dandelion. Great macro shot. I can clearly see and ''feel'' the downy softness of this plants white soft spokes. The black backdrop really allow the white hues of the dandelion to step up and take center stage for it visually pops off the page.', '2009-03-11 19:51:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5313687, 771900, 81530, '<td valign="top">Lily is covered in insects. Are they flies?</td>', 'Lily is covered in insects. Are they flies?', '2009-03-11 19:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
