(5314107, 770221, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not a horse person myself (I''m a cat lover, actually) but this is a sweet shot. I do have to make a nitpick about the blown highlights on her face, however. Midday sun is tough. There are some good adjustment techniques using layers, that can help pull in some of those highlights if they are not totally blown.</td>', 'I''m not a horse person myself (I''m a cat lover, actually) but this is a sweet shot. I do have to make a nitpick about the blown highlights on her face, however. Midday sun is tough. There are some good adjustment techniques using layers, that can help pull in some of those highlights if they are not totally blown.', '2009-03-11 20:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
