(5314192, 770261, 18197, '<td valign="top">The Shubert ... one of my old favorite theatres. I like the feeling you''ve capturd here. But I am bothered just a little that the bottom frame border is heavier (whiter?) than the top frame border. You shot this with a wide angle lens which causes things to "lean in." I would have straightened the verticals, but that''s a personal preference.</td>', 'The Shubert ... one of my old favorite theatres. I like the feeling you''ve capturd here. But I am bothered just a little that the bottom frame border is heavier (whiter?) than the top frame border. You shot this with a wide angle lens which causes things to "lean in." I would have straightened the verticals, but that''s a personal preference.', '2009-03-11 20:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5314193, 771809, 70514, '<td valign="top">The colors are so beautiful.  I love the blur of the background.  Almost sad, but hopeful.  Very nice combination.</td>', 'The colors are so beautiful.  I love the blur of the background.  Almost sad, but hopeful.  Very nice combination.', '2009-03-11 20:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
