(5314610, 770343, 37719, '<td valign="top">You know, if the ''brown'' is what you were going for, keep it out of the title.  Without that I would view this differently - a new twist; need, desperation, a ''situation.''  However, I view the picture on screen with the title and all I can say is...''huh.''<br/> <br/>I like the composition and position of the subject/composition.</td>', 'You know, if the ''brown'' is what you were going for, keep it out of the title.  Without that I would view this differently - a new twist; need, desperation, a ''situation.''  However, I view the picture on screen with the title and all I can say is...''huh.'' I like the composition and position of the subject/composition.', '2009-03-11 20:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
