(5314613, 771880, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. What a great still life! The presentation is simple, clean and elegantly minimalistic. A pleasing study of shapes, lines, and colors.  You have the circle within the  rectangular composition - shape within a shape. Love this circular window that opens up to show us the ocean off in the distance and then the spindly plant that extends it''s branches like arms reaching out for the water and the sun. The colors of the leaves or petals is a warm gold autumn type color. The reaching of the plant looks like it is seeking infusion of new life by grabbing at the water outside it''s reach. I am thinking that this would look great on someone''s wall in which the room is a minimalistic modern design! Especially if it is in a room with no windows - for this would act as one.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. What a great still life! The presentation is simple, clean and elegantly minimalistic. A pleasing study of shapes, lines, and colors.  You have the circle within the  rectangular composition - shape within a shape. Love this circular window that opens up to show us the ocean off in the distance and then the spindly plant that extends it''s branches like arms reaching out for the water and the sun. The colors of the leaves or petals is a warm gold autumn type color. The reaching of the plant looks like it is seeking infusion of new life by grabbing at the water outside it''s reach. I am thinking that this would look great on someone''s wall in which the room is a minimalistic modern design! Especially if it is in a room with no windows - for this would act as one.', '2009-03-11 20:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
