(5315087, 770173, 96572, '<td valign="top">a&amp;#8901;bun&amp;#8901;dance&amp;#8194;   &amp;#8194;[uh-buhn-duhns]  Show IPA<br/>noun<br/>1.	an extremely plentiful or oversufficient quantity or supply: an abundance of grain.<br/>2.	overflowing fullness: abundance of the heart.<br/>3.	affluence; wealth: the enjoyment of abundance.<br/>4.	Physics, Chemistry. the number of atoms of one isotope of an element divided by the total number of atoms in a mixture of the isotopes<br/> <br/>while there is not much chemistry in this picture, i do agree with the title / definition - oversufficient quantity or supply is just right.</td>', 'a&#8901;bun&#8901;dance&#8194;   &#8194;[uh-buhn-duhns]  Show IPAnoun1.	an extremely plentiful or oversufficient quantity or supply: an abundance of grain.2.	overflowing fullness: abundance of the heart.3.	affluence; wealth: the enjoyment of abundance.4.	Physics, Chemistry. the number of atoms of one isotope of an element divided by the total number of atoms in a mixture of the isotopes while there is not much chemistry in this picture, i do agree with the title / definition - oversufficient quantity or supply is just right.', '2009-03-11 21:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
