(5315092, 770626, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great shot. IMO, this would have been stronger if you cropped off the left almost 1/2 of the shot. Your "punch" is the man wiping his hands with the background of the building wall and shop tools. Love the subtle colors &amp; editing. On the other hand, my focus is so caught by the fore man that I don''t even "see" the left side unless I deliberately focus there.</td>', 'Great shot. IMO, this would have been stronger if you cropped off the left almost 1/2 of the shot. Your "punch" is the man wiping his hands with the background of the building wall and shop tools. Love the subtle colors & editing. On the other hand, my focus is so caught by the fore man that I don''t even "see" the left side unless I deliberately focus there.', '2009-03-11 21:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
