(5315401, 770256, 77196, '<td valign="top">Can you say Louis L''Amour or Zane Grey? Riding through the sage, Tom pulled up a minute to gaze at the crimson sunset. Though he''d come West more than a decade ago, he had never tired of the open sky and grand spectacle of the sun''s fond farewell to the day. Shaking his head, he urged his horse towards home.</td>', 'Can you say Louis L''Amour or Zane Grey? Riding through the sage, Tom pulled up a minute to gaze at the crimson sunset. Though he''d come West more than a decade ago, he had never tired of the open sky and grand spectacle of the sun''s fond farewell to the day. Shaking his head, he urged his horse towards home.', '2009-03-11 21:56:48.000000', NULL, 1),
