(5315820, 772105, 64989, '<td valign="top">Colors feel a little bright and un-natural.  I would tone it down in PS a bit.  I really like the detail in the trees on both sides.</td>', 'Colors feel a little bright and un-natural.  I would tone it down in PS a bit.  I really like the detail in the trees on both sides.', '2009-03-11 22:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
