(5315866, 772578, 41337, '<td valign="top">Oh no. The little one must have gotten the boot shortly after this one got done saying THIS IS SPARTA!</td>', 'Oh no. The little one must have gotten the boot shortly after this one got done saying THIS IS SPARTA!', '2009-03-11 22:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
