(5315871, 772712, 1, '<td valign="top">Awesome sky, odd title. :)  The water makes me think it''s over sharpened a tad.</td>', 'Awesome sky, odd title. :)  The water makes me think it''s over sharpened a tad.', '2009-03-11 22:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
