(5315900, 772391, 77196, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.', '2009-03-11 22:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5315901, 771852, 58457, '<td valign="top">I don''t like cats.  I don''t like pictures of cats.  But this guy is something else.  He has such a human personality, and how his left eye is slightly closed more that the right, and that tilted, gives him a quizzical, professorial look.  well done.</td>', 'I don''t like cats.  I don''t like pictures of cats.  But this guy is something else.  He has such a human personality, and how his left eye is slightly closed more that the right, and that tilted, gives him a quizzical, professorial look.  well done.', '2009-03-11 22:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
