(5316018, 770408, 97166, '<td valign="top">He gazed across the table at her, as she sat there sipping her wine.  He didn''t know how it had come this far, but it had, and he was more than a little scared.  He''d always been the player, the womanizer, the playful gigolo, but something had happened this time.  Something different.  Something scary but wonderful.<br/> <br/>He gazed across the table at her and wondered how he could possibly have fallen so deeply in love this time.  No more were thoughts of the one-night stand in his mind. No more was the looking forward to the next one. Not this time.  This time he looked at her and he saw her there in the morning, every morning. He looked at her and he saw her by his side when he was old. He looked at her at knew, for the first time in his life, that this was the one.<br/> <br/>He gazed across the table at her and saw her smiling at him, and he shyly smiled back, and reached out for her hand, at the beginning of something wonderful.</td>', 'He gazed across the table at her, as she sat there sipping her wine.  He didn''t know how it had come this far, but it had, and he was more than a little scared.  He''d always been the player, the womanizer, the playful gigolo, but something had happened this time.  Something different.  Something scary but wonderful. He gazed across the table at her and wondered how he could possibly have fallen so deeply in love this time.  No more were thoughts of the one-night stand in his mind. No more was the looking forward to the next one. Not this time.  This time he looked at her and he saw her there in the morning, every morning. He looked at her and he saw her by his side when he was old. He looked at her at knew, for the first time in his life, that this was the one. He gazed across the table at her and saw her smiling at him, and he shyly smiled back, and reached out for her hand, at the beginning of something wonderful.', '2009-03-11 22:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
