(5316079, 772485, 97166, '<td valign="top">In the vastness that is time, on an expanse of sea, two creaking old hulks appeared on the still waters.  In ages past, they had been full of life and activity, but those days were gone.  Now, they simply floated there, a skeletal memory of the past that would never again be.<br/> <br/>In the background, roaring past, was the evidence of the now, and the people on board that vessel gasped as they gazed towards the bare and decrepit hulls.  They gasped in fear and awe, for as they looked, the boats seemed to waver on the breeze, and become ghostly and ethereal.  Then, like a puff of mist, they were gone, the memory of their past gone with them.<br/> <br/>The sea returned to the time that is now, and once again forgot the time before, perhaps to return to it in the time to come.</td>', 'In the vastness that is time, on an expanse of sea, two creaking old hulks appeared on the still waters.  In ages past, they had been full of life and activity, but those days were gone.  Now, they simply floated there, a skeletal memory of the past that would never again be. In the background, roaring past, was the evidence of the now, and the people on board that vessel gasped as they gazed towards the bare and decrepit hulls.  They gasped in fear and awe, for as they looked, the boats seemed to waver on the breeze, and become ghostly and ethereal.  Then, like a puff of mist, they were gone, the memory of their past gone with them. The sea returned to the time that is now, and once again forgot the time before, perhaps to return to it in the time to come.', '2009-03-11 23:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5316080, 771385, 64989, '<td valign="top">Lots o'' contrast.  I like the choice to focus on the roots in the foreground, rather than the mountains in the rear.</td>', 'Lots o'' contrast.  I like the choice to focus on the roots in the foreground, rather than the mountains in the rear.', '2009-03-11 23:02:09.000000', NULL, 1),
