(5316174, 771880, 42100, '<td valign="top">There is a real personification to that plant...it''s as if it is quite sad and it longingly looks out the window wishing to see more of that big wide world in front of it.</td>', 'There is a real personification to that plant...it''s as if it is quite sad and it longingly looks out the window wishing to see more of that big wide world in front of it.', '2009-03-11 23:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5316175, 772475, 77196, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to take off my hat, salute, or just stand in silence and think about those whose lives were cut short - a mother losing her son, a young mother her husband, young children their father - that we might live in freedom and safety. It is indeed a poor country that can''t be grateful for the sacrifices of those in their military.</td>', 'Makes me want to take off my hat, salute, or just stand in silence and think about those whose lives were cut short - a mother losing her son, a young mother her husband, young children their father - that we might live in freedom and safety. It is indeed a poor country that can''t be grateful for the sacrifices of those in their military.', '2009-03-11 23:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5316177, 772488, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow the Sun looks so far away from us.  Good composition.</td>', 'Wow the Sun looks so far away from us.  Good composition.', '2009-03-11 23:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5316178, 772519, 66515, '<td valign="top">Interesting monochrome conversion. I really like the textures in the wood and the high contrast look to this shot.</td>', 'Interesting monochrome conversion. I really like the textures in the wood and the high contrast look to this shot.', '2009-03-11 23:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5316179, 772311, 42495, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this was setup or not, but it''s quite sad.</td>', 'I don''t know if this was setup or not, but it''s quite sad.', '2009-03-11 23:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
