(5316191, 772313, 66515, '<td valign="top">I am kinda up in the air on this shot. Its simple and minimalistic on one hand. But is it <i>too</i> minimalist?  I guess the acid test is: Would I want to print this out and put it up on my wall? Probably not but I wouldn''t fault someone if they did. So..the jury is still out. :)</td>', 'I am kinda up in the air on this shot. Its simple and minimalistic on one hand. But is it too minimalist?  I guess the acid test is: Would I want to print this out and put it up on my wall? Probably not but I wouldn''t fault someone if they did. So..the jury is still out. :)', '2009-03-11 23:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5316194, 770284, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really like how you''ve used light and mist to convey a sense of depth.</td>', 'I really like how you''ve used light and mist to convey a sense of depth.', '2009-03-11 23:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
