(5316250, 772597, 77196, '<td valign="top">feeding or sleeping? great shot with flying birds, passing people, and still birds. Like a sentinel, the old man sat on the bench, slumped forward slightly. His dark coat and pants a contrast to the white bench, the pigeons flew around him expectantly as people rushed by in their daily tasks. He did not know how long he had sat, but still he sat and waited. It would come. He knew it would.</td>', 'feeding or sleeping? great shot with flying birds, passing people, and still birds. Like a sentinel, the old man sat on the bench, slumped forward slightly. His dark coat and pants a contrast to the white bench, the pigeons flew around him expectantly as people rushed by in their daily tasks. He did not know how long he had sat, but still he sat and waited. It would come. He knew it would.', '2009-03-11 23:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
