(5316505, 772362, 79955, '<td valign="top">lighting a little harsh, some details loss in the highlights. I always feel that for these type of shots , a little underexposure on the highlights portion would be good to retain detail, then use advanced processing to get detail out of the shadow areas. Tough but possible. Another alternative would be employing HDR<br/>Also would have preferred and even more out of focus background (better bokeh)</td>', 'lighting a little harsh, some details loss in the highlights. I always feel that for these type of shots , a little underexposure on the highlights portion would be good to retain detail, then use advanced processing to get detail out of the shadow areas. Tough but possible. Another alternative would be employing HDRAlso would have preferred and even more out of focus background (better bokeh)', '2009-03-11 23:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
