(5316717, 770267, 83313, '<td valign="top">Beauty fades with time. Nice point. It''s an interesting composition, with the subject way off on the side and a fair amount of negative space on the left, but it works for this one. A bit shallower on the DOF than I am partial to (Hey, it''s a macro of a very small flower!), but that fine fuzz on the flower is nice and sharp. I like the fine fuzz.</td>', 'Beauty fades with time. Nice point. It''s an interesting composition, with the subject way off on the side and a fair amount of negative space on the left, but it works for this one. A bit shallower on the DOF than I am partial to (Hey, it''s a macro of a very small flower!), but that fine fuzz on the flower is nice and sharp. I like the fine fuzz.', '2009-03-12 00:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
