(5316948, 772643, 83313, '<td valign="top">Just a golf ball? I think not! It is really an evil plot to take men away from the loving embrace of their spouses on the weekends. Almost as insidious a plot as that "hobby" of photography.</td>', 'Just a golf ball? I think not! It is really an evil plot to take men away from the loving embrace of their spouses on the weekends. Almost as insidious a plot as that "hobby" of photography.', '2009-03-12 00:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
