(5316951, 772163, 97166, '<td valign="top">Aslan himself would never have thought it possible, existing for most of his time as the champion and savior of Narnia.  But even a savior eventually finds himself desiring companionship, and whence that companionship comes can often be from the most unlikely place imaginable.<br/> <br/>So it was that Aslan found himself in a love unlooked for and unexpected.  A love that transcended the world, the universe, and everything in it.  A love that ended up lasting eternity, and all of Narnia was better for it.</td>', 'Aslan himself would never have thought it possible, existing for most of his time as the champion and savior of Narnia.  But even a savior eventually finds himself desiring companionship, and whence that companionship comes can often be from the most unlikely place imaginable. So it was that Aslan found himself in a love unlooked for and unexpected.  A love that transcended the world, the universe, and everything in it.  A love that ended up lasting eternity, and all of Narnia was better for it.', '2009-03-12 00:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
