(5316962, 772499, 72103, '<td valign="top">Not much wrong here, maybe a tighter crop, less water, maybe a little LUCIS art ( if you''ve got it ) to bring out the detail more.  STill nice.  Must have been a magical moment.........  They''re magical creatures.  I had one come up and lie on my feet at a place called Monkey Mia in Western Australia.  He ( she? ) rolled over and looked up at me with one eye, i''m sure we contacted!</td>', 'Not much wrong here, maybe a tighter crop, less water, maybe a little LUCIS art ( if you''ve got it ) to bring out the detail more.  STill nice.  Must have been a magical moment.........  They''re magical creatures.  I had one come up and lie on my feet at a place called Monkey Mia in Western Australia.  He ( she? ) rolled over and looked up at me with one eye, i''m sure we contacted!', '2009-03-12 00:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5316963, 772718, 98171, '<td valign="top">i''m not personally against smoking, but what is the purpose in the photo? It just throws me off; this looks like it''s supposed to be a casual headshot type of thing, and instead, he''s smoking. hmmm</td>', 'i''m not personally against smoking, but what is the purpose in the photo? It just throws me off; this looks like it''s supposed to be a casual headshot type of thing, and instead, he''s smoking. hmmm', '2009-03-12 00:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
