(5317979, 772680, 12802, '<td valign="top">I love the colours in this, excellent autumn shot!  The reflections in the water add that little extra for me, full marks!</td>', 'I love the colours in this, excellent autumn shot!  The reflections in the water add that little extra for me, full marks!', '2009-03-12 03:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
