(5317986, 772317, 94235, '<td valign="top">I like the effect above the clouds. Well captured.</td>', 'I like the effect above the clouds. Well captured.', '2009-03-12 03:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5317987, 770620, 12802, '<td valign="top">You ask yourself is it actually worth using buckets on a fire like this...<br/> <br/>Love the almost silhouette of the firemen here, the bright flames at the top grab my attention first then I look downwards.<br/> <br/>So much detail here, I''ve been looking at it for a while.<br/> <br/>Well done, 9</td>', 'You ask yourself is it actually worth using buckets on a fire like this... Love the almost silhouette of the firemen here, the bright flames at the top grab my attention first then I look downwards. So much detail here, I''ve been looking at it for a while. Well done, 9', '2009-03-12 03:37:50.000000', NULL, 1);
