(5318674, 772566, 84438, '<td valign="top">This is great.  A really interesting shot.  The only thing I find lacking in this photo is the fact that the subject is stopped and looking at the camera, as opposed to ''trekking'' through the dunes.  Because of that, this comes off as more of a really, really beautiful snapshot than an artistic piece that is trying to make a statement.</td>', 'This is great.  A really interesting shot.  The only thing I find lacking in this photo is the fact that the subject is stopped and looking at the camera, as opposed to ''trekking'' through the dunes.  Because of that, this comes off as more of a really, really beautiful snapshot than an artistic piece that is trying to make a statement.', '2009-03-12 06:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318675, 772322, 63633, '<td valign="top">I have no experience with foxes, so others may disagree - but he''s so cute! Well captured and sharp, but I find the crop a bit harsh.</td>', 'I have no experience with foxes, so others may disagree - but he''s so cute! Well captured and sharp, but I find the crop a bit harsh.', '2009-03-12 06:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318676, 772588, 94235, '<td valign="top">Like how the color of the boats grabs the attention here.</td>', 'Like how the color of the boats grabs the attention here.', '2009-03-12 06:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318677, 771161, 68467, '<td valign="top">very strong portrait - with some few hours in photoshop u can make this outstanding - the eyes need a litte more work -8</td>', 'very strong portrait - with some few hours in photoshop u can make this outstanding - the eyes need a litte more work -8', '2009-03-12 06:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318678, 772620, 100393, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great portrait shot but the post processing seems to have pulled the life out of the image.</td>', 'I think this is a great portrait shot but the post processing seems to have pulled the life out of the image.', '2009-03-12 06:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318679, 771701, 7786, '<td valign="top">Fínasta norðurljósamynd en óheppilegt að þú hafir ekki nýtt þér alla 720 pixlana sem þú hefur í þessari keppni. Það hefði munað öllu að nýta þá.</td>', 'Fínasta norðurljósamynd en óheppilegt að þú hafir ekki nýtt þér alla 720 pixlana sem þú hefur í þessari keppni. Það hefði munað öllu að nýta þá.', '2009-03-12 06:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318680, 772470, 84438, '<td valign="top">This is a well done photo of an interesting subject.  Unfortunately, this just isn''t a very attractive looking butterfly, nor are the colours particularly striking overall.  The technicals are very good though.</td>', 'This is a well done photo of an interesting subject.  Unfortunately, this just isn''t a very attractive looking butterfly, nor are the colours particularly striking overall.  The technicals are very good though.', '2009-03-12 06:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
