(5318699, 772575, 68467, '<td valign="top">stunning colors</td>', 'stunning colors', '2009-03-12 06:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318700, 770281, 84438, '<td valign="top">This is nice ,but there are a few things that throw me off when looking at this photo.  Number one, because of the angle, I can tell this this is a photo taken of an actor on a stage.  Second of all, the flash that is reflecting off of the stage reenforces this point even more.  Because of this, I can''t get ''lost'' in this photo or the subject.</td>', 'This is nice ,but there are a few things that throw me off when looking at this photo.  Number one, because of the angle, I can tell this this is a photo taken of an actor on a stage.  Second of all, the flash that is reflecting off of the stage reenforces this point even more.  Because of this, I can''t get ''lost'' in this photo or the subject.', '2009-03-12 06:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
