(5318707, 772246, 73942, '<td valign="top">great action shot, love how the dirt is kicking up, makes this a little different from the other bike shots</td>', 'great action shot, love how the dirt is kicking up, makes this a little different from the other bike shots', '2009-03-12 06:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
