(5318709, 772108, 84438, '<td valign="top">Love your BW treatment of this photo.  A very beautiful location.  I don''t know why, but one of the first things that jumped out at me was the out of focus hand...  So strange that something so small was so noticable.</td>', 'Love your BW treatment of this photo.  A very beautiful location.  I don''t know why, but one of the first things that jumped out at me was the out of focus hand...  So strange that something so small was so noticable.', '2009-03-12 06:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
