(5318714, 771679, 84438, '<td valign="top">Interesting subjects.  The blue of the water makes a really nice background and offers some great contrast, causing your subjects to really stand out.</td>', 'Interesting subjects.  The blue of the water makes a really nice background and offers some great contrast, causing your subjects to really stand out.', '2009-03-12 06:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
