(5318750, 771461, 84438, '<td valign="top">Very cool location.  I could probably have used less of the sky and more of the snow on the mountain and waterfall..  But then it would be a pretty cliched DPC shot, wouldn''t it?  Never mind, I like it how it is. :)</td>', 'Very cool location.  I could probably have used less of the sky and more of the snow on the mountain and waterfall..  But then it would be a pretty cliched DPC shot, wouldn''t it?  Never mind, I like it how it is. :)', '2009-03-12 06:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318751, 771979, 88204, '<td valign="top">Great angle and composition. The softness works well. Simple colors give it punch but keep the attention on the subject. I like how you can see all the hands with the wedding rings on them. It really emphasizes your message. Well done!</td>', 'Great angle and composition. The softness works well. Simple colors give it punch but keep the attention on the subject. I like how you can see all the hands with the wedding rings on them. It really emphasizes your message. Well done!', '2009-03-12 06:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318752, 770513, 92512, '<td valign="top">That stare gives me the willys</td>', 'That stare gives me the willys', '2009-03-12 06:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318753, 772202, 104116, '<td valign="top">Well done, very interesting composition.</td>', 'Well done, very interesting composition.', '2009-03-12 06:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318755, 771862, 63633, '<td valign="top">A beautiful mountainscape with a stunning sky, but the crop looks a little harsh at the bottom for my tastes.</td>', 'A beautiful mountainscape with a stunning sky, but the crop looks a little harsh at the bottom for my tastes.', '2009-03-12 06:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318756, 772754, 84438, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, beautiful shot.  Nice emotional impact.  The only thing that would improve it, is if there was a bit more space between the man and woman, making it more obvious that they were holding hands.  Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful, beautiful shot.  Nice emotional impact.  The only thing that would improve it, is if there was a bit more space between the man and woman, making it more obvious that they were holding hands.  Nice job.', '2009-03-12 06:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318757, 772253, 92512, '<td valign="top">lacks something,?????</td>', 'lacks something,?????', '2009-03-12 06:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318758, 770662, 94235, '<td valign="top">Well done, and nice colors. The area on the right of the reflection looks like it has been blacked out.</td>', 'Well done, and nice colors. The area on the right of the reflection looks like it has been blacked out.', '2009-03-12 06:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318759, 771464, 10390, '<td valign="top">nicely framed, but there is too much contrast in this picture, the sky is way too black</td>', 'nicely framed, but there is too much contrast in this picture, the sky is way too black', '2009-03-12 06:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5318761, 772550, 60173, '<td valign="top">Absolutely lovely.</td>', 'Absolutely lovely.', '2009-03-12 06:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
