(5318768, 772099, 10390, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, nice color tones but I would like to see a off center composition or a vertical crop.</td>', 'Nice picture, nice color tones but I would like to see a off center composition or a vertical crop.', '2009-03-12 06:44:09.000000', NULL, 1),
