(5319559, 772562, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, technically excellent.  Because of the close crop, I have no idea why there is water on the subjects'' face though..  Did she splash it on her own face?  Did someone else spash her?  Because of this, I don''t feel like I have any connection with the photo.</td>', 'Nice photo, technically excellent.  Because of the close crop, I have no idea why there is water on the subjects'' face though..  Did she splash it on her own face?  Did someone else spash her?  Because of this, I don''t feel like I have any connection with the photo.', '2009-03-12 08:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
