(5319697, 771800, 49109, '<td valign="top">good composition and interesting lighting style, the blown light on his forehead could have been avoided with a softer light source</td>', 'good composition and interesting lighting style, the blown light on his forehead could have been avoided with a softer light source', '2009-03-12 09:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
