(5320546, 771470, 58457, '<td valign="top">an interesting viewpoint for sure...  I don''t know what to comment about--I guess there isn''t necessarily anything in the shot that grabs me.. maybe if it were taken at a time of day when the lighting was more dramatic, or maybe b&amp;W treatment (I just tried it in Photoshop black and white w/ a bit more contrast--see what you think...)</td>', 'an interesting viewpoint for sure...  I don''t know what to comment about--I guess there isn''t necessarily anything in the shot that grabs me.. maybe if it were taken at a time of day when the lighting was more dramatic, or maybe b&W treatment (I just tried it in Photoshop black and white w/ a bit more contrast--see what you think...)', '2009-03-12 10:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5320548, 771924, 89341, '<td valign="top">great pov and nice pp work brining out the colours</td>', 'great pov and nice pp work brining out the colours', '2009-03-12 10:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
