(5320556, 772153, 58457, '<td valign="top">a nice gaze, like she''s been caught at something, especially given the dispenser on the left.  a very photojournalistic quality.</td>', 'a nice gaze, like she''s been caught at something, especially given the dispenser on the left.  a very photojournalistic quality.', '2009-03-12 10:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
