(5320979, 770685, 83845, '<td valign="top">If the dog were looking at you and were more in focus, this would be a great shot!  Nice composition, good eye :)</td>', 'If the dog were looking at you and were more in focus, this would be a great shot!  Nice composition, good eye :)', '2009-03-12 10:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5320980, 771106, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. I absolutely LOVE the soft pastel colors in this composition! It takes on the aspects of a watercolor painting. Those soft hues play well with the subject and help to further convey to the viewer the feeling of touch. We can ''feel'' the softness of the subject just by looking at it. I also love the lines in this composition. You have them ''sweeping'' at a diagonal which adds further visual appeal and interest. I also love the textures I see here too. There is the cottony spindly threads that are between the brown spires that also invoke the idea of softness.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. I absolutely LOVE the soft pastel colors in this composition! It takes on the aspects of a watercolor painting. Those soft hues play well with the subject and help to further convey to the viewer the feeling of touch. We can ''feel'' the softness of the subject just by looking at it. I also love the lines in this composition. You have them ''sweeping'' at a diagonal which adds further visual appeal and interest. I also love the textures I see here too. There is the cottony spindly threads that are between the brown spires that also invoke the idea of softness.', '2009-03-12 10:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5320981, 770336, 24454, '<td valign="top">AWESOME!  I would be proud to have this one as one of my best photos of all time!  Good luck!</td>', 'AWESOME!  I would be proud to have this one as one of my best photos of all time!  Good luck!', '2009-03-12 10:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
