(5321027, 772178, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a scene.  I''m wonder what affect it would have if the horizon was leveled.  The despeckled process takes away from the image for me.</td>', 'Wow, what a scene.  I''m wonder what affect it would have if the horizon was leveled.  The despeckled process takes away from the image for me.', '2009-03-12 10:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
