(5321213, 770541, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. FABULOUS sunset colors on this capture!!!! Love the warm reds, purples, and orange hues seen in this beautiful landscape and it is all reflected in the glasslike lake. Love the clouds too in this shot that travel like leading lines across the sky. The silhouettes of the bare trees against the sunset sky also adds tremendous visual appeal to those gazing upon this lovely landscape.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. FABULOUS sunset colors on this capture!!!! Love the warm reds, purples, and orange hues seen in this beautiful landscape and it is all reflected in the glasslike lake. Love the clouds too in this shot that travel like leading lines across the sky. The silhouettes of the bare trees against the sunset sky also adds tremendous visual appeal to those gazing upon this lovely landscape.', '2009-03-12 11:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
