(5321277, 772536, 5112, '<td valign="top">... or ... NEWS FLASH!  Toddler eats pet dog!  [just teasing].  <br/> <br/>This is a very personal moment, and likely a memory that you''re going to cherish for years to come.  It is also probably too personal an image to do well at a very public contest such as the challenges here.</td>', '... or ... NEWS FLASH!  Toddler eats pet dog!  [just teasing].   This is a very personal moment, and likely a memory that you''re going to cherish for years to come.  It is also probably too personal an image to do well at a very public contest such as the challenges here.', '2009-03-12 11:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321278, 772355, 96751, '<td valign="top">The definition of Big Sky.  or Big Country!  Nice, glowing colors, love how the rails draw the eye into the distance, although they point away from the main event of the snow-capped mountains.  Great luminosity in the clouds.</td>', 'The definition of Big Sky.  or Big Country!  Nice, glowing colors, love how the rails draw the eye into the distance, although they point away from the main event of the snow-capped mountains.  Great luminosity in the clouds.', '2009-03-12 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321281, 770514, 39560, '<td valign="top">I like the snow on the bird. Focus seems to be a little soft particularly in the eye area. Maybe a tad underexposed also.</td>', 'I like the snow on the bird. Focus seems to be a little soft particularly in the eye area. Maybe a tad underexposed also.', '2009-03-12 11:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321282, 772307, 674, '<td valign="top">looks like a poster for a tropical island tree and moon and if life was perfect there would have been a large white yacht gliding by!</td>', 'looks like a poster for a tropical island tree and moon and if life was perfect there would have been a large white yacht gliding by!', '2009-03-12 11:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321283, 771618, 87204, '<td valign="top">OMG! What a cool place!I like it in color, but i bet it would be neat in duotone.</td>', 'OMG! What a cool place!I like it in color, but i bet it would be neat in duotone.', '2009-03-12 11:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321284, 772736, 811, '<td valign="top">Great composition, detail and exposure.  The colors seem a bit muted, though just a touch of contrast/saturation or adjustment of levels could give it a bit more dynamic?</td>', 'Great composition, detail and exposure.  The colors seem a bit muted, though just a touch of contrast/saturation or adjustment of levels could give it a bit more dynamic?', '2009-03-12 11:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
