(5321286, 772647, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love it!  I love how you were able to make it such a large close-up and still get his whole trunk in.  Any elephant done well will always get a high score from me :)</td>', 'I love it!  I love how you were able to make it such a large close-up and still get his whole trunk in.  Any elephant done well will always get a high score from me :)', '2009-03-12 11:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
