(5321312, 771251, 70000, '<td valign="top">Wow what crazy weather! I would have liked to see a little more detail in the highlights, but very cool.</td>', 'Wow what crazy weather! I would have liked to see a little more detail in the highlights, but very cool.', '2009-03-12 11:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321313, 770286, 39560, '<td valign="top">Nice lines. Don''t care for the border much. More could''ve been done with sky and clouds I think.</td>', 'Nice lines. Don''t care for the border much. More could''ve been done with sky and clouds I think.', '2009-03-12 11:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321315, 772617, 87204, '<td valign="top">I never knew they had mustaches.</td>', 'I never knew they had mustaches.', '2009-03-12 11:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321316, 772172, 99981, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of the sunset and the blue of the sky in this shot, i just don´t like this silhouette of tree. I understand your idea and i like it, but maybe it''s just from this view, but the tree is distracting me, so as the grey thing at the left bottom. Good luck, sorry if i was rude.</td>', 'I love the colors of the sunset and the blue of the sky in this shot, i just don´t like this silhouette of tree. I understand your idea and i like it, but maybe it''s just from this view, but the tree is distracting me, so as the grey thing at the left bottom. Good luck, sorry if i was rude.', '2009-03-12 11:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321317, 772011, 4226, '<td valign="top">sharp and clean shot.</td>', 'sharp and clean shot.', '2009-03-12 11:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321319, 772289, 1, '<td valign="top">This is so perfectly crisp with good tones and great composure.</td>', 'This is so perfectly crisp with good tones and great composure.', '2009-03-12 11:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321320, 772206, 70000, '<td valign="top">The blurry patch in the foreground is distracting here I think, but what a capture! I have never actually seen a live cicada before I think...only the shells the leave behind.</td>', 'The blurry patch in the foreground is distracting here I think, but what a capture! I have never actually seen a live cicada before I think...only the shells the leave behind.', '2009-03-12 11:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321321, 772387, 5112, '<td valign="top">In some ways this is very, very beautiful.  The colours are outstanding, and it is quite commendable that you managed to keep the gradients smooth, no banding that I can see (except on the ball, the banding there is noticeable).  <br/> <br/>I think what is keeping me from really liking this image is the ball.  From a technical POV, the colour on it is too different than the colours of the papers, it is too strong maybe.  There is the banding.  But most of all, the halo around the edge!  In a very graphic image like this one, that halo really doesn''t work and distracts quite a bit.<br/> <br/>But it certainly is an eye-catching creation!  It even looks somewhat like an eye peeping through a courtain.</td>', 'In some ways this is very, very beautiful.  The colours are outstanding, and it is quite commendable that you managed to keep the gradients smooth, no banding that I can see (except on the ball, the banding there is noticeable).   I think what is keeping me from really liking this image is the ball.  From a technical POV, the colour on it is too different than the colours of the papers, it is too strong maybe.  There is the banding.  But most of all, the halo around the edge!  In a very graphic image like this one, that halo really doesn''t work and distracts quite a bit. But it certainly is an eye-catching creation!  It even looks somewhat like an eye peeping through a courtain.', '2009-03-12 11:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321322, 772577, 45857, '<td valign="top">Interesting architectural details.</td>', 'Interesting architectural details.', '2009-03-12 11:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321324, 770566, 24454, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Sorry to be so cliche.  The "Wow" came out involuntarily :)  I just so love everything about this.  The drama.  The perspective.  It is fabulous, and only my 2nd 10!</td>', 'WOW!  Sorry to be so cliche.  The "Wow" came out involuntarily :)  I just so love everything about this.  The drama.  The perspective.  It is fabulous, and only my 2nd 10!', '2009-03-12 11:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321325, 771415, 87204, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2009-03-12 11:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321327, 770965, 70000, '<td valign="top">The colors are a bit much here I think. The composition and play on scale is really nice and I don''t think you needed to make the colors so unnaturally bright. The technicolored sunset is tired.</td>', 'The colors are a bit much here I think. The composition and play on scale is really nice and I don''t think you needed to make the colors so unnaturally bright. The technicolored sunset is tired.', '2009-03-12 11:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321329, 770606, 87204, '<td valign="top">Lonely spot</td>', 'Lonely spot', '2009-03-12 11:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321330, 772436, 1, '<td valign="top">Lovely pet portrait, but the processing (maybe too much dodging?) seems to have made the sky look a little strange.</td>', 'Lovely pet portrait, but the processing (maybe too much dodging?) seems to have made the sky look a little strange.', '2009-03-12 11:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5321331, 772435, 327, '<td valign="top">where can I get lashes like that? Little sweetie.</td>', 'where can I get lashes like that? Little sweetie.', '2009-03-12 11:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
