(5323099, 771880, 97166, '<td valign="top">It stood there with it''s branches plastered to the window, and it dreamed.<br/> <br/>It dreamed of the blowing wind upon its leaves.<br/> <br/>It dreamed of the smell of the sea salt in the air.<br/> <br/>It dreamed of the sound of the waves and the call of the gulls and the laughter of children as they danced through the tide pools and discovered the life of the sea.<br/> <br/>It stood there with it''s branches plastered to the window, and it wished beyond wishes that it had been born a tree.</td>', 'It stood there with it''s branches plastered to the window, and it dreamed. It dreamed of the blowing wind upon its leaves. It dreamed of the smell of the sea salt in the air. It dreamed of the sound of the waves and the call of the gulls and the laughter of children as they danced through the tide pools and discovered the life of the sea. It stood there with it''s branches plastered to the window, and it wished beyond wishes that it had been born a tree.', '2009-03-12 13:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
