(5323519, 770369, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very tender, very beautiful.  I like the touches of gold in the handles and the edges of the basket, the yellowish blanket complements that, and the slightly toned baby, perfectly!  Both a beautiful memory, and a wonderful picture.</td>', 'Very tender, very beautiful.  I like the touches of gold in the handles and the edges of the basket, the yellowish blanket complements that, and the slightly toned baby, perfectly!  Both a beautiful memory, and a wonderful picture.', '2009-03-12 14:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5323521, 772566, 36981, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  There seem to be quite a few yellow/gold/blue images in this challenge, using the colors in ways I''ve never seen before.  I love almost all of them, but this is one of my favorites because the subject is so well done as well.   Bumping to a 9.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  There seem to be quite a few yellow/gold/blue images in this challenge, using the colors in ways I''ve never seen before.  I love almost all of them, but this is one of my favorites because the subject is so well done as well.   Bumping to a 9.', '2009-03-12 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
