(5323549, 770412, 81530, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but it took me a while to figure out if the background was water or sky. Very deceptive.</td>', 'I don''t know why, but it took me a while to figure out if the background was water or sky. Very deceptive.', '2009-03-12 14:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5323550, 770578, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful use of shallow DOF!  If I were to nitpick, there are two things that come to mind.  (1) the subject could use just a little more light, and (2) the OOF circles, to my mind, should be to the other side, in the same place to which the plant is leaning into.  As it it, the plant is leaning away from them, and visually it doesn''t work as well (for my eyes).  This is just opinion :)</td>', 'Very beautiful use of shallow DOF!  If I were to nitpick, there are two things that come to mind.  (1) the subject could use just a little more light, and (2) the OOF circles, to my mind, should be to the other side, in the same place to which the plant is leaning into.  As it it, the plant is leaning away from them, and visually it doesn''t work as well (for my eyes).  This is just opinion :)', '2009-03-12 14:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
