(5324535, 771836, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now. There is such FABULOUS detail seen in this moon photo! Craters, gouges, and such... The red color almost makes me think of Mars - but I have seen pictures and blood red/reddish moons before. Harvest Moon? I like that you did not do a close crop such that all we see is the moon for the black backdrop of space and the stars really complement the photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. There is such FABULOUS detail seen in this moon photo! Craters, gouges, and such... The red color almost makes me think of Mars - but I have seen pictures and blood red/reddish moons before. Harvest Moon? I like that you did not do a close crop such that all we see is the moon for the black backdrop of space and the stars really complement the photo.', '2009-03-12 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5324537, 772179, 30982, '<td valign="top">To me, it has a wonderful strength.  Your composition and light are quite nice.</td>', 'To me, it has a wonderful strength.  Your composition and light are quite nice.', '2009-03-12 15:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
