(5324754, 771270, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow! The colors are stunningly beautiful and rich in tones! The landscape with the single white horse and what looks like ancient stone ruins in the backdrop is a lovely sight to behold. The details are wonderful as that I can see with such clarity the directions of the fur coat of that mountain pony. I also love how the early morning sunlight plays upon the tail, legs, and face of the horse that baths it with a nice golden glow. The greens of the region seen here showcase the deep rich and lush vegetation. Sigh, someday, I''d love to see Ireland but for now I have to settle to see it through the photographic captures of others that highlight the beauty of the place.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow! The colors are stunningly beautiful and rich in tones! The landscape with the single white horse and what looks like ancient stone ruins in the backdrop is a lovely sight to behold. The details are wonderful as that I can see with such clarity the directions of the fur coat of that mountain pony. I also love how the early morning sunlight plays upon the tail, legs, and face of the horse that baths it with a nice golden glow. The greens of the region seen here showcase the deep rich and lush vegetation. Sigh, someday, I''d love to see Ireland but for now I have to settle to see it through the photographic captures of others that highlight the beauty of the place.', '2009-03-12 15:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
