(5324862, 772682, 36981, '<td valign="top">This is lovely.  From the blur to the beautiful colors, it''s very instriguing.</td>', 'This is lovely.  From the blur to the beautiful colors, it''s very instriguing.', '2009-03-12 15:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5324863, 772578, 53964, '<td valign="top">It took every ounce of his remaining strength, but he was on top once more. Oh, he realised that it was only metaphorically, that he had ceded his dominance to a younger, more vigourous ram long ago, but standing here now, surveying the crags and valleys where he''d watched over his harem for so many years he felt a surge of pride and satisfaction. It had been a hard life and he had the scars to prove it but he''d risen to the challenge. He was ready to go now; he''d gained the peak one last time and could now take the rest he''d earned.</td>', 'It took every ounce of his remaining strength, but he was on top once more. Oh, he realised that it was only metaphorically, that he had ceded his dominance to a younger, more vigourous ram long ago, but standing here now, surveying the crags and valleys where he''d watched over his harem for so many years he felt a surge of pride and satisfaction. It had been a hard life and he had the scars to prove it but he''d risen to the challenge. He was ready to go now; he''d gained the peak one last time and could now take the rest he''d earned.', '2009-03-12 15:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
