(5324868, 772133, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lady, nice comp and lighting.  I think you lost sharpness in the resizing and when I try to focus on her face the resulting blur hurts my eyes.<br/>... or maybe I''m just looking at too many photos!</td>', 'Beautiful lady, nice comp and lighting.  I think you lost sharpness in the resizing and when I try to focus on her face the resulting blur hurts my eyes.... or maybe I''m just looking at too many photos!', '2009-03-12 15:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
