(5324903, 772407, 100106, '<td valign="top">By Freestyler do you mean BBoying? Even without your title, her clothing/style would have said this to me. Maybe I''m missing your point, if so I apologise. On the photo itself...well done. Your focus, composition and subject are great. Love the dark shadows under her Kangol (?) on her eyes. This adds a bit of mytstery for me. The detail within her jacket and jeans are outstanding. The last but not least - her experssion while trying to get that shot is wonderful. She has enough space to breath and really can''t find anything to fix or try different. 8</td>', 'By Freestyler do you mean BBoying? Even without your title, her clothing/style would have said this to me. Maybe I''m missing your point, if so I apologise. On the photo itself...well done. Your focus, composition and subject are great. Love the dark shadows under her Kangol (?) on her eyes. This adds a bit of mytstery for me. The detail within her jacket and jeans are outstanding. The last but not least - her experssion while trying to get that shot is wonderful. She has enough space to breath and really can''t find anything to fix or try different. 8', '2009-03-12 15:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5324906, 771124, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great photo ... composition, lighting, colors, focus ... Nice work.</td>', 'Great photo ... composition, lighting, colors, focus ... Nice work.', '2009-03-12 15:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5324907, 772730, 68467, '<td valign="top">nice tunnel effect</td>', 'nice tunnel effect', '2009-03-12 15:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
