(5324910, 771215, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. I can''t help but hear the song "Sitting on the dock of the bay..." This photo sooooo captures a relaxed laidback feel of sitting on the dock on a hot summer day chatting away with friends. Love the silhouettes and the addition of the sailboat in the composition is a wonderful - it further strengthens the idea of a day at the lake. You composed it wonderfully with the dock extending out from the bottom right corner towards the middle of the shot, the sailboat occupies the mid far left corner and then all the rest is the lake, sky, and the mountains that cut accross the middle of the photo. A very eye pleasing arrangement of elements. Love the colors too - the bright blue sky with the billowy white clouds also helps cement the idea of a relaxed day at the lake. The processing where the edges fade out to white is a nice touch too for it invokes the idea that this is a memory flashback to a enjoyable time in the past.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. I can''t help but hear the song "Sitting on the dock of the bay..." This photo sooooo captures a relaxed laidback feel of sitting on the dock on a hot summer day chatting away with friends. Love the silhouettes and the addition of the sailboat in the composition is a wonderful - it further strengthens the idea of a day at the lake. You composed it wonderfully with the dock extending out from the bottom right corner towards the middle of the shot, the sailboat occupies the mid far left corner and then all the rest is the lake, sky, and the mountains that cut accross the middle of the photo. A very eye pleasing arrangement of elements. Love the colors too - the bright blue sky with the billowy white clouds also helps cement the idea of a relaxed day at the lake. The processing where the edges fade out to white is a nice touch too for it invokes the idea that this is a memory flashback to a enjoyable time in the past.', '2009-03-12 15:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
