(5325045, 770421, 39427, '<td valign="top">An example of a shot that takes it to that next level of emotion and meaning.  Assuming this is a pure documentary photograph, IMO, an image like this is infinitely more valuable than the posed nonsense we see everywhere.  I don''t mean ''nonsense'', those types of shot have their time and place, I''m just saying that capturing real people doing real things is what I think photography is all about and wish I saw more of it on this site.  The expression and light on the face and the shafts of light behind make this a stand out shot and my first 10 this challenge.  The photograph just screams ''realness'' to me, GL</td>', 'An example of a shot that takes it to that next level of emotion and meaning.  Assuming this is a pure documentary photograph, IMO, an image like this is infinitely more valuable than the posed nonsense we see everywhere.  I don''t mean ''nonsense'', those types of shot have their time and place, I''m just saying that capturing real people doing real things is what I think photography is all about and wish I saw more of it on this site.  The expression and light on the face and the shafts of light behind make this a stand out shot and my first 10 this challenge.  The photograph just screams ''realness'' to me, GL', '2009-03-12 15:55:47.000000', NULL, 1),
