(5325125, 772613, 88822, '<td valign="top">a little over exposed, and the blue marks on the wall could be cloned out, also the composition is a little tight in my opinion,</td>', 'a little over exposed, and the blue marks on the wall could be cloned out, also the composition is a little tight in my opinion,', '2009-03-12 16:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5325127, 772369, 39427, '<td valign="top">very awesome.  Everything about it.  Composition is cohesive and stable with the man/shadow/trailer forming that visual triangle.  The addition of movement in the feet but crispness in the rest of the body means you got the perfect shutter speed, adds another element to the shot.  To top it off, you captured something cool happening.  Shot could be in a magazine (would love to check it out in color), giving it a 9 hope it does well</td>', 'very awesome.  Everything about it.  Composition is cohesive and stable with the man/shadow/trailer forming that visual triangle.  The addition of movement in the feet but crispness in the rest of the body means you got the perfect shutter speed, adds another element to the shot.  To top it off, you captured something cool happening.  Shot could be in a magazine (would love to check it out in color), giving it a 9 hope it does well', '2009-03-12 16:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5325128, 772233, 100687, '<td valign="top">This looks very #D. What did you use for the backdrop?</td>', 'This looks very #D. What did you use for the backdrop?', '2009-03-12 16:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
