(5325949, 772413, 96751, '<td valign="top">Could see this in a make-up magazine.  Although I understand that the make-up and eye are the subject, I''m not a big fan of oversoftened skin.</td>', 'Could see this in a make-up magazine.  Although I understand that the make-up and eye are the subject, I''m not a big fan of oversoftened skin.', '2009-03-12 17:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
