(5325969, 771976, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lovely! A bird shot with soul! Such a welcome change from the "portraits" that content themselves with detail, but seem to have no motivating, essential force behind them.</td>', 'Lovely! A bird shot with soul! Such a welcome change from the "portraits" that content themselves with detail, but seem to have no motivating, essential force behind them.', '2009-03-12 17:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
