(5325971, 770287, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is a really good image; if this was one of mine I''d perhaps take the yellow saturation down a little, but only you know what the best colour settings were.</td>', 'This is a really good image; if this was one of mine I''d perhaps take the yellow saturation down a little, but only you know what the best colour settings were.', '2009-03-12 17:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
