(5326013, 771884, 97166, '<td valign="top">Petrie was always a bit of a show-off, so when he came in for his snack that day, and dived just a little too deep, and caught his bill on the waves, and went tumbling off in a display of spectacular failure, the pelicans cheered mightily.<br/> <br/>"Good on ya Petrie!" they shouted in catcalls and jeers, and laughed.  For one such as Petrie, a little Schadenfreude can go a long, long way.</td>', 'Petrie was always a bit of a show-off, so when he came in for his snack that day, and dived just a little too deep, and caught his bill on the waves, and went tumbling off in a display of spectacular failure, the pelicans cheered mightily. "Good on ya Petrie!" they shouted in catcalls and jeers, and laughed.  For one such as Petrie, a little Schadenfreude can go a long, long way.', '2009-03-12 17:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
