(5326048, 772486, 70484, '<td valign="top">I like the texture created by the stone walls. However, the shadows seem too dark to see the blind beggar. Also, I don''t really like the over-light part on the left. Maybe a closer crop to just include the wall directly behind the beggar would allow you to lighten it up a little bit in order to see more of his features.</td>', 'I like the texture created by the stone walls. However, the shadows seem too dark to see the blind beggar. Also, I don''t really like the over-light part on the left. Maybe a closer crop to just include the wall directly behind the beggar would allow you to lighten it up a little bit in order to see more of his features.', '2009-03-12 17:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
