(5326526, 772361, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the rooftop perspective on this.  Very sharp b/w, wonderful preservation of details.  Looks almost like a storybook illustration.</td>', 'Love the rooftop perspective on this.  Very sharp b/w, wonderful preservation of details.  Looks almost like a storybook illustration.', '2009-03-12 18:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
