(5326528, 771379, 36065, '<td valign="top">I think that this one had a good deal of potential, especially with DPCs apparent insatiable hunger for third world images.  The darkness of the image, unfortunately, leaves my hanging and only going back to the super-bright fingernails of the subject.  I''d like to see this one with some lighting that was a good deal less harsh.</td>', 'I think that this one had a good deal of potential, especially with DPCs apparent insatiable hunger for third world images.  The darkness of the image, unfortunately, leaves my hanging and only going back to the super-bright fingernails of the subject.  I''d like to see this one with some lighting that was a good deal less harsh.', '2009-03-12 18:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
