(5326565, 772513, 98339, '<td valign="top">I have a shot of my nephew coming off the fire line in CA...it is something...really like your tones in the photo...</td>', 'I have a shot of my nephew coming off the fire line in CA...it is something...really like your tones in the photo...', '2009-03-12 18:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5326566, 771435, 36065, '<td valign="top">This image holds the potential for a great deal of interest.  The colors are phenomenal, though I do see a good deal of banding on my monitor.  The image especially suffers from its small size.  Always try to use the largest allowance that DPC offers.  I''d like to see this one really large, and I''d at least like to see it at the full challenge allowance of 720px.</td>', 'This image holds the potential for a great deal of interest.  The colors are phenomenal, though I do see a good deal of banding on my monitor.  The image especially suffers from its small size.  Always try to use the largest allowance that DPC offers.  I''d like to see this one really large, and I''d at least like to see it at the full challenge allowance of 720px.', '2009-03-12 18:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5326568, 771894, 70484, '<td valign="top">I like that this isn''t a typical capture of a cat. Nice detail of the whiskers. The lighting is very good.</td>', 'I like that this isn''t a typical capture of a cat. Nice detail of the whiskers. The lighting is very good.', '2009-03-12 18:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5326570, 770987, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great eyes, but the smudge on the nose and chin really make me smile.  Sweet cat with good detail on the eyes.  Even the crop is good.</td>', 'Great eyes, but the smudge on the nose and chin really make me smile.  Sweet cat with good detail on the eyes.  Even the crop is good.', '2009-03-12 18:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
