(5326597, 771920, 36065, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, but too much darkness.  The shadows you captured give an uneasy deformity to the child''s face.</td>', 'Interesting concept, but too much darkness.  The shadows you captured give an uneasy deformity to the child''s face.', '2009-03-12 18:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
