(5326600, 770589, 70484, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow depth of field for this, it brings more focus to the ring. Personally I probably would have cropped out the bright green light in the upper left, it''s a little distracting. Other than that, I really like this.</td>', 'I like the shallow depth of field for this, it brings more focus to the ring. Personally I probably would have cropped out the bright green light in the upper left, it''s a little distracting. Other than that, I really like this.', '2009-03-12 18:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
