(5326659, 770822, 96751, '<td valign="top">The b/w portion of this shot is awesome.  What an incredible car, and the setting is really moving.  I also like the processing on the sign.  But together the get in each other''s way.  The sign is too big and obstructs the car, and the car is too interesting and draws from the sign.</td>', 'The b/w portion of this shot is awesome.  What an incredible car, and the setting is really moving.  I also like the processing on the sign.  But together the get in each other''s way.  The sign is too big and obstructs the car, and the car is too interesting and draws from the sign.', '2009-03-12 18:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
