(5326803, 771079, 102024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful perspective with a very dark image.  The post processing brings out the details in this and the subtle tonal variation gives a very nostalgic feel (in my mind) to this image.  It could be a teeny bit brighter though.</td>', 'Wonderful perspective with a very dark image.  The post processing brings out the details in this and the subtle tonal variation gives a very nostalgic feel (in my mind) to this image.  It could be a teeny bit brighter though.', '2009-03-12 18:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
