(5326805, 770344, 102394, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of texture beside her nose that is really distracting for me - maybe it''s because of the lighting on that side of her face?  I think a softer light might help smooth out her skin.</td>', 'There is a lot of texture beside her nose that is really distracting for me - maybe it''s because of the lighting on that side of her face?  I think a softer light might help smooth out her skin.', '2009-03-12 18:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
