(5326854, 770412, 96751, '<td valign="top">This shot really made me stop to examine it.  I''m still not sure what I''m looking at, but the colors are really rich, and the lighting on the leaves is wonderful.  I also really like the lower ripples, and am mystified as to whether the upper ripples and butterfly are the reflection or the real thing :-)</td>', 'This shot really made me stop to examine it.  I''m still not sure what I''m looking at, but the colors are really rich, and the lighting on the leaves is wonderful.  I also really like the lower ripples, and am mystified as to whether the upper ripples and butterfly are the reflection or the real thing :-)', '2009-03-12 18:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5326856, 772099, 100064, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of "The Girl With the Golden Earring" painting. Nice light. Beautiful crispness. 8.</td>', 'Reminds me of "The Girl With the Golden Earring" painting. Nice light. Beautiful crispness. 8.', '2009-03-12 18:36:52.000000', NULL, 1),
