(5327449, 772406, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely fantastic.  I just wish I could see more of the church. The clouds are amazing.</td>', 'This is absolutely fantastic.  I just wish I could see more of the church. The clouds are amazing.', '2009-03-12 19:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
