(5327737, 772383, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel the title matches the photo very well personally; she doesn''t look like she''s looking to the future, she looks pained, lonely, borderline desperate maybe and like some hope she had has just been crushed....I''d have recommended a sadder title. That aside, her expression is wonderfully moving and the lighting really enhances it. It''s a great shot.</td>', 'I don''t feel the title matches the photo very well personally; she doesn''t look like she''s looking to the future, she looks pained, lonely, borderline desperate maybe and like some hope she had has just been crushed....I''d have recommended a sadder title. That aside, her expression is wonderfully moving and the lighting really enhances it. It''s a great shot.', '2009-03-12 19:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
