(5327759, 772417, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping this actually survives its review. It''s hard formje to see how those film-strip marks can be legal. We know, of course, that it''s not ACTUAL film because the image extends beyond the sprocket holes and that''s not possible.<br/> <br/>In any case, this is seeded into my high group right now. I''m not sure exactly why, but there''s a *presence* to this image that''s just undeniable, to me at least. I hope it all works out. Brave entry!</td>', 'I''m hoping this actually survives its review. It''s hard formje to see how those film-strip marks can be legal. We know, of course, that it''s not ACTUAL film because the image extends beyond the sprocket holes and that''s not possible. In any case, this is seeded into my high group right now. I''m not sure exactly why, but there''s a *presence* to this image that''s just undeniable, to me at least. I hope it all works out. Brave entry!', '2009-03-12 19:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
