(5328276, 771345, 36065, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see more lighting on the baby''s face.  From the point of view that you chose, it is difficult to capture a flattering shot of the face.</td>', 'I''d like to see more lighting on the baby''s face.  From the point of view that you chose, it is difficult to capture a flattering shot of the face.', '2009-03-12 20:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5328277, 772726, 41794, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Probably hard to do but would like to see it pulled back just a hair so as not to lose the top of the one tower.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Probably hard to do but would like to see it pulled back just a hair so as not to lose the top of the one tower.', '2009-03-12 20:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5328278, 772209, 58452, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. On first look I thought the large rock on the right was a giant gorilla! Lots of painterly textures and shapes. I''m not in love with the frame.</td>', 'Interesting composition. On first look I thought the large rock on the right was a giant gorilla! Lots of painterly textures and shapes. I''m not in love with the frame.', '2009-03-12 20:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
