(5328283, 770994, 30861, '<td valign="top">Absolutely outstanding, beautifully rendered. This one came up right next to "Lost in Time" in my voting queue, and what a pair of bookends they made.<br/> <br/>It''s just a personal reaction, but for me there''s a palpable, even aching sense of loneliness emanating from this image. Bumping on second pass, and good luck.</td>', 'Absolutely outstanding, beautifully rendered. This one came up right next to "Lost in Time" in my voting queue, and what a pair of bookends they made. It''s just a personal reaction, but for me there''s a palpable, even aching sense of loneliness emanating from this image. Bumping on second pass, and good luck.', '2009-03-12 20:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5328284, 772731, 68467, '<td valign="top">nice soft pastel color - i like it</td>', 'nice soft pastel color - i like it', '2009-03-12 20:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
