(5328297, 770466, 92643, '<td valign="top">Very interesting feeling to this one, somewhat whimsical, but also somewhat ominous due to the color of the sky and the way that the shape of the trees mimic the shape of the clouds, as if black clouds are boiling up from below.</td>', 'Very interesting feeling to this one, somewhat whimsical, but also somewhat ominous due to the color of the sky and the way that the shape of the trees mimic the shape of the clouds, as if black clouds are boiling up from below.', '2009-03-12 20:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
