(5328302, 772210, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like your location choice for this portrait.  He fits the scene very, very well.  I would like to see a bit more lighting on his face.</td>', 'I like your location choice for this portrait.  He fits the scene very, very well.  I would like to see a bit more lighting on his face.', '2009-03-12 20:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
