(5328377, 772550, 92643, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!  So many beautiful textures and patterns, but the most captivating thing about the photo is, of course, the focus apparent in the lovely model''s eyes.</td>', 'Gorgeous!  So many beautiful textures and patterns, but the most captivating thing about the photo is, of course, the focus apparent in the lovely model''s eyes.', '2009-03-12 20:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
