(5328814, 772716, 1, '<td valign="top">When I pulled this up, I was so fixated on the QUAY thing that I didn''t see the guy sitting there.  I really like photos where you get nice surprises once you start really looking at it.  If I was speeding through voting, I don''t think I would''ve seen him.</td>', 'When I pulled this up, I was so fixated on the QUAY thing that I didn''t see the guy sitting there.  I really like photos where you get nice surprises once you start really looking at it.  If I was speeding through voting, I don''t think I would''ve seen him.', '2009-03-12 21:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5328815, 772292, 99981, '<td valign="top">This shot is great but i''m sorry, i really think that this is too PP''d, mainly because of the bridge. I''m sorry if i was rude, i really like your shot and its colors. But i would like to see it more like the original.</td>', 'This shot is great but i''m sorry, i really think that this is too PP''d, mainly because of the bridge. I''m sorry if i was rude, i really like your shot and its colors. But i would like to see it more like the original.', '2009-03-12 21:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
