(5329206, 772641, 83313, '<td valign="top">It had been a long day on the job and Frank leaped into the air, flapping with all his might. It was time to head home to Mary and the kids. Even after all these years at his job, he still got some odd looks from people who were not used to seeing a bird working as an auto mechanic.</td>', 'It had been a long day on the job and Frank leaped into the air, flapping with all his might. It was time to head home to Mary and the kids. Even after all these years at his job, he still got some odd looks from people who were not used to seeing a bird working as an auto mechanic.', '2009-03-12 21:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5329207, 771041, 79141, '<td valign="top">awesome colors</td>', 'awesome colors', '2009-03-12 21:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
