(5329862, 770996, 83313, '<td valign="top">Worth the trek! <br/> <br/>I hate to leave even a minor critique on such an awesome shot, but I need to leave them fairly. I noticed some compression artifacts around the edge of the mountain and sky. Looked at the image properties. With a 58k file size, you could have used way less compression, which would have avoided those artifacts and possibly gained detail in the rest of the image as well. This entry ought to place highly in spite of that minor problem. I''ll probably be the only person anal enough to notice it.</td>', 'Worth the trek!  I hate to leave even a minor critique on such an awesome shot, but I need to leave them fairly. I noticed some compression artifacts around the edge of the mountain and sky. Looked at the image properties. With a 58k file size, you could have used way less compression, which would have avoided those artifacts and possibly gained detail in the rest of the image as well. This entry ought to place highly in spite of that minor problem. I''ll probably be the only person anal enough to notice it.', '2009-03-12 22:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
