(5329998, 771715, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now. The colors of the sunset at the beach are gorgeous!! The red, orange and golds are a deep rich hues too that are very appealing to look at. The colors on the shoreline are like liquid fire. Love how there is one lone sandpiper that populates the shore line and then our eyes travel up to see those three mountainous ranges of rock off beyond the waves. Beautifully composed and well presented!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. The colors of the sunset at the beach are gorgeous!! The red, orange and golds are a deep rich hues too that are very appealing to look at. The colors on the shoreline are like liquid fire. Love how there is one lone sandpiper that populates the shore line and then our eyes travel up to see those three mountainous ranges of rock off beyond the waves. Beautifully composed and well presented!', '2009-03-12 22:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
