(5330011, 772369, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good catch on this action shot.  The horse trailer sets the scene, but you have enough cowboy stuff besides I would rather see it cropped out and make it portrait mode.</td>', 'Good catch on this action shot.  The horse trailer sets the scene, but you have enough cowboy stuff besides I would rather see it cropped out and make it portrait mode.', '2009-03-12 22:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5330013, 772669, 44651, '<td valign="top">Brown sky?</td>', 'Brown sky?', '2009-03-12 22:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5330015, 770771, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely portrait in every way that matters. I am particularly taken by the excellent use of DOF to bring the face up from the neck, the clothes, and even the ears. There''s a sense of abstracting or isolating the face/expression as if he is in the process of working free of his body and becoming wholly spirit at the end. Well done :-)</td>', 'This is a lovely portrait in every way that matters. I am particularly taken by the excellent use of DOF to bring the face up from the neck, the clothes, and even the ears. There''s a sense of abstracting or isolating the face/expression as if he is in the process of working free of his body and becoming wholly spirit at the end. Well done :-)', '2009-03-12 22:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5330017, 772406, 30861, '<td valign="top">I like everything about this except I''m having a hard time, personally, with the extremely tight framing on the bottom. It makes me want to see this as the top half of a taller building, but I know it isn''t... Just another smidge of foreground and you''re in business.</td>', 'I like everything about this except I''m having a hard time, personally, with the extremely tight framing on the bottom. It makes me want to see this as the top half of a taller building, but I know it isn''t... Just another smidge of foreground and you''re in business.', '2009-03-12 22:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5330018, 771722, 2615, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2009-03-12 22:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
