(5330026, 772291, 76430, '<td valign="top">Puffins always look fake to me, but of course these are real.  Good bokeh makes the birds really stand out.  Is this an outdoor setting or stuffed birds indoors?</td>', 'Puffins always look fake to me, but of course these are real.  Good bokeh makes the birds really stand out.  Is this an outdoor setting or stuffed birds indoors?', '2009-03-12 23:00:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5330028, 772152, 42495, '<td valign="top">The composition is stellar here and the white background works perfectly.  Just a nitpick, but it looks like you missed a couple areas (bottom right of dress and under hands) with whatever spot editing you were doing.  It''s barely noticeable on this calibrated monitor but very apparent on my uncalibrated one</td>', 'The composition is stellar here and the white background works perfectly.  Just a nitpick, but it looks like you missed a couple areas (bottom right of dress and under hands) with whatever spot editing you were doing.  It''s barely noticeable on this calibrated monitor but very apparent on my uncalibrated one', '2009-03-12 23:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
