(5330034, 772407, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is, after all, the iconic pose of the early 21st-century urban photographer, LOL. Remember when we all used to stand up straight at your viewfinders? And now we crouch and the camera is at arm''s length? Well seen!</td>', 'This is, after all, the iconic pose of the early 21st-century urban photographer, LOL. Remember when we all used to stand up straight at your viewfinders? And now we crouch and the camera is at arm''s length? Well seen!', '2009-03-12 23:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
