(5330383, 770873, 1, '<td valign="top">Amazing contrast between the house and the mountain.  The photo really gives you a feel for how massive the mountain slope is.</td>', 'Amazing contrast between the house and the mountain.  The photo really gives you a feel for how massive the mountain slope is.', '2009-03-12 23:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
