(5331025, 772246, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m a biker and therefore am a sucker for images like this. In this particular case, I think the quality of your image may be more broadly appealing. Color, Clarity. Focus. Dramatic motion. Possibly among best of show. Congratulations!!</td>', 'I''m a biker and therefore am a sucker for images like this. In this particular case, I think the quality of your image may be more broadly appealing. Color, Clarity. Focus. Dramatic motion. Possibly among best of show. Congratulations!!', '2009-03-13 01:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
