(5331088, 771942, 90624, '<td valign="top">I kept on looking at this one for a while., was trying to figure out what and why the title. I love the striking color with the red and blue, against the black and white. Ok I like it!! 9</td>', 'I kept on looking at this one for a while., was trying to figure out what and why the title. I love the striking color with the red and blue, against the black and white. Ok I like it!! 9', '2009-03-13 01:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
