(5331214, 771807, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is almost a ''lensbaby effect'', although to be honest, to my eye it certainly looks like it was done in post processing.<br/> <br/>A bit more care with the color in the skin tones would have helped it. It seems a bit strong in the blues/magenta. This might have been a result of the camera trying to correct for the strong color of the bucket in auto white balance.<br/> <br/>I think it''s cute and while I don''t like the way the effects have been applied, I think the effects themselves are pretty fun, so I''m going to take the vote down and bring it back up again to 6. I wish there was a 6.5...<br/> <br/>On second thoughts, nyeh, it''s a happy challenge, so I''ll give ya a free ''happy point''! :)</td>', 'This is almost a ''lensbaby effect'', although to be honest, to my eye it certainly looks like it was done in post processing. A bit more care with the color in the skin tones would have helped it. It seems a bit strong in the blues/magenta. This might have been a result of the camera trying to correct for the strong color of the bucket in auto white balance. I think it''s cute and while I don''t like the way the effects have been applied, I think the effects themselves are pretty fun, so I''m going to take the vote down and bring it back up again to 6. I wish there was a 6.5... On second thoughts, nyeh, it''s a happy challenge, so I''ll give ya a free ''happy point''! :)', '2009-03-13 01:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
