(5331262, 770343, 32011, '<td valign="top">You were never going to get anywhere near the brown with an image this good.  I love the minimalism of it, yet it has detail and sharpness which can keep the viewer looking for much longer than one would expect of an image like this.  Sorry, but my vote will do nothing to help you get brown this time.</td>', 'You were never going to get anywhere near the brown with an image this good.  I love the minimalism of it, yet it has detail and sharpness which can keep the viewer looking for much longer than one would expect of an image like this.  Sorry, but my vote will do nothing to help you get brown this time.', '2009-03-13 02:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5331263, 771631, 28710, '<td valign="top">The only thing I don''t much like is the fact that the contrast of the clouds at the very top does not match the contrast of the clouds elsewhere. I''d be happy with lens falloff/vignetting in the corners, but it looks a bit strange. Yeah, stupid niggle. Sorry. Anyhow, you still get a 9. :)</td>', 'The only thing I don''t much like is the fact that the contrast of the clouds at the very top does not match the contrast of the clouds elsewhere. I''d be happy with lens falloff/vignetting in the corners, but it looks a bit strange. Yeah, stupid niggle. Sorry. Anyhow, you still get a 9. :)', '2009-03-13 02:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
