(5331266, 770896, 28710, '<td valign="top">No offense, but it doesn''t really look like there was just a storm. No indication of strong winds at all. In fact, the snow looks like it''s been sitting there, melting and re-freezing for a few days. When it did snow, it was probably a nice gentle snowfall with virtually no wind at all (look at the pocks and pits in the grass and how nicely the snow is piled up on the trees.<br/> <br/>Still, it''s a somewhat appealing display of snow...</td>', 'No offense, but it doesn''t really look like there was just a storm. No indication of strong winds at all. In fact, the snow looks like it''s been sitting there, melting and re-freezing for a few days. When it did snow, it was probably a nice gentle snowfall with virtually no wind at all (look at the pocks and pits in the grass and how nicely the snow is piled up on the trees. Still, it''s a somewhat appealing display of snow...', '2009-03-13 02:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
