(5331475, 771244, 28742, '<td valign="top">While I am not opposed to centered composition, it doesn''t work for me here. Fortunately there are many other positive aspects of this shot and I can just crop one side off in my mind and still give it a good score. :)</td>', 'While I am not opposed to centered composition, it doesn''t work for me here. Fortunately there are many other positive aspects of this shot and I can just crop one side off in my mind and still give it a good score. :)', '2009-03-13 02:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
