(5331490, 772581, 30364, '<td valign="top">This is a great bird shot because of the wonderful morphing of the tree and the bird.  The one becomes the other, with barely a visible junction.  Consider the legs of the bird, versus the slim branches lower down; such a lovely echo.  It''s a wildlife shot for grownups because it''s about so much more than the bird.  9.</td>', 'This is a great bird shot because of the wonderful morphing of the tree and the bird.  The one becomes the other, with barely a visible junction.  Consider the legs of the bird, versus the slim branches lower down; such a lovely echo.  It''s a wildlife shot for grownups because it''s about so much more than the bird.  9.', '2009-03-13 02:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
