(5331689, 772433, 30364, '<td valign="top">Certainly in my top few in this challenge.  The milky mist of the water hints at the immeasurable time that your title refers to, and makes a powerful statement about the idea of form and function, and aptness to purpose.  Thus about beauty.  A living Grecian Urn; a ''foster-child of Silence and slow Time ... beauty is truth, truth beauty''.  9.</td>', 'Certainly in my top few in this challenge.  The milky mist of the water hints at the immeasurable time that your title refers to, and makes a powerful statement about the idea of form and function, and aptness to purpose.  Thus about beauty.  A living Grecian Urn; a ''foster-child of Silence and slow Time ... beauty is truth, truth beauty''.  9.', '2009-03-13 03:17:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5331690, 772153, 28710, '<td valign="top">The scene is interesting (durex and kids), but it''s missing something I can''t quite define.<br/> <br/>Good though.</td>', 'The scene is interesting (durex and kids), but it''s missing something I can''t quite define. Good though.', '2009-03-13 03:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
