(5331733, 772089, 30364, '<td valign="top">A charming photograph made all the more wonderful by the modern sports shoes.  The image combines several lovely themes; the anachronism of the shoes versus the rest of the costume; the rock and the water, signifying time; and the puzzle of the one girl looking in the ''wrong'' direction, signifying (to my fevered imagination) temptation.  Plus its a beautifully rendered B&amp;W photograph, which is always a pleasure.  9.</td>', 'A charming photograph made all the more wonderful by the modern sports shoes.  The image combines several lovely themes; the anachronism of the shoes versus the rest of the costume; the rock and the water, signifying time; and the puzzle of the one girl looking in the ''wrong'' direction, signifying (to my fevered imagination) temptation.  Plus its a beautifully rendered B&W photograph, which is always a pleasure.  9.', '2009-03-13 03:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5331734, 771942, 30364, '<td valign="top">I don''t entirely understand it.  That''s a plus, as far as I''m concerned.  It''s graphically striking, and the colours are beautiful, as if organic ... like some rare stone polished by time.  7.</td>', 'I don''t entirely understand it.  That''s a plus, as far as I''m concerned.  It''s graphically striking, and the colours are beautiful, as if organic ... like some rare stone polished by time.  7.', '2009-03-13 03:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5331735, 771468, 54033, '<td valign="top">creative</td>', 'creative', '2009-03-13 03:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
