(5331764, 772265, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s rare I care for a sports action photograph.  But this is indeed a rare one.  It''s superb.  His astounding bodily contortion, combined with the focus of his attention, is fabulous.  Badminton is truly the martial art of racquet sports.  8.</td>', 'It''s rare I care for a sports action photograph.  But this is indeed a rare one.  It''s superb.  His astounding bodily contortion, combined with the focus of his attention, is fabulous.  Badminton is truly the martial art of racquet sports.  8.', '2009-03-13 03:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
