(5331791, 772483, 28710, '<td valign="top">Quick, somebody tip that janitor! Them''s some seriously nice floors!<br/> <br/>Great pic too btw. I 10ve the idea of the vertical lines of the school contrasting with the horizontal lines of the child who appears to be not getting along or running against the grain.<br/> <br/>If you look really closely, you will notice that there is a subtle rhythm of horizontal lines along the top which have a ''leading'' effect suggesting unrealized motion in that direction, presumably an exit.<br/> <br/>Very interesting pic.</td>', 'Quick, somebody tip that janitor! Them''s some seriously nice floors! Great pic too btw. I 10ve the idea of the vertical lines of the school contrasting with the horizontal lines of the child who appears to be not getting along or running against the grain. If you look really closely, you will notice that there is a subtle rhythm of horizontal lines along the top which have a ''leading'' effect suggesting unrealized motion in that direction, presumably an exit. Very interesting pic.', '2009-03-13 03:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
