(5331836, 770756, 28710, '<td valign="top">Sailing home? Without the sails up?<br/> <br/>I see the light beaming down (which has an optical effect of moving towards the viewer) overbearing on the storm which appears to be leaving off to the right (and moving away from the viewer).<br/> <br/>As such, I would have sliced off the land and gently cloned out the tall grasses.<br/> <br/>It''s got great potential and is a well-spied moment. If you want, you can PM me and I can show you what I mean more clearly. :)<br/> <br/>Just for ''happy voting'', I''m going to give you a score based on an average of what I see as the potential for this image and what I see in the image... and rounded up. :</td>', 'Sailing home? Without the sails up? I see the light beaming down (which has an optical effect of moving towards the viewer) overbearing on the storm which appears to be leaving off to the right (and moving away from the viewer). As such, I would have sliced off the land and gently cloned out the tall grasses. It''s got great potential and is a well-spied moment. If you want, you can PM me and I can show you what I mean more clearly. :) Just for ''happy voting'', I''m going to give you a score based on an average of what I see as the potential for this image and what I see in the image... and rounded up. :', '2009-03-13 03:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
