(5331982, 770246, 28710, '<td valign="top">At first, I didn''t get it. I thought, "Is this some sort of stupid ''hemp/marijuana'' joke?"<br/> <br/>BUT. I kept looking. And in the back there, you can see a halo of light surrounding a chapel/synagogue/probably religious building of some sort.<br/> <br/>And so you have juxtapositioning.<br/> <br/>And it did indeed take a bit of extra looking.<br/> <br/>What''s clever though is that there is enough general visual interest that your eye wants to keep looking to give the pic the time needed to get that.<br/> <br/>Very nicely accomplished. Went from 6 to a 9.</td>', 'At first, I didn''t get it. I thought, "Is this some sort of stupid ''hemp/marijuana'' joke?" BUT. I kept looking. And in the back there, you can see a halo of light surrounding a chapel/synagogue/probably religious building of some sort. And so you have juxtapositioning. And it did indeed take a bit of extra looking. What''s clever though is that there is enough general visual interest that your eye wants to keep looking to give the pic the time needed to get that. Very nicely accomplished. Went from 6 to a 9.', '2009-03-13 04:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
