(5332880, 772192, 88204, '<td valign="top">I love the angle. It''s so refreshing to see an less-typical take on flowers and landscapes. It''s a macro and a landscape at the same time, which is very eye catching. Nice job in balancing the lighting. I think the ideal composition might be a little different... less blue sky with horizon closer to the top, show the bottom of the main flower''s petals, have the line of the horizon above the top of the flower... but I''m guessing that would have introduced other challenges and taken away the simplicity of the shot. Those are all minor... it''s still a great and unique shot. Well done!</td>', 'I love the angle. It''s so refreshing to see an less-typical take on flowers and landscapes. It''s a macro and a landscape at the same time, which is very eye catching. Nice job in balancing the lighting. I think the ideal composition might be a little different... less blue sky with horizon closer to the top, show the bottom of the main flower''s petals, have the line of the horizon above the top of the flower... but I''m guessing that would have introduced other challenges and taken away the simplicity of the shot. Those are all minor... it''s still a great and unique shot. Well done!', '2009-03-13 06:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
