(5332992, 772210, 88204, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I like the distressed background, the expression, the shadows on his face, use of shallow DoF. Composition seems oddly weighted to the bottom... I''d prefer if it was a little closer on the face and the face a little more in the upper right, but that''s not to say it would be better, just an option. Well done.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I like the distressed background, the expression, the shadows on his face, use of shallow DoF. Composition seems oddly weighted to the bottom... I''d prefer if it was a little closer on the face and the face a little more in the upper right, but that''s not to say it would be better, just an option. Well done.', '2009-03-13 06:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
