(5333425, 772651, 56254, '<td valign="top">really lovely ... the petals look soft and silky, but the focus on the center is nice and sharp ...</td>', 'really lovely ... the petals look soft and silky, but the focus on the center is nice and sharp ...', '2009-03-13 08:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5333429, 772728, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. This is a wonderful study of light, shapes, and color. A simple clean minimalistic composition that is also an abstract that is very appealing. Love how the light fall such that where the liquid and rocks meet it is illuminated in a nice glow. I know you state in the title that this is black chocolate but I see it more of a rich, thick black oil that is bathing what appears to my eye as rocks. If that is not what it is then boy did you fool me! Not that it has any less visual impact for as I state I really love how the light falls and plays upon the scene - the differences between light and shadow draw the eye in - 7.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. This is a wonderful study of light, shapes, and color. A simple clean minimalistic composition that is also an abstract that is very appealing. Love how the light fall such that where the liquid and rocks meet it is illuminated in a nice glow. I know you state in the title that this is black chocolate but I see it more of a rich, thick black oil that is bathing what appears to my eye as rocks. If that is not what it is then boy did you fool me! Not that it has any less visual impact for as I state I really love how the light falls and plays upon the scene - the differences between light and shadow draw the eye in - 7.', '2009-03-13 08:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5333432, 771105, 100064, '<td valign="top">A little yellow but it works. Good detail on the cobble stones and love the one walker.</td>', 'A little yellow but it works. Good detail on the cobble stones and love the one walker.', '2009-03-13 08:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5333434, 772078, 94235, '<td valign="top">The grain in the sky adds to the graffiti subject. Nice blend and well processed.</td>', 'The grain in the sky adds to the graffiti subject. Nice blend and well processed.', '2009-03-13 08:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5333437, 772202, 69684, '<td valign="top">Must be a great place to stay. Lovely buildings and a great view!</td>', 'Must be a great place to stay. Lovely buildings and a great view!', '2009-03-13 08:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
