(5334329, 770342, 75034, '<td valign="top">I know this spot, it''s the brick works in Toronto :) I have many shots of this myself and one in my portfolio. What a fantastic place for natural light and texture, don''t you think? Your shot looks a little soft to me and perhaps a longer exposure or deeper DoF would have made this pop more. Just my thoughts. If you ever looking for a shooting partner just feel free to give me a PM (after voting, of course) and if you like we could set something up :)<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'I know this spot, it''s the brick works in Toronto :) I have many shots of this myself and one in my portfolio. What a fantastic place for natural light and texture, don''t you think? Your shot looks a little soft to me and perhaps a longer exposure or deeper DoF would have made this pop more. Just my thoughts. If you ever looking for a shooting partner just feel free to give me a PM (after voting, of course) and if you like we could set something up :) All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-03-13 09:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
