(5334647, 770279, 91282, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot. :D Shame you couldn''t actually get 99 red balloons, but that would be costly (and more awkward for your model, no doubt. :P). The only thing I can see that I might change would be maybe cropping it a little closer, like losing the two outermost rocks, mostly to get rid of the odd shrubberies on the edges. And cloning out that little spot to the left of her elbow.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot. :D Shame you couldn''t actually get 99 red balloons, but that would be costly (and more awkward for your model, no doubt. :P). The only thing I can see that I might change would be maybe cropping it a little closer, like losing the two outermost rocks, mostly to get rid of the odd shrubberies on the edges. And cloning out that little spot to the left of her elbow.', '2009-03-13 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
