(5334664, 771458, 15711, '<td valign="top">unfolding black<br/>the deep dark night<br/>yearning are the leaves<br/>for light<br/> <br/>reaching for <br/>what lingers still<br/>hints of sunshine<br/>stay until<br/> <br/>the curtain <br/>draws it to a close<br/>quiet moments<br/>I suppose<br/> <br/>would be their tale<br/>of how it was<br/>in the woods<br/>when nighttime falls<br/> <br/>This is lovely. It inspired me to write a quick poem. :~)</td>', 'unfolding blackthe deep dark nightyearning are the leavesfor light reaching for what lingers stillhints of sunshinestay until the curtain draws it to a closequiet momentsI suppose would be their taleof how it wasin the woodswhen nighttime falls This is lovely. It inspired me to write a quick poem. :~)', '2009-03-13 10:19:35.000000', NULL, 1),
