(5335188, 770208, 25024, '<td valign="top">What a fabulously strong image! Everything about is fantastic, the reflections, the colours, the sharpness, the DOF all brilliantly done, I must be looking at a ribbon winner here, good luck.</td>', 'What a fabulously strong image! Everything about is fantastic, the reflections, the colours, the sharpness, the DOF all brilliantly done, I must be looking at a ribbon winner here, good luck.', '2009-03-13 11:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
