(5335289, 772349, 30861, '<td valign="top">I sort of wish this title were something much more metaphorical, actually. The image is so eerie it went immediately into my top-seeds group for further evaluation. The title is so topical and so banal it''s actually detracting from my enjoyment of this image, which has a perfectly timeless quality to it. For some reason I''m reminded of Robert Downey in "Restoration", don''t ask me why. <br/> <br/>For whatever reason, I like it. A lot :-)</td>', 'I sort of wish this title were something much more metaphorical, actually. The image is so eerie it went immediately into my top-seeds group for further evaluation. The title is so topical and so banal it''s actually detracting from my enjoyment of this image, which has a perfectly timeless quality to it. For some reason I''m reminded of Robert Downey in "Restoration", don''t ask me why.  For whatever reason, I like it. A lot :-)', '2009-03-13 11:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
