(5335368, 772016, 30861, '<td valign="top">Hrmmm... You''ve done a good job here, and I freely grant you that; you made it into my high-seeds group, and I''m giving you a 7 in the end.<br/> <br/>But what I have to say is a personal reaction, and it may seem harsh: if you''re aware of the difference between "pathos" and "bathos", then you''ll understand when I say that in my opinion this image is living with one foot dangerously planted in the bathetic. That is to say, it seems to be overtly designed to push my buttons, tug at my heart strings, get me to react to its message in a favorable way. And I don''t respond all that well to this sort of manipulation.<br/> <br/>Please note: I''m NOT saying you are "guilty" of that process, just that it''s the way the image makes me *feel*, OK? If anything the flaw is mine, not yours. And besides, if that *is* what you were after, well you accomplished it with flying colors :-) I can see this being a poster shot for MS or something, easily.</td>', 'Hrmmm... You''ve done a good job here, and I freely grant you that; you made it into my high-seeds group, and I''m giving you a 7 in the end. But what I have to say is a personal reaction, and it may seem harsh: if you''re aware of the difference between "pathos" and "bathos", then you''ll understand when I say that in my opinion this image is living with one foot dangerously planted in the bathetic. That is to say, it seems to be overtly designed to push my buttons, tug at my heart strings, get me to react to its message in a favorable way. And I don''t respond all that well to this sort of manipulation. Please note: I''m NOT saying you are "guilty" of that process, just that it''s the way the image makes me *feel*, OK? If anything the flaw is mine, not yours. And besides, if that *is* what you were after, well you accomplished it with flying colors :-) I can see this being a poster shot for MS or something, easily.', '2009-03-13 11:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
