(5335887, 772753, 30049, '<td valign="top">Was this a handheld shot?  I ask because it''s not quite as sharp as it could be, most evident around the window on the wall.  Aperture may not have been deep enough either with the upward tilt of the focal plane.  Just an observation.  It is and interesting still life type photo and your timing on the natural light is right on the mark!  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Was this a handheld shot?  I ask because it''s not quite as sharp as it could be, most evident around the window on the wall.  Aperture may not have been deep enough either with the upward tilt of the focal plane.  Just an observation.  It is and interesting still life type photo and your timing on the natural light is right on the mark!  Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-03-13 11:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5335888, 772009, 102024, '<td valign="top">The clouds seem rather flat and the sense of depth is a little cheated by cropping out that road.  The muted tones are nice though.</td>', 'The clouds seem rather flat and the sense of depth is a little cheated by cropping out that road.  The muted tones are nice though.', '2009-03-13 11:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
