(5335923, 771086, 28710, '<td valign="top">IMO, the use of negative space is effective here, but could have been more effective in a full square crop. Why? because the nature of the flower is round, so providing a frame for what ''could'' have been there emphasizes what is missing even more. Again that''s IMO. And this crop is not uneffective at all.</td>', 'IMO, the use of negative space is effective here, but could have been more effective in a full square crop. Why? because the nature of the flower is round, so providing a frame for what ''could'' have been there emphasizes what is missing even more. Again that''s IMO. And this crop is not uneffective at all.', '2009-03-13 12:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
