(5336166, 771633, 91282, '<td valign="top">Goodness, what did you do to make her so unhappy? I like the comp, the expression, and the b&amp;w is a good choice. It''d be nice if this was a little bit sharper.</td>', 'Goodness, what did you do to make her so unhappy? I like the comp, the expression, and the b&w is a good choice. It''d be nice if this was a little bit sharper.', '2009-03-13 12:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
