(5336697, 771954, 100106, '<td valign="top">This is a fab action shot. I really like how he''s suspended over the weeds (sorry forgot their actual name). It gives his height off the ground such balance and depth. A little grainy but it adds to the photo for me. Nice timing on this shot, can see why it''s your gem. Oh...almost forgot the best part. His expression while in the air is wonderful. You captured one of those moments. Well done.</td>', 'This is a fab action shot. I really like how he''s suspended over the weeds (sorry forgot their actual name). It gives his height off the ground such balance and depth. A little grainy but it adds to the photo for me. Nice timing on this shot, can see why it''s your gem. Oh...almost forgot the best part. His expression while in the air is wonderful. You captured one of those moments. Well done.', '2009-03-13 12:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
