(5337607, 772367, 67258, '<td valign="top">I would have been tempted to go for a deeper depth of field to show off those wonderful feathers.  i also feel that you could have afforded to boost the saturation and contrast a little - as it is the photo does appear a little flat.  I suspect that the photo was taken with the sun fairly high - I have had most success with photographing peacocks when the sun is lower and the light coming from the side; it seems to bring out the colours and texture more.</td>', 'I would have been tempted to go for a deeper depth of field to show off those wonderful feathers.  i also feel that you could have afforded to boost the saturation and contrast a little - as it is the photo does appear a little flat.  I suspect that the photo was taken with the sun fairly high - I have had most success with photographing peacocks when the sun is lower and the light coming from the side; it seems to bring out the colours and texture more.', '2009-03-13 13:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
