(5337802, 770960, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: I really like the concept of this image but the execution falls a little short.  I think where it fails is that you zoomed on the hands a little too closely.  If the adult and child were a bit further away the image wouldn''t look as crowded to me.  I can see why you think this is a Gem and it will be a fond memory to look back upon as the years go by.  The do grow up so fast.  Thanks for entering this Gem.</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: I really like the concept of this image but the execution falls a little short.  I think where it fails is that you zoomed on the hands a little too closely.  If the adult and child were a bit further away the image wouldn''t look as crowded to me.  I can see why you think this is a Gem and it will be a fond memory to look back upon as the years go by.  The do grow up so fast.  Thanks for entering this Gem.', '2009-03-13 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5337803, 771630, 80096, '<td valign="top">I can hear it! Very nicely done.</td>', 'I can hear it! Very nicely done.', '2009-03-13 14:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5337804, 771048, 18197, '<td valign="top">Aptly titled. Interesting sense of scale. Interesting POV.</td>', 'Aptly titled. Interesting sense of scale. Interesting POV.', '2009-03-13 14:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5337805, 770239, 34192, '<td valign="top">I can actually see the mist moving.  Well, okay, I can''t, but it seems like it.  I saw many of this scene this past summer, and photographed a couple.  But this looks like it is happening, right now, in front of me. The tones, the focus, the sharpness, all work together to make this seem here and now... great work! 10</td>', 'I can actually see the mist moving.  Well, okay, I can''t, but it seems like it.  I saw many of this scene this past summer, and photographed a couple.  But this looks like it is happening, right now, in front of me. The tones, the focus, the sharpness, all work together to make this seem here and now... great work! 10', '2009-03-13 14:03:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5337806, 770179, 33361, '<td valign="top">Nice smooth skin...</td>', 'Nice smooth skin...', '2009-03-13 14:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
