(5337852, 770211, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wonderful editing on this to give the image the same mood the girl is portraying.  Such a sense of joy and playfulness. I even think the white framing added works really well, and I typically hate them.  love the ''balancing'' smudge in the left corner that some might niggle about - it balances the image and reminds us that stuff is there.  10</td>', 'Wonderful editing on this to give the image the same mood the girl is portraying.  Such a sense of joy and playfulness. I even think the white framing added works really well, and I typically hate them.  love the ''balancing'' smudge in the left corner that some might niggle about - it balances the image and reminds us that stuff is there.  10', '2009-03-13 14:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
