(5338565, 772398, 63269, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast might give this image a little more impact. Also, this was photographed on a slight angle from the building - if it had been possible, it might have been better to shoot straight on. This way the horizon won''t looked tiled. Just a thought. :)</td>', 'A little more contrast might give this image a little more impact. Also, this was photographed on a slight angle from the building - if it had been possible, it might have been better to shoot straight on. This way the horizon won''t looked tiled. Just a thought. :)', '2009-03-13 14:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
