(5338596, 772469, 36141, '<td valign="top">Love it. We don''t have bridges like this in my country. You''ve captured the sunset very well. Great landscape in focus.</td>', 'Love it. We don''t have bridges like this in my country. You''ve captured the sunset very well. Great landscape in focus.', '2009-03-13 14:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5338597, 772386, 86447, '<td valign="top">PERFECTLY composed!   All of the branches... all of the white... and then that pop of red.  I hope this does well for you.<br/> <br/>The sky is a bit blotchy/banding from processing, but that''s minor.  <br/> <br/>Not voting yet.</td>', 'PERFECTLY composed!   All of the branches... all of the white... and then that pop of red.  I hope this does well for you. The sky is a bit blotchy/banding from processing, but that''s minor.   Not voting yet.', '2009-03-13 14:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5338601, 771975, 41794, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2009-03-13 14:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5338602, 772707, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back now for comments. Very nice portrait of this young girl and you even caught the falling snow as an interesting backdrop element!! Colors, skin tones and details are good and very dynamic. This has a very casual capture feel to it as that we happened to glance and catch a glimpse of her sitting there taking a breather and thinking. Perhaps she is taking a break from building a snowman and deciding what to do next. Pose is very natural and does not appear posed at all. I like the snowy backdrop but I think that there is a little too much negative space. I think making the composition a vertical presentation with closer crop to the girl (cropping out the space up to the the tree with the white bark) would bring us closer to your main subject.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back now for comments. Very nice portrait of this young girl and you even caught the falling snow as an interesting backdrop element!! Colors, skin tones and details are good and very dynamic. This has a very casual capture feel to it as that we happened to glance and catch a glimpse of her sitting there taking a breather and thinking. Perhaps she is taking a break from building a snowman and deciding what to do next. Pose is very natural and does not appear posed at all. I like the snowy backdrop but I think that there is a little too much negative space. I think making the composition a vertical presentation with closer crop to the girl (cropping out the space up to the the tree with the white bark) would bring us closer to your main subject.', '2009-03-13 14:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5338603, 772529, 4226, '<td valign="top">A view I haven''t seen before even if I thought I have seen most of these pictures from the canyons.. nicely done!</td>', 'A view I haven''t seen before even if I thought I have seen most of these pictures from the canyons.. nicely done!', '2009-03-13 14:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5338604, 771826, 45857, '<td valign="top">"You''re not getting out until groundhog''s day"</td>', '"You''re not getting out until groundhog''s day"', '2009-03-13 14:49:53.000000', NULL, 1);
