(5339009, 772613, 70484, '<td valign="top">Miss Molly is very pretty! I would love to have her hair pushed a little to the side so that I could see more of her eye. Also, the light is almost overpowering at the window. I think a slight movement to the left with the camera would have put miss molly in front of the wall instead of allowing the window to distract from the picture while still allowing the light to spotlight such a beautiful girl!</td>', 'Miss Molly is very pretty! I would love to have her hair pushed a little to the side so that I could see more of her eye. Also, the light is almost overpowering at the window. I think a slight movement to the left with the camera would have put miss molly in front of the wall instead of allowing the window to distract from the picture while still allowing the light to spotlight such a beautiful girl!', '2009-03-13 15:13:51.000000', NULL, 1),
