(5339102, 772132, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>Lots of nighttime/sunset/cityscape type shots in this challenge, but yours is simply spellbinding. I''ve only ever been to Manhattan twice in my life, and it''s one of those places you either love or hate. I love it, but I''ve never seen it rendered so beautifully. This wouldn''t look out of place on any gallery wall. Two things make me jealous.. the fact that you''re in New York and I''m not, and the fact that you have the skills to take such a wonderful photograph. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  Lots of nighttime/sunset/cityscape type shots in this challenge, but yours is simply spellbinding. I''ve only ever been to Manhattan twice in my life, and it''s one of those places you either love or hate. I love it, but I''ve never seen it rendered so beautifully. This wouldn''t look out of place on any gallery wall. Two things make me jealous.. the fact that you''re in New York and I''m not, and the fact that you have the skills to take such a wonderful photograph.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-13 15:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
