(5339107, 771322, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>This looks like such a spectular view, even getting there must have been a great challenge, never mind photographing it - and in such a beautiful fashion. I love the transition of hue from warm in the foreground to cold in the distance. The pile of stones is intriguing, and makes me feel it is somewhere oriental - so I''m guessing the Himalaya''s (bet I''m half a planet wide of the mark lol).<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  This looks like such a spectular view, even getting there must have been a great challenge, never mind photographing it - and in such a beautiful fashion. I love the transition of hue from warm in the foreground to cold in the distance. The pile of stones is intriguing, and makes me feel it is somewhere oriental - so I''m guessing the Himalaya''s (bet I''m half a planet wide of the mark lol). Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-13 15:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
