(5339138, 772300, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>Yosemite is one of those places that is photographed so much, yet so badly by lots of people, thinking that the magnificence of the location can be captured by a point and click. Your photo on the other hand shows a much more thought out capture, nice low viewpoint, large depth of field, nice composition. Makes me wish I was there seeing Yosemite for myself.<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  Yosemite is one of those places that is photographed so much, yet so badly by lots of people, thinking that the magnificence of the location can be captured by a point and click. Your photo on the other hand shows a much more thought out capture, nice low viewpoint, large depth of field, nice composition. Makes me wish I was there seeing Yosemite for myself. Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-13 15:23:14.000000', NULL, 1),
