(5339150, 772090, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>There are lots of bug macros in this challenge, but this one really stands out to me... I''ve never really looked so closely at a damselfly, and I must say I always thought that their eyes would be like the compound eyes of a fly... they look more like frog eyes! Wonderful capture. Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  There are lots of bug macros in this challenge, but this one really stands out to me... I''ve never really looked so closely at a damselfly, and I must say I always thought that their eyes would be like the compound eyes of a fly... they look more like frog eyes! Wonderful capture. Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-13 15:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
