(5339206, 772492, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>What a cute little froggie, and "little" is an understatement! One of the stand out macro shots in this challenge, perfect focus and lighting. I love the reflection of the frog on the coin''s shiny surface. Is he one of those poison arrow tre frogs?<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  What a cute little froggie, and "little" is an understatement! One of the stand out macro shots in this challenge, perfect focus and lighting. I love the reflection of the frog on the coin''s shiny surface. Is he one of those poison arrow tre frogs? Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-13 15:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
