(5339552, 772210, 61961, '<td valign="top">At first glance this is merely a candid snap, but then one notices all the many interesting elements.  Beautiful colors, the background colors seem to compliment the handsome model''s coloring.  One side of his face is a bit shadowed, but his eye is bright.  Unusual placement in frame, and I like how the dark shirt along the bottom indicates his body position.  Best of all it avoids looking flat without resorting to overprocessing.  Good job.</td>', 'At first glance this is merely a candid snap, but then one notices all the many interesting elements.  Beautiful colors, the background colors seem to compliment the handsome model''s coloring.  One side of his face is a bit shadowed, but his eye is bright.  Unusual placement in frame, and I like how the dark shirt along the bottom indicates his body position.  Best of all it avoids looking flat without resorting to overprocessing.  Good job.', '2009-03-13 16:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5339553, 772519, 80096, '<td valign="top">Wonderful combination of shapes, lines and textures! Very abstract. The sepia tone works very well for this! 8</td>', 'Wonderful combination of shapes, lines and textures! Very abstract. The sepia tone works very well for this! 8', '2009-03-13 16:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
