(5341659, 772694, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Why hello Mr. Frog! What a wonderful close-up shot of this amphibian! You definately give us an up close and personal view of this frog. You have some wonderful detail in this shot most especially in the eyes. Don''t know if you caught his good side considering he is in mid-crock, but you certainly caught him in the action of creating his song. Colors and lighting on your main subject are great too!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Why hello Mr. Frog! What a wonderful close-up shot of this amphibian! You definately give us an up close and personal view of this frog. You have some wonderful detail in this shot most especially in the eyes. Don''t know if you caught his good side considering he is in mid-crock, but you certainly caught him in the action of creating his song. Colors and lighting on your main subject are great too!', '2009-03-13 19:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5341660, 770435, 96751, '<td valign="top">Masterful rotation.  Great detail on a stunning profile.  To be very picky, just a tad of a green tinge on the yellow portions of the mane.  Killer shot.</td>', 'Masterful rotation.  Great detail on a stunning profile.  To be very picky, just a tad of a green tinge on the yellow portions of the mane.  Killer shot.', '2009-03-13 19:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
