(5341739, 771026, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to vote now. Wow, this looks more like the curl of a nautalus shell then a stone stairway! Angle, how you composed the shot, and lighting help greatly with creating this illusion. The eye really follows the curve/curl down. There is lots of interesting textures carved into the stone or the ''pores'' in the stone and well as the curved shapes to hold the eye''s attention.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to vote now. Wow, this looks more like the curl of a nautalus shell then a stone stairway! Angle, how you composed the shot, and lighting help greatly with creating this illusion. The eye really follows the curve/curl down. There is lots of interesting textures carved into the stone or the ''pores'' in the stone and well as the curved shapes to hold the eye''s attention.', '2009-03-13 19:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
