(5341939, 771081, 99394, '<td valign="top">There''s too much going on in the shot for my taste personally. I think it would have been better to either focus on the falls or more on the house with just a little of the falls in the shot.</td>', 'There''s too much going on in the shot for my taste personally. I think it would have been better to either focus on the falls or more on the house with just a little of the falls in the shot.', '2009-03-13 19:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
