(5341949, 772767, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the pov. Great eye. Incredible detail with the eye and eyelashes (who knew?!).  Just to nit, the horizontal green leaf looks like it''s poking his eye.  Might have cloned that out :-)</td>', 'Love the pov. Great eye. Incredible detail with the eye and eyelashes (who knew?!).  Just to nit, the horizontal green leaf looks like it''s poking his eye.  Might have cloned that out :-)', '2009-03-13 19:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
