(5341989, 770994, 67579, '<td valign="top">In truth I used to have a greater appeal for B&amp;W photos but this one is one of the few IMO that is standing out from the crowd. to me anyway this has almost a classic film noir (sp?) look to  it which makes it that much better. well done!</td>', 'In truth I used to have a greater appeal for B&W photos but this one is one of the few IMO that is standing out from the crowd. to me anyway this has almost a classic film noir (sp?) look to  it which makes it that much better. well done!', '2009-03-13 19:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5341990, 772541, 100831, '<td valign="top">Old faithful, we rode the range together<br/>Old faithful in every kind of weather<br/>When your round up days are over<br/>There''ll be pastures white with clover<br/>For you old faithful pal of mine.<br/> <br/>Hurry up old fellow,<br/>''Cause the moon is yellow tonight<br/>Hurry up old fellow<br/>''Cause the moon is mellow and bright.<br/> <br/>There''s a coyote howlin'' to the moon above<br/>So carry me back to the one I love<br/>Hurry up old fellow<br/>''Cause we gotta get home tonight.<br/> <br/>Old faithful we rode the range together<br/>Old faithful in every kind of weather<br/>When your round up days are over <br/>There''ll be pastures white with clover<br/>For you old faithful pal of mine.<br/> <br/>For you old faithful pal of mine...</td>', 'Old faithful, we rode the range togetherOld faithful in every kind of weatherWhen your round up days are overThere''ll be pastures white with cloverFor you old faithful pal of mine. Hurry up old fellow,''Cause the moon is yellow tonightHurry up old fellow''Cause the moon is mellow and bright. There''s a coyote howlin'' to the moon aboveSo carry me back to the one I loveHurry up old fellow''Cause we gotta get home tonight. Old faithful we rode the range togetherOld faithful in every kind of weatherWhen your round up days are over There''ll be pastures white with cloverFor you old faithful pal of mine. For you old faithful pal of mine...', '2009-03-13 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5341992, 772566, 56057, '<td valign="top">great image- personally i would have cloned out the top of the second person just to give the effect of being alone in those dunes. :)</td>', 'great image- personally i would have cloned out the top of the second person just to give the effect of being alone in those dunes. :)', '2009-03-13 19:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5341993, 771924, 43191, '<td valign="top">The red really stands out against the bleak surroundings</td>', 'The red really stands out against the bleak surroundings', '2009-03-13 19:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
