(5342121, 772522, 36981, '<td valign="top">It''s a fun concept, although I''m not a big fan of rubber duckies.  Your focus is good, and you really caught the drops motion well.  I think two things would have improved this for me - more interesting lighting (right now it looks like it''s just a flash aimed directly at the duck, but I could be wrong), and a little more post-processing to bump up the colors &amp; contrasts. I think a brighter white on the duck, and a more vibrant pink in the back could have made this interesting.</td>', 'It''s a fun concept, although I''m not a big fan of rubber duckies.  Your focus is good, and you really caught the drops motion well.  I think two things would have improved this for me - more interesting lighting (right now it looks like it''s just a flash aimed directly at the duck, but I could be wrong), and a little more post-processing to bump up the colors & contrasts. I think a brighter white on the duck, and a more vibrant pink in the back could have made this interesting.', '2009-03-13 19:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
