(5342172, 771468, 96751, '<td valign="top">Straight out of X Files.  Very mysterious.  Great use of light.  Very interesting portal shape, and geometric shapes.  I wonder if cloning out the door handles would have made it even better.  Also, the object on the lower left is distracting.  Either more of it or not at all?</td>', 'Straight out of X Files.  Very mysterious.  Great use of light.  Very interesting portal shape, and geometric shapes.  I wonder if cloning out the door handles would have made it even better.  Also, the object on the lower left is distracting.  Either more of it or not at all?', '2009-03-13 20:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
