(5342204, 772741, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love the birds (geese I guess?), and your focus is good.  Their colors are very pretty - I wonder if the contrast could be increased a little to make them stand out more.  I wish that the black thing in the water wasn''t there - it makes it seem that the geese are separated from each other somehow.</td>', 'I love the birds (geese I guess?), and your focus is good.  Their colors are very pretty - I wonder if the contrast could be increased a little to make them stand out more.  I wish that the black thing in the water wasn''t there - it makes it seem that the geese are separated from each other somehow.', '2009-03-13 20:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
