(5342337, 770287, 47294, '<td valign="top">This challenge is just about killing me!  So many wonderful amazing photos entered just like this one.  Excellent reflection and composition, makes me want to pack my bags right now and travel the world in search of this place.  Excellent work, congratulations of a stunning photo, a fav and a 10 for me.</td>', 'This challenge is just about killing me!  So many wonderful amazing photos entered just like this one.  Excellent reflection and composition, makes me want to pack my bags right now and travel the world in search of this place.  Excellent work, congratulations of a stunning photo, a fav and a 10 for me.', '2009-03-13 20:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5342338, 770793, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>Lovely clarity and colours. I''ve never been to Portugal, hopefully one day I will visit. <br/> <br/>I just wish the horizon was level on this one (unless it''s an optical illusion the horizon appears to slope down left to right), and that the bottom left corner was cropped/cloned out. I''d have probably given it a 10 then. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  Lovely clarity and colours. I''ve never been to Portugal, hopefully one day I will visit.  I just wish the horizon was level on this one (unless it''s an optical illusion the horizon appears to slope down left to right), and that the bottom left corner was cropped/cloned out. I''d have probably given it a 10 then.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-13 20:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
