(5342659, 772099, 29011, '<td valign="top">There''s a renaissance style of Vermeer/Rembrandt in this. It''s as if she''s standing next to a window, and partly the catchlights give it away that it''s not so. I''ve a read tip somewhere where dark masking tape is placed on the lightbox to create an illusion of a window being reflected in the eye(s). An excellent shot. Lovely skin tones and the extra whiff of color from the scarf balances it all out. (no vote)</td>', 'There''s a renaissance style of Vermeer/Rembrandt in this. It''s as if she''s standing next to a window, and partly the catchlights give it away that it''s not so. I''ve a read tip somewhere where dark masking tape is placed on the lightbox to create an illusion of a window being reflected in the eye(s). An excellent shot. Lovely skin tones and the extra whiff of color from the scarf balances it all out. (no vote)', '2009-03-13 20:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
