(5343194, 770477, 100831, '<td valign="top">I had to look this up - Abbazia di Sant''Antimo in South Tuscany, a 12th-century Romanesque abbey, a gem of pale stone in the silvery green of an olive grove. Knowing that, this is an excellent capture of light and color in an heavenly abstract fashion. It has captured my attention and I hope others have noticed it as well. Nice job!</td>', 'I had to look this up - Abbazia di Sant''Antimo in South Tuscany, a 12th-century Romanesque abbey, a gem of pale stone in the silvery green of an olive grove. Knowing that, this is an excellent capture of light and color in an heavenly abstract fashion. It has captured my attention and I hope others have noticed it as well. Nice job!', '2009-03-13 21:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5343197, 771299, 100831, '<td valign="top">oh lovely!</td>', 'oh lovely!', '2009-03-13 21:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5343198, 772200, 35804, '<td valign="top">Just coming back to comment after voting...I want to go here, or having a backyard like this...what a place this is! I can hardly wait to see where this is. But for now I''m so happy knowing there is a place on Earth where something such as this exists.</td>', 'Just coming back to comment after voting...I want to go here, or having a backyard like this...what a place this is! I can hardly wait to see where this is. But for now I''m so happy knowing there is a place on Earth where something such as this exists.', '2009-03-13 21:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
