(5343290, 770667, 43774, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty neat, a good contrast between beauty and ruin.</td>', 'That''s pretty neat, a good contrast between beauty and ruin.', '2009-03-13 22:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5343291, 772558, 43088, '<td valign="top">This one snuck up on me. A very different shot and in a very good way. Really captures a feeling for the place. The composition is perfect and so is the lighting. I like the angle you were shooting from too.</td>', 'This one snuck up on me. A very different shot and in a very good way. Really captures a feeling for the place. The composition is perfect and so is the lighting. I like the angle you were shooting from too.', '2009-03-13 22:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5343292, 770392, 28710, '<td valign="top">just the right amount of oversharpening. heh. It''s there, but it works.<br/> <br/>It looks to my eye like you have used a layer of blur to give an artificial sense of bokeh. That works well, but I don''t think you applied it very well. My guess is that it was removed via a layer mask with a brush.<br/> <br/>If you had used an alpha channel it would have reaped better results.<br/> <br/>I could easily be wrong, but that''s what it looks like. Especially on the top of the head and moving down on the right side. <br/> <br/>Either way, very decent pic. I''m ignoring the above nitpicking for my score and treating it as if that wasn''t there.</td>', 'just the right amount of oversharpening. heh. It''s there, but it works. It looks to my eye like you have used a layer of blur to give an artificial sense of bokeh. That works well, but I don''t think you applied it very well. My guess is that it was removed via a layer mask with a brush. If you had used an alpha channel it would have reaped better results. I could easily be wrong, but that''s what it looks like. Especially on the top of the head and moving down on the right side.  Either way, very decent pic. I''m ignoring the above nitpicking for my score and treating it as if that wasn''t there.', '2009-03-13 22:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5343295, 771274, 97225, '<td valign="top">Beautiful portrait. Love the lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful portrait. Love the lighting.', '2009-03-13 22:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
