(5343334, 772246, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>Superb action shot, great colours and clarity. Excellent sense of motion and skill. Great composition!<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  Superb action shot, great colours and clarity. Excellent sense of motion and skill. Great composition! Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-13 22:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
