(5343337, 772767, 28710, '<td valign="top">you dream of a horse''s rump?<br/> <br/>I wonder how this would look if you cropped up to be square or even 4:3, so as to exclude enough of the horse''s rump that it was not immediately recognizable/prominent.<br/> <br/>I''m ignoring the graininess and purple fringing although I must say that a layer of gaussian blur would have done wonders for this pic, especially with the really strong highlights.</td>', 'you dream of a horse''s rump? I wonder how this would look if you cropped up to be square or even 4:3, so as to exclude enough of the horse''s rump that it was not immediately recognizable/prominent. I''m ignoring the graininess and purple fringing although I must say that a layer of gaussian blur would have done wonders for this pic, especially with the really strong highlights.', '2009-03-13 22:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
