(5343580, 771808, 36065, '<td valign="top">I like the capture, but the selective desaturation detracts from the image, in my opinion.  My eye is immediately drawn there instead of to the beauty of the little girl.  The lighting is already a bit harsh on the top of her head, and adding the only color there serves to pull my eye there even more.  I would have also pushed her toward the back of the frame a bit more with my cropping.  There are a lot of interesting elements inside the frame, but the color and centered composition really don''t pull my eye through them.</td>', 'I like the capture, but the selective desaturation detracts from the image, in my opinion.  My eye is immediately drawn there instead of to the beauty of the little girl.  The lighting is already a bit harsh on the top of her head, and adding the only color there serves to pull my eye there even more.  I would have also pushed her toward the back of the frame a bit more with my cropping.  There are a lot of interesting elements inside the frame, but the color and centered composition really don''t pull my eye through them.', '2009-03-13 22:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
