(5343752, 770287, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 30 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 30. <br/> <br/>Serenity indeed, a fantastically crystal clear reflection in the water. Great use of primary colours, and the compositional lead in lines work from all angles. A really lovely shot, and I expect a finish in the top 5%<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 30 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 30.  Serenity indeed, a fantastically crystal clear reflection in the water. Great use of primary colours, and the compositional lead in lines work from all angles. A really lovely shot, and I expect a finish in the top 5% Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-13 22:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
