(5344254, 772009, 5112, '<td valign="top">The sky is fantastic.  I like the fence at bottom right, and the two-track road.  The horizon line looks slightly not sharp (as if your focus were in front of the picture), and I think the picture would benefit from it being sharp.  The sky is really beautiful!  ~8</td>', 'The sky is fantastic.  I like the fence at bottom right, and the two-track road.  The horizon line looks slightly not sharp (as if your focus were in front of the picture), and I think the picture would benefit from it being sharp.  The sky is really beautiful!  ~8', '2009-03-13 23:45:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5344255, 771423, 80096, '<td valign="top">Very bizarre! ;-)</td>', 'Very bizarre! ;-)', '2009-03-13 23:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
