(5344260, 771385, 5112, '<td valign="top">Almost "surreal" looking, things look like the belong and don''t belong at the same time in this image.  Quite a different point of view.  The almost over the top processing works in this instance.</td>', 'Almost "surreal" looking, things look like the belong and don''t belong at the same time in this image.  Quite a different point of view.  The almost over the top processing works in this instance.', '2009-03-13 23:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
