(5344266, 772089, 50695, '<td valign="top">Mennonites in sneakers. There is such a story here, such multiple stories of acceptance and denial. To echo Wallace Stevens, six women at a waterfall are one woman at six waterfalls. 10</td>', 'Mennonites in sneakers. There is such a story here, such multiple stories of acceptance and denial. To echo Wallace Stevens, six women at a waterfall are one woman at six waterfalls. 10', '2009-03-13 23:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
