(5344316, 770749, 5112, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place and colours.  I think if you would have moved down a little to include a bit more of the pool at the bottom/bit less at top, it might have worked also.  To my eyes this is a bit overedited - there is a lot of detail lost in the "painterly" editing, and to me it doesn''t work all that well, but that is just opinion.</td>', 'Beautiful place and colours.  I think if you would have moved down a little to include a bit more of the pool at the bottom/bit less at top, it might have worked also.  To my eyes this is a bit overedited - there is a lot of detail lost in the "painterly" editing, and to me it doesn''t work all that well, but that is just opinion.', '2009-03-13 23:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
