(5344939, 770477, 30364, '<td valign="top">Beautiful coffee colours.  The shapes are suggestive of a path and very comforting. The heavier masses on each side fold together smoothly, and the lighter, nearly invisible shapes seen between them beckon the viewer.  The whole effect is of an invitation.  I like it.  7.</td>', 'Beautiful coffee colours.  The shapes are suggestive of a path and very comforting. The heavier masses on each side fold together smoothly, and the lighter, nearly invisible shapes seen between them beckon the viewer.  The whole effect is of an invitation.  I like it.  7.', '2009-03-14 01:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
