(5344958, 772382, 83313, '<td valign="top">This does give the impression of being all alone. Makes me wonder what she is thinking. It''s one of those good shots that probably just does not have enough wow factor to score highly here, which is a shame. If this is your own kid, this is certainly one that would be great to have on your wall.</td>', 'This does give the impression of being all alone. Makes me wonder what she is thinking. It''s one of those good shots that probably just does not have enough wow factor to score highly here, which is a shame. If this is your own kid, this is certainly one that would be great to have on your wall.', '2009-03-14 02:03:02.000000', NULL, 1),
