(5344964, 772308, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene. I appreciate the fact that you stayed subtle with the colors. Less JPEG compression might help a little. At 115k, you have a fair amount more overhead on file size before you are even cloise tot he challenge limit.</td>', 'Very nice scene. I appreciate the fact that you stayed subtle with the colors. Less JPEG compression might help a little. At 115k, you have a fair amount more overhead on file size before you are even cloise tot he challenge limit.', '2009-03-14 02:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
