(5344993, 771661, 83313, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. Ugly and totally beautiful at the same time. What kind of bird is this?</td>', 'Oh wow. Ugly and totally beautiful at the same time. What kind of bird is this?', '2009-03-14 02:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
