(5345113, 772588, 69684, '<td valign="top">A very colorful view with lots of nice reflections. I like the bright colors of the boats against the brownish surroundings.</td>', 'A very colorful view with lots of nice reflections. I like the bright colors of the boats against the brownish surroundings.', '2009-03-14 03:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
