(5345621, 770432, 79816, '<td valign="top">And to think I refreshed this page several times thinking my connection was down!<br/> <br/>It''s a shame the polar bear and arctic fox are looking away, you could have improved it by making noise so they looked. The igloo is a nice touch, and balances out the image perfectly. A little more sharpening and perhaps a contrast boost, this would have been a winner.</td>', 'And to think I refreshed this page several times thinking my connection was down! It''s a shame the polar bear and arctic fox are looking away, you could have improved it by making noise so they looked. The igloo is a nice touch, and balances out the image perfectly. A little more sharpening and perhaps a contrast boost, this would have been a winner.', '2009-03-14 04:43:40.000000', NULL, 1),
