(5346255, 772769, 100393, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but if I''m honest I think I''d like to have seen a tad more sharpness at some point in the image. I really like low DOF images but I think that works best where you can see a point of real sharpness. I have seen soft images that I really like, but they tend to use depth a bit more effectively and have more interesting colours; I''m thinking of the sort of images <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=5112" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">ursula</a> produces. Still, this is a nice picture though and for all my nit-picking, I have given a 7.</td>', 'I really like this picture, but if I''m honest I think I''d like to have seen a tad more sharpness at some point in the image. I really like low DOF images but I think that works best where you can see a point of real sharpness. I have seen soft images that I really like, but they tend to use depth a bit more effectively and have more interesting colours; I''m thinking of the sort of images  ursula produces. Still, this is a nice picture though and for all my nit-picking, I have given a 7.', '2009-03-14 06:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
