(5346714, 772288, 28710, '<td valign="top">That is an amazing pic of a mosquito. I think? Alternate title: Knock Knock, anybody home?<br/> <br/>LOVE the colors. Really, really glad I didn''t enter my fly pic for this challenge now :)<br/> <br/>instant fave and I say Hel10 to you too. :)<br/> <br/>Funny thing, I saw a fly with almost the exact same face yesterday, so I''m not all that confident that this actually is a mosquito. Either way....</td>', 'That is an amazing pic of a mosquito. I think? Alternate title: Knock Knock, anybody home? LOVE the colors. Really, really glad I didn''t enter my fly pic for this challenge now :) instant fave and I say Hel10 to you too. :) Funny thing, I saw a fly with almost the exact same face yesterday, so I''m not all that confident that this actually is a mosquito. Either way....', '2009-03-14 08:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5346716, 772471, 100106, '<td valign="top">Such good use of B/W. Beautiful capture here. A true moment in time, not something staged. The reflection adds so much and my eye isn''t destracted by anything at first glance. It went straight to the subjects. But what''s pleasing is there is other things to enjoy in this photo. Nicely done and thank you for sharing. =)</td>', 'Such good use of B/W. Beautiful capture here. A true moment in time, not something staged. The reflection adds so much and my eye isn''t destracted by anything at first glance. It went straight to the subjects. But what''s pleasing is there is other things to enjoy in this photo. Nicely done and thank you for sharing. =)', '2009-03-14 08:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
