(5346731, 770703, 29490, '<td valign="top">Nice find. Interesting geology fact #237: the red of the rocks is caused by oxidized iron, ie- rust.  Man made or nature made, rust to rust it''s all the same.  This is very nice!!  You are tied with two others for my top score.</td>', 'Nice find. Interesting geology fact #237: the red of the rocks is caused by oxidized iron, ie- rust.  Man made or nature made, rust to rust it''s all the same.  This is very nice!!  You are tied with two others for my top score.', '2009-03-14 08:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5346732, 772549, 100106, '<td valign="top">I like your image. Dark in the front and it litens up as it goes back. Most of the time, it is the opposite. To me, this is a moody shot with a good feel. Having the fog is a nice touch and the bird is just a plus. Really nice capture here, thank you for sharing.</td>', 'I like your image. Dark in the front and it litens up as it goes back. Most of the time, it is the opposite. To me, this is a moody shot with a good feel. Having the fog is a nice touch and the bird is just a plus. Really nice capture here, thank you for sharing.', '2009-03-14 08:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
