(5347649, 772195, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice! I hope you don''t get hit for having the tree branch OOF. One thought--have you tried cropping it in a little more from the right? The branch adds a nice diagonal to the picture, but I''m not convinced that you need to much of it. Try leaving the height the same, and crop of 1/4 to 1/3 of the branch and see what you think... - 8</td>', 'Very, very nice! I hope you don''t get hit for having the tree branch OOF. One thought--have you tried cropping it in a little more from the right? The branch adds a nice diagonal to the picture, but I''m not convinced that you need to much of it. Try leaving the height the same, and crop of 1/4 to 1/3 of the branch and see what you think... - 8', '2009-03-14 10:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
