(5347721, 771273, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like it very much. I''m wondering whether the cropping could be improved--something seems a little off (nit-picking here--it really is very nice). Have you tried cropping in a little more from the right? Also, for the future, I''m curious what it would have looked like down more at his level. Might have given an even better sense of the waves and the grandeur of the bridge. Just some thoughts--I like it because it looks cold and sort of menacing. - 8</td>', 'I like it very much. I''m wondering whether the cropping could be improved--something seems a little off (nit-picking here--it really is very nice). Have you tried cropping in a little more from the right? Also, for the future, I''m curious what it would have looked like down more at his level. Might have given an even better sense of the waves and the grandeur of the bridge. Just some thoughts--I like it because it looks cold and sort of menacing. - 8', '2009-03-14 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
