(5347792, 770231, 99263, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully enchanting image. I love the almost mystical atmosphere that this image exudes. Lovely play of light and beautiful softness. Superb. 10<br/> <br/>Ps. I have given 13 nine''s and this is the only 10 I have given in this challenge. This is for me my personal favorite. This image just has that something extra imo over the very excellent images that I gave a 9 to.</td>', 'Wonderfully enchanting image. I love the almost mystical atmosphere that this image exudes. Lovely play of light and beautiful softness. Superb. 10 Ps. I have given 13 nine''s and this is the only 10 I have given in this challenge. This is for me my personal favorite. This image just has that something extra imo over the very excellent images that I gave a 9 to.', '2009-03-14 10:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
