(5347794, 772759, 103142, '<td valign="top">It''s a very intriguing picture, but I think the DOP is a little too shallow for my tastes. If you had to work with this DOP, you might be better off focusing on the near flowers and letting the shot fade off. The upper right corner with the orange and white draws your eyes, but there''s not much for them when they get there. perhaps burn it out a bit or crop it out?</td>', 'It''s a very intriguing picture, but I think the DOP is a little too shallow for my tastes. If you had to work with this DOP, you might be better off focusing on the near flowers and letting the shot fade off. The upper right corner with the orange and white draws your eyes, but there''s not much for them when they get there. perhaps burn it out a bit or crop it out?', '2009-03-14 10:31:18.000000', NULL, 1),
