(5347816, 771381, 103142, '<td valign="top">Outtake from gas station? Nice shot. Since you''re cutting off the overhang a little already, you might want to try cropping it in from the left some more. I realize that you''d lose the "fina" on the overhang, but the left 1/5 of the picture doesn''t have much interest, and the tall pole and the sweeping upward wire at the top are a little distracting. Try cropping it in from left to right before the black rectangular sign--I think it will concentrate the focus a little more and get rid of some distractions.</td>', 'Outtake from gas station? Nice shot. Since you''re cutting off the overhang a little already, you might want to try cropping it in from the left some more. I realize that you''d lose the "fina" on the overhang, but the left 1/5 of the picture doesn''t have much interest, and the tall pole and the sweeping upward wire at the top are a little distracting. Try cropping it in from left to right before the black rectangular sign--I think it will concentrate the focus a little more and get rid of some distractions.', '2009-03-14 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347817, 772762, 94815, '<td valign="top">The extreme tilt seems pointless and a major distraction. It destroys any chance of framing effectively and simply destroys the otherwise fine quality of the this shot.</td>', 'The extreme tilt seems pointless and a major distraction. It destroys any chance of framing effectively and simply destroys the otherwise fine quality of the this shot.', '2009-03-14 10:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347818, 772442, 76335, '<td valign="top">I''m speechless. Wow. Looks totally posed but I think that''s what makes it work. Fun and funny stuff!</td>', 'I''m speechless. Wow. Looks totally posed but I think that''s what makes it work. Fun and funny stuff!', '2009-03-14 10:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347819, 772464, 81530, '<td valign="top">Would love to see a splash of colour such as a bird on the birdhouse.</td>', 'Would love to see a splash of colour such as a bird on the birdhouse.', '2009-03-14 10:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347820, 771218, 94815, '<td valign="top">Good color but horizon needs leveling.</td>', 'Good color but horizon needs leveling.', '2009-03-14 10:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
