(5347855, 772486, 103142, '<td valign="top">This looks like a wonderful shot, but it''s so dark, you''ve lost a lot of detail. My eye is drawn to the very light part in the upper left, and while it''s interesting I feel I''ve missed the most important part of the picture--the begger.</td>', 'This looks like a wonderful shot, but it''s so dark, you''ve lost a lot of detail. My eye is drawn to the very light part in the upper left, and while it''s interesting I feel I''ve missed the most important part of the picture--the begger.', '2009-03-14 10:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347858, 772656, 15305, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and great post processing, interesting to see a waterfall in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and great post processing, interesting to see a waterfall in B&W.', '2009-03-14 10:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
