(5347908, 772384, 84438, '<td valign="top">Nice..  A really wish the subjects were not so shadowy.  A fill flash on them would have really made this picture pop.</td>', 'Nice..  A really wish the subjects were not so shadowy.  A fill flash on them would have really made this picture pop.', '2009-03-14 10:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
