(5347921, 772471, 76335, '<td valign="top">I like it a lot but think a bit more contrast and/or sharpness would have helped it along...</td>', 'I like it a lot but think a bit more contrast and/or sharpness would have helped it along...', '2009-03-14 10:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347922, 771824, 103142, '<td valign="top">This photo intrigued me, so I had to play with it a little in photoshop. I absolutely love the shadow on the wall, but the foreground seemed so dark, it was distracting. I played just a tad with levels and made the midtones brighter. It made the picture a bit brighter, which seemed to fit because the sun is shining directly at us, and brought out your brilliant shadow a little bit more. Fun shot! 8</td>', 'This photo intrigued me, so I had to play with it a little in photoshop. I absolutely love the shadow on the wall, but the foreground seemed so dark, it was distracting. I played just a tad with levels and made the midtones brighter. It made the picture a bit brighter, which seemed to fit because the sun is shining directly at us, and brought out your brilliant shadow a little bit more. Fun shot! 8', '2009-03-14 10:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347923, 770631, 84438, '<td valign="top">I really like the shapes of the sails..  Really makes this photo.  The dark water provides great contrast.</td>', 'I really like the shapes of the sails..  Really makes this photo.  The dark water provides great contrast.', '2009-03-14 10:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347924, 771171, 81530, '<td valign="top">The clouds are very dreamlike.</td>', 'The clouds are very dreamlike.', '2009-03-14 10:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347925, 770692, 94815, '<td valign="top">Colors stand out against the grey. The errant pink umbrella seems stuck in the border. Why to it?</td>', 'Colors stand out against the grey. The errant pink umbrella seems stuck in the border. Why to it?', '2009-03-14 10:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347927, 770873, 81530, '<td valign="top">Wow. That house looks so small compared to that mountain.</td>', 'Wow. That house looks so small compared to that mountain.', '2009-03-14 10:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347929, 770246, 76335, '<td valign="top">I love the wide angle. A little more interest or activity in the frame (among the people) might have helped.</td>', 'I love the wide angle. A little more interest or activity in the frame (among the people) might have helped.', '2009-03-14 10:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
