(5347935, 770748, 103142, '<td valign="top">Seems a little too centered to me, would have liked it off to the left a bit, and cutting off the top of the pole with so much foreground seems a little uncomfortable. <br/> <br/>that being said, I love the building and I like the choice of black &amp; white.</td>', 'Seems a little too centered to me, would have liked it off to the left a bit, and cutting off the top of the pole with so much foreground seems a little uncomfortable.  that being said, I love the building and I like the choice of black & white.', '2009-03-14 10:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5347937, 770183, 16241, '<td valign="top">brilliant</td>', 'brilliant', '2009-03-14 10:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
