(5348388, 772260, 99263, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. You have the width at only 640 pixels. This is an advanced challenge and you were allowed a width of 720 pixels. Pity that you did not make use of the allowed width as I feel this image would come into it''s own right much better at a larger size.<br/>The size of 640 pixels wide is used for the Basic Challenge. 7</td>', 'Very good composition. You have the width at only 640 pixels. This is an advanced challenge and you were allowed a width of 720 pixels. Pity that you did not make use of the allowed width as I feel this image would come into it''s own right much better at a larger size.The size of 640 pixels wide is used for the Basic Challenge. 7', '2009-03-14 11:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5348389, 771736, 81530, '<td valign="top">The composition is good. I quite like the effect of the wide angle lens. The title confuses me a bit.</td>', 'The composition is good. I quite like the effect of the wide angle lens. The title confuses me a bit.', '2009-03-14 11:31:31.000000', NULL, 1);
