(5348522, 772316, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. I remember this shot from whose portfolio I know not:-) This is such a *GREAT* ''candid'' style shot that really captures a mood and feel. We really do get the sense we have stumbled across this woman and disturbed her solitude. We feel that we are intruders upon her secret space that she comes to to escape the crazy hectic world outside. I see her as connecting back with nature as seen in the fact she has gotten dirty and had emersed in the water; caring not that she is wet. In the composition, she has heard us and looks to see who has disturbed her, but we have jumped back into the shadows or trees to hide. The tones in this composition is just fabulous and the sepia gives it a feel of an old photograph of a time that has passed into memory.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. I remember this shot from whose portfolio I know not:-) This is such a *GREAT* ''candid'' style shot that really captures a mood and feel. We really do get the sense we have stumbled across this woman and disturbed her solitude. We feel that we are intruders upon her secret space that she comes to to escape the crazy hectic world outside. I see her as connecting back with nature as seen in the fact she has gotten dirty and had emersed in the water; caring not that she is wet. In the composition, she has heard us and looks to see who has disturbed her, but we have jumped back into the shadows or trees to hide. The tones in this composition is just fabulous and the sepia gives it a feel of an old photograph of a time that has passed into memory.', '2009-03-14 11:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5348523, 771825, 99263, '<td valign="top">Wonderful and unusual image. Very nice processing. 8</td>', 'Wonderful and unusual image. Very nice processing. 8', '2009-03-14 11:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
