(5349461, 772071, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1121 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>This photo really captures a sense of tranquility in such an idyllic setting. Nice use of foreground to give the lake and scenery some context, and the blue of the water is gorgeous. Definitely one of those "wish you were here" locations!<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1121 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. This photo really captures a sense of tranquility in such an idyllic setting. Nice use of foreground to give the lake and scenery some context, and the blue of the water is gorgeous. Definitely one of those "wish you were here" locations! Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-14 13:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5349462, 772244, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the blue. This shot makes me want to see more of this architecture.</td>', 'Love the blue. This shot makes me want to see more of this architecture.', '2009-03-14 13:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5349464, 772662, 15305, '<td valign="top">Lovely image, very well captured.</td>', 'Lovely image, very well captured.', '2009-03-14 13:34:34.000000', NULL, 1);
