(5349471, 771952, 27339, '<td valign="top">Everything is great about this except for the hippie title lol</td>', 'Everything is great about this except for the hippie title lol', '2009-03-14 13:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5349472, 771241, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1121 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>I have never visited Budapest, but I hope that one day I will. There are lots of sunset/twilight/bridge images in this challenge, but this is one of the better ones. A lovely warm glow to the lighting. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1121 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. I have never visited Budapest, but I hope that one day I will. There are lots of sunset/twilight/bridge images in this challenge, but this is one of the better ones. A lovely warm glow to the lighting.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-14 13:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
