(5349549, 772033, 83313, '<td valign="top">She looks like she is saying "Just take the stupid picture already!"<br/> <br/>A very nice portrait, but it comes off a bit soft. There is a lack of sharpness to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 50k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and clarity from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'She looks like she is saying "Just take the stupid picture already!" A very nice portrait, but it comes off a bit soft. There is a lack of sharpness to this photo and I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 50k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing a lot of the detail and clarity from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2009-03-14 13:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
