(5349602, 771825, 96751, '<td valign="top">How much did you pay for the kid and the camel????  Seriously, the Taj, a kid, AND a camel???  This is a historic-looking shot.  Great detail, great sky, even the splash the camel is making.  I love this.  I''ve been here and this shot really captures the yin/yang of India.  A fave.</td>', 'How much did you pay for the kid and the camel????  Seriously, the Taj, a kid, AND a camel???  This is a historic-looking shot.  Great detail, great sky, even the splash the camel is making.  I love this.  I''ve been here and this shot really captures the yin/yang of India.  A fave.', '2009-03-14 13:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5349603, 772578, 96751, '<td valign="top">Holy moly!!! Nothing as attractive as a, er, molting goat....  Incredible detail, fabulous sky background.  The tiny weed lower right looks like a tree, making the scale look like the worlds most humongous animal standing on a mountain.  Love this.  The can feel the wind!</td>', 'Holy moly!!! Nothing as attractive as a, er, molting goat....  Incredible detail, fabulous sky background.  The tiny weed lower right looks like a tree, making the scale look like the worlds most humongous animal standing on a mountain.  Love this.  The can feel the wind!', '2009-03-14 13:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5349604, 772303, 96751, '<td valign="top">The textures on this are fabulous.  The detail on the blueberry and the tiny droplets and their shadows are great.  A teensy bit more sheen on the berry would have made this a 10 for me.  Top 100.</td>', 'The textures on this are fabulous.  The detail on the blueberry and the tiny droplets and their shadows are great.  A teensy bit more sheen on the berry would have made this a 10 for me.  Top 100.', '2009-03-14 13:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
