(5350058, 770644, 67258, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite places!  I like this composition, and the tone-mapping works well to bring out the sky as well as the land and water.  It is a bit of a shame that the colour of the cottages on the harbour side has been leached out, as that is one of the aspects of Whitby that i find most charming.</td>', 'One of my favourite places!  I like this composition, and the tone-mapping works well to bring out the sky as well as the land and water.  It is a bit of a shame that the colour of the cottages on the harbour side has been leached out, as that is one of the aspects of Whitby that i find most charming.', '2009-03-14 14:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350059, 772231, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...<br/> <br/>Not sure why, but this image, though quite beautiful, makes me sad! I''m worried that the number on his ear indicates he''s headed for the butcher. 10</td>', 'Coming back to comment... Not sure why, but this image, though quite beautiful, makes me sad! I''m worried that the number on his ear indicates he''s headed for the butcher. 10', '2009-03-14 14:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
