(5350065, 771000, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now I am going to have the song <a href="//www.amazon.com/Up-Away-Digitally-Remastered-1997/dp/B00137RASE/ref=sr_f2_2?ie=UTF8&amp;s=dmusic&amp;qid=1237055956&amp;sr=102-2" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"Up, Up And Away"</a> running through my head.  Fantastic shot. You must have been in one of the other balloons.</td>', 'Now I am going to have the song "Up, Up And Away" running through my head.  Fantastic shot. You must have been in one of the other balloons.', '2009-03-14 14:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
