(5350084, 772152, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. Great action shot of this ballerina leaping in the air. The u shape created by the long scarf adds an interesting shape and curve to the composition. What I like most in this photo is her expression coupled with her dance pose. There seems to be this pure joy that comes off the page - a love of the dance that is palpable. Nice work!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. Great action shot of this ballerina leaping in the air. The u shape created by the long scarf adds an interesting shape and curve to the composition. What I like most in this photo is her expression coupled with her dance pose. There seems to be this pure joy that comes off the page - a love of the dance that is palpable. Nice work!', '2009-03-14 14:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
