(5350093, 772408, 103142, '<td valign="top">very intriguing! I like it very much.</td>', 'very intriguing! I like it very much.', '2009-03-14 14:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350094, 770413, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the little guy peeping around the corner.</td>', 'Love the little guy peeping around the corner.', '2009-03-14 14:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350095, 770991, 96751, '<td valign="top">What an interesting building.  The reflection is very cool.</td>', 'What an interesting building.  The reflection is very cool.', '2009-03-14 14:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350096, 772542, 96751, '<td valign="top">Though the hair, eye and eyebrow in the foreground are incredible, the dof is just too shallow and makes the subject look very odd.  Perhaps there is also a little "fisheye-ing".</td>', 'Though the hair, eye and eyebrow in the foreground are incredible, the dof is just too shallow and makes the subject look very odd.  Perhaps there is also a little "fisheye-ing".', '2009-03-14 14:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350097, 771898, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great sunburst rays.  I also like the lit railing on the right.</td>', 'Great sunburst rays.  I also like the lit railing on the right.', '2009-03-14 14:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350098, 772193, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...<br/> <br/>Wow! That''s one incredibly blue eye! Love the over the top edit on this very adorable boy! 10</td>', 'Coming back to comment... Wow! That''s one incredibly blue eye! Love the over the top edit on this very adorable boy! 10', '2009-03-14 14:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350099, 772297, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  A little oversaturated on the hands and eyes.</td>', 'Very sweet.  A little oversaturated on the hands and eyes.', '2009-03-14 14:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350100, 772480, 84438, '<td valign="top">Kind of an interesting subject, and I do like the composition with the various lines and squares.  I find the extreme yellow cast to be off-putting though.</td>', 'Kind of an interesting subject, and I do like the composition with the various lines and squares.  I find the extreme yellow cast to be off-putting though.', '2009-03-14 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350101, 770549, 96751, '<td valign="top">I swear he''s smiling.  I like the left half, but there''s something odd about the lighting on the right half.</td>', 'I swear he''s smiling.  I like the left half, but there''s something odd about the lighting on the right half.', '2009-03-14 14:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350104, 772349, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very different, pretty cool!</td>', 'Very different, pretty cool!', '2009-03-14 14:45:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350105, 771985, 83313, '<td valign="top">Exactly what I needed for a break in the commenting. Thanks. (Pops open a can...)</td>', 'Exactly what I needed for a break in the commenting. Thanks. (Pops open a can...)', '2009-03-14 14:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350107, 770912, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...<br/> <br/>Gorgeous, stunning, love the star filter! Perfect reflections in the dreamy water. 10</td>', 'Coming back to comment... Gorgeous, stunning, love the star filter! Perfect reflections in the dreamy water. 10', '2009-03-14 14:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350109, 772337, 67258, '<td valign="top">The bird is lovely and very well photographed, although I do find the line across the background (at the top of the left wing) a little distracting.</td>', 'The bird is lovely and very well photographed, although I do find the line across the background (at the top of the left wing) a little distracting.', '2009-03-14 14:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350110, 770417, 27339, '<td valign="top">Very clean shot. Would be great if this was for a real estate sale. It might seal the deal.</td>', 'Very clean shot. Would be great if this was for a real estate sale. It might seal the deal.', '2009-03-14 14:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350111, 772477, 67258, '<td valign="top">Tricky to expose right, but you have.  A very pleasing photo of these mute swans in flight.</td>', 'Tricky to expose right, but you have.  A very pleasing photo of these mute swans in flight.', '2009-03-14 14:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350112, 771170, 67258, '<td valign="top">The photo may not be the best technically, but by capturing the bird (a bunting of some sort?) in the process of weaving it''s nest, as a part of a natural history study it is invaluable.</td>', 'The photo may not be the best technically, but by capturing the bird (a bunting of some sort?) in the process of weaving it''s nest, as a part of a natural history study it is invaluable.', '2009-03-14 14:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350113, 772366, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...<br/> <br/>Stunning, they are like moving mini stained glass windows. Love the composition, the colors and details! 10</td>', 'Coming back to comment... Stunning, they are like moving mini stained glass windows. Love the composition, the colors and details! 10', '2009-03-14 14:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350114, 770903, 28963, '<td valign="top">Very nice sky and tones but I don''t like the skewed pov. I don''t find it makes the image more interesting (your intention?), it just confuses me. 6</td>', 'Very nice sky and tones but I don''t like the skewed pov. I don''t find it makes the image more interesting (your intention?), it just confuses me. 6', '2009-03-14 14:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350115, 772356, 83313, '<td valign="top">On ''yer left!<br/> <br/>Seems a little bright and slightly washed out, but a pleasant scene that I too, enjoy. I really need to get on my bike more this year.</td>', 'On ''yer left! Seems a little bright and slightly washed out, but a pleasant scene that I too, enjoy. I really need to get on my bike more this year.', '2009-03-14 14:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
