(5350145, 771921, 83313, '<td valign="top">"B1-RD to tower, request permission for landing." <br/> <br/>On the other hand, he looks like he is coming in for a fishing run, so this may be more like "attack pattern delta"</td>', '"B1-RD to tower, request permission for landing."  On the other hand, he looks like he is coming in for a fishing run, so this may be more like "attack pattern delta"', '2009-03-14 14:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350148, 772716, 28963, '<td valign="top">I know it''s a technical cliché to comment of the horizon being in the middle of the image but I really do feel the image suffers from it. To me the foreground included in this crop doesn''t add anything to the shot. I would probably have croped it just under the reflection. Otherwis it had a very nice feel to it with the looming clouds and lonely man on his chair. 6</td>', 'I know it''s a technical cliché to comment of the horizon being in the middle of the image but I really do feel the image suffers from it. To me the foreground included in this crop doesn''t add anything to the shot. I would probably have croped it just under the reflection. Otherwis it had a very nice feel to it with the looming clouds and lonely man on his chair. 6', '2009-03-14 14:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350149, 771861, 9411, '<td valign="top">wow, what a moment to be there for</td>', 'wow, what a moment to be there for', '2009-03-14 14:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350150, 772171, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a delightful smile your subject has - she looks lovely!  You clearly have a great deal of empathy with this old lady, and it shines through in the photo.  On a technical note, the background is a little stark, but it is the character that you have captured so well that matters here.</td>', 'What a delightful smile your subject has - she looks lovely!  You clearly have a great deal of empathy with this old lady, and it shines through in the photo.  On a technical note, the background is a little stark, but it is the character that you have captured so well that matters here.', '2009-03-14 14:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350151, 771822, 11854, '<td valign="top">Coming back to comment...<br/> <br/>Beautiful, stunning image! The colors are vibrant, the look (the eye) is incredible! 10</td>', 'Coming back to comment... Beautiful, stunning image! The colors are vibrant, the look (the eye) is incredible! 10', '2009-03-14 14:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350153, 771852, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, funny! Just to be nit-picky (feel free to ignore this), I''d  like the background a little more white than off-white.</td>', 'Very nice shot, funny! Just to be nit-picky (feel free to ignore this), I''d  like the background a little more white than off-white.', '2009-03-14 14:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
