(5350184, 772305, 103142, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, and well done, but not very realistic. I can''t figure out why his hand would be at this angle. He''s not pointing at anything, and not following along the text with his hand while he reads. So the picture starts telling the story, but the story doesn''t go anywhere. 7 for well done, would have been 8 if I could come up for a reason why it was this way.</td>', 'Interesting idea, and well done, but not very realistic. I can''t figure out why his hand would be at this angle. He''s not pointing at anything, and not following along the text with his hand while he reads. So the picture starts telling the story, but the story doesn''t go anywhere. 7 for well done, would have been 8 if I could come up for a reason why it was this way.', '2009-03-14 14:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
