(5350213, 772402, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment now. The big *WOW* factor here is the color! Love the bold and vibrant pinks that just pop off the green background. Love the hues too - the springtime green and the hot pink. I see alot of nice detail too with some of the textures of the petals visible. This is a very pleasing floral shot.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment now. The big *WOW* factor here is the color! Love the bold and vibrant pinks that just pop off the green background. Love the hues too - the springtime green and the hot pink. I see alot of nice detail too with some of the textures of the petals visible. This is a very pleasing floral shot.', '2009-03-14 15:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
