(5350286, 771079, 36199, '<td valign="top">I like the treatment of the colour, it gives the picture a ''gothic'' feel</td>', 'I like the treatment of the colour, it gives the picture a ''gothic'' feel', '2009-03-14 15:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350288, 770549, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. The wind gently blows and billows and the tall grass sways to the musical tune of the air. The ol'' girl feels the caress of the wind and she closes her eyes, tilts her head up ever so slightly to hear nature''s music. This is what I see and feel when I look upon this photo. I don''t really know if the dog is actually old or young but I feel that not only is the dog gentle but is an old soul that is connecting to nature. The expression is that he/she is hearing and feeling things in nature that we miss. Love the colors. The soft focus on the meadows brings a magical/mystical feel to the composition. One thing I note as very interesting is the choice of framework: the dropshadow makes the picture seem to pop off the page. I don''t think the photo needed that for the composition itself is strong that it does not need any frame to put the spotlight on it. It is beautiful all by itself.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. The wind gently blows and billows and the tall grass sways to the musical tune of the air. The ol'' girl feels the caress of the wind and she closes her eyes, tilts her head up ever so slightly to hear nature''s music. This is what I see and feel when I look upon this photo. I don''t really know if the dog is actually old or young but I feel that not only is the dog gentle but is an old soul that is connecting to nature. The expression is that he/she is hearing and feeling things in nature that we miss. Love the colors. The soft focus on the meadows brings a magical/mystical feel to the composition. One thing I note as very interesting is the choice of framework: the dropshadow makes the picture seem to pop off the page. I don''t think the photo needed that for the composition itself is strong that it does not need any frame to put the spotlight on it. It is beautiful all by itself.', '2009-03-14 15:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350290, 771833, 9411, '<td valign="top">nice use of the arch to frame the shot</td>', 'nice use of the arch to frame the shot', '2009-03-14 15:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
