(5350345, 772115, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Heh, yup that is an apt title. When I look upon your composition, I think of a saying I heard years ago, "The definition of a boy: A noise with dirt on it" The eyes are very startling they reach out and grab you as he levels a stare at us. The dirt well, I think he was having a lot of fun until ''we'' interupted his play and called him away. That is what I gather from his look. He was happy but is not now. He wants to go back and play. Mood and emotion are great. Love the color tones and the sharp details. You did such a wonderful job on this portrait of the young boy! Great work - 8.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Heh, yup that is an apt title. When I look upon your composition, I think of a saying I heard years ago, "The definition of a boy: A noise with dirt on it" The eyes are very startling they reach out and grab you as he levels a stare at us. The dirt well, I think he was having a lot of fun until ''we'' interupted his play and called him away. That is what I gather from his look. He was happy but is not now. He wants to go back and play. Mood and emotion are great. Love the color tones and the sharp details. You did such a wonderful job on this portrait of the young boy! Great work - 8.', '2009-03-14 15:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350346, 770694, 96751, '<td valign="top">Nice motion blur.  The oversaturated green is distracting for me.</td>', 'Nice motion blur.  The oversaturated green is distracting for me.', '2009-03-14 15:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350350, 772550, 103142, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot! I''d be curious to see what it looked like with her not in an exact profile. Also, if she''s holding her hand out in front like that, it might make more sense if she was looking at her hand. Otherwise it looks a little forced. this is nitpicking--it''s beautiful. - 8</td>', 'Beautiful shot! I''d be curious to see what it looked like with her not in an exact profile. Also, if she''s holding her hand out in front like that, it might make more sense if she was looking at her hand. Otherwise it looks a little forced. this is nitpicking--it''s beautiful. - 8', '2009-03-14 15:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
