(5350431, 770623, 71239, '<td valign="top">Striking pink, but tends to overpower the central subject and draw the eye up and left out of the shot.  Perhaps there is enough texture in the bridge that it could take a stronger colour and reserve a secondary &amp; more muted or complementary colour for the trees - thereby making the bridge stand out?</td>', 'Striking pink, but tends to overpower the central subject and draw the eye up and left out of the shot.  Perhaps there is enough texture in the bridge that it could take a stronger colour and reserve a secondary & more muted or complementary colour for the trees - thereby making the bridge stand out?', '2009-03-14 15:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350432, 771291, 73056, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and tones. Love how the angle of the trees and boat work together!</td>', 'Nice shot and tones. Love how the angle of the trees and boat work together!', '2009-03-14 15:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
