(5350462, 770220, 71239, '<td valign="top">There''s a good variety of textures to be had here, but maybe the stronger textures in the centre of the flower are making the shot top heavy?  Perhaps pulling back slightly to reveal a bit more of the petals would make the centre of the flower more of a focal point and would also allow you to get more depth of field to keep the centre of the flower nice and sharp.</td>', 'There''s a good variety of textures to be had here, but maybe the stronger textures in the centre of the flower are making the shot top heavy?  Perhaps pulling back slightly to reveal a bit more of the petals would make the centre of the flower more of a focal point and would also allow you to get more depth of field to keep the centre of the flower nice and sharp.', '2009-03-14 15:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
