(5350678, 770915, 99394, '<td valign="top">Nice tones. I think more of the plants should have been in focus. little distracted by the blurred background - seems to overpower the few sharp plants/limbs.</td>', 'Nice tones. I think more of the plants should have been in focus. little distracted by the blurred background - seems to overpower the few sharp plants/limbs.', '2009-03-14 15:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
