(5350695, 772070, 41802, '<td valign="top">Wow the mountain looks so big. Nice job showing us how small the person is into contrast with the mountain.</td>', 'Wow the mountain looks so big. Nice job showing us how small the person is into contrast with the mountain.', '2009-03-14 15:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
