(5350698, 770996, 62357, '<td valign="top">Stunning sky, stunning colours.</td>', 'Stunning sky, stunning colours.', '2009-03-14 15:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350699, 772507, 71239, '<td valign="top">A lovely subject, snow leopards are a favourite of mine.  A pity that the focus isn''t quite sharp.  I''m guessing this is a zoo shot and that you''re shooting through a window whilst trying to get a decent background and get rid of any out-of-focus wire mesh that is the bane of anyone taking shots at zoos.<br/>I might have taken advantage of the advance editing rules to darken down the post as the strong diagonal highlight is a bit distracting.<br/>That said, you''ve catured a great snarl on this wonderful big cat.</td>', 'A lovely subject, snow leopards are a favourite of mine.  A pity that the focus isn''t quite sharp.  I''m guessing this is a zoo shot and that you''re shooting through a window whilst trying to get a decent background and get rid of any out-of-focus wire mesh that is the bane of anyone taking shots at zoos.I might have taken advantage of the advance editing rules to darken down the post as the strong diagonal highlight is a bit distracting.That said, you''ve catured a great snarl on this wonderful big cat.', '2009-03-14 15:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
