(5350760, 771829, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a magnificent scene.  The reflection is great, and the framing by the two closest trees is nice too.  It looks like the either the front was oversaturated or the background was desaturated, but the uneveness of saturation looks odd.</td>', 'Such a magnificent scene.  The reflection is great, and the framing by the two closest trees is nice too.  It looks like the either the front was oversaturated or the background was desaturated, but the uneveness of saturation looks odd.', '2009-03-14 16:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
