(5350770, 770757, 71239, '<td valign="top">Lovely model and the red of her clothing works well with the greens in the background.  There just a little softness on the shot (perhaps this is a candid and she was turning her head?), but the lighting is sympathetic and the expression is fantastic.</td>', 'Lovely model and the red of her clothing works well with the greens in the background.  There just a little softness on the shot (perhaps this is a candid and she was turning her head?), but the lighting is sympathetic and the expression is fantastic.', '2009-03-14 16:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350772, 770620, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is intense, wonderful capture of an emotional (and dangerous!) moment.</td>', 'Wow, this is intense, wonderful capture of an emotional (and dangerous!) moment.', '2009-03-14 16:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350773, 771283, 98141, '<td valign="top">I love the different shades of color for the mountains, adds a subtle depth to the shot.</td>', 'I love the different shades of color for the mountains, adds a subtle depth to the shot.', '2009-03-14 16:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350774, 771711, 97166, '<td valign="top">In the most unexpected place imaginable, it awoke.  There, among the lazy field of summer flowers, with the grasses blowing in the breeze, and a silence about that place, it suddenly found itself alive, and conscious.<br/> <br/>It didn''t know why, or how, or did it even much care, for it was like to a newborn in its thoughts, and because of this it was mostly instinct that governed it then, and with instinct came the basics of thought. Those of confusion, fear, and hunger.<br/> <br/>And as it cast about, desperately searching for a way to settle that hunger, that so blinded it to all else for the moment, it came to the realization that it could not move from this spot, anchored to the ground by a single stem, and there was no food within reach.  Then the fear and confusion became terror and anger, and it reached its face to the sky and gave a great cry of frustration, it''s many yellowed teeth bared, and its lament went unheeded.</td>', 'In the most unexpected place imaginable, it awoke.  There, among the lazy field of summer flowers, with the grasses blowing in the breeze, and a silence about that place, it suddenly found itself alive, and conscious. It didn''t know why, or how, or did it even much care, for it was like to a newborn in its thoughts, and because of this it was mostly instinct that governed it then, and with instinct came the basics of thought. Those of confusion, fear, and hunger. And as it cast about, desperately searching for a way to settle that hunger, that so blinded it to all else for the moment, it came to the realization that it could not move from this spot, anchored to the ground by a single stem, and there was no food within reach.  Then the fear and confusion became terror and anger, and it reached its face to the sky and gave a great cry of frustration, it''s many yellowed teeth bared, and its lament went unheeded.', '2009-03-14 16:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350775, 772227, 98141, '<td valign="top">What a well-done portrait. DOF is fantastic, framing is nice, colors look great.</td>', 'What a well-done portrait. DOF is fantastic, framing is nice, colors look great.', '2009-03-14 16:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350776, 772347, 98141, '<td valign="top">I like the rays of sunlight over the mountains and the shadows from the clouds.</td>', 'I like the rays of sunlight over the mountains and the shadows from the clouds.', '2009-03-14 16:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350777, 772058, 98141, '<td valign="top">Really nice use of natural framing with the leaves. I love the b&amp;w for this, nice clarity as well.</td>', 'Really nice use of natural framing with the leaves. I love the b&w for this, nice clarity as well.', '2009-03-14 16:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350778, 772175, 98141, '<td valign="top">This is so ridiculous that I can''t help but love it.</td>', 'This is so ridiculous that I can''t help but love it.', '2009-03-14 16:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
