(5350832, 771858, 96751, '<td valign="top">You have definitely found your niche :-)  This might be my fave of the series.  I really love the specific lighting from the left, the awesome clouds, and the glint detail on the upper planes.  Really makes them pop from the black cloud.  The faint smoke trails off to the right are just even more eye candy.  Top 100 at the very least.  On the tiniest of nit picks, there''s a tiny bit of blown out white in the middle of the clouds (on the right), and the white smoke trails.</td>', 'You have definitely found your niche :-)  This might be my fave of the series.  I really love the specific lighting from the left, the awesome clouds, and the glint detail on the upper planes.  Really makes them pop from the black cloud.  The faint smoke trails off to the right are just even more eye candy.  Top 100 at the very least.  On the tiniest of nit picks, there''s a tiny bit of blown out white in the middle of the clouds (on the right), and the white smoke trails.', '2009-03-14 16:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350833, 770317, 96751, '<td valign="top">INCREDIBLE sky.  It is so overwhelming I almost didn''t notice the road and the car. A fave, and I speculate a top 50 finish here.</td>', 'INCREDIBLE sky.  It is so overwhelming I almost didn''t notice the road and the car. A fave, and I speculate a top 50 finish here.', '2009-03-14 16:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
