(5350838, 772090, 96751, '<td valign="top">Seriously amazing.  The colors are just so exciting, and the detail on the entire head and forearms (and unfortunate snack) are Killer.  Top 100</td>', 'Seriously amazing.  The colors are just so exciting, and the detail on the entire head and forearms (and unfortunate snack) are Killer.  Top 100', '2009-03-14 16:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350839, 772191, 96751, '<td valign="top">Definite WOW factor here.  Love the blue hue of the droplets against the beige/gray tinge of the mirror reflection.  The clarity and detail on this are incredible.  And I''m dying to know how you managed to avoid the camera showing up in the bead reflections.  Super shot.  A fave</td>', 'Definite WOW factor here.  Love the blue hue of the droplets against the beige/gray tinge of the mirror reflection.  The clarity and detail on this are incredible.  And I''m dying to know how you managed to avoid the camera showing up in the bead reflections.  Super shot.  A fave', '2009-03-14 16:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350840, 771926, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think this is going to place very, very high :-)<br/> <br/>Not only is it a stunning landscape, it has incredible movement and dynamics.  The colors are incredible and complimentary.  The curved movement of the pier, with the short vertical pylons add visual contrast.  Great reflection, incredible depth.  A fave.</td>', 'I think this is going to place very, very high :-) Not only is it a stunning landscape, it has incredible movement and dynamics.  The colors are incredible and complimentary.  The curved movement of the pier, with the short vertical pylons add visual contrast.  Great reflection, incredible depth.  A fave.', '2009-03-14 16:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350841, 772538, 96751, '<td valign="top">WOW.  Yeah, that''s pretty much it...  The detail on this is incredible, as are those teeth...</td>', 'WOW.  Yeah, that''s pretty much it...  The detail on this is incredible, as are those teeth...', '2009-03-14 16:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350842, 772649, 96751, '<td valign="top">I''ve been to one of these.  They''re amazing.  As is this shot.  This looks like a classic painting.  The tones, the poses, the way the horses and soldiers are spread out all over the landscape, the smoke from the gunshots.  That central tree is a real anchor, and with the two flags, creates a pleasing triangle.  Fabulous shot.</td>', 'I''ve been to one of these.  They''re amazing.  As is this shot.  This looks like a classic painting.  The tones, the poses, the way the horses and soldiers are spread out all over the landscape, the smoke from the gunshots.  That central tree is a real anchor, and with the two flags, creates a pleasing triangle.  Fabulous shot.', '2009-03-14 16:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350843, 772338, 96751, '<td valign="top">Glorious.  I don''t know if this is a bubble of a sphere, or even something else, but the image is just magical.  Perfect hues, shapes, clarity, sharpness, contrast.  I''ve come back to comment and bump up.  A fave.</td>', 'Glorious.  I don''t know if this is a bubble of a sphere, or even something else, but the image is just magical.  Perfect hues, shapes, clarity, sharpness, contrast.  I''ve come back to comment and bump up.  A fave.', '2009-03-14 16:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350844, 771677, 96751, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal.  Everything I love about photography is in this shot.  Fabulous lighting, motion capture, clarity, focus, mystery.  The water is so transparent, and the combination of the metallic suit under the gauzy material.  Came back to bump.  A fave.</td>', 'Phenomenal.  Everything I love about photography is in this shot.  Fabulous lighting, motion capture, clarity, focus, mystery.  The water is so transparent, and the combination of the metallic suit under the gauzy material.  Came back to bump.  A fave.', '2009-03-14 16:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350845, 770369, 96751, '<td valign="top">Very sweet.  Incredible contrast and composition.  The pale color and soft folds of the skin and blanket really complement the dark background.  Top 100 :-)</td>', 'Very sweet.  Incredible contrast and composition.  The pale color and soft folds of the skin and blanket really complement the dark background.  Top 100 :-)', '2009-03-14 16:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350849, 772550, 96751, '<td valign="top">Absolutely exquisite.  This is fine art material.  Glorious detail, the lines and position of her arm and shawl, the lighting on her face.  A fave</td>', 'Absolutely exquisite.  This is fine art material.  Glorious detail, the lines and position of her arm and shawl, the lighting on her face.  A fave', '2009-03-14 16:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350850, 771482, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ok, this has definite WOW factor!!!!  Extraordinary ice color, which makes me wonder if it''s natural.  Love the waves crashing against it, and the very dark background, but there is something odd.  Like it''s a composite or something.  But it so visually stunning.  Love it.</td>', 'Ok, this has definite WOW factor!!!!  Extraordinary ice color, which makes me wonder if it''s natural.  Love the waves crashing against it, and the very dark background, but there is something odd.  Like it''s a composite or something.  But it so visually stunning.  Love it.', '2009-03-14 16:20:11.000000', NULL, 1),
