(5350852, 770892, 96751, '<td valign="top">Excellent depth, incredible detail on the foreground.  Love the reflection on the water and the star burst sun.</td>', 'Excellent depth, incredible detail on the foreground.  Love the reflection on the water and the star burst sun.', '2009-03-14 16:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350853, 772063, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not THIS is a pet portrait.  How did you EVER manage to get them lined up like that.  Is this a composite?  You have an incredible eye, and patience.  And perfect pets.  Love the arrangement, and the chaise is perfect.  Great lighting.  I could go on and on.  A fave.</td>', 'Not THIS is a pet portrait.  How did you EVER manage to get them lined up like that.  Is this a composite?  You have an incredible eye, and patience.  And perfect pets.  Love the arrangement, and the chaise is perfect.  Great lighting.  I could go on and on.  A fave.', '2009-03-14 16:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350855, 770828, 96751, '<td valign="top">Just fabulous.  The colors, shapes, depth are wonderful.  A tad overblown for me on the central light rocks, but top 100 for sure.</td>', 'Just fabulous.  The colors, shapes, depth are wonderful.  A tad overblown for me on the central light rocks, but top 100 for sure.', '2009-03-14 16:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350856, 772738, 71239, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous model, but the lighting setup needs improving - I guess you were using a single flash, possibly on camera which makes it hard to avoid very hash lighting.  You have the model close to the backdrop and unfortunately with single small flash that throws a harsh shadow onto it.  I think there''s a really good shot waiting to get out here - perhaps using some diffuse light from a window instead of flash will yield a much softer look which would really suit this model.</td>', 'Gorgeous model, but the lighting setup needs improving - I guess you were using a single flash, possibly on camera which makes it hard to avoid very hash lighting.  You have the model close to the backdrop and unfortunately with single small flash that throws a harsh shadow onto it.  I think there''s a really good shot waiting to get out here - perhaps using some diffuse light from a window instead of flash will yield a much softer look which would really suit this model.', '2009-03-14 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350857, 772655, 96751, '<td valign="top">You bug peeps are just awesome.  Mantis'' are such great subjects.  This guy, and the incredible dof, are marvelous.  I almost feel that the brightly colored surroundings are a bit overwhelming for the exquisite detail of the bug, because the area of focus (eyes, ''hands'', leaf tips) is relatively small within the shot, and because the bokeh and autumnal colors are so vivid.</td>', 'You bug peeps are just awesome.  Mantis'' are such great subjects.  This guy, and the incredible dof, are marvelous.  I almost feel that the brightly colored surroundings are a bit overwhelming for the exquisite detail of the bug, because the area of focus (eyes, ''hands'', leaf tips) is relatively small within the shot, and because the bokeh and autumnal colors are so vivid.', '2009-03-14 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
