(5350859, 772492, 96751, '<td valign="top">That is one tiny froggy!!!  Fabulous shot.  The frog''s coloring against the bright metallic tones of the coin is great.  I like the reflections as well.  Great work.</td>', 'That is one tiny froggy!!!  Fabulous shot.  The frog''s coloring against the bright metallic tones of the coin is great.  I like the reflections as well.  Great work.', '2009-03-14 16:20:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350860, 771379, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is something very stirring about this shot.  It is very stark and contrasty, but in a very good way.  The negative space really adds to this person''s emotions, her hidden face an added mystery, rewarded with exquisite detail on the hands.  A fave.</td>', 'There is something very stirring about this shot.  It is very stark and contrasty, but in a very good way.  The negative space really adds to this person''s emotions, her hidden face an added mystery, rewarded with exquisite detail on the hands.  A fave.', '2009-03-14 16:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5350861, 771054, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  An instant fave.  Incredible scale, detail, depth.  The tone is magical, and the lines on the mountain face dynamic.</td>', 'Stunning.  An instant fave.  Incredible scale, detail, depth.  The tone is magical, and the lines on the mountain face dynamic.', '2009-03-14 16:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
