(5350914, 771152, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1120 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>I generally get fed up of baby shots, and everybody saying to me "aren''t babies gorgeous?". I tend to find babies are horrible squashed face little things, and have no interest in them. Having said all that, this baby is absolutely gorgeous, and it''s without a doubt the best baby picture I have ever seen. I love the high key and monocrome approach, which really allows you to focus on those lovely sparkling eyes, and the cheeky half grin. Superb work!<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1120 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. I generally get fed up of baby shots, and everybody saying to me "aren''t babies gorgeous?". I tend to find babies are horrible squashed face little things, and have no interest in them. Having said all that, this baby is absolutely gorgeous, and it''s without a doubt the best baby picture I have ever seen. I love the high key and monocrome approach, which really allows you to focus on those lovely sparkling eyes, and the cheeky half grin. Superb work! Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-14 16:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
