(5351091, 770313, 62357, '<td valign="top">love te lights reflecting on the wet footpath. The silhouette of the lady with the umbrella is wonderful. I feel almost like I am right behind her.  Well done, this is a great image</td>', 'love te lights reflecting on the wet footpath. The silhouette of the lady with the umbrella is wonderful. I feel almost like I am right behind her.  Well done, this is a great image', '2009-03-14 16:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
