(5351133, 771270, 40490, '<td valign="top">Very good. I ''m wondering how this would have looked if the background where slightly less in focus, or slightly more in focus. The ~almost~ in focus (or out of focus) is distracting. The colors are very good, though. I imagine many people are going to say it''s too dark, but I''m not certain of that, either way. 7</td>', 'Very good. I ''m wondering how this would have looked if the background where slightly less in focus, or slightly more in focus. The ~almost~ in focus (or out of focus) is distracting. The colors are very good, though. I imagine many people are going to say it''s too dark, but I''m not certain of that, either way. 7', '2009-03-14 16:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
