(5351207, 771105, 811, '<td valign="top">When I was in college, I took a Film as Literature class.  In it, the prof talked about strategies used by filmmakers to build tension, especially in horror flicks or dramas.  One of them was to use a narrow passage and light it with yellow and/or red.  This is what this shot reminds me of.  The blue slither gives just a little bit of hope, but it feels like the bad guy will jump out at any minute.</td>', 'When I was in college, I took a Film as Literature class.  In it, the prof talked about strategies used by filmmakers to build tension, especially in horror flicks or dramas.  One of them was to use a narrow passage and light it with yellow and/or red.  This is what this shot reminds me of.  The blue slither gives just a little bit of hope, but it feels like the bad guy will jump out at any minute.', '2009-03-14 17:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5351208, 772755, 40490, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen an image of him working, instead of looking into the camera. Anywho, good shot, nice use of sepia. The depth of field is sufficient for this shot :) Maybe try and get more of a range of colors in the final result</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen an image of him working, instead of looking into the camera. Anywho, good shot, nice use of sepia. The depth of field is sufficient for this shot :) Maybe try and get more of a range of colors in the final result', '2009-03-14 17:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
