(5353267, 772482, 77196, '<td valign="top">A bit too hot on the right side, and I don''t like the strand of hair blowing across her eye. Nice expression, and nice use of DOF.</td>', 'A bit too hot on the right side, and I don''t like the strand of hair blowing across her eye. Nice expression, and nice use of DOF.', '2009-03-14 19:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
