(5353274, 770818, 33732, '<td valign="top">Nice. Want to go there.  Take a lunch.</td>', 'Nice. Want to go there.  Take a lunch.', '2009-03-14 19:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5353275, 770288, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow! Look at the level of details you can see on these two seastars! It''s fabulous! Colors are wonderful too. My biggest critique (yeah, I know, does she have to be so darn picky;-) ) is that I think the composition would be <b>even stronger </b>in visual appeal if it was cropped closer to those seastars on the stone. There is just a bit too much negative space that does nothing to further the appeal of the photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow! Look at the level of details you can see on these two seastars! It''s fabulous! Colors are wonderful too. My biggest critique (yeah, I know, does she have to be so darn picky;-) ) is that I think the composition would be even stronger in visual appeal if it was cropped closer to those seastars on the stone. There is just a bit too much negative space that does nothing to further the appeal of the photo.', '2009-03-14 19:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
