(5353570, 771440, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. The widescreen cinema border complements the photo for it takes on the feel of a film. A ol'' style B&amp;W film to be specific with the camera panning in on the scenic street scene near the Louvre. There is some real beautiful architecture in this photo. I like how you composed it such that the Louvre''s pyramid is in the center of the shot and as such it dominates and captures the attention instantly. I also like how you have it where the lampposts act as a leading line that goes the vanishing point off into the horizon.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. The widescreen cinema border complements the photo for it takes on the feel of a film. A ol'' style B&W film to be specific with the camera panning in on the scenic street scene near the Louvre. There is some real beautiful architecture in this photo. I like how you composed it such that the Louvre''s pyramid is in the center of the shot and as such it dominates and captures the attention instantly. I also like how you have it where the lampposts act as a leading line that goes the vanishing point off into the horizon.', '2009-03-14 20:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
