(5353752, 772402, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1116 images, I gave 97 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 97, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>There is something about the uncluttered simplicity of this shot which appeals to me, and the green is a perfect foil for the pink and yellow. Probably a little too simplistic for a lot of members on this site, but I likeit, and I guess you do too, which is all that matters! :-)<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1116 images, I gave 97 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 97, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. There is something about the uncluttered simplicity of this shot which appeals to me, and the green is a perfect foil for the pink and yellow. Probably a little too simplistic for a lot of members on this site, but I likeit, and I guess you do too, which is all that matters! :-) Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-14 20:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
