(5353926, 772680, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1116 images, I gave 97 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 97, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>I know it''s a cop out comment... but the colours in this shot are awesome :-) I actually love the symmetry in this picture, even though it''s only an illusion. A fantastic setting, expertly recorded. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1116 images, I gave 97 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 97, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. I know it''s a cop out comment... but the colours in this shot are awesome :-) I actually love the symmetry in this picture, even though it''s only an illusion. A fantastic setting, expertly recorded.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-14 20:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
