(5354745, 772660, 100106, '<td valign="top">I''m a sucker for dinning tables and dinning presentations. Haven''t ever been able to figure out why. Maybe it''s the lines and sementry that grab me - who knows. None-the-less this is a surpurb shot that tickles my eye. The chairs have a great color with a soft but rugged look. Once my eye makes to the floor, I notice these great tones and textures. Draws me in even more. My only suggestion would be to have the middle table in the middle of the back two. But eh, that''s probably my sementry issue talking. =) 10 for grabbing and keeping me in.</td>', 'I''m a sucker for dinning tables and dinning presentations. Haven''t ever been able to figure out why. Maybe it''s the lines and sementry that grab me - who knows. None-the-less this is a surpurb shot that tickles my eye. The chairs have a great color with a soft but rugged look. Once my eye makes to the floor, I notice these great tones and textures. Draws me in even more. My only suggestion would be to have the middle table in the middle of the back two. But eh, that''s probably my sementry issue talking. =) 10 for grabbing and keeping me in.', '2009-03-14 22:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
