(5354984, 772311, 30364, '<td valign="top">I love those genuine hidden gem photographs that are so much better than they first appear (when it is the exact opposite - fool''s gold - that is so much more common, both in this challenge and in the wider world). <br/> <br/>It doesn''t look like much at first glance, I admit that.  But consider it just a moment longer and you see that it has substance.  It obliges the viewer to get involved, to become a participant in the photograph, rather than to simply admire it.  Nothing is certain: nothing is excluded either.  I like it because it''s not about photography, it''s about the photograph.  9.</td>', 'I love those genuine hidden gem photographs that are so much better than they first appear (when it is the exact opposite - fool''s gold - that is so much more common, both in this challenge and in the wider world).  It doesn''t look like much at first glance, I admit that.  But consider it just a moment longer and you see that it has substance.  It obliges the viewer to get involved, to become a participant in the photograph, rather than to simply admire it.  Nothing is certain: nothing is excluded either.  I like it because it''s not about photography, it''s about the photograph.  9.', '2009-03-14 22:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
