(5355317, 770202, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice. Not a fan of the border though. Also, the grass on the hill looks strange- almost like liquid or maybe it was just noise ninja''d too much (looks that way) but it''s alright man, you did a good job on the exposure and the colours.</td>', 'Nice. Not a fan of the border though. Also, the grass on the hill looks strange- almost like liquid or maybe it was just noise ninja''d too much (looks that way) but it''s alright man, you did a good job on the exposure and the colours.', '2009-03-14 22:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355319, 771631, 79141, '<td valign="top">looks a little flat to me</td>', 'looks a little flat to me', '2009-03-14 22:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355320, 772586, 43774, '<td valign="top">I am not a fan of HDR so you''ll have to excuse my comments. It looks like a cartoon, way overdone. But hey, maybe that''s what you were going for. I think the wire ruins it even more and it''s tilted to the right an awful lot. You''ve obviously spent time processing this, why not take a few more seconds and straighten it up? It''s really a quick fix.<br/> <br/>I would like to see the original because it looks like there were nice colours in the sky.</td>', 'I am not a fan of HDR so you''ll have to excuse my comments. It looks like a cartoon, way overdone. But hey, maybe that''s what you were going for. I think the wire ruins it even more and it''s tilted to the right an awful lot. You''ve obviously spent time processing this, why not take a few more seconds and straighten it up? It''s really a quick fix. I would like to see the original because it looks like there were nice colours in the sky.', '2009-03-14 22:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355321, 772475, 43774, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the sepia here, but it''s a pretty good candid shot.</td>', 'Not sure I like the sepia here, but it''s a pretty good candid shot.', '2009-03-14 22:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355322, 770462, 43774, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, makes me think of Casablanca.</td>', 'Dramatic, makes me think of Casablanca.', '2009-03-14 22:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355323, 770541, 43774, '<td valign="top">Lovely sky and colour, the clouds are wonderful. I really like the bare trees.</td>', 'Lovely sky and colour, the clouds are wonderful. I really like the bare trees.', '2009-03-14 22:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355324, 772548, 22301, '<td valign="top">Excellent leading lines, I like how bright the tracks are.</td>', 'Excellent leading lines, I like how bright the tracks are.', '2009-03-14 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355326, 771818, 43774, '<td valign="top">Different, yes. What is it? Sorry I don''t find this more interesting.</td>', 'Different, yes. What is it? Sorry I don''t find this more interesting.', '2009-03-14 22:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355327, 771029, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice crispness</td>', 'nice crispness', '2009-03-14 22:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355328, 772716, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. The B&amp;W processing is spectacular. The tones and contrasts are very dynamic. Love the clouds and the gleam on the water''s surface that looks like a pathway. Speaking of the pathway it leads our eye to the main subject of the composition. We see the outpost first but then our eye spots the human element. The man that is sitting there watching...but watching what we ask? Perhaps he is a lookout or perhaps he is like us, just watching the fantastic display on storm clouds. A storm seems to be brewing and there might be a spectacular light show off in the distance of cloud to cloud lightning or lightning strikes upon the water. The composition''s mood and feel really draws us in. This holds many story elements. Well done!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. The B&W processing is spectacular. The tones and contrasts are very dynamic. Love the clouds and the gleam on the water''s surface that looks like a pathway. Speaking of the pathway it leads our eye to the main subject of the composition. We see the outpost first but then our eye spots the human element. The man that is sitting there watching...but watching what we ask? Perhaps he is a lookout or perhaps he is like us, just watching the fantastic display on storm clouds. A storm seems to be brewing and there might be a spectacular light show off in the distance of cloud to cloud lightning or lightning strikes upon the water. The composition''s mood and feel really draws us in. This holds many story elements. Well done!', '2009-03-14 22:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355331, 770960, 43774, '<td valign="top">Very cute, sweet.</td>', 'Very cute, sweet.', '2009-03-14 22:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355332, 771083, 42495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and bright, the clarity just pulls me into this.  Not many photos work well with centered composition, this is one that certainly does.</td>', 'Beautiful and bright, the clarity just pulls me into this.  Not many photos work well with centered composition, this is one that certainly does.', '2009-03-14 22:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355333, 771413, 9411, '<td valign="top">interesting concept shot, I think there is a figure there. possibly it should have been a little more distinct, but still mysterious?</td>', 'interesting concept shot, I think there is a figure there. possibly it should have been a little more distinct, but still mysterious?', '2009-03-14 22:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5355334, 771856, 88136, '<td valign="top">seems a tad over-HDRed, but im not one to talk. if the willow tree wasnt there i might like this more, it just seems to make the scene feel disorganized and messy</td>', 'seems a tad over-HDRed, but im not one to talk. if the willow tree wasnt there i might like this more, it just seems to make the scene feel disorganized and messy', '2009-03-14 22:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
