(5355896, 772771, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like how the molten lava appears to be moving forward, although I''m guessing at a very slow rate.</td>', 'I like how the molten lava appears to be moving forward, although I''m guessing at a very slow rate.', '2009-03-14 23:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
