(5355898, 771902, 78062, '<td valign="top">I''m gonna guess this was out of focus and you tried to bring it back by resizing and sharpening the hell out of it. You were almost there but I think went a little too far with the sharpenin.<br/> <br/>It''s also a shame the tigers weren''t closer together too. The b/w is an intersting choice and not one I would have made for this pic. Presumably you were going for dramatics but colour would have helped seperate the tigers from the background because as it is, there''s a lot of neutral flat grey in the pic which mkaes it look a bit tired.<br/> <br/>Nice symettry though.</td>', 'I''m gonna guess this was out of focus and you tried to bring it back by resizing and sharpening the hell out of it. You were almost there but I think went a little too far with the sharpenin. It''s also a shame the tigers weren''t closer together too. The b/w is an intersting choice and not one I would have made for this pic. Presumably you were going for dramatics but colour would have helped seperate the tigers from the background because as it is, there''s a lot of neutral flat grey in the pic which mkaes it look a bit tired. Nice symettry though.', '2009-03-14 23:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
