(5355939, 771206, 78062, '<td valign="top">Sweet picture but its a shame its so dark around the top of the face (eyes, fringe). In fact the whole pic above the clothes looks a little too dark which you could have solved with curves or levels or brightness/contrast in PS.<br/> <br/>And if i can be really anal about this: if the stray hairs were removed/cloned out it would have made it look much neater. I''m not sure that''s a big deal but it''s definately a factor in my assessment of it.<br/>But I like it! It''s honest and simple and will probably mean something to the parents of the child in later years.</td>', 'Sweet picture but its a shame its so dark around the top of the face (eyes, fringe). In fact the whole pic above the clothes looks a little too dark which you could have solved with curves or levels or brightness/contrast in PS. And if i can be really anal about this: if the stray hairs were removed/cloned out it would have made it look much neater. I''m not sure that''s a big deal but it''s definately a factor in my assessment of it.But I like it! It''s honest and simple and will probably mean something to the parents of the child in later years.', '2009-03-14 23:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
