(5355982, 771153, 75034, '<td valign="top">If I had to guess I would throw out the name Roz and I would feel confident that I would be right. There are few on this site that can match you in insect photography but that being said I doubt that they could capture the soul the way you do. Some people are unparalleled in landscape, others people, but you have mastered the hardest of them all, the insect. <br/> <br/>You truly inspire me Roz and you always have.<br/> <br/>You ROCK <br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'If I had to guess I would throw out the name Roz and I would feel confident that I would be right. There are few on this site that can match you in insect photography but that being said I doubt that they could capture the soul the way you do. Some people are unparalleled in landscape, others people, but you have mastered the hardest of them all, the insect.  You truly inspire me Roz and you always have. You ROCK  All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-03-14 23:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
