(5356067, 771688, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in leaf and petals. Still think I''d prefer to see the face of the flower.</td>', 'Nice detail in leaf and petals. Still think I''d prefer to see the face of the flower.', '2009-03-14 23:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356068, 770526, 79141, '<td valign="top">nice capture</td>', 'nice capture', '2009-03-14 23:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356069, 771190, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, not as detailed as I''d like, probably due to the DPC size and the composition</td>', 'Nice shot, not as detailed as I''d like, probably due to the DPC size and the composition', '2009-03-14 23:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356070, 771976, 75034, '<td valign="top">Nice and crisp shot on the main area of the bird. It''s nice to see that you didn''t get carried away with the processing, you could have very easily lost yourself with the contrast and colour shifting towards the dominate colours but I think you did just enough. Photographing birds is hard at times and you did a great job catching the playful nature of this bird.<br/> <br/>All the best to you and yours.<br/> <br/>MAX!</td>', 'Nice and crisp shot on the main area of the bird. It''s nice to see that you didn''t get carried away with the processing, you could have very easily lost yourself with the contrast and colour shifting towards the dominate colours but I think you did just enough. Photographing birds is hard at times and you did a great job catching the playful nature of this bird. All the best to you and yours. MAX!', '2009-03-14 23:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356071, 770516, 79141, '<td valign="top">stunning color and detail</td>', 'stunning color and detail', '2009-03-14 23:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356073, 772714, 42495, '<td valign="top">Great expression to fit the title, and if this is staged it does look real.  The car provides a nice backdrop for the subject, and the fact that it''s an old Pontiac gives it character.</td>', 'Great expression to fit the title, and if this is staged it does look real.  The car provides a nice backdrop for the subject, and the fact that it''s an old Pontiac gives it character.', '2009-03-14 23:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
