(5356085, 770378, 80831, '<td valign="top">I like how the blue above the flower makes it looks like its being talked to by someone up above...cool shot.</td>', 'I like how the blue above the flower makes it looks like its being talked to by someone up above...cool shot.', '2009-03-14 23:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356086, 772111, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like this, but it''s a bit oversaturated on my monitor.</td>', 'I like this, but it''s a bit oversaturated on my monitor.', '2009-03-14 23:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356087, 772526, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Love the colors and pattern on the bark. Sky is gorgeous blue. Nice capture of the falls.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Love the colors and pattern on the bark. Sky is gorgeous blue. Nice capture of the falls.', '2009-03-14 23:27:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356088, 772094, 100831, '<td valign="top">very interesting elements and perspective - IMHO they all add up to a magnificent image!</td>', 'very interesting elements and perspective - IMHO they all add up to a magnificent image!', '2009-03-14 23:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356089, 772383, 30364, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  There is a lamentable tendency at DPC to believe that every portrait should have ''tack-sharp'' focus on the eyes, and that every pore should be smoothed.  But this superb photograph shatters all that.  The uncertainty and ambiguity of the photography and the forensic mood of the lighting and composition are perfectly suited to the motivation of the portrait.  You give us a three-dimensional person.  Imagination.  Anxiety.  Unease.  But not panic; there''s a hint of resolution there as well.  I''d put my trust in this person.  9.</td>', 'I like this very much.  There is a lamentable tendency at DPC to believe that every portrait should have ''tack-sharp'' focus on the eyes, and that every pore should be smoothed.  But this superb photograph shatters all that.  The uncertainty and ambiguity of the photography and the forensic mood of the lighting and composition are perfectly suited to the motivation of the portrait.  You give us a three-dimensional person.  Imagination.  Anxiety.  Unease.  But not panic; there''s a hint of resolution there as well.  I''d put my trust in this person.  9.', '2009-03-14 23:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356090, 772179, 69684, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait with lots of curly shapes.</td>', 'Nice portrait with lots of curly shapes.', '2009-03-14 23:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356092, 772297, 100831, '<td valign="top">Oh how cute - very well done!!</td>', 'Oh how cute - very well done!!', '2009-03-14 23:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356094, 771367, 80831, '<td valign="top">Wow...i lived in NY for 18yrs and never knew of this place...magnificent! 7</td>', 'Wow...i lived in NY for 18yrs and never knew of this place...magnificent! 7', '2009-03-14 23:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356095, 770859, 5112, '<td valign="top">A very intense sunset (sunrise?).  I like how the sun is peeping through the pilons.</td>', 'A very intense sunset (sunrise?).  I like how the sun is peeping through the pilons.', '2009-03-14 23:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356096, 771810, 100106, '<td valign="top">Weird, different, dark but yet, fun. Great group shot!</td>', 'Weird, different, dark but yet, fun. Great group shot!', '2009-03-14 23:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
