(5356102, 772012, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice timing and I like the reflection.  Excellent lighting.  I think it would be better if you had more wine colored fluid or adjusted it that way in post processing.</td>', 'Nice timing and I like the reflection.  Excellent lighting.  I think it would be better if you had more wine colored fluid or adjusted it that way in post processing.', '2009-03-14 23:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
