(5356133, 771167, 43774, '<td valign="top">An elegant pose but your processing is a bit odd....too contrasty and dark, sorry.</td>', 'An elegant pose but your processing is a bit odd....too contrasty and dark, sorry.', '2009-03-14 23:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356136, 772076, 43774, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting piece of the earth and the children give it some scale. That being said, it''s not a spectacular piece of geography, it''s drab and dull. Your photo also seems to be tilted to the left.</td>', 'It''s an interesting piece of the earth and the children give it some scale. That being said, it''s not a spectacular piece of geography, it''s drab and dull. Your photo also seems to be tilted to the left.', '2009-03-14 23:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356139, 770770, 77196, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a painting. Nice idea and execution.</td>', 'Almost looks like a painting. Nice idea and execution.', '2009-03-14 23:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356145, 772007, 69684, '<td valign="top">Nice position of the sun shining through the railing.</td>', 'Nice position of the sun shining through the railing.', '2009-03-14 23:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356147, 772561, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful.  I love the colors and water drops on the near branches and how well they match the hazy image of the trees across the river.  Very nice.</td>', 'This is really beautiful.  I love the colors and water drops on the near branches and how well they match the hazy image of the trees across the river.  Very nice.', '2009-03-14 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356153, 771156, 77196, '<td valign="top">Very colorful.</td>', 'Very colorful.', '2009-03-14 23:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356154, 772133, 47541, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I find these shots a bit sterile, good for the style though</td>', 'Nice shot but I find these shots a bit sterile, good for the style though', '2009-03-14 23:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356157, 772094, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. I LOVE how you composed all your elements here to tell a story!!! You have a great eye to have spotted the potential of all three elements together. The seastar, the lone person, and the ship in the distance could all have a longing to be at sea and they all seek it in different ways. The ship ''longs'' to be out in the deeper waters for she is a ship meant to travel to far distant and deep waters. The lone man stands there looking in the direction of the ship. He longs to get back to the sea and feel the freedom of open air and wide expanse of blue. The seastar longs to return to the ocean bottom. The shore is far from it''s familiar home of the deep ocean floor. Three main subjects all with a story to tell. Well done in showing us this story!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. I LOVE how you composed all your elements here to tell a story!!! You have a great eye to have spotted the potential of all three elements together. The seastar, the lone person, and the ship in the distance could all have a longing to be at sea and they all seek it in different ways. The ship ''longs'' to be out in the deeper waters for she is a ship meant to travel to far distant and deep waters. The lone man stands there looking in the direction of the ship. He longs to get back to the sea and feel the freedom of open air and wide expanse of blue. The seastar longs to return to the ocean bottom. The shore is far from it''s familiar home of the deep ocean floor. Three main subjects all with a story to tell. Well done in showing us this story!', '2009-03-14 23:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356165, 771694, 42495, '<td valign="top">Wow, that is quite the shot.  It almost looks like the rainbow is from the sand.</td>', 'Wow, that is quite the shot.  It almost looks like the rainbow is from the sand.', '2009-03-14 23:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356171, 772274, 77196, '<td valign="top">Nice textures.</td>', 'Nice textures.', '2009-03-14 23:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
