(5356580, 772378, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1116 images, I gave 97 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 97, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>This is a great action shot, and of a subject I figure is hard to predict. I''d have scored it higher if the fish was facing towards the camera, but I guess even if you asked him nicely, he was probably in too much of a hurry :-)<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1116 images, I gave 97 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 97, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. This is a great action shot, and of a subject I figure is hard to predict. I''d have scored it higher if the fish was facing towards the camera, but I guess even if you asked him nicely, he was probably in too much of a hurry :-) Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-14 23:47:09.000000', NULL, 1),
