(5356742, 771732, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>This is simply one of those breathtaking locations that probably get photographed a whole lot, but which only actually looks breathtaking in a small proportion of those photos. Yours is one of the breathtaking ones. A beautiful composition, fantastic colours, excellent depth of field and clarity. I love it. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  This is simply one of those breathtaking locations that probably get photographed a whole lot, but which only actually looks breathtaking in a small proportion of those photos. Yours is one of the breathtaking ones. A beautiful composition, fantastic colours, excellent depth of field and clarity. I love it.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-14 23:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356743, 772762, 77196, '<td valign="top">Love never goes out of style. Great car. Beautiful flowers. Nice looking couple.</td>', 'Love never goes out of style. Great car. Beautiful flowers. Nice looking couple.', '2009-03-14 23:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356744, 772538, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31. <br/> <br/>There are quite a few "big cat" images in this challenge, what makes this one stand out is that all of the others almost look posed... calm big cats sitting dozily facing the camera. This on the otherhand conveys some of the savagery and ferocity of such magnificent beasts. I hope you had a very long lens on your camera lol, I would not fancy getting this close to a 10ft tiger with teeth like that!<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 31 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 31.  There are quite a few "big cat" images in this challenge, what makes this one stand out is that all of the others almost look posed... calm big cats sitting dozily facing the camera. This on the otherhand conveys some of the savagery and ferocity of such magnificent beasts. I hope you had a very long lens on your camera lol, I would not fancy getting this close to a 10ft tiger with teeth like that! Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-14 23:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5356745, 771984, 62357, '<td valign="top">Great abstract.  Quite hard to determine what part of a plane this is, so well done</td>', 'Great abstract.  Quite hard to determine what part of a plane this is, so well done', '2009-03-14 23:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
