(5358051, 771155, 83313, '<td valign="top">The date of the title immediatley grabs me. I have to assume that was intentional, and you are trying to convey that these small children had absolutely no idea how their world and their future had just changed. I can''t give it more than a 5 for the snapshotty photography, but it has far more impact than the scores will tell.</td>', 'The date of the title immediatley grabs me. I have to assume that was intentional, and you are trying to convey that these small children had absolutely no idea how their world and their future had just changed. I can''t give it more than a 5 for the snapshotty photography, but it has far more impact than the scores will tell.', '2009-03-15 04:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
