(5358885, 772368, 11467, '<td valign="top">Nice flower, however it could be made a little more interesting as a photo. <br/>When photographing, try not to put your subject bang slap in the middle.<br/>In post processing Try increasing the contrast a little , and balance the colour as I think this has a bit of a blue tint to it.  (Possibly the wrong white balance setting in the camera) <br/>The water drops add a nice freshness to the flower.</td>', 'Nice flower, however it could be made a little more interesting as a photo. When photographing, try not to put your subject bang slap in the middle.In post processing Try increasing the contrast a little , and balance the colour as I think this has a bit of a blue tint to it.  (Possibly the wrong white balance setting in the camera) The water drops add a nice freshness to the flower.', '2009-03-15 06:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
