(5358906, 770257, 22689, '<td valign="top">So educative macro, it''s amazing to see all the details with that quality.<br/>It''s fascinating to see an example of symbiosis.<br/>Your photo is really eye catching, the only points I think could be improved are the noise in the right side of the flower and the halo.<br/>But I''m not picky, I just try to be constructive, this photo is a 10 for me.<br/>Good luck !</td>', 'So educative macro, it''s amazing to see all the details with that quality.It''s fascinating to see an example of symbiosis.Your photo is really eye catching, the only points I think could be improved are the noise in the right side of the flower and the halo.But I''m not picky, I just try to be constructive, this photo is a 10 for me.Good luck !', '2009-03-15 06:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
