(5359518, 770343, 102811, '<td valign="top">I think this is a better photo than you give yourself credit for, I like it. Nice composition and use of negative space. The empty roll also tells a story which we have all experienced at one time or another :( and the B&amp;W works well. Either that or you were being ironic! Good luck whatever your goal for the challenge is!</td>', 'I think this is a better photo than you give yourself credit for, I like it. Nice composition and use of negative space. The empty roll also tells a story which we have all experienced at one time or another :( and the B&W works well. Either that or you were being ironic! Good luck whatever your goal for the challenge is!', '2009-03-15 08:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
