(5360919, 772133, 102811, '<td valign="top">If this was a challenge conected with extreme sports and (very) gorgeous models I think you would be looking at a ribbon for this great image. It is also technically very good. What looks like a small bruise on her right thigh is a very minor point (only because everything else is so good does it stand out) but overall I really like it and it gets an 8 from me. Well done and all the best for the rest of the challenge.</td>', 'If this was a challenge conected with extreme sports and (very) gorgeous models I think you would be looking at a ribbon for this great image. It is also technically very good. What looks like a small bruise on her right thigh is a very minor point (only because everything else is so good does it stand out) but overall I really like it and it gets an 8 from me. Well done and all the best for the rest of the challenge.', '2009-03-15 10:12:58.000000', NULL, 1),
