(5361632, 772764, 100393, '<td valign="top">Apologies but I have given you a 1 and now must justify that choice. I normally only give out 1s for images that look ''un-crafted''; i.e. images which appear to have been taken with little attention or care. I think making it monochrome compounds this, as you run a risk of looking as if you were trying to confer a more ''arty'' look for something which is actually not deserving of such treatment. Perhaps I misjudge and this is actually a bid for the brown....?</td>', 'Apologies but I have given you a 1 and now must justify that choice. I normally only give out 1s for images that look ''un-crafted''; i.e. images which appear to have been taken with little attention or care. I think making it monochrome compounds this, as you run a risk of looking as if you were trying to confer a more ''arty'' look for something which is actually not deserving of such treatment. Perhaps I misjudge and this is actually a bid for the brown....?', '2009-03-15 10:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
