(5362045, 772246, 15711, '<td valign="top">Really nice stop action. I am particularly fond any time an image has a diagonal line and this certainly does.  Nice work and I like that top/bottom frame too. In a perfect world, those power lines wouldn''t be there, but then you''d get a DQ for cloning them out. LOL :~)</td>', 'Really nice stop action. I am particularly fond any time an image has a diagonal line and this certainly does.  Nice work and I like that top/bottom frame too. In a perfect world, those power lines wouldn''t be there, but then you''d get a DQ for cloning them out. LOL :~)', '2009-03-15 11:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
