(5362138, 772347, 7743, '<td valign="top">The light on the mountains is sweet but the focus seems a little soft.  Also, the line of the mountains, being in the middle, makes the image rather static.<br/> <br/>The hard part here though is where would be the best place for the line of mountains, top or bottom of image.  Now this depends on what else was in the scene.  It looks like there may be a worn path in the foreground so a lower vantage point using the path as a leading line would work.<br/> <br/>If there were some more drama in the sky then exploit the clouds and put the mountains at the bottom.</td>', 'The light on the mountains is sweet but the focus seems a little soft.  Also, the line of the mountains, being in the middle, makes the image rather static. The hard part here though is where would be the best place for the line of mountains, top or bottom of image.  Now this depends on what else was in the scene.  It looks like there may be a worn path in the foreground so a lower vantage point using the path as a leading line would work. If there were some more drama in the sky then exploit the clouds and put the mountains at the bottom.', '2009-03-15 11:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
