(5363431, 770526, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow... amazing!  One of those shots where you''d expect to see a surfer, but I think that would ruin it.  The shades of blue, the great swooping line of the wave, and the raw power are fantastic here!</td>', 'Wow... amazing!  One of those shots where you''d expect to see a surfer, but I think that would ruin it.  The shades of blue, the great swooping line of the wave, and the raw power are fantastic here!', '2009-03-15 13:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
