(5363495, 770164, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Is this one of your gems you discovered looking through your files or was it on your short list from the start of the challenge?  Feel free to PM me with an answer. The B&amp;W conversion iis spot on and the image is just fun to look at. 9</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Is this one of your gems you discovered looking through your files or was it on your short list from the start of the challenge?  Feel free to PM me with an answer. The B&W conversion iis spot on and the image is just fun to look at. 9', '2009-03-15 13:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5363497, 772371, 15305, '<td valign="top">Wonderful cityscape, great sharpness and detail. Definitely a different POV and good composition.</td>', 'Wonderful cityscape, great sharpness and detail. Definitely a different POV and good composition.', '2009-03-15 13:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5363498, 770888, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: It is very difficult post processing these birds, as any sharpening makes their eyes look over sharpened.  Nicely done. 9</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: It is very difficult post processing these birds, as any sharpening makes their eyes look over sharpened.  Nicely done. 9', '2009-03-15 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
