(5363502, 772089, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment and bump: Hocking Hills I believe.  In itself, this water fall is much more interesting with a long exposure time (blurred water) but capturing these young ladies is far more interesting than the waterfall ever could be in itself.  B&amp;W is also a must for this image, as the people would be less of a focal point if in color.  Nice job. 9</td>', 'Back to comment and bump: Hocking Hills I believe.  In itself, this water fall is much more interesting with a long exposure time (blurred water) but capturing these young ladies is far more interesting than the waterfall ever could be in itself.  B&W is also a must for this image, as the people would be less of a focal point if in color.  Nice job. 9', '2009-03-15 13:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5363503, 770513, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Love the intensity of the look, the symmetry and the details here.</td>', 'Wow!  Love the intensity of the look, the symmetry and the details here.', '2009-03-15 13:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5363504, 772233, 61679, '<td valign="top">This one took a while to see but what I saw, when I could see it, was well worth seeing.  I hope the other voters take their time when viewing this.  Nice job.</td>', 'This one took a while to see but what I saw, when I could see it, was well worth seeing.  I hope the other voters take their time when viewing this.  Nice job.', '2009-03-15 13:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
