(5364157, 770783, 47852, '<td valign="top">Beautiful falls and nicely captured with the slower shutter speed.  I do wish there was something here to give a sense of scale... I have a feeling this is a lot bigger than it seems.</td>', 'Beautiful falls and nicely captured with the slower shutter speed.  I do wish there was something here to give a sense of scale... I have a feeling this is a lot bigger than it seems.', '2009-03-15 14:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
