(5364162, 772566, 104643, '<td valign="top">Interpretation of Topic: Very interesting!<br/>Photography: I would have liked the Trekers to be a bit clearer, but neat contrasts.<br/>Viewers Reaction: Awesome!</td>', 'Interpretation of Topic: Very interesting!Photography: I would have liked the Trekers to be a bit clearer, but neat contrasts.Viewers Reaction: Awesome!', '2009-03-15 14:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
