(5364169, 772302, 83313, '<td valign="top">There may be some extra JPEG compression taking away some detail. I see some artifacts right around the high contrast edges of the outcropping. Your file size is only 49k and you could have used up to 200k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. When you save your file, always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.</td>', 'There may be some extra JPEG compression taking away some detail. I see some artifacts right around the high contrast edges of the outcropping. Your file size is only 49k and you could have used up to 200k for this challenge. Compression kills detail. When you save your file, always use the least compression you can get away with and still come in under challenge limits.', '2009-03-15 14:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364171, 770675, 64446, '<td valign="top">Lovely field and skies. It''s like a dream...</td>', 'Lovely field and skies. It''s like a dream...', '2009-03-15 14:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
