(5364185, 770410, 9411, '<td valign="top">ok, how do you comment on this? dang, 16 photos left and this pops up. I think this would have become something else using a "hard light/ other" layer. create some serious contrast, if you know what I mean</td>', 'ok, how do you comment on this? dang, 16 photos left and this pops up. I think this would have become something else using a "hard light/ other" layer. create some serious contrast, if you know what I mean', '2009-03-15 14:39:41.000000', NULL, 1),
