(5364192, 772044, 12250, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  Not sure how many chances to get this shot so nice capture.</td>', 'Good shot.  Not sure how many chances to get this shot so nice capture.', '2009-03-15 14:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364195, 771155, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out the story of the two boys, why they''re standing in front of a lit up heart shaped mirror, and what they''re grabbing.  I can''t seem to piece it all together.  But somehow, I still like the photo, though since it was entered into this challenge, it must have even more personal meaning for you.  It will be interesting to read the story behind this one!</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out the story of the two boys, why they''re standing in front of a lit up heart shaped mirror, and what they''re grabbing.  I can''t seem to piece it all together.  But somehow, I still like the photo, though since it was entered into this challenge, it must have even more personal meaning for you.  It will be interesting to read the story behind this one!', '2009-03-15 14:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
