(5364237, 772649, 83313, '<td valign="top">The smoke gives some awesome dimension and feel to this. My Flickr meetup group attended a WWII reenactment last year. Some of the participants liked what we posted and we got invited to be part of the action as "war correspondents" for the next one. I expect to get some great action shots the next time.</td>', 'The smoke gives some awesome dimension and feel to this. My Flickr meetup group attended a WWII reenactment last year. Some of the participants liked what we posted and we got invited to be part of the action as "war correspondents" for the next one. I expect to get some great action shots the next time.', '2009-03-15 14:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364239, 772594, 5112, '<td valign="top">His look of concentration on the play action is just right for the picture.</td>', 'His look of concentration on the play action is just right for the picture.', '2009-03-15 14:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364240, 772062, 88136, '<td valign="top">imlvoe pomegranates! i was meaning to go buy one today. ill just look at your photo instead:)</td>', 'imlvoe pomegranates! i was meaning to go buy one today. ill just look at your photo instead:)', '2009-03-15 14:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
