(5364248, 770917, 47852, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tad soft at the focal point, but overall a lovely macro.  The lines and bokeh are wonderful.</td>', 'Perhaps a tad soft at the focal point, but overall a lovely macro.  The lines and bokeh are wonderful.', '2009-03-15 14:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
