(5364253, 772511, 83313, '<td valign="top">I have never seen a flower like that. I will take your word for it that this is real. I would expect this must be carefully bred. Hope you have some notes explaining it.</td>', 'I have never seen a flower like that. I will take your word for it that this is real. I would expect this must be carefully bred. Hope you have some notes explaining it.', '2009-03-15 14:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364255, 771891, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent colours in the "redes", in English you can even make a play on the word, red = net in Spanish, red = the colour red (rojo) in English.  I think, if it were me, I would experiment with getting a bit closer.  I''m not sure that the dark section at top, especially top left, works, although it gives the picture a sense of depth which it would likely loose if you concentrated on just the section in brighter light.  Hmmmm.  In any case, I like this.</td>', 'Wow, excellent colours in the "redes", in English you can even make a play on the word, red = net in Spanish, red = the colour red (rojo) in English.  I think, if it were me, I would experiment with getting a bit closer.  I''m not sure that the dark section at top, especially top left, works, although it gives the picture a sense of depth which it would likely loose if you concentrated on just the section in brighter light.  Hmmmm.  In any case, I like this.', '2009-03-15 14:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364258, 770510, 61315, '<td valign="top">Beautiful mosque and nice sky background.</td>', 'Beautiful mosque and nice sky background.', '2009-03-15 14:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364259, 772597, 83313, '<td valign="top">Blurry, but also interesting to look at. Kind of neat that it was right in front of a camera store. The image in the upper left looks like a giant reflection.</td>', 'Blurry, but also interesting to look at. Kind of neat that it was right in front of a camera store. The image in the upper left looks like a giant reflection.', '2009-03-15 14:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
