(5364405, 770289, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1115 images, I gave 94 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 94, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>The thing I love about this shot in comparison to all the other sunset/sunrise pictures in this challenge is the understated hues. The pinks and blues are so subtle and light as to almost not be there. Pretty much every other shot in this vein has the colours so saturated that they overpower the image. Nice work!<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1115 images, I gave 94 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 94, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. The thing I love about this shot in comparison to all the other sunset/sunrise pictures in this challenge is the understated hues. The pinks and blues are so subtle and light as to almost not be there. Pretty much every other shot in this vein has the colours so saturated that they overpower the image. Nice work! Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-15 15:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
