(5364500, 772410, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1115 images, I gave 94 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 94, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>There are a few close up flower shots in this challenge, this is one of the best. It looks to me very much like a dinosaurs head, with two great curly tusks at the front. Sharp in all the right places, but it does suffer from a fair bit of noise and dust as far as I can see. Nice shot. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1115 images, I gave 94 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 94, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. There are a few close up flower shots in this challenge, this is one of the best. It looks to me very much like a dinosaurs head, with two great curly tusks at the front. Sharp in all the right places, but it does suffer from a fair bit of noise and dust as far as I can see. Nice shot.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-15 15:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364502, 771482, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1115 images, I gave 94 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 94, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Heh, I hope this was submitted by Ricardo Bevilaqua, as it''s in his photo.net portfolio, and his Flickr site too :-)<br/> <br/>Nonetheless a beautiful hue to the upsala (it was googling for "upsala" to figure out what the hell it was that I discovered Ricardo''s pictures.<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1115 images, I gave 94 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 94, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. Heh, I hope this was submitted by Ricardo Bevilaqua, as it''s in his photo.net portfolio, and his Flickr site too :-) Nonetheless a beautiful hue to the upsala (it was googling for "upsala" to figure out what the hell it was that I discovered Ricardo''s pictures. Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-15 15:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364503, 772088, 60386, '<td valign="top">I love how you can see his eyes and the beautiful feathering around them so clearly.</td>', 'I love how you can see his eyes and the beautiful feathering around them so clearly.', '2009-03-15 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364513, 770976, 60386, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, I wish the boys were sharper, but I really like the composition.</td>', 'Interesting lighting, I wish the boys were sharper, but I really like the composition.', '2009-03-15 15:12:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364517, 770986, 5112, '<td valign="top">This is lovely!  I particularly like how  the image goes strongly from totally black to totally light, and yet, it doesn''t look blown or too dark anywhere.  The composition, with the tall clear mountain right below the brightness, is just right.  You should be so proud of this, and print it BIG, HUGE, maybe even as a mural kind of print, maybe even split into 3 screens.</td>', 'This is lovely!  I particularly like how  the image goes strongly from totally black to totally light, and yet, it doesn''t look blown or too dark anywhere.  The composition, with the tall clear mountain right below the brightness, is just right.  You should be so proud of this, and print it BIG, HUGE, maybe even as a mural kind of print, maybe even split into 3 screens.', '2009-03-15 15:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364522, 772405, 102024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful soft tones and colors with a decent composition.</td>', 'Beautiful soft tones and colors with a decent composition.', '2009-03-15 15:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364523, 771711, 60386, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, I may have liked it better with a little tighter crop, but there is beautiful detail in this flower.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, I may have liked it better with a little tighter crop, but there is beautiful detail in this flower.', '2009-03-15 15:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364533, 772513, 5112, '<td valign="top">Wow, excellent portrait!  That face is processed just right, as is his expression.  Beautiful.  Added to favourites.  ~10</td>', 'Wow, excellent portrait!  That face is processed just right, as is his expression.  Beautiful.  Added to favourites.  ~10', '2009-03-15 15:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364536, 772164, 102024, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp grass and a fitting title.</td>', 'Nice sharp grass and a fitting title.', '2009-03-15 15:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364538, 772643, 9411, '<td valign="top">nice product shot,</td>', 'nice product shot,', '2009-03-15 15:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364539, 770422, 102024, '<td valign="top">Image is rather bland.  Doesn''t hold my interest.</td>', 'Image is rather bland.  Doesn''t hold my interest.', '2009-03-15 15:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364540, 772682, 9411, '<td valign="top">I really like this image. Very much in the mode of some of my work. Color, mystery, soft touch. I think if she was not so high in the composition it would have worked even better.</td>', 'I really like this image. Very much in the mode of some of my work. Color, mystery, soft touch. I think if she was not so high in the composition it would have worked even better.', '2009-03-15 15:14:17.000000', NULL, 1),
