(5364544, 770186, 102024, '<td valign="top">Great things happening in the eyes.  Image feels a bit too sharp.</td>', 'Great things happening in the eyes.  Image feels a bit too sharp.', '2009-03-15 15:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364545, 770824, 60386, '<td valign="top">This photo is so funny! I think it would have been a little better if the features were a little sharper, but I just love the pose he is in.</td>', 'This photo is so funny! I think it would have been a little better if the features were a little sharper, but I just love the pose he is in.', '2009-03-15 15:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364548, 772366, 5112, '<td valign="top">For some reason I really like this one.  I think it must be the warm light.  It''s an unconventional butterfly photo, at least compared to the usual more document like butterfly pictures, yet this one works beautifully.  I can imagine myself walking by a wall, or a window, and seeing something like this, and thoroughly enjoying it.  ~10  Added to favourites.</td>', 'For some reason I really like this one.  I think it must be the warm light.  It''s an unconventional butterfly photo, at least compared to the usual more document like butterfly pictures, yet this one works beautifully.  I can imagine myself walking by a wall, or a window, and seeing something like this, and thoroughly enjoying it.  ~10  Added to favourites.', '2009-03-15 15:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364549, 772266, 102024, '<td valign="top">Well lit and a good strong composition.</td>', 'Well lit and a good strong composition.', '2009-03-15 15:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364550, 772591, 60386, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and the composition.</td>', 'I love the colors and the composition.', '2009-03-15 15:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364551, 770380, 102024, '<td valign="top">the colors in the sky look great, and the scope of the image is nice, but the image feels more sharpened than sharp.</td>', 'the colors in the sky look great, and the scope of the image is nice, but the image feels more sharpened than sharp.', '2009-03-15 15:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364552, 771917, 61315, '<td valign="top">I really like this - the composition is nice, the scene is interesting, the colors and tones are great but... I''m not crazy about the PP - seems a little too much for this terrific shot. It''s just a matter of taste, I know. I gave this a 7 but with more subtle PP would have voted it higher. :-)</td>', 'I really like this - the composition is nice, the scene is interesting, the colors and tones are great but... I''m not crazy about the PP - seems a little too much for this terrific shot. It''s just a matter of taste, I know. I gave this a 7 but with more subtle PP would have voted it higher. :-)', '2009-03-15 15:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364553, 771894, 5112, '<td valign="top">I don''t usually care much for pet portraits, but this one''s the best pet candid I''ve seen in quite a while!  I like it.</td>', 'I don''t usually care much for pet portraits, but this one''s the best pet candid I''ve seen in quite a while!  I like it.', '2009-03-15 15:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364554, 772760, 60386, '<td valign="top">Interesting suggestion of motion and mixture of colors.</td>', 'Interesting suggestion of motion and mixture of colors.', '2009-03-15 15:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364555, 770231, 102024, '<td valign="top">Not sure I like the title, but the image is nice.  The rays of light work well with the comp... perhaps cropping out a bit more of the tree on the left... just a bit.</td>', 'Not sure I like the title, but the image is nice.  The rays of light work well with the comp... perhaps cropping out a bit more of the tree on the left... just a bit.', '2009-03-15 15:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364556, 770319, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very different.  It bothers me a bit that the image looks tilted to the left, and I''m wondering if it is intentional.  If so, to my eyes it is not working, not so much because of the people tilting, but because of the backdrop, the pinkish hills behind the people.  It is interesting to look at though.  Added to favourites.  ~9</td>', 'Very different.  It bothers me a bit that the image looks tilted to the left, and I''m wondering if it is intentional.  If so, to my eyes it is not working, not so much because of the people tilting, but because of the backdrop, the pinkish hills behind the people.  It is interesting to look at though.  Added to favourites.  ~9', '2009-03-15 15:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364557, 770614, 102024, '<td valign="top">Nice strong composition, not sure if I am feelin the color treatment here.</td>', 'Nice strong composition, not sure if I am feelin the color treatment here.', '2009-03-15 15:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
