(5364561, 772275, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like your point of view.  The selective colouring works in this case.  Added to favourites.  ~10</td>', 'I like your point of view.  The selective colouring works in this case.  Added to favourites.  ~10', '2009-03-15 15:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
