(5364702, 770685, 104643, '<td valign="top">Interpretation of Topic: Nice Choice.<br/>Photography: Nice color contrast, I would like to see the dog sharper.<br/>Viewers Reaction: So cute, love the sharpness of each blade of grass.</td>', 'Interpretation of Topic: Nice Choice.Photography: Nice color contrast, I would like to see the dog sharper.Viewers Reaction: So cute, love the sharpness of each blade of grass.', '2009-03-15 15:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
