(5364707, 771274, 31535, '<td valign="top">Great skin tones and texture in this portrait and the lighting really sculpts her face. The ''glance left'' look is a little different from the norm, but I think it works here.</td>', 'Great skin tones and texture in this portrait and the lighting really sculpts her face. The ''glance left'' look is a little different from the norm, but I think it works here.', '2009-03-15 15:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364708, 771927, 60386, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the sky and the reflection, and I love the pattern of the waves on the water.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the sky and the reflection, and I love the pattern of the waves on the water.', '2009-03-15 15:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364709, 772012, 54778, '<td valign="top">Like the contrast in light and colours.. and of course the motion..</td>', 'Like the contrast in light and colours.. and of course the motion..', '2009-03-15 15:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364710, 771464, 102024, '<td valign="top">I like the darkness of the sky but the top of the lighthouse is a bit lost in it.</td>', 'I like the darkness of the sky but the top of the lighthouse is a bit lost in it.', '2009-03-15 15:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364711, 771825, 100393, '<td valign="top">Incredible, I can''t fault it. 10 from me and I hope you get the blue.<br/> <br/>Having gone hunting a little - this must be <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=78062" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Tez</a> - fabulous image, I hadn''t seen <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=739395" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/78062/120/739395.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/78062/120/739395.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/75000-79999/78062/120/739395.jpg"/></a> before which is also great, but for me the figure and camel foreground enhances what is already a spectacular background. The vignette here is just right too.... and that''s before we get to the tones, the light..... I''m getting boring now - I''ll shut up!</td>', 'Incredible, I can''t fault it. 10 from me and I hope you get the blue. Having gone hunting a little - this must be  Tez - fabulous image, I hadn''t seen  before which is also great, but for me the figure and camel foreground enhances what is already a spectacular background. The vignette here is just right too.... and that''s before we get to the tones, the light..... I''m getting boring now - I''ll shut up!', '2009-03-15 15:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364712, 771915, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing image, the tones are fabulous. One of three 10s I gave out during my first pass.</td>', 'This is an amazing image, the tones are fabulous. One of three 10s I gave out during my first pass.', '2009-03-15 15:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364714, 772662, 60386, '<td valign="top">Oh, so cute.  I love the detail on his fur.</td>', 'Oh, so cute.  I love the detail on his fur.', '2009-03-15 15:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364715, 770189, 100393, '<td valign="top">This is only the second 10 I have given in this challenge (on my first pass) and I have voted on 797 so far.<br/> <br/>This is a fantastic shot - composition, subject, lighting; all wonderful - I just wish it was bigger!</td>', 'This is only the second 10 I have given in this challenge (on my first pass) and I have voted on 797 so far. This is a fantastic shot - composition, subject, lighting; all wonderful - I just wish it was bigger!', '2009-03-15 15:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5364717, 771190, 104643, '<td valign="top">Interpretation of Topic: Great Choice.<br/>Photography: Sharp, nice contrast/lighting.<br/>Viewers Reaction: Makes one stop and stare.</td>', 'Interpretation of Topic: Great Choice.Photography: Sharp, nice contrast/lighting.Viewers Reaction: Makes one stop and stare.', '2009-03-15 15:29:08.000000', NULL, 1);
