(5365461, 770583, 52130, '<td valign="top">haha, at first glance it looks like the hawk left a big pile of droppings on the plant. Aside from that, the color of the sky and the almost brownish tone in the plant are not too appealing and the center composition doesn''t really help either.</td>', 'haha, at first glance it looks like the hawk left a big pile of droppings on the plant. Aside from that, the color of the sky and the almost brownish tone in the plant are not too appealing and the center composition doesn''t really help either.', '2009-03-15 16:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
