(5365468, 771019, 99263, '<td valign="top">Delightful portrait. (7)<br/>This man reminds me so much of Neem Karoli Baba. <br/><a href="//g.imagehost.org/0433/Maharajji_23.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//g.imagehost.org/0433/Maharajji_23.jpg</a> <br/> <br/><a href="//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neem_Karoli_Baba" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neem_Karoli_Baba</a></td>', 'Delightful portrait. (7)This man reminds me so much of Neem Karoli Baba. //g.imagehost.org/0433/Maharajji_23.jpg  //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Neem_Karoli_Baba', '2009-03-15 16:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365469, 772443, 99263, '<td valign="top">Striking image. I like the way the mountain appears to be almost luminous. 8</td>', 'Striking image. I like the way the mountain appears to be almost luminous. 8', '2009-03-15 16:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365470, 771205, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great composition and play of light. Has an almost painting like look. Love those dark pregnant clouds. 7</td>', 'Great composition and play of light. Has an almost painting like look. Love those dark pregnant clouds. 7', '2009-03-15 16:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365471, 770257, 99263, '<td valign="top">Beautiful close-up with incredible detail. 8</td>', 'Beautiful close-up with incredible detail. 8', '2009-03-15 16:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365472, 772709, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely candid shot. I like the sepia conversion. 7</td>', 'Lovely candid shot. I like the sepia conversion. 7', '2009-03-15 16:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365473, 771917, 73056, '<td valign="top">Really great angle and composition on this. Since my earlier novice comment about "alittle heavy" on the processing, I have researched HDR alittle. In doing so, realized your processing is truly reflective of that style. Your picture is beautifully composed and presented, which clearly shows someone behind the camera who possesses the photographic eye we''d all love to have. Just wanted to come back and tell you. From the humbled and somewhat embarassed novice :)</td>', 'Really great angle and composition on this. Since my earlier novice comment about "alittle heavy" on the processing, I have researched HDR alittle. In doing so, realized your processing is truly reflective of that style. Your picture is beautifully composed and presented, which clearly shows someone behind the camera who possesses the photographic eye we''d all love to have. Just wanted to come back and tell you. From the humbled and somewhat embarassed novice :)', '2009-03-15 16:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365474, 772752, 99263, '<td valign="top">Nice and unusual angle, interesting subject and title and great processing. 7</td>', 'Nice and unusual angle, interesting subject and title and great processing. 7', '2009-03-15 16:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365475, 770170, 102024, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the water.  The image is beautifully crisp and the colors are lovely.</td>', 'Great capture of the water.  The image is beautifully crisp and the colors are lovely.', '2009-03-15 16:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365476, 770406, 99263, '<td valign="top">Hauntingly beautiful image. Very beautifully executed. There''s just one little odd object that does not appear to fit in and is probably an artifact of some kind due to editing and processing. You can see it on the left. About 3 cm from the bottom up and 3 cm from the left side of the frame where the 2 lines cross. It''s a little square object. Nevertheless, stunning image. 8</td>', 'Hauntingly beautiful image. Very beautifully executed. There''s just one little odd object that does not appear to fit in and is probably an artifact of some kind due to editing and processing. You can see it on the left. About 3 cm from the bottom up and 3 cm from the left side of the frame where the 2 lines cross. It''s a little square object. Nevertheless, stunning image. 8', '2009-03-15 16:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365478, 772227, 99263, '<td valign="top">Lovely and captivating portrait with lots of fine detail. 8</td>', 'Lovely and captivating portrait with lots of fine detail. 8', '2009-03-15 16:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365481, 771686, 102024, '<td valign="top">Good use of line to draw through the image.  A good portrait.</td>', 'Good use of line to draw through the image.  A good portrait.', '2009-03-15 16:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365483, 772350, 102024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, composition is okay.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, composition is okay.', '2009-03-15 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365484, 772112, 15305, '<td valign="top">Great capture, nicely composed by the way.</td>', 'Great capture, nicely composed by the way.', '2009-03-15 16:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365485, 772111, 102024, '<td valign="top">The colors are very striking.</td>', 'The colors are very striking.', '2009-03-15 16:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365486, 772618, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. This is my leaning tree, I come here when I need time and space to think...to feel...to think of which direction I need to take. It''s trunk has always got my back. I come here and it''s rough bark is strong and gives me support when I need a comfort zone. My leaning tree rests nearby the waters. An ideal place for the waters reflect the skies moods as I too reflect upon things and feelings. The gentle sound of the water lapping is a gentle soothing sound that helps to calm jangled nerves. This is my secret place, my leaning tree. This is what story unfolds when I look upon your composition. The colors and silhouettes as well as the presence of the two main subject paints a mood and feel for the photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. This is my leaning tree, I come here when I need time and space to think...to feel...to think of which direction I need to take. It''s trunk has always got my back. I come here and it''s rough bark is strong and gives me support when I need a comfort zone. My leaning tree rests nearby the waters. An ideal place for the waters reflect the skies moods as I too reflect upon things and feelings. The gentle sound of the water lapping is a gentle soothing sound that helps to calm jangled nerves. This is my secret place, my leaning tree. This is what story unfolds when I look upon your composition. The colors and silhouettes as well as the presence of the two main subject paints a mood and feel for the photo.', '2009-03-15 16:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365487, 770613, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, good detail.</td>', 'Nice capture, good detail.', '2009-03-15 16:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
