(5365827, 772063, 69684, '<td valign="top">Wow. Beautiful portrait in B&amp;W and what a nice models. How long could you keep them this way?</td>', 'Wow. Beautiful portrait in B&W and what a nice models. How long could you keep them this way?', '2009-03-15 16:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
