(5365870, 770549, 5112, '<td valign="top">Hey!  I know this one!!!  Judi, hello, your dog picture looks as good now as it did when I first saw it.  I like the look of satisfaction on his? her? face.  And the colours are great, really beautiful.</td>', 'Hey!  I know this one!!!  Judi, hello, your dog picture looks as good now as it did when I first saw it.  I like the look of satisfaction on his? her? face.  And the colours are great, really beautiful.', '2009-03-15 17:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
