(5365876, 770873, 5112, '<td valign="top">It sure gives a sense of scale!  The mountainside looks enormous and the home so tiny.  Beautifully seen.</td>', 'It sure gives a sense of scale!  The mountainside looks enormous and the home so tiny.  Beautifully seen.', '2009-03-15 17:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365877, 772097, 94235, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot but my eyes were drawn straight to the blemish on the left side of the vest.</td>', 'Lovely shot but my eyes were drawn straight to the blemish on the left side of the vest.', '2009-03-15 17:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365878, 772012, 15305, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, I hope you share how you did it!! Congratulations!</td>', 'Excellent shot, I hope you share how you did it!! Congratulations!', '2009-03-15 17:07:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365879, 770829, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. I love how you composed the shot such that the small bridge leads our eye directly to the gondola at the end of the trail but also to the sights beyond on the horizon. The way you composed it with the bridge in the center acts as a welcome for us to come visually explore the scenery. ''Come, climb aboard the gondola. We will show you the beautiful sights to be seen in the city'', is what this photo says to me. Only one other element would improve this travel shot and that would be a gondolier who stands at the ready; waiting to show us the beauty of the city:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. I love how you composed the shot such that the small bridge leads our eye directly to the gondola at the end of the trail but also to the sights beyond on the horizon. The way you composed it with the bridge in the center acts as a welcome for us to come visually explore the scenery. ''Come, climb aboard the gondola. We will show you the beautiful sights to be seen in the city'', is what this photo says to me. Only one other element would improve this travel shot and that would be a gondolier who stands at the ready; waiting to show us the beauty of the city:-)', '2009-03-15 17:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365881, 770173, 15305, '<td valign="top">Nice color and detail.</td>', 'Nice color and detail.', '2009-03-15 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365882, 770492, 5112, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful!  Yeah for long lenses!!!</td>', 'Very beautiful!  Yeah for long lenses!!!', '2009-03-15 17:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5365883, 771574, 91282, '<td valign="top">I wish this was bigger, I''d like to see the details a little better. At first I thought this was motion capture of a car going in front of the theater, but now its looking more like maybe its a multiple exposure of different angles/areas?</td>', 'I wish this was bigger, I''d like to see the details a little better. At first I thought this was motion capture of a car going in front of the theater, but now its looking more like maybe its a multiple exposure of different angles/areas?', '2009-03-15 17:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
