(5365898, 770703, 5112, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, and I''m sort of split on whether the editing is too much or not.  The editing stands out, and, usually, when I notice the editing before the picture, it bothers me.  I''m not sure with this one.  It works wonders with the truck.  Got to think about it ...</td>', 'I like the picture, and I''m sort of split on whether the editing is too much or not.  The editing stands out, and, usually, when I notice the editing before the picture, it bothers me.  I''m not sure with this one.  It works wonders with the truck.  Got to think about it ...', '2009-03-15 17:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
