(5366259, 771825, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to vote now. I see this young boy strolling in the waters with his camel in tow. He is returning home after a successful day at the market - everything loaded on the camel''s back this morning has been sold. He is happy for he returns home to his father with his pockets full of money. This is why he choose to travel home this way past the Taj Mahal. If any thief tried to steal, they would be heard far more easily. This is the story I see with this capture. Love all the details seen in the architecture on the Taj Mahal as well as the human element (the boy and the camel) that brings a story with it. I also like the sepia tones that add to the look, mood and feel that this picture was captured on film decades ago. A memory of a moment in time long since past. Great capture!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to vote now. I see this young boy strolling in the waters with his camel in tow. He is returning home after a successful day at the market - everything loaded on the camel''s back this morning has been sold. He is happy for he returns home to his father with his pockets full of money. This is why he choose to travel home this way past the Taj Mahal. If any thief tried to steal, they would be heard far more easily. This is the story I see with this capture. Love all the details seen in the architecture on the Taj Mahal as well as the human element (the boy and the camel) that brings a story with it. I also like the sepia tones that add to the look, mood and feel that this picture was captured on film decades ago. A memory of a moment in time long since past. Great capture!', '2009-03-15 17:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5366260, 772140, 22459, '<td valign="top">great wide angle of a beautiful scene</td>', 'great wide angle of a beautiful scene', '2009-03-15 17:48:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5366261, 772281, 104897, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this one. The fabric is interesting enough to make a nice frame for the model''s face, without being too busy or distracting. The hint of trees in the background brings life, action, a story. I don''t know what I''m trying to say, but I like this one. Title is take it or leave it, maybe "Lilac Captive"?</td>', 'I love the colors in this one. The fabric is interesting enough to make a nice frame for the model''s face, without being too busy or distracting. The hint of trees in the background brings life, action, a story. I don''t know what I''m trying to say, but I like this one. Title is take it or leave it, maybe "Lilac Captive"?', '2009-03-15 17:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5366262, 772140, 89116, '<td valign="top">I like how you put most of the clouds out of the frame since they aren''t as amazing as the falls.  Nicely done!</td>', 'I like how you put most of the clouds out of the frame since they aren''t as amazing as the falls.  Nicely done!', '2009-03-15 17:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
