(5366547, 770537, 30791, '<td valign="top">Going through and giving at least the same amount of comments I am receiving on my entry. Love the intimacy of this photo. Up close, personal, and above all it shows your dedication to capturing a sight that most people do not get an opportunity to see. Being from Florida I understand how difficult it must have been to have captured this photo. Alligators are skittish creatures ;)<br/>Im upgrading my initial vote of an 8 to a 10 due to you have captured a shot that I could only have dreamed of getting myself. Good luck.</td>', 'Going through and giving at least the same amount of comments I am receiving on my entry. Love the intimacy of this photo. Up close, personal, and above all it shows your dedication to capturing a sight that most people do not get an opportunity to see. Being from Florida I understand how difficult it must have been to have captured this photo. Alligators are skittish creatures ;)Im upgrading my initial vote of an 8 to a 10 due to you have captured a shot that I could only have dreamed of getting myself. Good luck.', '2009-03-15 18:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5366548, 771673, 66750, '<td valign="top">picture looks a bit flat</td>', 'picture looks a bit flat', '2009-03-15 18:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
