(5367424, 772255, 104643, '<td valign="top">I like this because you have the complete picture with the land and the sky.  Great coloring, sharp shot.</td>', 'I like this because you have the complete picture with the land and the sky.  Great coloring, sharp shot.', '2009-03-15 20:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5367425, 770224, 18197, '<td valign="top">We have see so many capitol photos at DPC over the years, it''s tempting to dismiss this. That would be a mistake. With only light and shadow for your tools, you have given us superb definition of the dome. You''ve given us a winter context. Arguably the best capitol dome photo in a long time and among best in class.</td>', 'We have see so many capitol photos at DPC over the years, it''s tempting to dismiss this. That would be a mistake. With only light and shadow for your tools, you have given us superb definition of the dome. You''ve given us a winter context. Arguably the best capitol dome photo in a long time and among best in class.', '2009-03-15 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5367426, 772485, 77196, '<td valign="top">Somber. End of day. Almost restful.</td>', 'Somber. End of day. Almost restful.', '2009-03-15 20:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
