(5367431, 770213, 18197, '<td valign="top">This succeeds brilliantly as an abstract, and upon closer inspection, the sharp edges and reflection improves upon it. Among best of class.</td>', 'This succeeds brilliantly as an abstract, and upon closer inspection, the sharp edges and reflection improves upon it. Among best of class.', '2009-03-15 20:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
