(5367450, 771805, 104643, '<td valign="top">I can see why this would be a "GEM".  Not many of us get a baby sea lion to stop and pose for us.  Of course you get credit too for taking such a terrific photo. Love this.</td>', 'I can see why this would be a "GEM".  Not many of us get a baby sea lion to stop and pose for us.  Of course you get credit too for taking such a terrific photo. Love this.', '2009-03-15 20:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5367451, 771800, 18197, '<td valign="top">I am not normally a fan of low key portraits but this one is so well done, I have to give it best in class. You''ve not only shown us an interesting face, you have given us an interesting "person" with a real personality and his own emotional payload.</td>', 'I am not normally a fan of low key portraits but this one is so well done, I have to give it best in class. You''ve not only shown us an interesting face, you have given us an interesting "person" with a real personality and his own emotional payload.', '2009-03-15 20:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
