(5367473, 772280, 77196, '<td valign="top">Normally, this would get a negative comment for having nothing in focus. But you''ve capture a hurried feel here. Not sure whether the gate is a good idea or bad, but the house hidden in the right edge doesn''t look all that hospitable. To me, it does convey a sense of urgency to get through the stone gate.</td>', 'Normally, this would get a negative comment for having nothing in focus. But you''ve capture a hurried feel here. Not sure whether the gate is a good idea or bad, but the house hidden in the right edge doesn''t look all that hospitable. To me, it does convey a sense of urgency to get through the stone gate.', '2009-03-15 20:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5367474, 771273, 87751, '<td valign="top">Perfect DOF and GREAT title.  Nice work.</td>', 'Perfect DOF and GREAT title.  Nice work.', '2009-03-15 20:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
