(5367525, 770319, 18197, '<td valign="top">You have given us a dramatic photo on several levels. A dramatic abstract. A dramatic landscape. And a dramatic adventure. The composition with 3 diagonal stripes, as it were, gives us a lot of motion, which I appreciate. And the four figures at the crest of the dune make us care and give a sense of scale. Among best of show.</td>', 'You have given us a dramatic photo on several levels. A dramatic abstract. A dramatic landscape. And a dramatic adventure. The composition with 3 diagonal stripes, as it were, gives us a lot of motion, which I appreciate. And the four figures at the crest of the dune make us care and give a sense of scale. Among best of show.', '2009-03-15 20:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
