(5367570, 771173, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow! What a fabulous shot of this male deer! Just look and the fabulous details and the way the light illuminates it beautifully such that we can appreciate the texture seen in the fur. Love the bokeh of the background - the spring hues of the forest greens really allows this deer to shine in his natural surroundings. This must have been some sight to see live!</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow! What a fabulous shot of this male deer! Just look and the fabulous details and the way the light illuminates it beautifully such that we can appreciate the texture seen in the fur. Love the bokeh of the background - the spring hues of the forest greens really allows this deer to shine in his natural surroundings. This must have been some sight to see live!', '2009-03-15 20:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
