(5367573, 770626, 22970, '<td valign="top">I like the processing you have done with this photograph. Makes the vote feel as if they are in the same building. Nice lighting, detail, and focus. Bump-up the score.</td>', 'I like the processing you have done with this photograph. Makes the vote feel as if they are in the same building. Nice lighting, detail, and focus. Bump-up the score.', '2009-03-15 20:25:37.000000', NULL, 1),
