(5368029, 770892, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1115 images, I gave 93 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 93, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>I love the almost monochromatic feel to this image, with the hint of blue at the top giving the shot that little bit extra. Nicely controlled exposure on the snow. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1115 images, I gave 93 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 93, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. I love the almost monochromatic feel to this image, with the hint of blue at the top giving the shot that little bit extra. Nicely controlled exposure on the snow.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-15 21:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
