(5368330, 770569, 45475, '<td valign="top">[Fisherman, through clenched teeth]: "I got a snag and the tide went out ages ago, can I move yet?"<br/> <br/>[Photographer}: "NO! Only two more minutes to go, shut up and keep still."<br/> <br/>Excellent work here. Love the breakwater.</td>', '[Fisherman, through clenched teeth]: "I got a snag and the tide went out ages ago, can I move yet?" [Photographer}: "NO! Only two more minutes to go, shut up and keep still." Excellent work here. Love the breakwater.', '2009-03-15 21:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
