(5369113, 771677, 47316, '<td valign="top">nice concept, processing and lighting but I don''t feel you captured her quite right. the posing is rather awkward. I know its difficult whipping hair (i''ve had to do it as a model myself) on thing that helped is deciding where you want your subject to end up as far as a pose goes, try having her land there and capture it a few times slowly, and then go for the full on head whip! :)</td>', 'nice concept, processing and lighting but I don''t feel you captured her quite right. the posing is rather awkward. I know its difficult whipping hair (i''ve had to do it as a model myself) on thing that helped is deciding where you want your subject to end up as far as a pose goes, try having her land there and capture it a few times slowly, and then go for the full on head whip! :)', '2009-03-15 22:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
