(5369162, 771180, 79955, '<td valign="top">the lighting did not help you on this one. Focus is a little soft.<br/>Did you use fill flash for this ? You should have and with the right amount of fill flash you could have underexposed a little for the background colors.<br/>The flash would also have picked out the splashes better.</td>', 'the lighting did not help you on this one. Focus is a little soft.Did you use fill flash for this ? You should have and with the right amount of fill flash you could have underexposed a little for the background colors.The flash would also have picked out the splashes better.', '2009-03-15 22:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
