(5369214, 770670, 61961, '<td valign="top">This looks magical!  It''s hard to get the full effect at this size, that''s why it''s important (in my opinion) to try to use the fully allowed 720 pixels.  I wonder if this would lose the mystery if it were a little brighter?  Lovely shot at any rate.</td>', 'This looks magical!  It''s hard to get the full effect at this size, that''s why it''s important (in my opinion) to try to use the fully allowed 720 pixels.  I wonder if this would lose the mystery if it were a little brighter?  Lovely shot at any rate.', '2009-03-15 22:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
