(5369230, 772011, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments not. Beautiful floral shot! Love the crisp whites and buttery yellow of this lotus flower. You captured some nice details too, with the lined texture I see on the outer petals. The dark water really helps to set off the brilliant white of the flower quite nicely such that it pops off the page.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments not. Beautiful floral shot! Love the crisp whites and buttery yellow of this lotus flower. You captured some nice details too, with the lined texture I see on the outer petals. The dark water really helps to set off the brilliant white of the flower quite nicely such that it pops off the page.', '2009-03-15 22:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369231, 771836, 2389, '<td valign="top">Great image - I''ve tried unsuccessfully to get a good eclipse shot and you have done it well! -10-</td>', 'Great image - I''ve tried unsuccessfully to get a good eclipse shot and you have done it well! -10-', '2009-03-15 22:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
