(5369451, 770310, 79955, '<td valign="top">brave attempt at a selective desat. I do not think this will be scoring well right now. anyway some of my recommendations are (keeping with the selective desat strategy)<br/>- pump up the overall contrast slightly<br/>- selectively sharpen the eyes<br/>- selectively increase the contrast of the eyes only<br/>- also go for a tighter squarer crop<br/>Try it and see what you think. 4 from me</td>', 'brave attempt at a selective desat. I do not think this will be scoring well right now. anyway some of my recommendations are (keeping with the selective desat strategy)- pump up the overall contrast slightly- selectively sharpen the eyes- selectively increase the contrast of the eyes only- also go for a tighter squarer cropTry it and see what you think. 4 from me', '2009-03-15 23:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
