(5369813, 770257, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 15 of them a 10. Your image was one of those 15. <br/> <br/>Lots of bug macros in this challenge, but this one is simply awesome! How on earth do you even begin to set up for a shot like this? I don''t think I''ve ever seen such a brilliant bee close up, the definition was superb. I actually voted this a 9 originally, but as I came to comment on it, felt that in fact it deserved a 10. <br/> <br/>It''s hard to predict the top 10, never mind the ribbons with so many entrants, but this has got to be a contender. Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 15 of them a 10. Your image was one of those 15.  Lots of bug macros in this challenge, but this one is simply awesome! How on earth do you even begin to set up for a shot like this? I don''t think I''ve ever seen such a brilliant bee close up, the definition was superb. I actually voted this a 9 originally, but as I came to comment on it, felt that in fact it deserved a 10.  It''s hard to predict the top 10, never mind the ribbons with so many entrants, but this has got to be a contender. Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-15 23:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
