(5369823, 771892, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 30 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 30. <br/> <br/>I''m a real bird lover, and a sucker for close up birdie portraits. There are a few in this challenge, but this one excels. She is indeed a gem. The crop is perfect, and the colour palate is so subtle yet effective. It''s hard to predict the top photos where there are over a thousand to choose from, but this is surely top 20 material. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1124 images, I gave 30 of them a 9. Your image was one of those 30.  I''m a real bird lover, and a sucker for close up birdie portraits. There are a few in this challenge, but this one excels. She is indeed a gem. The crop is perfect, and the colour palate is so subtle yet effective. It''s hard to predict the top photos where there are over a thousand to choose from, but this is surely top 20 material.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-15 23:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
