(5369886, 771563, 3735, '<td valign="top">I had looked at this photo before and came back to check it out a little better. I was trying to figure out how you did this ?   Is this different window panels with a reflection or what ?  This photo is so interesting<br/>Thank you for sharing it with me .</td>', 'I had looked at this photo before and came back to check it out a little better. I was trying to figure out how you did this ?   Is this different window panels with a reflection or what ?  This photo is so interestingThank you for sharing it with me .', '2009-03-15 23:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369887, 771402, 30861, '<td valign="top">Or learning to hold his breath underwater at least :-) Beautiful, whimsical shot, makes me feel "right there" with you, not an easy thing to accomplish underwater. Well done.</td>', 'Or learning to hold his breath underwater at least :-) Beautiful, whimsical shot, makes me feel "right there" with you, not an easy thing to accomplish underwater. Well done.', '2009-03-15 23:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
