(5369890, 771048, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is excellent. My first reaction (as I seeded this into my "bump" group on first pass) was that it was close, but that the murky processing had failed the image. I don''t think that any longer. I think if you processed it conventionally the parallax would dissipate. It''s a powerful, and timeless, shot. Well done and bumping. 9.</td>', 'This is excellent. My first reaction (as I seeded this into my "bump" group on first pass) was that it was close, but that the murky processing had failed the image. I don''t think that any longer. I think if you processed it conventionally the parallax would dissipate. It''s a powerful, and timeless, shot. Well done and bumping. 9.', '2009-03-15 23:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369892, 771678, 79955, '<td valign="top">Too overprocessed, bright detailess portion is a killer , which is something you want to avoid or at least compensate for when you shoot.</td>', 'Too overprocessed, bright detailess portion is a killer , which is something you want to avoid or at least compensate for when you shoot.', '2009-03-15 23:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
