(5369926, 772581, 18197, '<td valign="top">Lovely bird who had the good artistic sense to perch in front of you on this photogenically long stick. And, you made the most of it. Among best in class.</td>', 'Lovely bird who had the good artistic sense to perch in front of you on this photogenically long stick. And, you made the most of it. Among best in class.', '2009-03-15 23:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369928, 770566, 94235, '<td valign="top">Great contrasts and beautiful clarity in the mountains.</td>', 'Great contrasts and beautiful clarity in the mountains.', '2009-03-15 23:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369931, 772366, 52500, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  A fleeting moment in the too brief lives of these fascinating creatures.  On a second passthrough, I''ve decided that I really like this image a lot.  Up to a 9 you go.</td>', 'Beautiful.  A fleeting moment in the too brief lives of these fascinating creatures.  On a second passthrough, I''ve decided that I really like this image a lot.  Up to a 9 you go.', '2009-03-15 23:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369932, 772378, 52500, '<td valign="top">Fantastic.  I''m a sucker for cool fish shots in general, but this is extraordinary.  I would have probably processed it a bit differently, but no matter, it''s still wonderful.  Hey, I just stumbled across this bad boy on 1x!  Looks awesome in large. :)</td>', 'Fantastic.  I''m a sucker for cool fish shots in general, but this is extraordinary.  I would have probably processed it a bit differently, but no matter, it''s still wonderful.  Hey, I just stumbled across this bad boy on 1x!  Looks awesome in large. :)', '2009-03-15 23:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369933, 772277, 18197, '<td valign="top">I really can''t puzzle out what I''m seeing here but I like the flow of the water ... even if I can''t figure out what''s causing it. Among best in class.</td>', 'I really can''t puzzle out what I''m seeing here but I like the flow of the water ... even if I can''t figure out what''s causing it. Among best in class.', '2009-03-15 23:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369934, 772433, 52500, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure exactly what it is about this image that I find so captivating, but you''re one of my top 3.  I''m certainly a sucker for negative space, so that''s part of it.  Ah, well.  Perhaps it''s the undefinable character itself that I love.</td>', 'I''m really not sure exactly what it is about this image that I find so captivating, but you''re one of my top 3.  I''m certainly a sucker for negative space, so that''s part of it.  Ah, well.  Perhaps it''s the undefinable character itself that I love.', '2009-03-15 23:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369935, 771838, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice crop. Talk about in your face.</td>', 'Nice crop. Talk about in your face.', '2009-03-15 23:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369936, 771026, 52500, '<td valign="top">This is one of my top 4 images (which all received 10s) in this challenge.  I love the way it looks so organic.  I actually thought it was a shell when I saw the thumbnail (which I saw first), but this is so much better than the shell would have been.  Anyone can shoot a shell, but you saw it in the staircase and processed it masterfully.  I love the DOF, too.  Well done!</td>', 'This is one of my top 4 images (which all received 10s) in this challenge.  I love the way it looks so organic.  I actually thought it was a shell when I saw the thumbnail (which I saw first), but this is so much better than the shell would have been.  Anyone can shoot a shell, but you saw it in the staircase and processed it masterfully.  I love the DOF, too.  Well done!', '2009-03-15 23:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369937, 772472, 52500, '<td valign="top">You''re one of my top 4.  I love the negative space and the simplicity.  Overall, it just feels right.  I could state at this all day.</td>', 'You''re one of my top 4.  I love the negative space and the simplicity.  Overall, it just feels right.  I could state at this all day.', '2009-03-15 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369938, 772655, 52500, '<td valign="top">Perfect focus, and man those colors!  I love me some bug macros, and this one is superb.</td>', 'Perfect focus, and man those colors!  I love me some bug macros, and this one is superb.', '2009-03-15 23:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369939, 770939, 58452, '<td valign="top">I don''t like things eating my bees.  LOL Very unique capture. Don''t think I''ve ever seen a mantis eat a bee. Excellent. Wow, that almost looks like a stinger in the mantis foreleg! Wonder how this meal turned out?</td>', 'I don''t like things eating my bees.  LOL Very unique capture. Don''t think I''ve ever seen a mantis eat a bee. Excellent. Wow, that almost looks like a stinger in the mantis foreleg! Wonder how this meal turned out?', '2009-03-15 23:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369942, 772759, 52500, '<td valign="top">I can''t really figure out what''s going on with the colors here, but I like it a lot.  The orange really jumps our and grabs me.  I love how it''s reflected off of the water in all kinds of little spots.  The plants are fascinating just by themselves, and the shallow DOF really emphasizes the little flowers.</td>', 'I can''t really figure out what''s going on with the colors here, but I like it a lot.  The orange really jumps our and grabs me.  I love how it''s reflected off of the water in all kinds of little spots.  The plants are fascinating just by themselves, and the shallow DOF really emphasizes the little flowers.', '2009-03-15 23:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369943, 772475, 37845, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of remembrance.</td>', 'Nice photo of remembrance.', '2009-03-15 23:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5369944, 772405, 58452, '<td valign="top">Caught a pretty pastel sunset there my friend.</td>', 'Caught a pretty pastel sunset there my friend.', '2009-03-15 23:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
