(5369964, 770574, 18197, '<td valign="top">Technically, this is far from perfect and you''ve broken a lot of the rules of engagement ... but in the end it all seems to work. Among best of class.</td>', 'Technically, this is far from perfect and you''ve broken a lot of the rules of engagement ... but in the end it all seems to work. Among best of class.', '2009-03-15 23:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
