(5370053, 770892, 18197, '<td valign="top">I think the thing that appeals to me here is the stark contrast of rock and snow. The flowing river adds a nice dimension. The sky color and detail are nice. Overall, the whole photo seems to work. It''s a pleasant place I''d like to experience. Among best in class.</td>', 'I think the thing that appeals to me here is the stark contrast of rock and snow. The flowing river adds a nice dimension. The sky color and detail are nice. Overall, the whole photo seems to work. It''s a pleasant place I''d like to experience. Among best in class.', '2009-03-16 00:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5370056, 772530, 94235, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. A little too dark maybe.</td>', 'Nice portrait. A little too dark maybe.', '2009-03-16 00:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5370057, 770685, 15305, '<td valign="top">Looks like a wild beast lurking in the grass.</td>', 'Looks like a wild beast lurking in the grass.', '2009-03-16 00:09:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5370061, 771832, 15305, '<td valign="top">Interesting grainy effect.</td>', 'Interesting grainy effect.', '2009-03-16 00:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
