(5370229, 770222, 45475, '<td valign="top">I''d pay good money to see the Too''s candid family album.... :D<br/> <br/>Okay, so I''m going to apply the (top secret) ''Family Happy-Snap Scale'' to this. It starts at maximum points right off the bat, thanks to the classic red-eye. No family snapshot should be without red-eye, it''s simply not done. Comes hand in hand with blinding flash, which is another absolute must. The crazy facials keep it hovering at maximum still, but...... [sigh] you lose significant points for not drawing a goofy expression on Buzz. There''s no excuse for that I''m afraid. Sorry.</td>', 'I''d pay good money to see the Too''s candid family album.... :D Okay, so I''m going to apply the (top secret) ''Family Happy-Snap Scale'' to this. It starts at maximum points right off the bat, thanks to the classic red-eye. No family snapshot should be without red-eye, it''s simply not done. Comes hand in hand with blinding flash, which is another absolute must. The crazy facials keep it hovering at maximum still, but...... [sigh] you lose significant points for not drawing a goofy expression on Buzz. There''s no excuse for that I''m afraid. Sorry.', '2009-03-16 00:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
