(5372209, 771458, 30364, '<td valign="top">It''s a very interesting image to enter in a ''hidden gem'' challenge, because you must know that it will be more or less instantly dismissed by nearly everyone.  And yet it is one of the very small minority of photographs that actually is a hidden gem.  It <i>depicts</i> a hidden gem.  A splash of sunlight illuminates these leaves and in doing so also highlights the functional beauty of the forms.  Tones, textures and shapes, arrayed here as the notes of a musical phrase on the staff.  Considered like that, it''s surprisingly lovely, and indeed a hidden gem.  9.</td>', 'It''s a very interesting image to enter in a ''hidden gem'' challenge, because you must know that it will be more or less instantly dismissed by nearly everyone.  And yet it is one of the very small minority of photographs that actually is a hidden gem.  It depicts a hidden gem.  A splash of sunlight illuminates these leaves and in doing so also highlights the functional beauty of the forms.  Tones, textures and shapes, arrayed here as the notes of a musical phrase on the staff.  Considered like that, it''s surprisingly lovely, and indeed a hidden gem.  9.', '2009-03-16 05:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
