(5372645, 772317, 22970, '<td valign="top">A Nice capture, dramatic. I Just don''t understand why the 15 pixel tilt to the left, I takes away from the image. I know some may say why worry about a slight tilt but the water line is 15 pixels lower on the left side than the the right. It''s enough to make involuntary tilt my head to the left while viewing instead of being able to look at it level. I still find the overall photograph appealing enough to warrant a good score. I would just keep an eye on making sure the horizon is level in future shots.</td>', 'A Nice capture, dramatic. I Just don''t understand why the 15 pixel tilt to the left, I takes away from the image. I know some may say why worry about a slight tilt but the water line is 15 pixels lower on the left side than the the right. It''s enough to make involuntary tilt my head to the left while viewing instead of being able to look at it level. I still find the overall photograph appealing enough to warrant a good score. I would just keep an eye on making sure the horizon is level in future shots.', '2009-03-16 08:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
