(5372667, 771822, 22970, '<td valign="top">The colors and pose are great. Elegant model and the lighting and focus is spot on. The one thing that distracts me is the reflection within the pupal of her eye. I takes away from that eye-to-eye contact that this photograph needs. With that said, the distraction is minimal and only effects my score by one point.</td>', 'The colors and pose are great. Elegant model and the lighting and focus is spot on. The one thing that distracts me is the reflection within the pupal of her eye. I takes away from that eye-to-eye contact that this photograph needs. With that said, the distraction is minimal and only effects my score by one point.', '2009-03-16 08:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
