(5372695, 770655, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow, this is a fabulous shot of this scenic desert landscape. Love how you composed the shot to have interesting rock elements both in the foreground and the background. The curved shapes of the red rocks in the foreground add interesting shapes and textures while the rocky mountain range in the backdrop also provide interesting shapes and variations in color that attracts and holds the eye''s attention. There is a beautiful blue sky with puffy white clouds to further complement the scene. This is a beautiful scenic shot, one worthy of a calender photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow, this is a fabulous shot of this scenic desert landscape. Love how you composed the shot to have interesting rock elements both in the foreground and the background. The curved shapes of the red rocks in the foreground add interesting shapes and textures while the rocky mountain range in the backdrop also provide interesting shapes and variations in color that attracts and holds the eye''s attention. There is a beautiful blue sky with puffy white clouds to further complement the scene. This is a beautiful scenic shot, one worthy of a calender photo.', '2009-03-16 08:58:26.000000', NULL, 1),
