(5373087, 772192, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the very close and very far images in this; it''s a good attempt, but nothing is really in sharp focus.  Maybe doing some USM in processing would bring out the focus some more.  I''d also like to see some more of the flowers, but if it''s a shot picked from long ago I guess that couldn''t be helped.</td>', 'I like the very close and very far images in this; it''s a good attempt, but nothing is really in sharp focus.  Maybe doing some USM in processing would bring out the focus some more.  I''d also like to see some more of the flowers, but if it''s a shot picked from long ago I guess that couldn''t be helped.', '2009-03-16 10:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373088, 772197, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice selection of shot, but you reduced it to 500 pixels.  You should have used the 720 allowed.  This shot shows the power of the ocean with the carved out cliffs leacing to the unseen shore.</td>', 'Nice selection of shot, but you reduced it to 500 pixels.  You should have used the 720 allowed.  This shot shows the power of the ocean with the carved out cliffs leacing to the unseen shore.', '2009-03-16 10:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373090, 772738, 76430, '<td valign="top">There is potential here but the on-camera flash really hurts the exposure.  She''s a very pretty girl with nice eye coloring.  This looks like an un-posed shot or between poses.  She would make some great shots with diffused flash and a little more posing.</td>', 'There is potential here but the on-camera flash really hurts the exposure.  She''s a very pretty girl with nice eye coloring.  This looks like an un-posed shot or between poses.  She would make some great shots with diffused flash and a little more posing.', '2009-03-16 10:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373092, 772647, 76430, '<td valign="top">It almost looks like Louisa''s elephant from Skin.  Nice close shot.  I hope you were safely positioned.</td>', 'It almost looks like Louisa''s elephant from Skin.  Nice close shot.  I hope you were safely positioned.', '2009-03-16 10:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373094, 772060, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good catch of all of those birds, with one or two coming in for a landing.  A faster shutter speed catching frozen wings "may" have been nice.  I see some layering in the clouds.  Maybe you reduced the quality of the jpg too much.</td>', 'Good catch of all of those birds, with one or two coming in for a landing.  A faster shutter speed catching frozen wings "may" have been nice.  I see some layering in the clouds.  Maybe you reduced the quality of the jpg too much.', '2009-03-16 10:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
