(5373108, 771955, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice view but it looks really oversaturated.  Maybe you had to in order to show the rainbow, but maybe you could have selected and saturated just the rainbow.  The water looks unreal being so green.  I think just reducing saturation on the water would have made it better.  And you used 640 pixels when you had 720.</td>', 'Nice view but it looks really oversaturated.  Maybe you had to in order to show the rainbow, but maybe you could have selected and saturated just the rainbow.  The water looks unreal being so green.  I think just reducing saturation on the water would have made it better.  And you used 640 pixels when you had 720.', '2009-03-16 10:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
