(5373112, 772625, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the flowers and the woman in the middle to give an idea of scale.  I don''t really like the red border, though it does match many of the flowers.</td>', 'I like the flowers and the woman in the middle to give an idea of scale.  I don''t really like the red border, though it does match many of the flowers.', '2009-03-16 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
