(5373114, 772455, 56109, '<td valign="top">Go Michigan! After traveling around the world to various places, I still think Michigan has some of the best sunsets. So did you go swimming?</td>', 'Go Michigan! After traveling around the world to various places, I still think Michigan has some of the best sunsets. So did you go swimming?', '2009-03-16 10:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373116, 772051, 76430, '<td valign="top">It looks like a good time of day with the long shadows on the grass tufts.  I don''t really like the cut-off white sand dune.  I''d prefer an angle showing more of the dune, or maybe just square it off with more to the left.</td>', 'It looks like a good time of day with the long shadows on the grass tufts.  I don''t really like the cut-off white sand dune.  I''d prefer an angle showing more of the dune, or maybe just square it off with more to the left.', '2009-03-16 10:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
