(5373119, 770410, 76430, '<td valign="top">Yes it is, but otherwise not an especially interesting shot.  I think it would have more interest in color, especially if it was a nice red or yellow hydrant.  Also it''s not as sharp as I''d like to see it.</td>', 'Yes it is, but otherwise not an especially interesting shot.  I think it would have more interest in color, especially if it was a nice red or yellow hydrant.  Also it''s not as sharp as I''d like to see it.', '2009-03-16 10:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373121, 772419, 76430, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it''s cropped a bit too close on top, where the wing touches the edge.  It also seems a little too magenta tinged, though it may be due to the actual sky color.  I''d like to see more detail in the bird.</td>', 'Good idea, but it''s cropped a bit too close on top, where the wing touches the edge.  It also seems a little too magenta tinged, though it may be due to the actual sky color.  I''d like to see more detail in the bird.', '2009-03-16 10:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373122, 770210, 76430, '<td valign="top">This must be someone close to you with some things she''s proud of.  The flash hurts this shot with shadows and glare.  Since this is probably an old shot you picked and you couldn''t re-shoot maybe you could have fixed it post-processing with dodge and burn and blur.</td>', 'This must be someone close to you with some things she''s proud of.  The flash hurts this shot with shadows and glare.  Since this is probably an old shot you picked and you couldn''t re-shoot maybe you could have fixed it post-processing with dodge and burn and blur.', '2009-03-16 10:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373123, 772433, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m not so sure about this one.  It''s an alligator or crocodile, but just seeing the middle of it and so much negative space doesn''t do it for me.  You do have excellent detail on the hide.  This looks like it may have been a "Skin" outtake.</td>', 'I''m not so sure about this one.  It''s an alligator or crocodile, but just seeing the middle of it and so much negative space doesn''t do it for me.  You do have excellent detail on the hide.  This looks like it may have been a "Skin" outtake.', '2009-03-16 10:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
