(5373125, 770905, 76430, '<td valign="top">This really looks cold and desolate.  It makes me glad to be in Southern California instead of Northern Minnesota where I was raised.  The mid-picture horizon is risky.  Maybe cropping closer to their feed and losing much of the left side would make the people more prominent and make the horizon more fit the "rules".</td>', 'This really looks cold and desolate.  It makes me glad to be in Southern California instead of Northern Minnesota where I was raised.  The mid-picture horizon is risky.  Maybe cropping closer to their feed and losing much of the left side would make the people more prominent and make the horizon more fit the "rules".', '2009-03-16 10:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373127, 771153, 9411, '<td valign="top">Wow! don''t really see how this could be better as an image. just not a fan of adding borders, really unnecessary.</td>', 'Wow! don''t really see how this could be better as an image. just not a fan of adding borders, really unnecessary.', '2009-03-16 10:45:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373128, 772164, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the slanted exposure, but the sunset is pretty blown out for my taste.  The water is positioned well if there was any detail in the sun, but otherwise there isn''t that much interest in the foreground or sky.</td>', 'I like the slanted exposure, but the sunset is pretty blown out for my taste.  The water is positioned well if there was any detail in the sun, but otherwise there isn''t that much interest in the foreground or sky.', '2009-03-16 10:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
