(5373141, 771799, 76430, '<td valign="top">I wish you had used the 720 pixels you were allowed instead of 300 so we could see her better.  Check the tutorial on saving for DPC.  I like the fence or whatever is in front of her.  Cropping more to fill the frame with her face with some blue above and below would have been good, provided you didn''t crop it even smaller.  I''m afraid many people will be voting this very low only because of the size.  That''s unfortunate.</td>', 'I wish you had used the 720 pixels you were allowed instead of 300 so we could see her better.  Check the tutorial on saving for DPC.  I like the fence or whatever is in front of her.  Cropping more to fill the frame with her face with some blue above and below would have been good, provided you didn''t crop it even smaller.  I''m afraid many people will be voting this very low only because of the size.  That''s unfortunate.', '2009-03-16 10:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
