(5373361, 772350, 34659, '<td valign="top">Looks like Canada (maybe from the Calgary Workshops?).  Such a beautiful scene - and beautifully processed.</td>', 'Looks like Canada (maybe from the Calgary Workshops?).  Such a beautiful scene - and beautifully processed.', '2009-03-16 11:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373363, 771157, 34659, '<td valign="top">One of the best osprey shots I think I''ve ever seen.  The clarity, tones, and action are terrific!  The fact that it''s a utility pole is a little distracting, BUT seeing the osprey''s talons clasped around the right pole with the left extended is really pretty amazing.  Great action shot - and as a bird lover, one in a million.  9 from me.  :-)</td>', 'One of the best osprey shots I think I''ve ever seen.  The clarity, tones, and action are terrific!  The fact that it''s a utility pole is a little distracting, BUT seeing the osprey''s talons clasped around the right pole with the left extended is really pretty amazing.  Great action shot - and as a bird lover, one in a million.  9 from me.  :-)', '2009-03-16 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5373364, 770239, 34659, '<td valign="top">Such a breathtakingly emotive capture.  I can almost feel the cool mist from the whale''s breath.  Amazing capture and beautifully represented.  Bumping up...</td>', 'Such a breathtakingly emotive capture.  I can almost feel the cool mist from the whale''s breath.  Amazing capture and beautifully represented.  Bumping up...', '2009-03-16 11:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
