(5373377, 771373, 34659, '<td valign="top">My first impression was "This is completely out of the box and illegal".  My second impression was "OMG, this is a landscape shot inverted on end".  My third impression was "What amazing colors and the illusion of a humanesque figure is incredible".  My final overall impression was "WOW".  You''ve earned my respect and admiration.  Can''t wait to see whose work this is...  Bumping up.  :-)</td>', 'My first impression was "This is completely out of the box and illegal".  My second impression was "OMG, this is a landscape shot inverted on end".  My third impression was "What amazing colors and the illusion of a humanesque figure is incredible".  My final overall impression was "WOW".  You''ve earned my respect and admiration.  Can''t wait to see whose work this is...  Bumping up.  :-)', '2009-03-16 11:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
