(5373844, 771695, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. She has come to the sea to bathe in the warm salt air and hear the calming voice of the surf as it washes ashore. She reflects upon the events of the day. That is the story I feel being played out when I look at your photo. I feel the warm salt air not just because of the presence of the ocean but because the deep rich red, gold and orange tones of the shore convey warmth. The reflection on the sand of the woman speaks to me of the inner reflection/meditation she is doing as she gazes out to sea.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. She has come to the sea to bathe in the warm salt air and hear the calming voice of the surf as it washes ashore. She reflects upon the events of the day. That is the story I feel being played out when I look at your photo. I feel the warm salt air not just because of the presence of the ocean but because the deep rich red, gold and orange tones of the shore convey warmth. The reflection on the sand of the woman speaks to me of the inner reflection/meditation she is doing as she gazes out to sea.', '2009-03-16 11:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
