(5373947, 772069, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. This is a great journalistic shot showcasing the story of this demolition!! I like how you have included the human element. The man with his arms raised up in air ...I can almost here him whooping and hollering as he watches this impressive site. And it must have been quite and experience to behold not just for the people in the shot but the one taking the shot as well;-) The title made me chuckle for if he did work there he is most happy about it''s demise:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. This is a great journalistic shot showcasing the story of this demolition!! I like how you have included the human element. The man with his arms raised up in air ...I can almost here him whooping and hollering as he watches this impressive site. And it must have been quite and experience to behold not just for the people in the shot but the one taking the shot as well;-) The title made me chuckle for if he did work there he is most happy about it''s demise:-)', '2009-03-16 12:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
