(5374131, 770850, 29490, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful use of negative space, perhaps inspired by <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=715" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Remie</a>''s Cowspace photo #5783 (dont'' want to use mucho space for thumb)?  In the end it does not matter where the inspiration came from, what matters is this photo is.  The snow, the mooer, the post.  Simple and effective.  And vast.  Moo.  Well done.  Currently one-of-three tied with my top score.</td>', 'What a wonderful use of negative space, perhaps inspired by  Remie''s Cowspace photo #5783 (dont'' want to use mucho space for thumb)?  In the end it does not matter where the inspiration came from, what matters is this photo is.  The snow, the mooer, the post.  Simple and effective.  And vast.  Moo.  Well done.  Currently one-of-three tied with my top score.', '2009-03-16 12:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
