(5374580, 771153, 69325, '<td valign="top">sorry, this totally DNMC....<br/> <br/>this is obviously NOT a hidden gem, it''s right out there for everyone and their uncle to see...in fact I have a very similar shot in my favorites, you are obviously trying to copy the style of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67145" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Roz</a>, but you will never be good enough. Maybe try water drops. Or move to Iceland. /10</td>', 'sorry, this totally DNMC.... this is obviously NOT a hidden gem, it''s right out there for everyone and their uncle to see...in fact I have a very similar shot in my favorites, you are obviously trying to copy the style of  Roz, but you will never be good enough. Maybe try water drops. Or move to Iceland. /10', '2009-03-16 13:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
