(5375663, 772651, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. I like how you composed the shot so that the orchid is at a diagonal for it adds visual interest. Lovely details seen in the texture on the petals and the colorful spotted pattern in the inner core of the flower. The square crop was a good choice for it keeps the attention focused squarely (pardon the pun) on the details and beauty of the flower.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments now. I like how you composed the shot so that the orchid is at a diagonal for it adds visual interest. Lovely details seen in the texture on the petals and the colorful spotted pattern in the inner core of the flower. The square crop was a good choice for it keeps the attention focused squarely (pardon the pun) on the details and beauty of the flower.', '2009-03-16 15:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
