(5375724, 772322, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. I absolutely love the details seen in the fur of this fox. Great coloration that really shows off the variations in shade color of this little guy. While this is a good photo, there is one factor that could boost it into the stellar category. The visible eye of the fox seems to be squinting - a wider eye would let us look more into the eye of this lively creature not to mention possibly catch some catchlights to add a twinkle. I know, I know easier said than done. In most cases you have a few seconds to just get the shot let alone perfect it;-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. I absolutely love the details seen in the fur of this fox. Great coloration that really shows off the variations in shade color of this little guy. While this is a good photo, there is one factor that could boost it into the stellar category. The visible eye of the fox seems to be squinting - a wider eye would let us look more into the eye of this lively creature not to mention possibly catch some catchlights to add a twinkle. I know, I know easier said than done. In most cases you have a few seconds to just get the shot let alone perfect it;-)', '2009-03-16 16:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5375725, 770863, 67145, '<td valign="top">brilliant shot .. love the b&amp;w .. love the drama .. just fantastic .. :)</td>', 'brilliant shot .. love the b&w .. love the drama .. just fantastic .. :)', '2009-03-16 16:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5375726, 771696, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice head-on shot of this tiger.  I like the added touch of the background and the OOF leaves in the foreground.</td>', 'Nice head-on shot of this tiger.  I like the added touch of the background and the OOF leaves in the foreground.', '2009-03-16 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
