(5375754, 771731, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Love the cool blue/violet colors upon the water and clouds. Those colors communicate serenity and tranquility. Love how you composed the shot such that the water-logged boats dominate the foreground. One can really appreciate the rough texture seen in the peeling paint of the wood. I also find the sun cresting over the mountains in the backdrop very eye catching as well. You caught it at the right time when it is caught between the mountain and clouds such that it bursts forth with a star pattern. I feel that this is an early morning vision that we are seeing as we take a stroll down to the lake. Very lovely image.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Love the cool blue/violet colors upon the water and clouds. Those colors communicate serenity and tranquility. Love how you composed the shot such that the water-logged boats dominate the foreground. One can really appreciate the rough texture seen in the peeling paint of the wood. I also find the sun cresting over the mountains in the backdrop very eye catching as well. You caught it at the right time when it is caught between the mountain and clouds such that it bursts forth with a star pattern. I feel that this is an early morning vision that we are seeing as we take a stroll down to the lake. Very lovely image.', '2009-03-16 16:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
