(5375891, 772745, 76430, '<td valign="top">This almost looks painful.  Nice pose, though I think having all of her in the shot would improve it while still being tasteful.</td>', 'This almost looks painful.  Nice pose, though I think having all of her in the shot would improve it while still being tasteful.', '2009-03-16 16:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
