(5375961, 771977, 76430, '<td valign="top">I really like the pattern of ski trails on the otherwise pristine snow of the mountain.  I also like the peak and sky background.  Now that I look really close I can see several skiers coming down with 4 of them (I think) lined up almost perfectly in a vertical line.</td>', 'I really like the pattern of ski trails on the otherwise pristine snow of the mountain.  I also like the peak and sky background.  Now that I look really close I can see several skiers coming down with 4 of them (I think) lined up almost perfectly in a vertical line.', '2009-03-16 16:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
