(5375967, 770313, 100773, '<td valign="top">I wish this was taken with a faster shutterspeed, but it''s very good as it is now. The car turning in the right side of the image is good, indicates movement in the photograph, but at the same time I would like to see the woman totally freezed. Impossible to have both at the same time unless the car drives f''in fast.</td>', 'I wish this was taken with a faster shutterspeed, but it''s very good as it is now. The car turning in the right side of the image is good, indicates movement in the photograph, but at the same time I would like to see the woman totally freezed. Impossible to have both at the same time unless the car drives f''in fast.', '2009-03-16 16:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
