(5376001, 771151, 22689, '<td valign="top">I gave this one a 9 because I think that there''s no need of a wonderful landscape or a gorgeous model to achieve a good photo, sometimes people vote what they see but not the quality.<br/>This one may look more "simple", please don''t get me wrong, I mean that there are only 3 elements : the sky, the leaf and the snail.<br/>I like it, it''s effective and well done.</td>', 'I gave this one a 9 because I think that there''s no need of a wonderful landscape or a gorgeous model to achieve a good photo, sometimes people vote what they see but not the quality.This one may look more "simple", please don''t get me wrong, I mean that there are only 3 elements : the sky, the leaf and the snail.I like it, it''s effective and well done.', '2009-03-16 16:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
