(5376869, 770903, 18197, '<td valign="top">Prague is one of the most photogenic cities in Europe. Your capture of the bridge is superb and truly does this fine city justice. The unusual angle enhances the drama of the shot and feels natural. Very nicely done!</td>', 'Prague is one of the most photogenic cities in Europe. Your capture of the bridge is superb and truly does this fine city justice. The unusual angle enhances the drama of the shot and feels natural. Very nicely done!', '2009-03-16 18:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
