(5377690, 771954, 84124, '<td valign="top">That is freakin'' cool!  Great stop action, but it begs the question, what the hell is going on here?  Two minor critiques, get your sensor cleaned!  I counted 4 obvious specs of dust.  Also, your blue sky is somewhat grainy, I''m assuming you shot at ISO1600, since this is advanced editing, do some selective noise reduction with the noise reduction software of your liking.</td>', 'That is freakin'' cool!  Great stop action, but it begs the question, what the hell is going on here?  Two minor critiques, get your sensor cleaned!  I counted 4 obvious specs of dust.  Also, your blue sky is somewhat grainy, I''m assuming you shot at ISO1600, since this is advanced editing, do some selective noise reduction with the noise reduction software of your liking.', '2009-03-16 21:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
