(5378854, 772168, 77196, '<td valign="top">Before the others were up, Tom stepped out of the cabin. Looking towards the east, the barren land was painted by the reflections of the sky and a yellow and crimson sunrise. A playful breeze tugged at his unruly hair, and he heard an owl hoot good-night to the day.</td>', 'Before the others were up, Tom stepped out of the cabin. Looking towards the east, the barren land was painted by the reflections of the sky and a yellow and crimson sunrise. A playful breeze tugged at his unruly hair, and he heard an owl hoot good-night to the day.', '2009-03-16 23:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
