(5379084, 770578, 42495, '<td valign="top">I like the bokeh, but would like to see a bit more light on the flower or whatever it is.</td>', 'I like the bokeh, but would like to see a bit more light on the flower or whatever it is.', '2009-03-16 23:35:52.000000', NULL, 1),
