(5379471, 770432, 83313, '<td valign="top">That bright area over on the left side is distracting and pulls the viewers eye away from the subject. It also seems blurred and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 4.3k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)</td>', 'That bright area over on the left side is distracting and pulls the viewers eye away from the subject. It also seems blurred and unclear. I think most of it is due to the use of excessive JPEG compression. Your file size of only 4.3k indicates a highly compressed image and that is what is robbing most of the detail and sharpness from this image. Check your compression settings when you save your file. Always adjust JPEG compression so that your file size is as large as possible, but within the challenge limit. (200k for this one)', '2009-03-17 00:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
