(5380533, 770793, 99263, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. Nice clarity and detail.<br/>You should have cropped to just above the object in the left hand bottom corner. That would have balanced the entire image perfectly because then the bridge and it''s reflection would have been perfectly in the middle of the frame. In other words the piece of sky at the top and the piece of reflected sky at the bottom would have been the same size.</td>', 'Cool shot. Nice clarity and detail.You should have cropped to just above the object in the left hand bottom corner. That would have balanced the entire image perfectly because then the bridge and it''s reflection would have been perfectly in the middle of the frame. In other words the piece of sky at the top and the piece of reflected sky at the bottom would have been the same size.', '2009-03-17 06:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
