(5380820, 772465, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - commenting on random images)<br/> <br/>Lots of detail and incredibly sharp - nice overall colour tone. Good composition but a bit disappointed you cut off the top left of the image. I gave this a 7 on my initial pass. still a 7.</td>', '(Voting completed - commenting on random images) Lots of detail and incredibly sharp - nice overall colour tone. Good composition but a bit disappointed you cut off the top left of the image. I gave this a 7 on my initial pass. still a 7.', '2009-03-17 07:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380821, 771025, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - commenting on random images)<br/> <br/>Very good use of light and dark - Good choice of exposure, even without the title this photo would be quite self explanatory. Good composition. Doesnt really have a WOW factor though. Gave this a 7 on initial voting. Still stands at a 7.</td>', '(Voting completed - commenting on random images) Very good use of light and dark - Good choice of exposure, even without the title this photo would be quite self explanatory. Good composition. Doesnt really have a WOW factor though. Gave this a 7 on initial voting. Still stands at a 7.', '2009-03-17 07:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380822, 771322, 3746, '<td valign="top">I am 70% of the way through voting and this is the winner for me.. breathtaking.. I hope this wins.<br/> <br/>Finished voting. To be honest this is still the winner. I have a feeling this was taken on a medium format such is the detail - if not then its a phenomenal shot. upping to a 10 from a 9.</td>', 'I am 70% of the way through voting and this is the winner for me.. breathtaking.. I hope this wins. Finished voting. To be honest this is still the winner. I have a feeling this was taken on a medium format such is the detail - if not then its a phenomenal shot. upping to a 10 from a 9.', '2009-03-17 07:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380823, 770692, 58683, '<td valign="top">I love the random splash of colour. Almost modern art if you squint a litte. One of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'I love the random splash of colour. Almost modern art if you squint a litte. One of my favorites for the challenge.', '2009-03-17 07:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380828, 772381, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - commenting on random images)<br/> <br/>OK, the top half of the photo is great, nice soft colours, crisp reflection. However, then we reach the bottom half and it kind of becomes an oversaturated mess. If I had edited this, I would of cropped off just at the base of the lowest post, then maybe desaturated the blue a wee bit.. readjusting vote from 6 to 5.</td>', '(Voting completed - commenting on random images) OK, the top half of the photo is great, nice soft colours, crisp reflection. However, then we reach the bottom half and it kind of becomes an oversaturated mess. If I had edited this, I would of cropped off just at the base of the lowest post, then maybe desaturated the blue a wee bit.. readjusting vote from 6 to 5.', '2009-03-17 07:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380830, 772655, 37845, '<td valign="top">Really like the ultra shallow DOF here.. good colour as well.</td>', 'Really like the ultra shallow DOF here.. good colour as well.', '2009-03-17 07:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380831, 770506, 37845, '<td valign="top">The reflections are ok, but I spend most of my time looking at the weeds towards the bottom. Perhaps if they were cropped out?!?1</td>', 'The reflections are ok, but I spend most of my time looking at the weeds towards the bottom. Perhaps if they were cropped out?!?1', '2009-03-17 07:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380832, 771677, 37845, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, and nice stop action. I would have liked it better had she been facing the camera, but the shot is still good as it is.</td>', 'Cool shot, and nice stop action. I would have liked it better had she been facing the camera, but the shot is still good as it is.', '2009-03-17 07:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380835, 772405, 37845, '<td valign="top">I went fishing this weekend myself... Ice fishing. I was a lot colder than your photo. I didnt catch anything. <br/> <br/>I like the colour in your sunset... nice pastels.</td>', 'I went fishing this weekend myself... Ice fishing. I was a lot colder than your photo. I didnt catch anything.  I like the colour in your sunset... nice pastels.', '2009-03-17 07:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380837, 770871, 37845, '<td valign="top">This shot rocks!!!! You almost have her completely out of the water. Ive never been able to train my pet whale to do tricks... you must let me know how ;)</td>', 'This shot rocks!!!! You almost have her completely out of the water. Ive never been able to train my pet whale to do tricks... you must let me know how ;)', '2009-03-17 07:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380838, 770829, 37845, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot of Venice. I like how the blue tarps stand out... great tones in the shot too.</td>', 'Sweet shot of Venice. I like how the blue tarps stand out... great tones in the shot too.', '2009-03-17 07:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380839, 770254, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)<br/> <br/>As a pro wedding photographer myself I feel you have made several mistakes with this shot. Firstly it would of benefited from seeing the brides face. Secondly, I cant really make out the expression of the grooms face so I am very detached from the image as a whole. Thirdly I would of preferred this shot with a long focal length, wide aperture lens, it would of compressed the shot a lot more and given it a nice sense of depth. Next up is the whole area of darkness at the bottom of the shot.<br/> <br/>As a whole it is a rather poor wedding shot and not something I would expect to present to a paying bride &amp; groom. Revising my vote from 5 to a 4. I hope the criticism is of benefit to you.</td>', '(Voting completed - back to comment on random images) As a pro wedding photographer myself I feel you have made several mistakes with this shot. Firstly it would of benefited from seeing the brides face. Secondly, I cant really make out the expression of the grooms face so I am very detached from the image as a whole. Thirdly I would of preferred this shot with a long focal length, wide aperture lens, it would of compressed the shot a lot more and given it a nice sense of depth. Next up is the whole area of darkness at the bottom of the shot. As a whole it is a rather poor wedding shot and not something I would expect to present to a paying bride & groom. Revising my vote from 5 to a 4. I hope the criticism is of benefit to you.', '2009-03-17 07:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380842, 772606, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)<br/> <br/>OK, I can see what you shot for here, however you didn''t quite stop the motion enough to achieve the effect I assume you was aiming for. The lighting is nice and strong, but like any shot of this type it has been seen many many times, has no WOW factor and provokes no emotions in me at all. revising my vote from a 6 to a 5</td>', '(Voting completed - back to comment on random images) OK, I can see what you shot for here, however you didn''t quite stop the motion enough to achieve the effect I assume you was aiming for. The lighting is nice and strong, but like any shot of this type it has been seen many many times, has no WOW factor and provokes no emotions in me at all. revising my vote from a 6 to a 5', '2009-03-17 08:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380846, 770930, 37845, '<td valign="top">Nice shot of the fireworks... lots of detail in the explosion.</td>', 'Nice shot of the fireworks... lots of detail in the explosion.', '2009-03-17 08:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
