(5380849, 770281, 37845, '<td valign="top">Cool dress!!!  I like everything about the picture, except the stage... but I can imagine that cropping it out would have left it too tight on the bottom. Still a nice shot overall though.</td>', 'Cool dress!!!  I like everything about the picture, except the stage... but I can imagine that cropping it out would have left it too tight on the bottom. Still a nice shot overall though.', '2009-03-17 08:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5380850, 772388, 37845, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a childhood photo of my own, where I am sitting next to my grandfather, and echoing his pose. The young boy here seems to be doing the same.</td>', 'This reminds me of a childhood photo of my own, where I am sitting next to my grandfather, and echoing his pose. The young boy here seems to be doing the same.', '2009-03-17 08:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
