(5380853, 772119, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)<br/> <br/>Original vote = 5<br/> <br/>OK, lets see. Its a technically sound image - good strong light, good composition and if we had the time to ponder over each image one could ask oneself how the boat ended up where it is, we know its probably a mundane story but one can be allowed to imagine it was beached after her crew fought in a storm at sea. Sadly there is no real WOW factor to this image and it doesnt really provoke any emotions in me, which in my view are two of the biggest points I look for in any photo.<br/> <br/>I''d imagine you are sitting on quite an average score at the moment, 5.4 to 5.6.<br/> <br/>New vote - still a 5. good luck!</td>', '(Voting completed - back to comment on random images) Original vote = 5 OK, lets see. Its a technically sound image - good strong light, good composition and if we had the time to ponder over each image one could ask oneself how the boat ended up where it is, we know its probably a mundane story but one can be allowed to imagine it was beached after her crew fought in a storm at sea. Sadly there is no real WOW factor to this image and it doesnt really provoke any emotions in me, which in my view are two of the biggest points I look for in any photo. I''d imagine you are sitting on quite an average score at the moment, 5.4 to 5.6. New vote - still a 5. good luck!', '2009-03-17 08:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
