(5380867, 772682, 79955, '<td valign="top">nope , does not hit the right note with me, sorry.<br/> <br/>Back to comment again an bumping up.<br/>On looking at this image longer, I am starting to like it more, the tones and warmth from the image is starting to grow on me. Also from the post processing, I can see the care that you have taken to retain details in the background. Sorry for the initial vote bumping up to 6</td>', 'nope , does not hit the right note with me, sorry. Back to comment again an bumping up.On looking at this image longer, I am starting to like it more, the tones and warmth from the image is starting to grow on me. Also from the post processing, I can see the care that you have taken to retain details in the background. Sorry for the initial vote bumping up to 6', '2009-03-17 08:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
