(5380870, 770492, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)<br/> <br/>Original vote = 6<br/> <br/>This is a classic pose for a family of Cheetahs so the composition is bang on. Technically its flawed in as such not all the cats are in focus, the little fella at the bottom left is WAAAY out of the area of focus, so shooting with a smaller aperture would of been of benefit- they don''t seem to be moving around too much so I am sure you could of afforded to lose a bit off shutter speed in exchange for a deeper DOF. Exposure and colours are good though. well done.<br/> <br/>Revised vote = still a 6,  well done!</td>', '(Voting completed - back to comment on random images) Original vote = 6 This is a classic pose for a family of Cheetahs so the composition is bang on. Technically its flawed in as such not all the cats are in focus, the little fella at the bottom left is WAAAY out of the area of focus, so shooting with a smaller aperture would of been of benefit- they don''t seem to be moving around too much so I am sure you could of afforded to lose a bit off shutter speed in exchange for a deeper DOF. Exposure and colours are good though. well done. Revised vote = still a 6,  well done!', '2009-03-17 08:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
