(5380893, 772054, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)<br/> <br/>Original vote = 6<br/> <br/>First off the composition is good, the symmetry pleases this OCD sufferer. Now, the only thing that lets this down a bit is the processing. To my untrained eye it looks like you have run this through a tonemapping program, maybe Photomatix? It seems the dark colours have `run` out of the roof of the chapel and stained the sky, resulting in a darkened sky that actually draws the eye more than the bright red door. However, everything else here is good, granted the shot doesnt really have a a WOW factor, but since the symmetry is rather pleasing it please a base emotion in me..<br/> <br/>Revised vote - still a 6 - well done.</td>', '(Voting completed - back to comment on random images) Original vote = 6 First off the composition is good, the symmetry pleases this OCD sufferer. Now, the only thing that lets this down a bit is the processing. To my untrained eye it looks like you have run this through a tonemapping program, maybe Photomatix? It seems the dark colours have `run` out of the roof of the chapel and stained the sky, resulting in a darkened sky that actually draws the eye more than the bright red door. However, everything else here is good, granted the shot doesnt really have a a WOW factor, but since the symmetry is rather pleasing it please a base emotion in me.. Revised vote - still a 6 - well done.', '2009-03-17 08:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
