(5380906, 772652, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)<br/>Original vote = 5<br/> <br/>OK, I am not sure why I gave this a 5 the first time around - on revisiting this image I notice the horizon isn`t straight! (I even checked in photoshop in case my eyes were uncalibrated). Secondly the photo is actually rather boring - there isnt much happening in the sky in the way of clouds, sunbeams etc and the lower half of the photo is just rather dull. Its not really telling me a story, it provokes no emotion in me and has zero WOW-factor. Also there seems to be some vignetting in the lower left corner which unbalances the image even more.<br/> <br/>Revised vote - 3</td>', '(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)Original vote = 5 OK, I am not sure why I gave this a 5 the first time around - on revisiting this image I notice the horizon isn`t straight! (I even checked in photoshop in case my eyes were uncalibrated). Secondly the photo is actually rather boring - there isnt much happening in the sky in the way of clouds, sunbeams etc and the lower half of the photo is just rather dull. Its not really telling me a story, it provokes no emotion in me and has zero WOW-factor. Also there seems to be some vignetting in the lower left corner which unbalances the image even more. Revised vote - 3', '2009-03-17 08:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
