(5380916, 771792, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)<br/> <br/>Original vote = 5<br/> <br/>OK, my one mission this year is to capture a picture of a wild barn owl. Now if this is a wild one (and I am assuming the fact it has no leg ring or jesses) then it is a great capture. Nice exposure but would of benefitted from a tiny bit more contrast and maybe a bit more sharpening. HOwever good shot overall even if it is a captive bird.<br/> <br/>Revised vote = 6</td>', '(Voting completed - back to comment on random images) Original vote = 5 OK, my one mission this year is to capture a picture of a wild barn owl. Now if this is a wild one (and I am assuming the fact it has no leg ring or jesses) then it is a great capture. Nice exposure but would of benefitted from a tiny bit more contrast and maybe a bit more sharpening. HOwever good shot overall even if it is a captive bird. Revised vote = 6', '2009-03-17 08:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
