(5380932, 772644, 3746, '<td valign="top">(Voting completed - back to comment on random images)<br/> <br/>Original vote = 5<br/> <br/>Quite an uninspiring shot to be honest, it doesnt provoke any emotinal reactions (and I am quite a sucker for good aviation shots) and has no WOW factor whatsoever. Its tightly cropped so gives us no sense of movement, size or location (except for being in the sky). There is also some sensor dust present that could of been removed, but to be honest it doesnt detract from the image overall..<br/> <br/>sadly I am going to revise my vote down on this to a 4.</td>', '(Voting completed - back to comment on random images) Original vote = 5 Quite an uninspiring shot to be honest, it doesnt provoke any emotinal reactions (and I am quite a sucker for good aviation shots) and has no WOW factor whatsoever. Its tightly cropped so gives us no sense of movement, size or location (except for being in the sky). There is also some sensor dust present that could of been removed, but to be honest it doesnt detract from the image overall.. sadly I am going to revise my vote down on this to a 4.', '2009-03-17 08:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
