(5381054, 772516, 37845, '<td valign="top">I like Elvis Costellos music.. though I dont think I have heard anything by Emmylou Harris. Decent shot... though I think its cropped a bit too tight on the top.</td>', 'I like Elvis Costellos music.. though I dont think I have heard anything by Emmylou Harris. Decent shot... though I think its cropped a bit too tight on the top.', '2009-03-17 08:56:57.000000', NULL, 1),
