(5381058, 772374, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow, great focus on the two eagles for we see some really nice details in their feathery bodies and head. While you have captured great detail, I think there are still two areas of work that can greatly improve this good shot. First, the color hues seem a tad washed out - contrast and a little saturation boosts can really shine the spotlight on this capture. The main focus is on these two majestic birds - nothing wrong with bringing us closer to fully appreciate their beauty. Cropping out the branch at the bottom will do so and <i>further increase</i> the appreciation of this photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to leave comments. Wow, great focus on the two eagles for we see some really nice details in their feathery bodies and head. While you have captured great detail, I think there are still two areas of work that can greatly improve this good shot. First, the color hues seem a tad washed out - contrast and a little saturation boosts can really shine the spotlight on this capture. The main focus is on these two majestic birds - nothing wrong with bringing us closer to fully appreciate their beauty. Cropping out the branch at the bottom will do so and further increase the appreciation of this photo.', '2009-03-17 08:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5381061, 770631, 64446, '<td valign="top">Man, you are brave hanging out that high. Greate angle. Good job!</td>', 'Man, you are brave hanging out that high. Greate angle. Good job!', '2009-03-17 08:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5381064, 770670, 37845, '<td valign="top">Awesome cave.. the darkness is brooding, and the stalactites are cool. Nice shot.</td>', 'Awesome cave.. the darkness is brooding, and the stalactites are cool. Nice shot.', '2009-03-17 08:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5381067, 770987, 71239, '<td valign="top">Great eyes, but I find leaving the ear in the crop means they are a bit too far to the right in the shot.  You could crop between the ear and the left side eye - which would give you a full image of that delicate fur with the mouth and eyes providing points of interest, whilst retaining that nice angle of the head.</td>', 'Great eyes, but I find leaving the ear in the crop means they are a bit too far to the right in the shot.  You could crop between the ear and the left side eye - which would give you a full image of that delicate fur with the mouth and eyes providing points of interest, whilst retaining that nice angle of the head.', '2009-03-17 09:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5381070, 770502, 64446, '<td valign="top">That''s a funny competitor and interesting subject. Great stopped motion, sharp, well saturated.</td>', 'That''s a funny competitor and interesting subject. Great stopped motion, sharp, well saturated.', '2009-03-17 09:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5381071, 771948, 37845, '<td valign="top">The composition here is good, but there are a few small things that could improve this photo. The horizon is a little tilted, and the colours could use a little more pop.</td>', 'The composition here is good, but there are a few small things that could improve this photo. The horizon is a little tilted, and the colours could use a little more pop.', '2009-03-17 09:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
