(5381225, 771118, 71239, '<td valign="top">Nice lead in lines with the railing and rectangular lights, followed by the round lights providing a stop-point.  I might have cropped slightly tighter on the right and top to emphasize those features &amp; I feel I''m missing a main subject at the end of the path where the light lead me to.  Of course there''s never a subject around when you need one :-)</td>', 'Nice lead in lines with the railing and rectangular lights, followed by the round lights providing a stop-point.  I might have cropped slightly tighter on the right and top to emphasize those features & I feel I''m missing a main subject at the end of the path where the light lead me to.  Of course there''s never a subject around when you need one :-)', '2009-03-17 09:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
