(5381665, 772280, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the foreground blur.  It looks like you''re in a car driving by this scene rather than going through the gate.  At the speed this looks like a good catch and a split second decision.</td>', 'I like the foreground blur.  It looks like you''re in a car driving by this scene rather than going through the gate.  At the speed this looks like a good catch and a split second decision.', '2009-03-17 10:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
