(5383463, 772602, 37845, '<td valign="top">The sun rays are nice, but I find that there is a lack of sharpness throughout the rest of the photo.</td>', 'The sun rays are nice, but I find that there is a lack of sharpness throughout the rest of the photo.', '2009-03-17 13:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
