(5383647, 772401, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 93 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 93, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>I love the really deep rich blue and green in this shot which counter each other really well. The symmetry of the shoreline is pleasing, and the shy gives just enough light to lift the image from murky obscurity. Nicely shot.<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 93 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 93, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. I love the really deep rich blue and green in this shot which counter each other really well. The symmetry of the shoreline is pleasing, and the shy gives just enough light to lift the image from murky obscurity. Nicely shot. Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 14:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383648, 771150, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1116 images, I gave 97 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 97, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Interesting perspective, I love the symmetry that the reflection provides, effectively in both directions. I would have scored this higher if there was a bit of colour/detail on the trees rather than them being silhoutted, but nonetheless a great shot. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1116 images, I gave 97 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 97, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. Interesting perspective, I love the symmetry that the reflection provides, effectively in both directions. I would have scored this higher if there was a bit of colour/detail on the trees rather than them being silhoutted, but nonetheless a great shot.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 14:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383651, 771983, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1121 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>There is something about celestial photography that I find awe-inspiring. It has intrigued my since I was very young, reading glossy books that were an Atlas of the skies, with fantastic astronomical images. I don''t believe that this is the best celestial image of the challenge (one of my 10''s went to the Cone and a Hidden Fox), but nonetheless, it''s still an excellent and inspiring image.<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1121 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. There is something about celestial photography that I find awe-inspiring. It has intrigued my since I was very young, reading glossy books that were an Atlas of the skies, with fantastic astronomical images. I don''t believe that this is the best celestial image of the challenge (one of my 10''s went to the Cone and a Hidden Fox), but nonetheless, it''s still an excellent and inspiring image. Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 14:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383652, 772028, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m totally liking this as I come back to it. I failed to comment on first pass, but it''s been at 7 and I am bumping to 8. You''ve created a quiet, understated, intensely <i>human</i> image that resonates with me. The tonalities are wonderful overall. To my eye, it looks like the face has been dodged just a little too much, it just seems a hair too light, but that''s a quibble.</td>', 'I''m totally liking this as I come back to it. I failed to comment on first pass, but it''s been at 7 and I am bumping to 8. You''ve created a quiet, understated, intensely human image that resonates with me. The tonalities are wonderful overall. To my eye, it looks like the face has been dodged just a little too much, it just seems a hair too light, but that''s a quibble.', '2009-03-17 14:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383653, 771157, 98141, '<td valign="top">Wow, the clarity and details in this are fantastic. So is the pose.</td>', 'Wow, the clarity and details in this are fantastic. So is the pose.', '2009-03-17 14:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383656, 772207, 37845, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. I would have liked it better had the person been more of a focal point.</td>', 'Interesting shot. I would have liked it better had the person been more of a focal point.', '2009-03-17 14:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383660, 770537, 61222, '<td valign="top">Amazing capture. Love the colors.</td>', 'Amazing capture. Love the colors.', '2009-03-17 14:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383662, 772512, 67343, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites, love the hot horse shoe and motion of the hands.</td>', 'One of my favorites, love the hot horse shoe and motion of the hands.', '2009-03-17 14:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383663, 772280, 30861, '<td valign="top">This one is gaining favor with me big-time. I doubt it''s scoring well for you, which is a pity, because there''s so much to love here. I''m guessing lensbaby, which is a real plus courage-wise :-) I love the intricate interleaving of sharp/soft/sharp/soft in this sweeping, emotive image. Bumping to 8.</td>', 'This one is gaining favor with me big-time. I doubt it''s scoring well for you, which is a pity, because there''s so much to love here. I''m guessing lensbaby, which is a real plus courage-wise :-) I love the intricate interleaving of sharp/soft/sharp/soft in this sweeping, emotive image. Bumping to 8.', '2009-03-17 14:09:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383664, 772371, 98141, '<td valign="top">A great shot of the tightness of the Big Apple, it really feels crowded and massive in this.</td>', 'A great shot of the tightness of the Big Apple, it really feels crowded and massive in this.', '2009-03-17 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383665, 770626, 30861, '<td valign="top">I''m just coming back to this my review, and bumping you to an 8. I love the tonalities here, and the subtle partially-desaturated look you''ve achieved. If I have a quibble, it''s that he''s just a little too central in the frame, to my eye at least. I think the dynamics would be dramatically improved if he were as little as one body-width closer to the edge. Of course, that would create issues with the upright on the back wall, and you *have* worked very succesfully to isolate him from the clutter, so it''s not a major nit for me, but...</td>', 'I''m just coming back to this my review, and bumping you to an 8. I love the tonalities here, and the subtle partially-desaturated look you''ve achieved. If I have a quibble, it''s that he''s just a little too central in the frame, to my eye at least. I think the dynamics would be dramatically improved if he were as little as one body-width closer to the edge. Of course, that would create issues with the upright on the back wall, and you *have* worked very succesfully to isolate him from the clutter, so it''s not a major nit for me, but...', '2009-03-17 14:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383666, 772513, 37845, '<td valign="top">Good environmental portrait. Nice detail in the face, and I like his expression.</td>', 'Good environmental portrait. Nice detail in the face, and I like his expression.', '2009-03-17 14:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5383667, 771825, 30861, '<td valign="top">Perfectly gorgeous, a non-typical, gritty view of the monument. Well done! <br/> <br/>It''s now bump city for you, just in the nick of time. The more I look, the better I like :-) Moving you to the 9 group, and good luck in the challenge!<br/> <br/>I think what really does it for me is the sheer incongruity (in my mind at least) of a <i>wading camel!</i></td>', 'Perfectly gorgeous, a non-typical, gritty view of the monument. Well done!  It''s now bump city for you, just in the nick of time. The more I look, the better I like :-) Moving you to the 9 group, and good luck in the challenge! I think what really does it for me is the sheer incongruity (in my mind at least) of a wading camel!', '2009-03-17 14:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
