(5383856, 770541, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 92 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 92, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Lots of sunset images in this challenge, but I like the really simplistic approach to the composition in this one. The colours look more natural too as opposed to some of the other shots where the colours have been pushed very far forward. One thing I think letting it down slightly is the apparent tilt on the horizon which I find slightly distracting. Nonetheless, a very nice image. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 92 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 92, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. Lots of sunset images in this challenge, but I like the really simplistic approach to the composition in this one. The colours look more natural too as opposed to some of the other shots where the colours have been pushed very far forward. One thing I think letting it down slightly is the apparent tilt on the horizon which I find slightly distracting. Nonetheless, a very nice image.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 14:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
