(5384357, 770189, 30861, '<td valign="top">Well, I can see LOTR for sure, but you know what else? If it weren''t for the anti-Christian backlash that would ensue, I''d have called this "Moses on Mt. Sinai" or something :-) Really nicely done. I hope you have the backstory in your photographer''s comments section. 8</td>', 'Well, I can see LOTR for sure, but you know what else? If it weren''t for the anti-Christian backlash that would ensue, I''d have called this "Moses on Mt. Sinai" or something :-) Really nicely done. I hope you have the backstory in your photographer''s comments section. 8', '2009-03-17 15:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5384358, 770571, 54033, '<td valign="top">NICE</td>', 'NICE', '2009-03-17 15:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
