(5384360, 770385, 37845, '<td valign="top">For a natural light portrait, taken at night (so it appears anyway), this shot is good. The fire, and her expression are the strengths of this shot.</td>', 'For a natural light portrait, taken at night (so it appears anyway), this shot is good. The fire, and her expression are the strengths of this shot.', '2009-03-17 15:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
