(5384364, 772479, 30861, '<td valign="top">Much stronger on second pass than first, for me. A lovely effect, great control of DOF, real old-timey feel to the light &amp; color. 8 from me.</td>', 'Much stronger on second pass than first, for me. A lovely effect, great control of DOF, real old-timey feel to the light & color. 8 from me.', '2009-03-17 15:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
