(5384506, 772538, 71239, '<td valign="top">Great snarl and some sympathetic PP to draw attention to the face.  I might have backed off the sharpening on the whiskers a little (or dulled them) so that they didn''t come out as bright white stripes - I think they detract a bit from the face and eyes - especially on his left hand side.</td>', 'Great snarl and some sympathetic PP to draw attention to the face.  I might have backed off the sharpening on the whiskers a little (or dulled them) so that they didn''t come out as bright white stripes - I think they detract a bit from the face and eyes - especially on his left hand side.', '2009-03-17 15:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5384507, 771919, 92512, '<td valign="top">Ilike the flower,but not the bug.</td>', 'Ilike the flower,but not the bug.', '2009-03-17 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5384508, 772182, 103229, '<td valign="top">would like you to have cropped it a little less on top and a little more on the left to bring the eye all the way across and back then to the eyes and face. still a strong image</td>', 'would like you to have cropped it a little less on top and a little more on the left to bring the eye all the way across and back then to the eyes and face. still a strong image', '2009-03-17 15:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
