(5384537, 772265, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 90 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 90, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Fantastic action shot, and a brilliant viewpoint and perspective. The expression on the face of the player is also really good, with his eyes firmly locked on the position of the shuttlecock. Great photo!<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 90 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 90, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. Fantastic action shot, and a brilliant viewpoint and perspective. The expression on the face of the player is also really good, with his eyes firmly locked on the position of the shuttlecock. Great photo! Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 15:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
