(5384553, 771952, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 90 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 90, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Lots of flower close-ups in this challenge, but this is one of my favourites. The black and white finish really helps the viewer focus on the form of the image, and personally I love the wispy ethereal feal to the image. Lovely shot!<br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 90 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 90, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. Lots of flower close-ups in this challenge, but this is one of my favourites. The black and white finish really helps the viewer focus on the form of the image, and personally I love the wispy ethereal feal to the image. Lovely shot! Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 16:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
