(5384814, 770417, 71239, '<td valign="top">Really well constructed shot with great interest in the different textures and colours.  The formal lines and strong colours of the building in the foreground are perfectly complimented by the stormy tones and softer texture of the sea and islands beyond.  Great shot. 9.</td>', 'Really well constructed shot with great interest in the different textures and colours.  The formal lines and strong colours of the building in the foreground are perfectly complimented by the stormy tones and softer texture of the sea and islands beyond.  Great shot. 9.', '2009-03-17 16:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
