(5384857, 771338, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 90 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 90, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Lots of nighttime cityscapes in this challenger, but this is one of my favourites... the light trails on the water add a little extra dimension. The place loks really vibrant and exciting. Nice shot. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1113 images, I gave 90 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 90, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. Lots of nighttime cityscapes in this challenger, but this is one of my favourites... the light trails on the water add a little extra dimension. The place loks really vibrant and exciting. Nice shot.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 16:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5384858, 771693, 92512, '<td valign="top">pretty photo the boat is a little distracting</td>', 'pretty photo the boat is a little distracting', '2009-03-17 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5384859, 772545, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1120 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Lots of starry night skies in this challenge but I love the duo-tone effect of this image. The stars stand out beautifully from the sky, and the water looks so tranquil. Nice shot. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1120 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. Lots of starry night skies in this challenge but I love the duo-tone effect of this image. The stars stand out beautifully from the sky, and the water looks so tranquil. Nice shot.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 16:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5384860, 771468, 41802, '<td valign="top">Very sci-fi.  Good use of light.</td>', 'Very sci-fi.  Good use of light.', '2009-03-17 16:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5384861, 772397, 101702, '<td valign="top">I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1121 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge.<br/> <br/>There are two almost identical shots of this location in this challenge, but I rate yours more highly. The colours and processing on your shot feel so much more natural (I was there myself last year on my honeymoon). I also prefer that your vantage point and framing excludes the sky, helping the viewer to focus on the horseshoe itself. <br/> <br/>Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.</td>', 'I''m hoping to leave comments on as many photo''s in this challenge as possible... out of (currently) 1121 images, I gave 98 of them an 8. Your image was one of those 98, placing you well within the top 10% for this challenge. There are two almost identical shots of this location in this challenge, but I rate yours more highly. The colours and processing on your shot feel so much more natural (I was there myself last year on my honeymoon). I also prefer that your vantage point and framing excludes the sky, helping the viewer to focus on the horseshoe itself.  Good luck for a strong finish in this challenge.', '2009-03-17 16:34:14.000000', NULL, 1),
