(5387359, 770492, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great shot! One is hard enough to capture on film, let alone a whole family, and all except momma looking at the camera (or at least your general direction).</td>', 'Great shot! One is hard enough to capture on film, let alone a whole family, and all except momma looking at the camera (or at least your general direction).', '2009-03-17 22:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387360, 771822, 80096, '<td valign="top">Dramatic! Very nicely done! 7</td>', 'Dramatic! Very nicely done! 7', '2009-03-17 22:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387361, 772620, 60047, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfully comforting expression in this beauty.</td>', 'What a wonderfully comforting expression in this beauty.', '2009-03-17 22:08:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387362, 770609, 77196, '<td valign="top">The boat slipped silently down the quiet stream, fading in and out of the mist as the silent snow-shrouded shores stood sentinel, not knowing whither it was going, nor what its purpose may be. For now, it was enough that it glided by, bothering neither shore with its stealthy passage.</td>', 'The boat slipped silently down the quiet stream, fading in and out of the mist as the silent snow-shrouded shores stood sentinel, not knowing whither it was going, nor what its purpose may be. For now, it was enough that it glided by, bothering neither shore with its stealthy passage.', '2009-03-17 22:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387363, 772236, 70270, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured some personality behind the mask.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'You''ve captured some personality behind the mask.  Excellent shot.', '2009-03-17 22:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387364, 772246, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Great colors. Perhaps a bit more shallow DOF would have blurred the power lines and background trees.</td>', 'Great action shot. Great colors. Perhaps a bit more shallow DOF would have blurred the power lines and background trees.', '2009-03-17 22:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387365, 772255, 82999, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Excellent scene, execution, etc.  Certainly one of the better lightning photographs I''ve seen.</td>', 'Love it.  Excellent scene, execution, etc.  Certainly one of the better lightning photographs I''ve seen.', '2009-03-17 22:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387366, 771322, 70270, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of that movie poster from Razor''s Edge ... beautiful scene</td>', 'Reminds me of that movie poster from Razor''s Edge ... beautiful scene', '2009-03-17 22:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387367, 771865, 77196, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color, reflections, and editing. Absolutely beautiful!</td>', 'Wonderful color, reflections, and editing. Absolutely beautiful!', '2009-03-17 22:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387368, 771236, 80096, '<td valign="top">Exellent vantage point. Great DOF! 7</td>', 'Exellent vantage point. Great DOF! 7', '2009-03-17 22:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387371, 772425, 80096, '<td valign="top">Very nice!</td>', 'Very nice!', '2009-03-17 22:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5387372, 770549, 70484, '<td valign="top">I like this photo. Not too sure about the border effect, but I like the softness of the photo. I do wish that it wasn''t cropped so close to the top of his head though. Just a personal preference.</td>', 'I like this photo. Not too sure about the border effect, but I like the softness of the photo. I do wish that it wasn''t cropped so close to the top of his head though. Just a personal preference.', '2009-03-17 22:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
