(5387407, 772722, 77196, '<td valign="top">Excellent action shot. Even if there is no motion blur at all, the lean of the bike tells you it is moving. Great colors and detail.</td>', 'Excellent action shot. Even if there is no motion blur at all, the lean of the bike tells you it is moving. Great colors and detail.', '2009-03-17 22:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
