(5387409, 772098, 77196, '<td valign="top">Awesome capture. Great color, Excellent feel of motion, but the kids'' expressions are the crown jewel. They are having a blast. I can just hear them as soon as they''re off - "can we go again? Pleeeeeaaaase!?"</td>', 'Awesome capture. Great color, Excellent feel of motion, but the kids'' expressions are the crown jewel. They are having a blast. I can just hear them as soon as they''re off - "can we go again? Pleeeeeaaaase!?"', '2009-03-17 22:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
