(5387413, 771482, 82999, '<td valign="top">Is that blue real?  Never mind, I really don''t care if it isn''t.  Great shot.</td>', 'Is that blue real?  Never mind, I really don''t care if it isn''t.  Great shot.', '2009-03-17 22:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
