(5387811, 772704, 29009, '<td valign="top">I recognize this one!  :)  I''ll say before what I said in the forums, I think the shot is trying to do too much.  The guards with their flags is one shot, the majesty of the architecture is another.  I can''t remember who you are, but I remember that you loved this shot anyway, so while I''d give this a 6 ordinarily I''m bumping to a 7 because I admire that you stuck to your guns and submitted it.</td>', 'I recognize this one!  :)  I''ll say before what I said in the forums, I think the shot is trying to do too much.  The guards with their flags is one shot, the majesty of the architecture is another.  I can''t remember who you are, but I remember that you loved this shot anyway, so while I''d give this a 6 ordinarily I''m bumping to a 7 because I admire that you stuck to your guns and submitted it.', '2009-03-17 22:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
