(5387947, 770686, 97166, '<td valign="top">Bob smacked his forehead, and wished he could turn back time.  Never, in his life, had he seen a worse bartender.  Never, in his wildest dreams, could he have imagined such an incompetent person existed.<br/> <br/>Yet here he was, in front of him, serving up the most impossibly stupid drinks while a bar full of people looked on in utter amazement at what they saw before them, and when someone ordered a Club Soda and Gin, and the idiot threw a full, unopened can into a pitcher full of premium Bombay Sapphire, it was simply the last straw.</td>', 'Bob smacked his forehead, and wished he could turn back time.  Never, in his life, had he seen a worse bartender.  Never, in his wildest dreams, could he have imagined such an incompetent person existed. Yet here he was, in front of him, serving up the most impossibly stupid drinks while a bar full of people looked on in utter amazement at what they saw before them, and when someone ordered a Club Soda and Gin, and the idiot threw a full, unopened can into a pitcher full of premium Bombay Sapphire, it was simply the last straw.', '2009-03-17 23:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
