(5387968, 770584, 97166, '<td valign="top">She sighed and smacked her head.  Why was this her lot in life?  Why had she been born the only girl into a family of five siblings?  Why did her brothers have to be so damned goofy?<br/> <br/>She lifted the camera once more, and desperately pleaded with them to just give her one, ONE shot that she could send to their parents for their birthday.  She pleaded with them to just settle down for ONE MEASLY SHOT.<br/> <br/>And, to her surprise, they seemed to capitulate. They settled down.  They gave her wonderful smiles, and she shouted with joy and lifted the camera and...<br/> <br/>... she hated her brothers.</td>', 'She sighed and smacked her head.  Why was this her lot in life?  Why had she been born the only girl into a family of five siblings?  Why did her brothers have to be so damned goofy? She lifted the camera once more, and desperately pleaded with them to just give her one, ONE shot that she could send to their parents for their birthday.  She pleaded with them to just settle down for ONE MEASLY SHOT. And, to her surprise, they seemed to capitulate. They settled down.  They gave her wonderful smiles, and she shouted with joy and lifted the camera and... ... she hated her brothers.', '2009-03-17 23:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
