(5388052, 770500, 97166, '<td valign="top">On a lazy afternoon, as the sun rode its highest point in the sky, and the dust rolled lazily in a gentle breeze, the quiet of the temple was suddenly shattered by a lone man, running in from the desert lands beyond.  Shouting the whole way, but paying no attention to the monks that sat about, he ran straight for the inner sanctum, to the High Elder within.<br/> <br/>"I found it! I found it!" he was shouting, and all were suddenly interested. What had he found? What was it that was so important? So Precious?<br/> <br/>He ran up to the elder, and held out a cloth-wrapped package to him, and with a calm serenity the elder took it from him, and began to remove the layers of cloth.  As he did, it began to steam and a scent wafted out that was familiar to all, and the Elder grinned mightily.<br/> <br/>For it was the precious Falafel Pita Wrap, and he was very hungry.<br/> <br/>The Elder was pleased.</td>', 'On a lazy afternoon, as the sun rode its highest point in the sky, and the dust rolled lazily in a gentle breeze, the quiet of the temple was suddenly shattered by a lone man, running in from the desert lands beyond.  Shouting the whole way, but paying no attention to the monks that sat about, he ran straight for the inner sanctum, to the High Elder within. "I found it! I found it!" he was shouting, and all were suddenly interested. What had he found? What was it that was so important? So Precious? He ran up to the elder, and held out a cloth-wrapped package to him, and with a calm serenity the elder took it from him, and began to remove the layers of cloth.  As he did, it began to steam and a scent wafted out that was familiar to all, and the Elder grinned mightily. For it was the precious Falafel Pita Wrap, and he was very hungry. The Elder was pleased.', '2009-03-17 23:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
