(5388059, 772501, 49578, '<td valign="top">Seeing 2 spiders fight can be interesting, but then this photo does not have much to hold my attention</td>', 'Seeing 2 spiders fight can be interesting, but then this photo does not have much to hold my attention', '2009-03-17 23:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388060, 772286, 76430, '<td valign="top">It''s a dull reflection, so I''m guessing it''s a time exposure with waves on the water.  It makes it interesting.</td>', 'It''s a dull reflection, so I''m guessing it''s a time exposure with waves on the water.  It makes it interesting.', '2009-03-17 23:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388061, 770285, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is really quite a beautiful bird shot.  Love how you go the snow just right.</td>', 'This is really quite a beautiful bird shot.  Love how you go the snow just right.', '2009-03-17 23:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388062, 772524, 49578, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. But why that expression? He looks so worried!Is that what you want to show?</td>', 'Nice lighting. But why that expression? He looks so worried!Is that what you want to show?', '2009-03-17 23:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388063, 772655, 42495, '<td valign="top">The face/head look almost human-like.  I''m not fond of the saturated red background, but this is still well done.</td>', 'The face/head look almost human-like.  I''m not fond of the saturated red background, but this is still well done.', '2009-03-17 23:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388064, 770420, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love the scene and the time exposure making the water flow really show while the leaves are sharp as a tack.</td>', 'I love the scene and the time exposure making the water flow really show while the leaves are sharp as a tack.', '2009-03-17 23:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388065, 770408, 42495, '<td valign="top">The lighting makes this photo, IMO.  I like the way your brought out detail in your pp.</td>', 'The lighting makes this photo, IMO.  I like the way your brought out detail in your pp.', '2009-03-17 23:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388066, 772133, 42495, '<td valign="top">Excellent job on the pp.</td>', 'Excellent job on the pp.', '2009-03-17 23:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388067, 772578, 49578, '<td valign="top">Probabaly some reference (background or something) could have helped to indicate that this is indeed the highest point at which the animal is standing</td>', 'Probabaly some reference (background or something) could have helped to indicate that this is indeed the highest point at which the animal is standing', '2009-03-17 23:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388069, 772151, 22689, '<td valign="top">Stunning landscape, sharp image with natural colours, excellent composition.<br/>my vote 10</td>', 'Stunning landscape, sharp image with natural colours, excellent composition.my vote 10', '2009-03-17 23:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388070, 770425, 76430, '<td valign="top">Is that a moth or a bird?  I''d like to see the focus more on it rather than the front flower or not have it in the picture.  Otherwise nice DOF and composition.</td>', 'Is that a moth or a bird?  I''d like to see the focus more on it rather than the front flower or not have it in the picture.  Otherwise nice DOF and composition.', '2009-03-17 23:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388071, 770214, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing that you might receive some comments not liking the shadows in the eyes.  I think it adds drama to an already emotionally charged image.  I don''t give out many 10''s, but you get one from me.  Great portrait that invokes a story...</td>', 'I''m guessing that you might receive some comments not liking the shadows in the eyes.  I think it adds drama to an already emotionally charged image.  I don''t give out many 10''s, but you get one from me.  Great portrait that invokes a story...', '2009-03-17 23:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
