(5388080, 770602, 49578, '<td valign="top">If the left side of the frame contains your main subject then it seems to be too dark.</td>', 'If the left side of the frame contains your main subject then it seems to be too dark.', '2009-03-17 23:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388081, 772188, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is a really beautiful scene.  Is it Japan?  Lovely colors and finishing.</td>', 'This is a really beautiful scene.  Is it Japan?  Lovely colors and finishing.', '2009-03-17 23:42:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388082, 772418, 97166, '<td valign="top">She awoke that morning, and looked around, stunned, but not entirely unsurprised.  She had known for some time that something wasn''t entirely right with the house that she had bought.  Something was strange there.  The noises she heard, the things she had glimpsed out of the corner of her eye.<br/> <br/>Yes, something wasn''t entirely right, but it hadn''t felt entirely wrong either.  So when she woke, and found herself sitting up to the touch of a fresh and fragrant breeze, in the middle of an open field, it didn''t entirely surprise her, and she somehow knew that she wasn''t in New York anymore.</td>', 'She awoke that morning, and looked around, stunned, but not entirely unsurprised.  She had known for some time that something wasn''t entirely right with the house that she had bought.  Something was strange there.  The noises she heard, the things she had glimpsed out of the corner of her eye. Yes, something wasn''t entirely right, but it hadn''t felt entirely wrong either.  So when she woke, and found herself sitting up to the touch of a fresh and fragrant breeze, in the middle of an open field, it didn''t entirely surprise her, and she somehow knew that she wasn''t in New York anymore.', '2009-03-17 23:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388083, 771563, 22689, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, vivid colours, like a patchwork with a leitmotiv.<br/>Very original !</td>', 'Nice abstract, vivid colours, like a patchwork with a leitmotiv.Very original !', '2009-03-17 23:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388084, 770280, 49578, '<td valign="top">I''m sure there must be awesome colours in this pic! Why b/w? The b/w looks good too BTW</td>', 'I''m sure there must be awesome colours in this pic! Why b/w? The b/w looks good too BTW', '2009-03-17 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388085, 772396, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is a very funny picture and title.  Is this you or a friend?</td>', 'This is a very funny picture and title.  Is this you or a friend?', '2009-03-17 23:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388086, 771322, 5475, '<td valign="top">Two landscapes in one, and it gives me a little vertigo.  What an amazing location, and you have captured it beautifully.  10 from me!</td>', 'Two landscapes in one, and it gives me a little vertigo.  What an amazing location, and you have captured it beautifully.  10 from me!', '2009-03-17 23:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388088, 771945, 49578, '<td valign="top">Really an interesting composition</td>', 'Really an interesting composition', '2009-03-17 23:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388089, 772562, 15711, '<td valign="top">She looks like Kate Winslett. :~)</td>', 'She looks like Kate Winslett. :~)', '2009-03-17 23:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388090, 771247, 76430, '<td valign="top">Excellent close-up of a garden snail.  It looks monstrous here. Very sharp.</td>', 'Excellent close-up of a garden snail.  It looks monstrous here. Very sharp.', '2009-03-17 23:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388091, 771052, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very nice Niagara Falls shot without having the falls in it.  I love the rainbow over the boat.</td>', 'Very nice Niagara Falls shot without having the falls in it.  I love the rainbow over the boat.', '2009-03-17 23:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388094, 772597, 29009, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I''m very drawn to this. Motion with the birds juxtaposed with the inaction of the guy on the bench, plus an interesting drama in the background.  This one has it all, perfect choice of black and white - awesome tonal range.  Nailed it.  10</td>', 'For some reason, I''m very drawn to this. Motion with the birds juxtaposed with the inaction of the guy on the bench, plus an interesting drama in the background.  This one has it all, perfect choice of black and white - awesome tonal range.  Nailed it.  10', '2009-03-17 23:45:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388096, 770369, 48697, '<td valign="top">very cute!</td>', 'very cute!', '2009-03-17 23:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388103, 770205, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''m not typically a fan of stylized make up shots.  The models usually have a "stare with attitude" straight at the camera.  This one really works, for me at least.  It is very interesting, but the red jewels on the lips push it beyond unexpected.  Great image, and a 10 from me!</td>', 'I''m not typically a fan of stylized make up shots.  The models usually have a "stare with attitude" straight at the camera.  This one really works, for me at least.  It is very interesting, but the red jewels on the lips push it beyond unexpected.  Great image, and a 10 from me!', '2009-03-17 23:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388104, 770254, 76430, '<td valign="top">Very peaceful scene at the end of a chaotic day I''m sure.  You can see the love between them.  I might have cropped some of the bottom to keep them from being in the middle of a square and to remove unneeded picture parts.</td>', 'Very peaceful scene at the end of a chaotic day I''m sure.  You can see the love between them.  I might have cropped some of the bottom to keep them from being in the middle of a square and to remove unneeded picture parts.', '2009-03-17 23:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388105, 770189, 97166, '<td valign="top">It had finally come to this moment, as he stood there on that peak and lifted his staff to the winds.  Finally, it had come to this confrontation with the dark force that had long been threatening these lands, and he was afraid.<br/> <br/>Afraid that his strength would not suffice.  Afraid that his test here would fail.  Afraid that the land would be covered in darkness should he fall.<br/> <br/>Yes, he was afraid, but he stood tall and faced the setting sun and gathered the energies of it into himself and faced that fear.  For he was the chosen, a mage of immense power and destiny, and if he did not prevail here, no one would.</td>', 'It had finally come to this moment, as he stood there on that peak and lifted his staff to the winds.  Finally, it had come to this confrontation with the dark force that had long been threatening these lands, and he was afraid. Afraid that his strength would not suffice.  Afraid that his test here would fail.  Afraid that the land would be covered in darkness should he fall. Yes, he was afraid, but he stood tall and faced the setting sun and gathered the energies of it into himself and faced that fear.  For he was the chosen, a mage of immense power and destiny, and if he did not prevail here, no one would.', '2009-03-17 23:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388107, 771299, 60495, '<td valign="top">IMO, this image is too busy and lack a subject to focus on, if the thorns are the subject it may work a little better to get a tighter crop and focus on fewer thorns at one time. Hope the information is helpful, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'IMO, this image is too busy and lack a subject to focus on, if the thorns are the subject it may work a little better to get a tighter crop and focus on fewer thorns at one time. Hope the information is helpful, good luck in the challenge.', '2009-03-17 23:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388108, 772655, 48697, '<td valign="top">Great macro, is this the Doc?</td>', 'Great macro, is this the Doc?', '2009-03-17 23:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388109, 770341, 76430, '<td valign="top">This window is in great shape compared to the rest of the building.  I really like how the red paint stands out against the weathered siding.</td>', 'This window is in great shape compared to the rest of the building.  I really like how the red paint stands out against the weathered siding.', '2009-03-17 23:46:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388110, 770922, 29009, '<td valign="top">It''s technically excellent, especially with the monochrome background.  She just looks really ticked, tho, and that''s not drawing me in as much as pensive might have.</td>', 'It''s technically excellent, especially with the monochrome background.  She just looks really ticked, tho, and that''s not drawing me in as much as pensive might have.', '2009-03-17 23:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388112, 772387, 5475, '<td valign="top">If you''ve seen one cool colored paper shot, you''ve seen em all... well, except for this one.  I think it is the composition you have created with the shapes and the red ball that appeals to me.  The colors are great, 10 from me!</td>', 'If you''ve seen one cool colored paper shot, you''ve seen em all... well, except for this one.  I think it is the composition you have created with the shapes and the red ball that appeals to me.  The colors are great, 10 from me!', '2009-03-17 23:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
