(5388145, 770986, 87751, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Just gorgeous. Colors are breathtaking and the composition is beautiful.  One of my top 10 in the challenge for sure.  And a 10 for sure as well.</td>', 'Love it.  Just gorgeous. Colors are breathtaking and the composition is beautiful.  One of my top 10 in the challenge for sure.  And a 10 for sure as well.', '2009-03-17 23:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388146, 770901, 76430, '<td valign="top">Stampede!  This looks like a rare find, though with the fence it appears to be a farm of preserve.  Interesting watching the behaviour.</td>', 'Stampede!  This looks like a rare find, though with the fence it appears to be a farm of preserve.  Interesting watching the behaviour.', '2009-03-17 23:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388147, 770432, 48697, '<td valign="top">Looks over exposed;-)</td>', 'Looks over exposed;-)', '2009-03-17 23:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388148, 772760, 5475, '<td valign="top">First of all, I''m a huge marble fan.  I have shot marbles in many different ways, but not this way.  I imagine you might get some comments not liking the motion blur.  I love the way it shows motion in a still photo.  I''ve seen prettier marble photos, but I love your concept and execution.  10 from me!</td>', 'First of all, I''m a huge marble fan.  I have shot marbles in many different ways, but not this way.  I imagine you might get some comments not liking the motion blur.  I love the way it shows motion in a still photo.  I''ve seen prettier marble photos, but I love your concept and execution.  10 from me!', '2009-03-17 23:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388149, 772643, 60495, '<td valign="top">Not the most exciting subject but it does have nice dimples!</td>', 'Not the most exciting subject but it does have nice dimples!', '2009-03-17 23:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388150, 772308, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like how the time exposure makes the falls look like a veil.</td>', 'I like how the time exposure makes the falls look like a veil.', '2009-03-17 23:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388151, 772063, 29011, '<td valign="top">Charming! :) This makes my top10 list. Love it all. This looks a lot like Idnic''s style, is that you? (no vote)</td>', 'Charming! :) This makes my top10 list. Love it all. This looks a lot like Idnic''s style, is that you? (no vote)', '2009-03-17 23:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388152, 770681, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice base image.  i think i would have tried to make it pop a little more with a curve adjustment, but that''s just me.</td>', 'nice base image.  i think i would have tried to make it pop a little more with a curve adjustment, but that''s just me.', '2009-03-17 23:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388153, 770284, 76430, '<td valign="top">I like the mist and the sun peaking between the trees.</td>', 'I like the mist and the sun peaking between the trees.', '2009-03-17 23:50:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388154, 771981, 23394, '<td valign="top">nicely observed, but looks a little flat.</td>', 'nicely observed, but looks a little flat.', '2009-03-17 23:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388155, 772151, 29011, '<td valign="top">What a beauty. Perfect shot on all levels. I must visit this place one day. Top10 fave. Good luck! (no vote)</td>', 'What a beauty. Perfect shot on all levels. I must visit this place one day. Top10 fave. Good luck! (no vote)', '2009-03-17 23:50:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388156, 771155, 23394, '<td valign="top">great moment.  yes, there is hope.</td>', 'great moment.  yes, there is hope.', '2009-03-17 23:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388158, 772667, 76430, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful IR shot.  It looks like snow.  I''d love to stay there.</td>', 'This is a beautiful IR shot.  It looks like snow.  I''d love to stay there.', '2009-03-17 23:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388159, 772484, 5475, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful image.  I have a Canon 100mm f2.8 macro lens that will create razor thin strips of depth of field.  I think you have used the limited DOF concept here perfectly.  It doesn''t work more often than it does, and this is one application where I love it!  10 from me!</td>', 'What a beautiful image.  I have a Canon 100mm f2.8 macro lens that will create razor thin strips of depth of field.  I think you have used the limited DOF concept here perfectly.  It doesn''t work more often than it does, and this is one application where I love it!  10 from me!', '2009-03-17 23:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388160, 770566, 29009, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  I''m glad I kept voting all the way to midnight so I could get to give this the 10 it deserves. Simply wonderful.</td>', 'Stunning.  I''m glad I kept voting all the way to midnight so I could get to give this the 10 it deserves. Simply wonderful.', '2009-03-17 23:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
