(5388180, 771892, 5475, '<td valign="top">I''m not a bird photographer, but I have tried and I have a couple of nice shots.  I''ve got just enough experience to realize how hard it is.  This capture is absolutely amazing in it''s detail, and lighting.  You must have had a great overcast day for this photo.  No glare spots on the beak or feathers, which is near impossible to control.  Well done, 10 from me!</td>', 'I''m not a bird photographer, but I have tried and I have a couple of nice shots.  I''ve got just enough experience to realize how hard it is.  This capture is absolutely amazing in it''s detail, and lighting.  You must have had a great overcast day for this photo.  No glare spots on the beak or feathers, which is near impossible to control.  Well done, 10 from me!', '2009-03-17 23:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
