(5388197, 770432, 30861, '<td valign="top">I had originally scored this 6. In retrospect, it deserves to be higher, as an absolutely pluperfect example of its genre, which, while not taken seriously by *most* DPCers, nevertheless is a valid creative expression :-) Besides which, the image absolutely IS flawless. 10 it is...</td>', 'I had originally scored this 6. In retrospect, it deserves to be higher, as an absolutely pluperfect example of its genre, which, while not taken seriously by *most* DPCers, nevertheless is a valid creative expression :-) Besides which, the image absolutely IS flawless. 10 it is...', '2009-03-17 23:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
