(5388203, 771079, 69046, '<td valign="top">Love the processing and style 10</td>', 'Love the processing and style 10', '2009-03-17 23:58:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388205, 772582, 5475, '<td valign="top">His appearance with (cataracts???) immediately makes this photo interesting.  It would be so easy for this to come across as a snapshot of a most interesting individual.  The plastic lawn chair, dirty t shirt, etc lends this image to being plain, with the exception of his eyes. However, your even lighting and post processing of his skin really makes the image, and builds character beyond his eyes.  It would appear that there is a slight halo around his hair, on the wood surface.  I don''t know if this is natural, or a soft layer mask, but everything else is flawless.  A 10 from me...</td>', 'His appearance with (cataracts???) immediately makes this photo interesting.  It would be so easy for this to come across as a snapshot of a most interesting individual.  The plastic lawn chair, dirty t shirt, etc lends this image to being plain, with the exception of his eyes. However, your even lighting and post processing of his skin really makes the image, and builds character beyond his eyes.  It would appear that there is a slight halo around his hair, on the wood surface.  I don''t know if this is natural, or a soft layer mask, but everything else is flawless.  A 10 from me...', '2009-03-17 23:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5388206, 772132, 23394, '<td valign="top">a little over the top, but then again, what about the city isn''t ;-)  nice shot.  i''ll bet you wish they had a frequent riders discount on that elevator...</td>', 'a little over the top, but then again, what about the city isn''t ;-)  nice shot.  i''ll bet you wish they had a frequent riders discount on that elevator...', '2009-03-17 23:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
