(5388208, 771859, 60495, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty harsh which makes the image way to light and the background to much of a focal point which takes away from the subject, the subject also lacks a real wow factor which is partially the lighting and partially the subject it self. The subject does have some neat layering and writing that makes me stop to study what it to figure out what it is and maybe with better lighting it could work. Hope the information helps, Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'The lighting is pretty harsh which makes the image way to light and the background to much of a focal point which takes away from the subject, the subject also lacks a real wow factor which is partially the lighting and partially the subject it self. The subject does have some neat layering and writing that makes me stop to study what it to figure out what it is and maybe with better lighting it could work. Hope the information helps, Good luck in the challenge.', '2009-03-17 23:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
