(5388238, 772704, 98186, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all of the comments!  Unfortunately, I decided to submit this photo at the last minute while I was on the way out the door to go to work.  I basically just slapped a border on there and accidentally did a low quality RAW-JPEG conversion.  This is probably why the image looks a little pixelated or out of focus.  <br/> <br/>Either way, my goal for this was to get a 5.0 or better, so I''m happy with the results.  <br/> <br/>Thank you again to all those who commented!</td>', 'Thank you for all of the comments!  Unfortunately, I decided to submit this photo at the last minute while I was on the way out the door to go to work.  I basically just slapped a border on there and accidentally did a low quality RAW-JPEG conversion.  This is probably why the image looks a little pixelated or out of focus.   Either way, my goal for this was to get a 5.0 or better, so I''m happy with the results.   Thank you again to all those who commented!', '2009-03-18 00:38:13.000000', NULL, 0),
