(5388506, 770311, 17011, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by andrewt:</b></div><hr/><i> nice effort at doing the selective desat to highlight the shape. Unfortunately the overall image has an unattractive washed out look.<br/>try bumping up the green slightly, For the B&amp;W portion , play with the contrast and make it look even more out of focus to artificially exaggerate shallow DOF. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Very helpful i tried that and it made a ton of difference Thank you for your time</td>', 'Originally posted by andrewt: nice effort at doing the selective desat to highlight the shape. Unfortunately the overall image has an unattractive washed out look.try bumping up the green slightly, For the B&W portion , play with the contrast and make it look even more out of focus to artificially exaggerate shallow DOF.   Very helpful i tried that and it made a ton of difference Thank you for your time', '2009-03-18 03:07:13.000000', NULL, 0),
