(5388612, 770620, 42125, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments.<br/>This is indeed a tradition in Vestmannaeyjar, Iceland. A huge bonfire where the local firedepartment controls the fire and are ready to put it out if something happens. The fiest is always held the first weekend in August.</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments.This is indeed a tradition in Vestmannaeyjar, Iceland. A huge bonfire where the local firedepartment controls the fire and are ready to put it out if something happens. The fiest is always held the first weekend in August.', '2009-03-18 04:06:29.000000', NULL, 0),
