(5388624, 772370, 32132, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments everyone! I have always been afraid to enter ~but it wasn''t as painful as I thought! I''ve not edited this way with a "high-key" /"cross process" before, so it was new to me. It''s interesting how the objective eyes pick up on things I hadn''t even noticed! I had one with her smiling, but it didn''t seem to be as interesting....Thanks againg for all the feedback!</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments everyone! I have always been afraid to enter ~but it wasn''t as painful as I thought! I''ve not edited this way with a "high-key" /"cross process" before, so it was new to me. It''s interesting how the objective eyes pick up on things I hadn''t even noticed! I had one with her smiling, but it didn''t seem to be as interesting....Thanks againg for all the feedback!', '2009-03-18 04:15:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388625, 771825, 68504, '<td valign="top">DPC is such a puzzle.  I am surprised this didn''t ribbon;  on the other hand, considering what seems to be the ribbon taste, I have to be pleased this did as well as it did.  It simply crowns all the reading I have been doing about the history of India, including the present day.  In any case this will live longer than the others.</td>', 'DPC is such a puzzle.  I am surprised this didn''t ribbon;  on the other hand, considering what seems to be the ribbon taste, I have to be pleased this did as well as it did.  It simply crowns all the reading I have been doing about the history of India, including the present day.  In any case this will live longer than the others.', '2009-03-18 04:16:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388626, 772520, 79955, '<td valign="top">Super shot Robert, This is just brilliant.</td>', 'Super shot Robert, This is just brilliant.', '2009-03-18 04:17:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388628, 770311, 85578, '<td valign="top">"I wonder if he got as much negative unhelpful snarky comments as he gave me."<br/>comment form one of my previous challenges..<br/> <br/>gee Stu.. .okay it was negative but I couldnt explain it... you know what? I will mark the things I dont like in red and post it on other portal and send you link, maybe you will understand... <br/> <br/>top lef spike ... you can clearly see there that wrong postprocessing there is green colour to be seen over it . I dont know how where you doing this selective colour but its wrong. and you can clearly see the boundaries of the green heart too.. its nice idea but not very well performed. there is another unidentified line on the left side and the bw conversion is flat. I didnt want to insult you or to be rude, Im just trying to explain you that the initial purpose wasnt achieved ... <br/> <br/>have a great day ;)<br/>brano</td>', '"I wonder if he got as much negative unhelpful snarky comments as he gave me."comment form one of my previous challenges.. gee Stu.. .okay it was negative but I couldnt explain it... you know what? I will mark the things I dont like in red and post it on other portal and send you link, maybe you will understand...  top lef spike ... you can clearly see there that wrong postprocessing there is green colour to be seen over it . I dont know how where you doing this selective colour but its wrong. and you can clearly see the boundaries of the green heart too.. its nice idea but not very well performed. there is another unidentified line on the left side and the bw conversion is flat. I didnt want to insult you or to be rude, Im just trying to explain you that the initial purpose wasnt achieved ...  have a great day ;)brano', '2009-03-18 04:20:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388630, 772713, 68504, '<td valign="top">Such a sweet play on lines.</td>', 'Such a sweet play on lines.', '2009-03-18 04:21:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388631, 771322, 101702, '<td valign="top">Heh, it seems I was indeed half a planet away with my guess on the location. Congrats on the blue. Although I only gave this a 9 initially, with hindsight and on further views I should have stuck my neck out and gone for the 10. <br/> <br/>To get a blue against such a massive entry is an awesome achievement. Well done!</td>', 'Heh, it seems I was indeed half a planet away with my guess on the location. Congrats on the blue. Although I only gave this a 9 initially, with hindsight and on further views I should have stuck my neck out and gone for the 10.  To get a blue against such a massive entry is an awesome achievement. Well done!', '2009-03-18 04:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388632, 770177, 99710, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone who voted , commented and made this photo a favorite.<br/> <br/>Here''s the story behind the photo:<br/> <br/>This photo was taken during an Outreach Activity of my choir group at Barrio Puray, a remote barrio in the Municipality of Rodriguez, Rizal Province Philippines. We often go there to give this poor families some grocery items, used clothing, toys, books &amp; other school supplies.<br/> <br/>I saw these two little kids observing us after we arrived and while preparing to distribute the relief goods. <br/> <br/>I took some snapshots, I was captured by the boys look, it''s later on that I realize that they were holding on a barb wire. <br/> <br/>Our group really hoped that we gave these kids a small reason to smile after we gave them something, in a few weeks time we''re going back there to give more than 100 kids school supplies and slippers.<br/> <br/>Again, thanks for the views and votes.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone who voted , commented and made this photo a favorite. Here''s the story behind the photo: This photo was taken during an Outreach Activity of my choir group at Barrio Puray, a remote barrio in the Municipality of Rodriguez, Rizal Province Philippines. We often go there to give this poor families some grocery items, used clothing, toys, books & other school supplies. I saw these two little kids observing us after we arrived and while preparing to distribute the relief goods.  I took some snapshots, I was captured by the boys look, it''s later on that I realize that they were holding on a barb wire.  Our group really hoped that we gave these kids a small reason to smile after we gave them something, in a few weeks time we''re going back there to give more than 100 kids school supplies and slippers. Again, thanks for the views and votes.', '2009-03-18 04:21:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388635, 771858, 85578, '<td valign="top">thx for comments ;)</td>', 'thx for comments ;)', '2009-03-18 04:24:19.000000', NULL, 0),
