(5388640, 771836, 101702, '<td valign="top">Oooohhhh, so sorry you didn''t ribbon for this awesome shot. I gave it a 10, and had it pegged for the blue.</td>', 'Oooohhhh, so sorry you didn''t ribbon for this awesome shot. I gave it a 10, and had it pegged for the blue.', '2009-03-18 04:28:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388641, 771322, 67237, '<td valign="top">Huge congrats on achieving this fantastic result, a blue ribbon with a 7.6+ score in a 1000+ entries challenge !!!<br/> <br/>I am SO GLAD you won it with a shot taken in my country. Some people was expecting to have an Icelandic landscape in the front page, and you put Peru on it!!! :-) <br/> <br/>Let me add a little publicity to my country and say that not only Johana''s (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=96751" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">tanguera</a>)image <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=770764" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_770764.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_770764.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_770764.jpg"/></a> was taken in Peru, but also  <br/>Dave''s (<img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=67961" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">davemce</a>)image <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=770566" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_770566.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_770566.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_770566.jpg"/></a> <br/>and of course mine <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=772558" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_772558.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_772558.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1005/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_772558.jpg"/></a>. <br/>The last two were taken in the same valley (Sacred Valley of Urubamba), and amazingly enough, even when dates are approx 17 months apart, you can identify very similar color palettes, and even the donkeys seem to be the same :-).<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-18 20:54:50.</i></td>', 'Huge congrats on achieving this fantastic result, a blue ribbon with a 7.6+ score in a 1000+ entries challenge !!! I am SO GLAD you won it with a shot taken in my country. Some people was expecting to have an Icelandic landscape in the front page, and you put Peru on it!!! :-)  Let me add a little publicity to my country and say that not only Johana''s ( tanguera)image  was taken in Peru, but also  Dave''s ( davemce)image  and of course mine . The last two were taken in the same valley (Sacred Valley of Urubamba), and amazingly enough, even when dates are approx 17 months apart, you can identify very similar color palettes, and even the donkeys seem to be the same :-).', '2009-03-18 04:28:37.000000', '2009-03-18 20:54:50.000000', 0),
