(5388678, 772377, 68546, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments and votes. The flare and dust spots in this shot were intentional and so that''s why they weren''t cloned out. I wanted a dramatic gym type feel to it and I think (personally) they add to the shot, but I appreciate the comments.<br/> <br/>Also I''m surprised at the number of Adidas comments, it''s not a Nike ad I simply used their slogan for the title. But again thanks all the same :0) <br/> <br/>I''m pleased this made it close to my average, so thanks again</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments and votes. The flare and dust spots in this shot were intentional and so that''s why they weren''t cloned out. I wanted a dramatic gym type feel to it and I think (personally) they add to the shot, but I appreciate the comments. Also I''m surprised at the number of Adidas comments, it''s not a Nike ad I simply used their slogan for the title. But again thanks all the same :0)  I''m pleased this made it close to my average, so thanks again', '2009-03-18 04:57:48.000000', NULL, 0),
