(5388735, 772200, 47483, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pug-H:</b></div><hr/><i> I lived in Kumamoto, not far from Aso, twenty years ago. I guess these are more recent creations. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>yes it seems it is new addition. <br/> <br/>One of my friend (kathy - she is american, living in oita) suggested me to visit this place. But due to time problems we could not make it. <br/> <br/>Weather was very bad and we were unsuccessfully returning back from mount Aso. I was thinking that i missed this place and suddenly my wife spotted it. <br/> <br/>In my photo weather look pretty good but actually it was so bad that you could not even see around. And it was raining (little bit). <br/> <br/>I will try to upload original if i get time. <br/> <br/>Anyway very good experience visiting Aso. If possible will go there again.<br/>----------<br/> <br/>Here is a link to original<br/> <br/><a href="//farm4.static.flickr.com/3606/3365410338_92b8edfec5_b.jpg" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//farm4.static.flickr.com/3606/3365410338_92b8edfec5_b.jpg</a> <br/> <br/>You could see that things were pretty bad (lightwise). <br/> <br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-18 08:04:06.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Pug-H: I lived in Kumamoto, not far from Aso, twenty years ago. I guess these are more recent creations.   yes it seems it is new addition.  One of my friend (kathy - she is american, living in oita) suggested me to visit this place. But due to time problems we could not make it.  Weather was very bad and we were unsuccessfully returning back from mount Aso. I was thinking that i missed this place and suddenly my wife spotted it.  In my photo weather look pretty good but actually it was so bad that you could not even see around. And it was raining (little bit).  I will try to upload original if i get time.  Anyway very good experience visiting Aso. If possible will go there again.---------- Here is a link to original //farm4.static.flickr.com/3606/3365410338_92b8edfec5_b.jpg  You could see that things were pretty bad (lightwise).  ', '2009-03-18 05:41:11.000000', '2009-03-18 08:04:06.000000', 0),
