(5388793, 771727, 57763, '<td valign="top"><i>[i]<u><b>The Good, the Bad &amp; Ugly of DPChallenge:</b></u></i>[/i]<br/> <br/><b>Good</b>: Someone who obviously understands that photography doesn''t have to be taken too seriously. thank you to  <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=83313" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Yo_Spiff</a> <br/> <br/><b>Bad</b> (not really! :) more insightful): Someone who gets it. thank you to <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30791" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Fetor</a> <br/> <br/><b>Ugly</b>: Someone who may never understand.    <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=101207" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">FranzDavis</a>  Now we know why some mammals eat their own young......<br/> <br/>thank you to all for the votes, views and comments<br/>K<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-18 06:52:28.</i></td>', '[i]The Good, the Bad & Ugly of DPChallenge:[/i] Good: Someone who obviously understands that photography doesn''t have to be taken too seriously. thank you to   Yo_Spiff  Bad (not really! :) more insightful): Someone who gets it. thank you to  Fetor  Ugly: Someone who may never understand.     FranzDavis  Now we know why some mammals eat their own young...... thank you to all for the votes, views and commentsK', '2009-03-18 06:25:25.000000', '2009-03