(5388851, 771690, 11467, '<td valign="top">I agree with HotPasta.<br/>Also the dirt around her right eye is detracting from the image. <br/>The crop is very good and the stare and catchlights in the eyes are also excellent.<br/>If it was sharper, had less grain, and had a little more contrast it could have scored much better.<br/> <br/>I gave it a 6 by the way.<br/></td>', 'I agree with HotPasta.Also the dirt around her right eye is detracting from the image. The crop is very good and the stare and catchlights in the eyes are also excellent.If it was sharper, had less grain, and had a little more contrast it could have scored much better. I gave it a 6 by the way.', '2009-03-18 07:00:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388852, 770211, 34192, '<td valign="top">It really surprises me (no, honestly it doesn''t any more) that this ended up so far below all those lifeless, over saturated, landscapes.  this was one of the top 10 images of the competition.  Votes value pretty over sublime.  Your notes hit it right on the head.  This is the perfect edit of a perfect image.  Keep on - I much prefer your take on the world than the DPC consensus.</td>', 'It really surprises me (no, honestly it doesn''t any more) that this ended up so far below all those lifeless, over saturated, landscapes.  this was one of the top 10 images of the competition.  Votes value pretty over sublime.  Your notes hit it right on the head.  This is the perfect edit of a perfect image.  Keep on - I much prefer your take on the world than the DPC consensus.', '2009-03-18 07:00:29.000000', NULL, 0),
