(5388855, 772421, 30791, '<td valign="top">You got absolutely slammed! Im actually pissed this wasnt in the top 20. I was pleased however that my favorite shot youve ever taken just so happens to be this one. Just goes to show people vote down what they can not achieve themselves. f*cking haters</td>', 'You got absolutely slammed! Im actually pissed this wasnt in the top 20. I was pleased however that my favorite shot youve ever taken just so happens to be this one. Just goes to show people vote down what they can not achieve themselves. f*cking haters', '2009-03-18 07:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5388858, 770231, 99263, '<td valign="top">Congratz. 10th place? I commented that this was the only 10 I gave and for me this was the winner.<br/>Still a worthy place to finish in the top 10 out of more then 1000 entries. :)<br/>Ironic really... I see you only gave 1 TEN yourself in this challenge and that was to the image that actually won.<br/> <br/>My Comment:<br/>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------<br/>Wonderfully enchanting image. I love the almost mystical atmosphere that this image exudes. Lovely play of light and beautiful softness. Superb. 10<br/> <br/>Ps. I have given 13 nine''s and this is the only 10 I have given in this challenge. This is for me my personal favorite. This image just has that something extra imo over the very excellent images that I gave a 9 to.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-18 07:10:27.</i></td>', 'Congratz. 10th place? I commented that this was the only 10 I gave and for me this was the winner.Still a worthy place to finish in the top 10 out of more then 1000 entries. :)Ironic really... I see you only gave 1 TEN yourself in this challenge and that was to the image that actually won. My Comment:-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------Wonderfully enchanting image. I love the almost mystical atmosphere that this image exudes. Lovely play of light and beautiful softness. Superb. 10 Ps. I have given 13 nine''s and this is the only 10 I have given in this challenge. This is for me my personal favorite. This image just has that something extra imo over the very excellent images that I gave a 9 to.', '2009-03-18 07:04:55.000000', '2009-03-18 07:10:27.000000', 0),
(5388860, 772537, 34192, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You know, a train adds even more interest to this shot.  Ignore the score - this is an amazing image, though under-appreciated by the DPC masses.  Its not a sunset.  Keep the colors - they add to the chaos and the real life feeling.  Maximally underrated, you honestly deserved better.  Maybe if some of the voters stopped and looked and actualy thought about it for a while, they would see the beauty...</td>', 'Wow.  You know, a train adds even more interest to this shot.  Ignore the score - this is an amazing image, though under-appreciated by the DPC masses.  Its not a sunset.  Keep the colors - they add to the chaos and the real life feeling.  Maximally underrated, you honestly deserved better.  Maybe if some of the voters stopped and looked and actualy thought about it for a while, they would see the beauty...', '2009-03-18 07:06:42.000000', NULL, 0),
