(5388907, 772417, 33535, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> We know, of course, that it''s not ACTUAL film because the image extends beyond the sprocket holes and that''s not possible.<br/></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>i think it is!<br/>so is it a film image or just photoshopped?<br/>cool scene btw.<br/> <br/>eta: just noticed this was taken in reykholt?! i''ve lived there for almost a year!<br/>could be the other reykholt near strokkur though...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-18 07:31:11.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: We know, of course, that it''s not ACTUAL film because the image extends beyond the sprocket holes and that''s not possible.  i think it is!so is it a film image or just photoshopped?cool scene btw. eta: just noticed this was taken in reykholt?! i''ve lived there for almost a year!could be the other reykholt near strokkur though...', '2009-03-18 07:28:36.000000', '2009-03-18 07:31:11.000000', 0),
