(5388984, 770211, 66193, '<td valign="top">I cannot believe how this ended up :(  I gave this a 10 during voting, and made it a fave on the spot.  It is such a fantastic image in so many ways.  I just saw your comment about leaving this crazy DPC world for a while.  You couldn''t have gone out on a better image!  I hope our paths cross again in the future.  Best of luck to you, Tim, and God Bless.</td>', 'I cannot believe how this ended up :(  I gave this a 10 during voting, and made it a fave on the spot.  It is such a fantastic image in so many ways.  I just saw your comment about leaving this crazy DPC world for a while.  You couldn''t have gone out on a better image!  I hope our paths cross again in the future.  Best of luck to you, Tim, and God Bless.', '2009-03-18 08:12:37.000000', NULL, 0),
