(5389071, 770554, 63499, '<td valign="top">I forgot to add comments when I uploaded the photo and now I can''t figure out how to go back and add them....<br/> <br/>This is a favorite of mine because this is her - bright, colorful, loud and always wearing mismatching things. Her skin and hair are very fair and can be a challenge for me, and on this day, I felt that I had finally gotten them right without being too overexposed.<br/> <br/>Post challenge comments -<br/> <br/>Thank you for all of the comments and suggestions! Based on some of the comments, I''m guessing my monitor is a little darker than everyone''s though. :)<br/></td>', 'I forgot to add comments when I uploaded the photo and now I can''t figure out how to go back and add them.... This is a favorite of mine because this is her - bright, colorful, loud and always wearing mismatching things. Her skin and hair are very fair and can be a challenge for me, and on this day, I felt that I had finally gotten them right without being too overexposed. Post challenge comments - Thank you for all of the comments and suggestions! Based on some of the comments, I''m guessing my monitor is a little darker than everyone''s though. :)', '2009-03-18 08:54:28.000000', NULL, 0),
