(5389117, 772387, 29490, '<td valign="top">Fifteen 1''s???? What the??  Still, good finish for a nice photo!  eta - I didn''t see the thread about this until after I made this comment.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-18 09:23:34.</i></td>', 'Fifteen 1''s???? What the??  Still, good finish for a nice photo!  eta - I didn''t see the thread about this until after I made this comment.', '2009-03-18 09:17:18.000000', '2009-03-18 09:23:34.000000', 0),
