(5389129, 770863, 61961, '<td valign="top">Great job.  I know the building and assumed the photographer lived in NYC, but I should have recognized the beautiful tone work as yours!  Remarkable how much the photo is complemented by using the letterbox frame.</td>', 'Great job.  I know the building and assumed the photographer lived in NYC, but I should have recognized the beautiful tone work as yours!  Remarkable how much the photo is complemented by using the letterbox frame.', '2009-03-18 09:21:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389130, 772558, 70661, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! Going into my favs!</td>', 'This is beautiful! Going into my favs!', '2009-03-18 09:21:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389132, 772014, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh Sandy!  Are you going to do a book on a collection of faces?  If so, I must have it lol.  That would be an amazing thing to have.  Where is your story for this gentleman?  I love coming to read those.  (I feel like I have seen a similar photo before - maybe the story is there?)  Beautiful capture of his eyes.  They totally speak for the picture.  Congrats on a great job!</td>', 'Oh Sandy!  Are you going to do a book on a collection of faces?  If so, I must have it lol.  That would be an amazing thing to have.  Where is your story for this gentleman?  I love coming to read those.  (I feel like I have seen a similar photo before - maybe the story is there?)  Beautiful capture of his eyes.  They totally speak for the picture.  Congrats on a great job!', '2009-03-18 09:23:22.000000', NULL, 0),
