(5389159, 771482, 67697, '<td valign="top">Fascinating.  When I think of icebergs, Argentina is not the first place that comes to mind.  I had no idea you could see them there!  Beautiful capture of the blue.  It must be amazing to see this in person.</td>', 'Fascinating.  When I think of icebergs, Argentina is not the first place that comes to mind.  I had no idea you could see them there!  Beautiful capture of the blue.  It must be amazing to see this in person.', '2009-03-18 09:34:20.000000', NULL, 0),
