(5389177, 772111, 67579, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AGrigorof:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t think the frame works too well; it detracts the attention from the tree line and the main subject. The roots themselves lack any details and they are too messy to be an elegant silhouette. <b>I''ve tried some roots myself, a while ago, and people didn''t like them :( - a 6 from me, just for that.</b> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>So you are saying you would have given a higher score but someone else in some other challenge didn''t like your entry so now anything with roots in it you will penalize because of this?</td>', 'Originally posted by AGrigorof: I don''t think the frame works too well; it detracts the attention from the tree line and the main subject. The roots themselves lack any details and they are too messy to be an elegant silhouette. I''ve tried some roots myself, a while ago, and people didn''t like them :( - a 6 from me, just for that.   So you are saying you would have given a higher score but someone else in some other challenge didn''t like your entry so now anything with roots in it you will penalize because of this?', '2009-03-18 09:41:08.000000', NULL, 0),
