(5389208, 772098, 67697, '<td valign="top">yay!  It''s great to see a photo from you again.  I took a picture like this of my kids too - not easy to do.  What a great way to capture a moment of pure exhiliration!  I''m curious tho, were you in a seat facing them or did you just hang your camera up and hope for the best? lol  Fun shot!</td>', 'yay!  It''s great to see a photo from you again.  I took a picture like this of my kids too - not easy to do.  What a great way to capture a moment of pure exhiliration!  I''m curious tho, were you in a seat facing them or did you just hang your camera up and hope for the best? lol  Fun shot!', '2009-03-18 09:52:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389211, 770770, 67697, '<td valign="top">Terry, this is awesome!  The processing is perfect - it beautifully captures his "character".  So did he win the election?  hehe.</td>', 'Terry, this is awesome!  The processing is perfect - it beautifully captures his "character".  So did he win the election?  hehe.', '2009-03-18 09:55:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389213, 771373, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is fascinating!  Tell me more!  I want to know what is going on here.  lol I would have thought you were on some voodoo island instead of NJ.  Of course, maybe NJ is some voodoo island (never been there - so what do I know?)  hehe.  Such a captivating image... great job.</td>', 'This is fascinating!  Tell me more!  I want to know what is going on here.  lol I would have thought you were on some voodoo island instead of NJ.  Of course, maybe NJ is some voodoo island (never been there - so what do I know?)  hehe.  Such a captivating image... great job.', '2009-03-18 09:57:37.000000', NULL, 0),
