(5389238, 772765, 67697, '<td valign="top">Good for you for avoiding the DPC pretty stuff and putting in what you want.  This is great because it represents life, captured!  Of course it''s a dog''s life, but I''m an animal lover and I understand that.  What happened to the puppy?  Why only one paw bandaged?  Thanks for posting a photo that makes you stop and wonder  :)</td>', 'Good for you for avoiding the DPC pretty stuff and putting in what you want.  This is great because it represents life, captured!  Of course it''s a dog''s life, but I''m an animal lover and I understand that.  What happened to the puppy?  Why only one paw bandaged?  Thanks for posting a photo that makes you stop and wonder  :)', '2009-03-18 10:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
