(5389307, 772204, 67697, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think there was any desat, or at least not too much.  I think it''s a great photo.  I think if you toned down the red you would find that THEN, you had a cold photo.  The red adds life to the stone cold structure.  I think it''s a very interesting contrast you captured here.  Beautiful shot of detail and symmetry - and yes, this seems a little different for you.  Great job!  :)</td>', 'I didn''t think there was any desat, or at least not too much.  I think it''s a great photo.  I think if you toned down the red you would find that THEN, you had a cold photo.  The red adds life to the stone cold structure.  I think it''s a very interesting contrast you captured here.  Beautiful shot of detail and symmetry - and yes, this seems a little different for you.  Great job!  :)', '2009-03-18 10:33:44.000000', NULL, 0),
