(5389321, 772303, 76430, '<td valign="top">After seeing your comments in the gripe thread I came here to look at it.  This was among the 75% I never got to, but I probably would not have rated it as highly as the others because for a splash shot I can barely see a splash.  Yes, the blueberry is incredibly detailed, but the milk shows very little detail.  People like the crown effect of splash shots.  A technical question; is this a double blueberry drop?  It appears the hole in the milk is ahead of the blueberry as if there was another blueberry an inch ahead.</td>', 'After seeing your comments in the gripe thread I came here to look at it.  This was among the 75% I never got to, but I probably would not have rated it as highly as the others because for a splash shot I can barely see a splash.  Yes, the blueberry is incredibly detailed, but the milk shows very little detail.  People like the crown effect of splash shots.  A technical question; is this a double blueberry drop?  It appears the hole in the milk is ahead of the blueberry as if there was another blueberry an inch ahead.', '2009-03-18 10:38:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389331, 771153, 67697, '<td valign="top">Roz, I think about the days where you used to wonder about how to do better here and since then, you''ve taken off like a rocket and have figured it all out.  I hate bugs but this is an amazing piece.  I love how it really is sitting there and posing for you.  The light and clarity on the eyes is amazing, and this looks perfect in black and white.  Congrats on an amazing finish in this challenge!</td>', 'Roz, I think about the days where you used to wonder about how to do better here and since then, you''ve taken off like a rocket and have figured it all out.  I hate bugs but this is an amazing piece.  I love how it really is sitting there and posing for you.  The light and clarity on the eyes is amazing, and this looks perfect in black and white.  Congrats on an amazing finish in this challenge!', '2009-03-18 10:43:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389333, 771926, 67237, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the deserved ribbon on your first valid entry!!<br/>Just make sure about the date, because according to the info you entered the shot has not been taken yet :-)</td>', 'Congrats on the deserved ribbon on your first valid entry!!Just make sure about the date, because according to the info you entered the shot has not been taken yet :-)', '2009-03-18 10:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
