(5389390, 772631, 62357, '<td valign="top">When I saw this I thought it must have been from the Sofitel on Chestnut!  I stayed there last year twice and thought the view was amazing.  I myself lived in Chicago for 6 years. You commented on my photo, which was taken from the top of the Hancock.  Sorry this didn''t do better.</td>', 'When I saw this I thought it must have been from the Sofitel on Chestnut!  I stayed there last year twice and thought the view was amazing.  I myself lived in Chicago for 6 years. You commented on my photo, which was taken from the top of the Hancock.  Sorry this didn''t do better.', '2009-03-18 11:14:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389392, 771130, 89669, '<td valign="top">I would like to thank everyone for all of their wonderful comments during the challenge. While I didn''t do as well as I had hoped, it could have always been worse. I fought back and forth about what photo to enter for this and while I think the ither one might have done a little better, I wanted to submit something unique. The other photo was of the Painted Hills in Oregon. You can see it here:<br/> <br/>//photo.net/photodb/photo?photo_id=8576066<br/> <br/>Please feel free to ask me any questions regarding the photos. I am happy to answer them. All of the post processing for the challenge photo was done in lightroom.</td>', 'I would like to thank everyone for all of their wonderful comments during the challenge. While I didn''t do as well as I had hoped, it could have always been worse. I fought back and forth about what photo to enter for this and while I think the ither one might have done a little better, I wanted to submit something unique. The other photo was of the Painted Hills in Oregon. You can see it here: //photo.net/photodb/photo?photo_id=8576066 Please feel free to ask me any questions regarding the photos. I am happy to answer them. All of the post processing for the challenge photo was done in lightroom.', '2009-03-18 11:16:34.000000', NULL, 0),
