(5389415, 771861, 3746, '<td valign="top">Just noticed its a little Piper PA-38 Tomahawk, when I used to have flying lessons thats what we started in (sadly too expensive to keep up)..  ALthough in the pilot fraternity it was more widely known as the Trauma-hawk...<br/> <br/>Thanks for the story, glad to know everyone was OK.</td>', 'Just noticed its a little Piper PA-38 Tomahawk, when I used to have flying lessons thats what we started in (sadly too expensive to keep up)..  ALthough in the pilot fraternity it was more widely known as the Trauma-hawk... Thanks for the story, glad to know everyone was OK.', '2009-03-18 11:27:08.000000', NULL, 0),
