(5389519, 772703, 100301, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the nice comments, it wasn''t HDR though...   The tight crop is because there is a skating rink and an apartment building right behind it.  I wish it was open and rolling fields, but I work with what I got...  :-)</td>', 'Thanks for all the nice comments, it wasn''t HDR though...   The tight crop is because there is a skating rink and an apartment building right behind it.  I wish it was open and rolling fields, but I work with what I got...  :-)', '2009-03-18 12:07:58.000000', NULL, 0),
