(5389717, 771019, 99263, '<td valign="top">Did you look at the site and the photo I gave a link to? Here is the link to the Guru''s official site. It''s just that your father resembles him in a way facially.  Your father looks such a happy man, so content and with such a beautiful happy smile.<br/>The guru was revered and loved by many in his lifetime. I just thought it might interest you to know of this man. Your dad''s actually got a much nicer smile then what the guru displays in his photo''s.<br/><a href="//neemkarolibaba.com/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//neemkarolibaba.com/</a></td>', 'Did you look at the site and the photo I gave a link to? Here is the link to the Guru''s official site. It''s just that your father resembles him in a way facially.  Your father looks such a happy man, so content and with such a beautiful happy smile.The guru was revered and loved by many in his lifetime. I just thought it might interest you to know of this man. Your dad''s actually got a much nicer smile then what the guru displays in his photo''s.//neemkarolibaba.com/', '2009-03-18 13:13:13.000000', NULL, 0),
