(5389741, 772710, 30982, '<td valign="top">Way WAY better than your other consideration.  Heck, even *I* can take a good tourist shot with the best of them sometimes, but it takes both a good photog and a good dad to get an angelic picture of a beautiful girl!  Means a lot more, too, I''d wager.</td>', 'Way WAY better than your other consideration.  Heck, even *I* can take a good tourist shot with the best of them sometimes, but it takes both a good photog and a good dad to get an angelic picture of a beautiful girl!  Means a lot more, too, I''d wager.', '2009-03-18 13:21:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389743, 771863, 62357, '<td valign="top">Deb, so happy this scored so high.  Should have been the blue ribbon as it truly sums up in a frame what DPC is all about.  Fun and friends.</td>', 'Deb, so happy this scored so high.  Should have been the blue ribbon as it truly sums up in a frame what DPC is all about.  Fun and friends.', '2009-03-18 13:22:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389744, 772168, 11843, '<td valign="top">I apologize for not commenting during voting - time was limited.  Excellent handling of the bright sky versus the dark terrain. Super job, great contest placement, Congrats! Cheers....Martin</td>', 'I apologize for not commenting during voting - time was limited.  Excellent handling of the bright sky versus the dark terrain. Super job, great contest placement, Congrats! Cheers....Martin', '2009-03-18 13:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389745, 771106, 5112, '<td valign="top">Melanie, this so so absolutely beautiful (although I am biased, hehe).  You did a wonderful job with this image, I love the play of sharp/not sharp, and the contrast between the golden seed pods and the clear blue/greens pink/purples in the background.  <br/> <br/>I have been considering using a 50mm reversed, and after seeing this I will definitely try it now (after I buy the reversing ring).  So now you can count yourself as being inspiration for me :)<br/> <br/>You do beautiful work!</td>', 'Melanie, this so so absolutely beautiful (although I am biased, hehe).  You did a wonderful job with this image, I love the play of sharp/not sharp, and the contrast between the golden seed pods and the clear blue/greens pink/purples in the background.   I have been considering using a 50mm reversed, and after seeing this I will definitely try it now (after I buy the reversing ring).  So now you can count yourself as being inspiration for me :) You do beautiful work!', '2009-03-18 13:23:14.000000', NULL, 0),
