(5389758, 772062, 61788, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for your comments! and votes too!<br/> <br/>To answer some of your comments:<br/>- branch comes from pomegranate tree too - that''s the state of it in January in California<br/>- cloth in the background is not even intentionally - I feel that way it is more natural :)<br/>- vase is really very light kind of bluish - that''s the way my daughter painted it long ago<br/>- here I made every effort to minimize postprocessing - so this is pretty much straight from the camera (if "pretty much straight" includes "Crop, Resize, Sharpen" ;)<br/> <br/>Vardan</td>', 'Thank you all for your comments! and votes too! To answer some of your comments:- branch comes from pomegranate tree too - that''s the state of it in January in California- cloth in the background is not even intentionally - I feel that way it is more natural :)- vase is really very light kind of bluish - that''s the way my daughter painted it long ago- here I made every effort to minimize postprocessing - so this is pretty much straight from the camera (if "pretty much straight" includes "Crop, Resize, Sharpen" ;) Vardan', '2009-03-18 13:31:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389759, 772272, 77316, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments...<br/> <br/>I am not Katherine or the Puzzle Man<br/> <br/>On dust - this picture was taken in our living room in Kabul, Afghanistan, one of the dustiest cities on earth.  With that in mind I''m pleased to say the dust in this picture is the dust on our toshak, not on the lens or sensor.  That''s why I left most of it.  I did take out some of the more distracting bits from the dark bottom left corner.</td>', 'Thanks for all your comments... I am not Katherine or the Puzzle Man On dust - this picture was taken in our living room in Kabul, Afghanistan, one of the dustiest cities on earth.  With that in mind I''m pleased to say the dust in this picture is the dust on our toshak, not on the lens or sensor.  That''s why I left most of it.  I did take out some of the more distracting bits from the dark bottom left corner.', '2009-03-18 13:32:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389760, 772337, 38162, '<td valign="top">no doubt this title really hurt the score.</td>', 'no doubt this title really hurt the score.', '2009-03-18 13:33:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389761, 770705, 50695, '<td valign="top">"it best defines what is missing for me in most of my work."<br/> <br/>I think I know what you mean, and I feel the same way about my poetry. Perhaps you worry that "most of your work" is so mysterious that a viewer has no story or emotion to latch onto. But in your case, the mystery is its own emotion, its own story, and oh so beautiful.<br/> <br/>Or maybe you think the exact opposite. Whatever it is, shut up already!</td>', '"it best defines what is missing for me in most of my work." I think I know what you mean, and I feel the same way about my poetry. Perhaps you worry that "most of your work" is so mysterious that a viewer has no story or emotion to latch onto. But in your case, the mystery is its own emotion, its own story, and oh so beautiful. Or maybe you think the exact opposite. Whatever it is, shut up already!', '2009-03-18 13:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
