(5389840, 770417, 39427, '<td valign="top">this shot, i believe, is sensational in its geometric composition, work with color, and just plain beauty of subject.  Would have given it a 9 if i came across it during voting.  Would actually kinda like to see what it would look like with .5in cropped off the left (crop out that door/window) &amp; 1.5inch cropped off the right, maybe up until the first beam, just to experiment  Added to faves</td>', 'this shot, i believe, is sensational in its geometric composition, work with color, and just plain beauty of subject.  Would have given it a 9 if i came across it during voting.  Would actually kinda like to see what it would look like with .5in cropped off the left (crop out that door/window) & 1.5inch cropped off the right, maybe up until the first beam, just to experiment  Added to faves', '2009-03-18 14:19:59.000000', NULL, 0),
