(5389882, 772713, 39427, '<td valign="top">of the best captivity shots I''ve seen.  I normally hate zoo shots b/c they feel cheap, like shooting fish in a barrel, but this image goes a step further.  We see the zebra''s camouflage within a man-made environs, which is both though evoking as well as visually stimulating.  Coupled with the down-trodden look of the animal, I just think this image has a lot of depth and so deserving of top 25 billing.  fav''d</td>', 'of the best captivity shots I''ve seen.  I normally hate zoo shots b/c they feel cheap, like shooting fish in a barrel, but this image goes a step further.  We see the zebra''s camouflage within a man-made environs, which is both though evoking as well as visually stimulating.  Coupled with the down-trodden look of the animal, I just think this image has a lot of depth and so deserving of top 25 billing.  fav''d', '2009-03-18 14:40:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389885, 772072, 84438, '<td valign="top">Holy cow.  Your processing is out of this world.  This should have ribboned IMHO.</td>', 'Holy cow.  Your processing is out of this world.  This should have ribboned IMHO.', '2009-03-18 14:42:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389895, 772421, 50695, '<td valign="top">are you kidding? the 1s give this some cred.</td>', 'are you kidding? the 1s give this some cred.', '2009-03-18 14:47:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389898, 771892, 39218, '<td valign="top">She reminds me of the Queen Mother all puffed up and with that peak on her head... I took a male cardinal at about forty feet away last week and was delighted to have done that well.  This is a beautiful example of photography and I can''t imagine improving on it in any way.  Even the little branch is perfectly positioned.  Bravo.</td>', 'She reminds me of the Queen Mother all puffed up and with that peak on her head... I took a male cardinal at about forty feet away last week and was delighted to have done that well.  This is a beautiful example of photography and I can''t imagine improving on it in any way.  Even the little branch is perfectly positioned.  Bravo.', '2009-03-18 14:48:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389903, 770252, 96751, '<td valign="top">This was seriously underrated.  Still a fave of mine.</td>', 'This was seriously underrated.  Still a fave of mine.', '2009-03-18 14:50:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389907, 770198, 70514, '<td valign="top">I like the diagonal line that seperates yet joins the two groups.  I do love your animal pictures, you always capture something quite lovely every time.</td>', 'I like the diagonal line that seperates yet joins the two groups.  I do love your animal pictures, you always capture something quite lovely every time.', '2009-03-18 14:52:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389909, 771534, 91197, '<td valign="top">congrats on your personal best and your 3 favs!!!</td>', 'congrats on your personal best and your 3 favs!!!', '2009-03-18 14:55:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389911, 772441, 70514, '<td valign="top">This woman has the kind of smile that makes others smile with her.  Mischievous, and wonderfully captured!</td>', 'This woman has the kind of smile that makes others smile with her.  Mischievous, and wonderfully captured!', '2009-03-18 14:56:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389912, 771472, 39218, '<td valign="top">Awwwwww... I really feel for your heavy heart on this story.  <br/> <br/>As a human being who was out doing your work and spraying, you did what you thought was best in moving the little ones to a place where you believed they would have a better chance at survival.  <br/> <br/>There is also the very real possibility that if they were alive two days later and then not a few days after that, that something might have happened to the mother herself, in which case nothing could have saved them. <br/> <br/>Please don''t be so hard on yourself and love this picture again.  If not, their lives and the enjoyment they have brought others will not be in vain, but you will be depriving yourself of the joy of having been there to witness the miracle that they were. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-18 15:15:25.</i></td>', 'Awwwwww... I really feel for your heavy heart on this story.   As a human being who was out doing your work and spraying, you did what you thought was best in moving the little ones to a place where you believed they would have a better chance at survival.   There is also the very real possibility that if they were alive two days later and then not a few days after that, that something might have happened to the mother herself, in which case nothing could have saved them.  Please don''t be so hard on yourself and love this picture again.  If not, their lives and the enjoyment they have brought others will not be in vain, but you will be depriving yourself of the joy of having been there to witness the miracle that they were. ', '2009-03-18 14:58:55.000000', '2009-03-18 15:15:25.000000', 0),
(5389925, 771971, 82985, '<td valign="top"><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=677021" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/80000-84999/82985/120/677021.jpg"/></a>PostLuminous Award Nominee!<br/>Per my comment below...</td>', 'PostLuminous Award Nominee!Per my comment below...', '2009-03-18 15:08:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389926, 771322, 24454, '<td valign="top">Ohhhhh. . .thank you for not only giving us one of the most breathtaking photos I''ve seen, but for sharing your story of the memory.  That makes it even more special.   I love LOVE to make those mountain treks in the Rocky Mountains, and I know the exhilaration of doing it, then capturing the memory in a beautiful photo.  I''m so glad your memory won top honors for you and that we get to share in it with you!   Mega congratulations!</td>', 'Ohhhhh. . .thank you for not only giving us one of the most breathtaking photos I''ve seen, but for sharing your story of the memory.  That makes it even more special.   I love LOVE to make those mountain treks in the Rocky Mountains, and I know the exhilaration of doing it, then capturing the memory in a beautiful photo.  I''m so glad your memory won top honors for you and that we get to share in it with you!   Mega congratulations!', '2009-03-18 15:08:59.000000', NULL, 0),
