(5389964, 770892, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow, Joanna!  You certainly have some beautiful star and light photos, but I do believe this is one of your best.  I think the 6.16 score doesn''t nearly do it justice!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow, Joanna!  You certainly have some beautiful star and light photos, but I do believe this is one of your best.  I think the 6.16 score doesn''t nearly do it justice! ', '2009-03-18 15:17:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389967, 770575, 50695, '<td valign="top">"I may be wrong and perhaps you do have more of a story to your shot but the fact is that it doesn''t come across to the viewer." - Nuzzer<br/> <br/>This guy''s hilarious. He writes this comment on the only photos that DO tell a story.</td>', '"I may be wrong and perhaps you do have more of a story to your shot but the fact is that it doesn''t come across to the viewer." - Nuzzer This guy''s hilarious. He writes this comment on the only photos that DO tell a story.', '2009-03-18 15:20:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389969, 770549, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is most definitely one of my favorite photos.  The dog looks to be so blissfully savoring the beautiful summer day.  It washes over you as you look at the photo.  I think this is fabulous photography!</td>', 'This is most definitely one of my favorite photos.  The dog looks to be so blissfully savoring the beautiful summer day.  It washes over you as you look at the photo.  I think this is fabulous photography!', '2009-03-18 15:20:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389974, 771938, 50695, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Simms:</b></div><hr/><i> The crop really bothers me here</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I told you DPC wouldn''t like the crop. hahahaha</td>', 'Originally posted by Simms: The crop really bothers me here  I told you DPC wouldn''t like the crop. hahahaha', '2009-03-18 15:22:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389980, 772578, 24454, '<td valign="top">I''m so happy you had another photo of this amazing scene for this challenge.  It is one of my favorite photos of all time.   When I was in Colorado last weekend, I photographed a big horn sheep standing on a rockon a hillside and I thought of your photo -- of course, it sure made mine fall short!  It is "the bar" by which any other sheep photo will forever be measured :)   Great score and finish in this challenge.   Wish it could have won another ribbon for you!<br/></td>', 'I''m so happy you had another photo of this amazing scene for this challenge.  It is one of my favorite photos of all time.   When I was in Colorado last weekend, I photographed a big horn sheep standing on a rockon a hillside and I thought of your photo -- of course, it sure made mine fall short!  It is "the bar" by which any other sheep photo will forever be measured :)   Great score and finish in this challenge.   Wish it could have won another ribbon for you!', '2009-03-18 15:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389981, 771434, 39218, '<td valign="top">Amazing... Congratulations on a great showing.  Love this one.</td>', 'Amazing... Congratulations on a great showing.  Love this one.', '2009-03-18 15:24:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389983, 770581, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very surprised this didn''t finish higher - I thought it a very pleasing portrait.  The quiet contemplation of the boy is enhanced by the natural light and the setting.</td>', 'Very surprised this didn''t finish higher - I thought it a very pleasing portrait.  The quiet contemplation of the boy is enhanced by the natural light and the setting.', '2009-03-18 15:24:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389990, 770336, 39218, '<td valign="top">The lighting is perfection.  Really beautiful.</td>', 'The lighting is perfection.  Really beautiful.', '2009-03-18 15:28:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389993, 770255, 23478, '<td valign="top">Love it - B&amp;W works excellent.  Into my favs...</td>', 'Love it - B&W works excellent.  Into my favs...', '2009-03-18 15:30:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5389997, 770514, 39218, '<td valign="top">Really lovely and the steel blue against her colouring is perfection... awesome atmosphere.</td>', 'Really lovely and the steel blue against her colouring is perfection... awesome atmosphere.', '2009-03-18 15:32:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390011, 770549, 34192, '<td valign="top">I''m thrown a little by the shadowed border but I think the image itself is wonderful, particularly the colors and the touch of blur/glow.</td>', 'I''m thrown a little by the shadowed border but I think the image itself is wonderful, particularly the colors and the touch of blur/glow.', '2009-03-18 15:36:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390014, 772519, 6845, '<td valign="top">Ok i do not want to read all your comments, but i am curious and i just noticed my self, did anyone comment on the slight tilt to the horizon? In any case, I love this shot, and i am really shocked it didn''t do better.</td>', 'Ok i do not want to read all your comments, but i am curious and i just noticed my self, did anyone comment on the slight tilt to the horizon? In any case, I love this shot, and i am really shocked it didn''t do better.', '2009-03-18 15:37:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390015, 772016, 75585, '<td valign="top">I would have loved to see this place higher - but still 37 in THIS challenge is something to be proud of.  Great image!!</td>', 'I would have loved to see this place higher - but still 37 in THIS challenge is something to be proud of.  Great image!!', '2009-03-18 15:37:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390018, 772015, 67697, '<td valign="top">oooh, very pretty!  love the bokeh.  It''s like stepping into another world.  Wonderful capture of light.  Congrats on the postLumie!</td>', 'oooh, very pretty!  love the bokeh.  It''s like stepping into another world.  Wonderful capture of light.  Congrats on the postLumie!', '2009-03-18 15:38:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390020, 770211, 60173, '<td valign="top">5.0... Unbelievable... <br/> <br/>This new wave of users needs to hurry up and learn their basics so they can start appreciating the art of breaking the rules. <br/> <br/>This is one of my absolute favorite photos on the site, but I''ve never marked it as a favorite. I never had to, because it''s ingrained in my memory. I''ll go ahead and add it now as some form of silent protest.<br/> <br/>...stupid effin watery sunsets! Gah! I''m so mad, heh.</td>', '5.0... Unbelievable...  This new wave of users needs to hurry up and learn their basics so they can start appreciating the art of breaking the rules.  This is one of my absolute favorite photos on the site, but I''ve never marked it as a favorite. I never had to, because it''s ingrained in my memory. I''ll go ahead and add it now as some form of silent protest. ...stupid effin watery sunsets! Gah! I''m so mad, heh.', '2009-03-18 15:39:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390024, 771863, 41337, '<td valign="top">This probably would have done better had these faces been more recognizable by the currently active DPC voters.</td>', 'This probably would have done better had these faces been more recognizable by the currently active DPC voters.', '2009-03-18 15:41:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390025, 772538, 24454, '<td valign="top">This one was yours?  I should have guessed.  Your ability to capture the soul of animals is unsurpassed!   Its amazing the connection you feel when you look at this.  But the technical quality is amazing.  I swear that krinkled up nose is popping out of my computer screen!</td>', 'This one was yours?  I should have guessed.  Your ability to capture the soul of animals is unsurpassed!   Its amazing the connection you feel when you look at this.  But the technical quality is amazing.  I swear that krinkled up nose is popping out of my computer screen!', '2009-03-18 15:44:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390034, 772479, 60173, '<td valign="top">I''m really starting to think that if I love a photo I''m cursing it from scoring well on this site. I''m sorry I love your photo!<br/> <br/>=)</td>', 'I''m really starting to think that if I love a photo I''m cursing it from scoring well on this site. I''m sorry I love your photo! =)', '2009-03-18 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390038, 772631, 23484, '<td valign="top">I am absolutely stunned at this score. This is a gorgeous image. I can''t believe you got 30 3''s.</td>', 'I am absolutely stunned at this score. This is a gorgeous image. I can''t believe you got 30 3''s.', '2009-03-18 15:53:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390046, 770770, 23484, '<td valign="top">Terry, you didn''t get kicked out of Flint again did you? Nice job on this.</td>', 'Terry, you didn''t get kicked out of Flint again did you? Nice job on this.', '2009-03-18 15:57:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390048, 770501, 34192, '<td valign="top">I thought for a while on this image trying to think of what the heck was going on.  I wasn''t able to return while voting - sorry for that - and to comment.  I figured out that I don''t need to know what, who, where, or anything.  I just need to appreciate it for what it is.  I love the echo of the blacks and the shapes here. I love your post processing.  I love what I can''t see and what I think I see.  Beautiful image...</td>', 'I thought for a while on this image trying to think of what the heck was going on.  I wasn''t able to return while voting - sorry for that - and to comment.  I figured out that I don''t need to know what, who, where, or anything.  I just need to appreciate it for what it is.  I love the echo of the blacks and the shapes here. I love your post processing.  I love what I can''t see and what I think I see.  Beautiful image...', '2009-03-18 15:57:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390050, 770321, 39218, '<td valign="top">I like the unconventional pose and the lighting and think that it is awesome that the model will have this to look at someday when she is perhaps not so slender or nearly as flexible. Some people have discussed the hair and I find that her hair and her anonymity are perfect, and the shadow in the background is perfect... without it, it would seem as if she wasn''t grounded somehow. <br/> <br/>Safe to say I like this shot.</td>', 'I like the unconventional pose and the lighting and think that it is awesome that the model will have this to look at someday when she is perhaps not so slender or nearly as flexible. Some people have discussed the hair and I find that her hair and her anonymity are perfect, and the shadow in the background is perfect... without it, it would seem as if she wasn''t grounded somehow.  Safe to say I like this shot.', '2009-03-18 15:59:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390052, 770164, 39218, '<td valign="top">People just didn''t get it.  <br/> <br/>Fabulous shot.</td>', 'People just didn''t get it.   Fabulous shot.', '2009-03-18 16:01:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390054, 772537, 30982, '<td valign="top">I would have never guessed a train.  I thought it a diner of some sort, but a train?  With those curtains and pictures hanging on the wall?  WAY cool!</td>', 'I would have never guessed a train.  I thought it a diner of some sort, but a train?  With those curtains and pictures hanging on the wall?  WAY cool!', '2009-03-18 16:04:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390055, 771307, 43156, '<td valign="top">Just came back to say that I stay behind my 8 on this great shot.</td>', 'Just came back to say that I stay behind my 8 on this great shot.', '2009-03-18 16:04:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390064, 772519, 67145, '<td valign="top">hey adam .. i can see why this would be your favourite photograph ... not only how excellent it is .. so beautiful .. but the experience of being in such a place would only add to the appeal .. sublime for sure  .. love your processing style .. intense, dramatic and powerful .. totally right for this majestic scene .. :).... WOW..!!..:)<br/>sounds so remote the places you go .. along with camera, memory cards &amp; battery, a compass would be part of your necessary equipment .. !!!.. oh .. and food .. !!!:)</td>', 'hey adam .. i can see why this would be your favourite photograph ... not only how excellent it is .. so beautiful .. but the experience of being in such a place would only add to the appeal .. sublime for sure  .. love your processing style .. intense, dramatic and powerful .. totally right for this majestic scene .. :).... WOW..!!..:)sounds so remote the places you go .. along with camera, memory cards & battery, a compass would be part of your necessary equipment .. !!!.. oh .. and food .. !!!:)', '2009-03-18 16:15:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390067, 771938, 39218, '<td valign="top">Such a dynamic pic and the crop, to me is perfect... it speaks of raw, unrestrained power and the fact that the horse is tied and just wants to be FREE.<br/> <br/>LOVE it and most definitely was misunderstood.</td>', 'Such a dynamic pic and the crop, to me is perfect... it speaks of raw, unrestrained power and the fact that the horse is tied and just wants to be FREE. LOVE it and most definitely was misunderstood.', '2009-03-18 16:16:25.000000', NULL, 0),
