(5390078, 770625, 49447, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the great comments, and votes.  I haven''t been active in a while, even though I check in almost every day, and to come back with my PB was great!<br/> <br/>I voted on every image, found a few favorites and had two people choose mine. <br/> <br/>Unfortunately, was not able to comment as much as I would have liked.  The images were all wonderful and my average vote was 6.2662 for the over 1100 images.  <br/> <br/>Thank you for this challenge!  <br/> <br/>Henry<br/></td>', 'Thank you all for the great comments, and votes.  I haven''t been active in a while, even though I check in almost every day, and to come back with my PB was great! I voted on every image, found a few favorites and had two people choose mine.  Unfortunately, was not able to comment as much as I would have liked.  The images were all wonderful and my average vote was 6.2662 for the over 1100 images.   Thank you for this challenge!   Henry', '2009-03-18 16:22:21.000000', NULL, 0),
