(5390105, 772058, 84124, '<td valign="top">I think this is only the second time I''ve said something like this on this site, but this really should be way way way up there.  You were robbed.  I think you may have gotten hurt by having 1100+ images in this challenge where so many voters didn''t stop and smell the roses on this one, it''s an extraordinary image, be proud.  Independent of my favs in this challenge, my girlfriend also picked this one out as one of her top 3.</td>', 'I think this is only the second time I''ve said something like this on this site, but this really should be way way way up there.  You were robbed.  I think you may have gotten hurt by having 1100+ images in this challenge where so many voters didn''t stop and smell the roses on this one, it''s an extraordinary image, be proud.  Independent of my favs in this challenge, my girlfriend also picked this one out as one of her top 3.', '2009-03-18 16:38:06.000000', NULL, 0),
