(5390505, 770477, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow, I knew this wouldn''t be a popular shot when I saw it in voting, but I never imagined it would be one away from the brown!  From all the posthumous threads and side challenges where people seem to appreciate the more oob entries, I thought those voters would pull this one through.  Anyone can manage to take an out of focus shot (and some people just do it without trying), but you''ve captured something very pleasing here in this scene.  Thanks for putting this one in the challenge!</td>', 'Wow, I knew this wouldn''t be a popular shot when I saw it in voting, but I never imagined it would be one away from the brown!  From all the posthumous threads and side challenges where people seem to appreciate the more oob entries, I thought those voters would pull this one through.  Anyone can manage to take an out of focus shot (and some people just do it without trying), but you''ve captured something very pleasing here in this scene.  Thanks for putting this one in the challenge!', '2009-03-18 19:35:38.000000', NULL, 0),
