(5390750, 772523, 33392, '<td valign="top">I like dogs, and I like the concept of this shot.  I have to agree with the others though, that the color cast is a bit off.  My guess is you took the photo under normal incandescent lights.  It has that tungsten glow.. And yes - I have a Huey calibrate my monitor.<br/> <br/>I took a very quick stab at rebalancing the light on the 2nd example you posted.<br/> <br/>My quick adjustement <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=774496" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/33392/120/774496.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/33392/120/774496.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/30000-34999/33392/120/774496.jpg"/></a> vs. your posting  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=774490" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96477/120/774490.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96477/120/774490.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/95000-99999/96477/120/774490.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/></td>', 'I like dogs, and I like the concept of this shot.  I have to agree with the others though, that the color cast is a bit off.  My guess is you took the photo under normal incandescent lights.  It has that tungsten glow.. And yes - I have a Huey calibrate my monitor. I took a very quick stab at rebalancing the light on the 2nd example you posted. My quick adjustement  vs. your posting    ', '2009-03-18 21:35:25.000000', NULL, 0),
