(5390850, 771155, 39218, '<td valign="top">The date makes this so poignant... the planes were all out vacant from our skies and the world as we knew it was completely upside down, but these sweet little boys were at Disneyland, where everything is magical and surreal... and life continued and the boys grew and are probably just entering teenagerhood.  It''s a great photograph.</td>', 'The date makes this so poignant... the planes were all out vacant from our skies and the world as we knew it was completely upside down, but these sweet little boys were at Disneyland, where everything is magical and surreal... and life continued and the boys grew and are probably just entering teenagerhood.  It''s a great photograph.', '2009-03-18 22:33:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5390852, 771274, 40757, '<td valign="top">For what it''s worth, I disagree with those that want more light on her right. The plunge to darkness is a big factor in this photo, IMHO. Beautiful work.</td>', 'For what it''s worth, I disagree with those that want more light on her right. The plunge to darkness is a big factor in this photo, IMHO. Beautiful work.', '2009-03-18 22:33:58.000000', NULL, 0),
