(5391250, 771413, 47249, '<td valign="top">@aliqui: Thanks a lot for your support, I appreciate it. :)<br/>Yes, I know it isn''t an ''easy'' image, no problem...<br/> <br/>@oded: about ''overprocessed''...really only minimal editing here, it''s a night scenery almost straight from my camera :)<br/> <br/>In spite of the low rate I''m really glad about some beautiful comments here, thanks a lot all of you!<br/> <br/></td>', '@aliqui: Thanks a lot for your support, I appreciate it. :)Yes, I know it isn''t an ''easy'' image, no problem... @oded: about ''overprocessed''...really only minimal editing here, it''s a night scenery almost straight from my camera :) In spite of the low rate I''m really glad about some beautiful comments here, thanks a lot all of you! ', '2009-03-19 05:47:33.000000', NULL, 0),
