(5391935, 771322, 48607, '<td valign="top">CONGRATS!!!!!<br/>Looks amazing! D this is truely your best work.<br/>I''m really happy it won 1st place. <br/></td>', 'CONGRATS!!!!!Looks amazing! D this is truely your best work.I''m really happy it won 1st place. ', '2009-03-19 14:35:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5391954, 772752, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very pleased you decided to stop and shoot this - it is a wonderful picture!  Thank you for sharing it.</td>', 'Very pleased you decided to stop and shoot this - it is a wonderful picture!  Thank you for sharing it.', '2009-03-19 14:54:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(5391955, 770962, 63, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the great comments.  For the people who live at lower elevations, the blue is the sky in the Colorado Rockies.  I follow eagles around the state. But this is my best eagle encounter.</td>', 'Thanks for all of the great comments.  For the people who live at lower elevations, the blue is the sky in the Colorado Rockies.  I follow eagles around the state. But this is my best eagle encounter.', '2009-03-19 14:55:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(5391971, 770857, 18257, '<td valign="top"><br/> <br/>I really like this one personally and have it printed large scale in my office.<br/>For those who asked, the photo was not staged, I was taking various shots on a high ground when I noticed these two beneath me, totally out from two long days and nights of training.<br/> <br/>The sense of peacefulness is what is so compelling for me in this photo, even if the exposure is not balanced right in the photo (which I find quite complementing).<br/> <br/>Thank you all for voting and commenting! Didn''t expect this much feedback.</td>', ' I really like this one personally and have it printed large scale in my office.For those who asked, the photo was not staged, I was taking various shots on a high ground when I noticed these two beneath me, totally out from two long days and nights of training. The sense of peacefulness is what is so compelling for me in this photo, even if the exposure is not balanced right in the photo (which I find quite complementing). Thank you all for voting and commenting! Didn''t expect this much feedback.', '2009-03-19 15:03:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(5391994, 771690, 101702, '<td valign="top">Came back to comment after the gripe thread... for me the border completely detracted from the image as it is really "in your face". I also felt that the lighting was harsh, and the girls eyes lacked focus and sparkle and the shot as a whole lacks some clarity (which I guess is a byproduct of the nature of the camera). Colours framing and subject matter were fine. I scored it a 5, which appears to be the most common viewpoint with 185 others also voting it a 5. Your tags have it as "snapshot" and "candid", and I think that is a fair self-assessment. A nice enough shot but it just didn''t wow me. I would probably have given it a 6 if it didn''t have the yellow border.</td>', 'Came back to comment after the gripe thread... for me the border completely detracted from the image as it is really "in your face". I also felt that the lighting was harsh, and the girls eyes lacked focus and sparkle and the shot as a whole lacks some clarity (which I guess is a byproduct of the nature of the camera). Colours framing and subject matter were fine. I scored it a 5, which appears to be the most common viewpoint with 185 others also voting it a 5. Your tags have it as "snapshot" and "candid", and I think that is a fair self-assessment. A nice enough shot but it just didn''t wow me. I would probably have given it a 6 if it didn''t have the yellow border.', '2009-03-19 15:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392047, 770214, 51167, '<td valign="top">This was one of my 10''s.  It is a great shot with a lot of emotion to it.  The lighting is perfect.</td>', 'This was one of my 10''s.  It is a great shot with a lot of emotion to it.  The lighting is perfect.', '2009-03-19 16:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392051, 772682, 51167, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a painting.  I love the blur and color on this.  It was one of my favorites during the voting.</td>', 'Almost looks like a painting.  I love the blur and color on this.  It was one of my favorites during the voting.', '2009-03-19 16:24:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392118, 772167, 101702, '<td valign="top">You have asked for more comments in the gripe thread... I gave this a six which is in line with 177 other like-minded voters, 6 being the vote you received the most times. In my scale, 6 is good technical knowledge and composition, just a bit lacking in some areas. <br/> <br/>Upon a revisit, I find that the object in the lower left hand corner to keep drawing my eye, stopping me from actually "looking" at the guy. So to improve the shot I would clone out, or crop out that part of the image. Also I find the girls behind the shoulder to be a distraction, but removing those might require a bit more work. I would have scored it more highly with those amendments as my eyes would remain fixed then on the main subject, which is a good one. Some of the other comments also mention a tighter crop which I presume is for the same reason as I suggest, the lower left corner.</td>', 'You have asked for more comments in the gripe thread... I gave this a six which is in line with 177 other like-minded voters, 6 being the vote you received the most times. In my scale, 6 is good technical knowledge and composition, just a bit lacking in some areas.  Upon a revisit, I find that the object in the lower left hand corner to keep drawing my eye, stopping me from actually "looking" at the guy. So to improve the shot I would clone out, or crop out that part of the image. Also I find the girls behind the shoulder to be a distraction, but removing those might require a bit more work. I would have scored it more highly with those amendments as my eyes would remain fixed then on the main subject, which is a good one. Some of the other comments also mention a tighter crop which I presume is for the same reason as I suggest, the lower left corner.', '2009-03-19 16:53:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392134, 772016, 48389, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and colours. A very moving image indeed and one that does indeed show hope in a wonderful way!</td>', 'Beautiful composition and colours. A very moving image indeed and one that does indeed show hope in a wonderful way!', '2009-03-19 17:08:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392137, 770214, 49773, '<td valign="top">Pozdrav!</td>', 'Pozdrav!', '2009-03-19 17:18:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392146, 772523, 96477, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marcusvdt:</b></div><hr/><i> It has noise in the nose indeed. <b>Hope you invest on glasses. </b></i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>What a rude and non helpful comment.</td>', 'Originally posted by marcusvdt: It has noise in the nose indeed. Hope you invest on glasses.   What a rude and non helpful comment.', '2009-03-19 17:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392155, 772536, 68586, '<td valign="top">Snapshot - shmapshot !<br/> <br/>I''ve always loved this picture - makes me smile everytime I see it, and you know what - pictures are meant to be about connecting with the viewer, getting a reaction.<br/> <br/>This works for me.</td>', 'Snapshot - shmapshot ! I''ve always loved this picture - makes me smile everytime I see it, and you know what - pictures are meant to be about connecting with the viewer, getting a reaction. This works for me.', '2009-03-19 17:58:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392156, 771077, 60495, '<td valign="top">Wow, this was a Gem, nicely done and good finish.</td>', 'Wow, this was a Gem, nicely done and good finish.', '2009-03-19 17:59:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392157, 772713, 3087, '<td valign="top">Hello! You must be Jubei Kibagami registered in a new name? I loved the image you uploaded back in 2004, looked identical to this one, so I''m thinking this must be an adjacent frame? Lovely!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Hello! You must be Jubei Kibagami registered in a new name? I loved the image you uploaded back in 2004, looked identical to this one, so I''m thinking this must be an adjacent frame? Lovely! ', '2009-03-19 18:01:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392195, 771444, 3724, '<td valign="top">I love the frontal composition &amp; colours. I think an interesting subject. 8</td>', 'I love the frontal composition & colours. I think an interesting subject. 8', '2009-03-19 18:54:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392207, 771253, 59029, '<td valign="top">What, I didn''t comment on this shot?! shame on me! I gave you a 9.  Wonderful framing, love the details and expressions.</td>', 'What, I didn''t comment on this shot?! shame on me! I gave you a 9.  Wonderful framing, love the details and expressions.', '2009-03-19 19:06:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392217, 772439, 2333, '<td valign="top">Hah, I suspected this might have been yours! I wasn''t sure, though, so I didn''t want to comment like I knew it was during the challenge... I know, CHICKEN! Good to see you in a challenge again, and with a beautiful image to boot.</td>', 'Hah, I suspected this might have been yours! I wasn''t sure, though, so I didn''t want to comment like I knew it was during the challenge... I know, CHICKEN! Good to see you in a challenge again, and with a beautiful image to boot.', '2009-03-19 19:13:54.000000', NULL, 0);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5392251, 771534, 100831, '<td valign="top">Personal best - Way to go!! Since my photo was also an abstract at just about the same intestity level, and there weren''t too many abstract photos to look at in this particular challenge, I had to come back and look again. I love it! Great job.</td>', 'Personal best - Way to go!! Since my photo was also an abstract at just about the same intestity level, and there weren''t too many abstract photos to look at in this particular challenge, I had to come back and look again. I love it! Great job.', '2009-03-19 19:58:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392259, 772653, 63218, '<td valign="top">Hi Patti, I was one of your 10s.  I looked at it for a while before voting, just enjoying the light &amp; shadow. Also the strange hints of green I keep seeing amongst the leaves--but when I concentrate on looking closely it''s gone. I gave it a 10 because I like the sky &amp; the way the light models the figure of the fellow tossing the handfull of dirt.  And because of the way it holds my attention.  Interesting to look at. I keep waiting for him to turn around &amp; he seems just about to.<br/> <br/>Don''t give up. The people who are willling to take a risk &amp; a chance &amp; a dare on this site need to please stick around to support one another &amp; to remind the literal-minded stick-in-the-mud types that there is some diversity in the world after all.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-19 20:03:07.</i></td>', 'Hi Patti, I was one of your 10s.  I looked at it for a while before voting, just enjoying the light & shadow. Also the strange hints of green I keep seeing amongst the leaves--but when I concentrate on looking closely it''s gone. I gave it a 10 because I like the sky & the way the light models the figure of the fellow tossing the handfull of dirt.  And because of the way it holds my attention.  Interesting to look at. I keep waiting for him to turn around & he seems just about to. Don''t give up. The people who are willling to take a risk & a chance & a dare on this site need to please stick around to support one another & to remind the literal-minded stick-in-the-mud types that there is some diversity in the world after all.', '2009-03-19 20:02:36.000000', '2009-03-19 20:03:07.000000', 0),
(5392266, 772313, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s a quality of degeneration from the hard lines of a geometry into faded edges of what ought to be planar that I really like here; it seems so simply euclidean in its geometry, but then you notice the apparent curvature of those planes ... Also, the Picabian references are rather neat. I kind of wish I''d had the patience to plough through the whole challenge when I see this (and there a truly grand compliment).</td>', 'There''s a quality of degeneration from the hard lines of a geometry into faded edges of what ought to be planar that I really like here; it seems so simply euclidean in its geometry, but then you notice the apparent curvature of those planes ... Also, the Picabian references are rather neat. I kind of wish I''d had the patience to plough through the whole challenge when I see this (and there a truly grand compliment).', '2009-03-19 20:08:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392273, 770211, 31535, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by timfythetoo:</b></div><hr/><i> I believe it is time for me to take a break from challenges and do some vision seeking.</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Nooooooo. Say it ain''t so! I''ll miss scrounging the challenges to find the "too" shot. You''ve been an inspiration. Good luck with whatever you do and don''t stay away too long. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-19 20:14:02.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by timfythetoo: I believe it is time for me to take a break from challenges and do some vision seeking. Nooooooo. Say it ain''t so! I''ll miss scrounging the challenges to find the "too" shot. You''ve been an inspiration. Good luck with whatever you do and don''t stay away too long. :)', '2009-03-19 20:13:29.000000', '2009-03-19 20:14:02.000000', 0),
(5392335, 772152, 8624, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Her pose, the fabric and the lighting are exceptional.</td>', 'I love this shot. Her pose, the fabric and the lighting are exceptional.', '2009-03-19 20:50:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392339, 770625, 100831, '<td valign="top">Really nice capture - lovely color and bokeh and the bird is so sharp!<br/>I hope you find time to shoot and enter more often in the time to come.</td>', 'Really nice capture - lovely color and bokeh and the bird is so sharp!I hope you find time to shoot and enter more often in the time to come.', '2009-03-19 20:52:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392345, 770214, 8624, '<td valign="top">outstanding. the gloves, the sweat, the torn shirt, the graffiti, all blend to create an awesome portrait!</td>', 'outstanding. the gloves, the sweat, the torn shirt, the graffiti, all blend to create an awesome portrait!', '2009-03-19 20:54:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392352, 772388, 30173, '<td valign="top">Im overwhelmed from this wonderful comments. thanks to you dpc folks...<br/> <br/>In this picture you can see my father and his grandson (son of my sister). It was the 67th birthday of my dad and we went out for a walk on a beautiful sunny day. The shot is a candid.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-19 20:58:36.</i></td>', 'Im overwhelmed from this wonderful comments. thanks to you dpc folks... In this picture you can see my father and his grandson (son of my sister). It was the 67th birthday of my dad and we went out for a walk on a beautiful sunny day. The shot is a candid.', '2009-03-19 20:58:03.000000', '2009-03-19 20:58:36.000000', 0),
(5392354, 772014, 8624, '<td valign="top">one of my favorites. his beard and eyes are absolutely captivating.</td>', 'one of my favorites. his beard and eyes are absolutely captivating.', '2009-03-19 20:58:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392358, 772581, 8624, '<td valign="top">beautiful tones, beautiful pose.</td>', 'beautiful tones, beautiful pose.', '2009-03-19 21:00:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392380, 772168, 24454, '<td valign="top">Tareq, this is so amazing!  What an honor to be in the top 20 in this 1,113 strong challenge with such wonderful entries.<br/></td>', 'Tareq, this is so amazing!  What an honor to be in the top 20 in this 1,113 strong challenge with such wonderful entries.', '2009-03-19 21:10:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392384, 771153, 24454, '<td valign="top">Roz! I am totally out of superlatives to make an impact on what I think of your macro work.  It is beyond words.  What an honor to finish in 12th place in a challenge with 1,113 submissions.  You are in a league all by yourself.  Although, I have been quite amazed by Greg''s work too lately :)  The 2 of you are most definitely the finest macro photographers on the planet!<br/> <br/>Congratulations my friend!  You are freaking AMAZING!</td>', 'Roz! I am totally out of superlatives to make an impact on what I think of your macro work.  It is beyond words.  What an honor to finish in 12th place in a challenge with 1,113 submissions.  You are in a league all by yourself.  Although, I have been quite amazed by Greg''s work too lately :)  The 2 of you are most definitely the finest macro photographers on the planet! Congratulations my friend!  You are freaking AMAZING!', '2009-03-19 21:13:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392393, 772524, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love this photo!  The lighting is so dramatic and interesting.  And I love the story that you told with it.  I feel the same way about belonging to this amazing community of fellow photographers and friends :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love this photo!  The lighting is so dramatic and interesting.  And I love the story that you told with it.  I feel the same way about belonging to this amazing community of fellow photographers and friends :) ', '2009-03-19 21:18:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392528, 771322, 92512, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, breath taking to say the least.</td>', 'Congratulations, breath taking to say the least.', '2009-03-19 22:35:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392529, 770219, 67237, '<td valign="top">What could I say that has not been said about this image? (I have enjoyed reading the wide range of during- voting comments)<br/> <br/>Firstly, to point out that it had the ability to move the viewer''s neurones and hormones :-) in all sort of directions around and about what the motion-blurred couple represents and what their mood is.<br/> <br/>Secondly, that you, the pg, had the ability to pick that one frame you knew it was the right frame to capture in order to inspire what you thought and saw.<br/> <br/>Congratulations for both things!!</td>', 'What could I say that has not been said about this image? (I have enjoyed reading the wide range of during- voting comments) Firstly, to point out that it had the ability to move the viewer''s neurones and hormones :-) in all sort of directions around and about what the motion-blurred couple represents and what their mood is. Secondly, that you, the pg, had the ability to pick that one frame you knew it was the right frame to capture in order to inspire what you thought and saw. Congratulations for both things!!', '2009-03-19 22:35:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392531, 771865, 92512, '<td valign="top">Congratulations, on your victory . yes placing second is a victory. But taking a photo like this is agreat feat in its self.</td>', 'Congratulations, on your victory . yes placing second is a victory. But taking a photo like this is agreat feat in its self.', '2009-03-19 22:38:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392535, 771825, 88136, '<td valign="top">gave this a nine(i might have said that already) and i really do love it. im coming back to fav it:)</td>', 'gave this a nine(i might have said that already) and i really do love it. im coming back to fav it:)', '2009-03-19 22:39:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392539, 771926, 92512, '<td valign="top">Of the top three this was my favorite. Congratulations, for the yellow.</td>', 'Of the top three this was my favorite. Congratulations, for the yellow.', '2009-03-19 22:41:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(5392556, 772536, 12253, '<td valign="top">That is TOO Funny to be #723!  I think it''s technically good, but it could have been spruced up for the DPC crowd (maybe some vignette and emphasis on the foreground players).  Anyway, I think it''s very cool!</td>', 'That is TOO Funny to be #723!  I think it''s technically good, but it could have been spruced up for the DPC crowd (maybe some vignette and emphasis on the foreground players).  Anyway, I think it''s very cool!', '2009-03-19 22:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
