(5393763, 772378, 48697, '<td valign="top">One of my few 10''s, love this shot!</td>', 'One of my few 10''s, love this shot!', '2009-03-20 22:39:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5393783, 772111, 73884, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dknourek:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by AGrigorof:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t think the frame works too well; it detracts the attention from the tree line and the main subject. The roots themselves lack any details and they are too messy to be an elegant silhouette. <b>I''ve tried some roots myself, a while ago, and people didn''t like them :( - a 6 from me, just for that.</b> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>So you are saying you would have given a higher score but someone else in some other challenge didn''t like your entry so now anything with roots in it you will penalize because of this? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>You got it wrong. I gave it a higher score just because of that. If you look at your scores, most of the people scored this 6 and 5. I didn''t give it 5, but 6 just for the roots. I scored it higher than the average voter. Anyway, it is bizarre to consider MY comment unhelpful when I did provide you more feedback than a simple "nice colors". Yes, nice colors, but all too common and the border interferes with them. Another comment you found unhelpful is saying that the clouds would be better with more contrast. That''s true, yet unhelpful for you.</td>', 'Originally posted by dknourek: Originally posted by AGrigorof: I don''t think the frame works too well; it detracts the attention from the tree line and the main subject. The roots themselves lack any details and they are too messy to be an elegant silhouette. I''ve tried some roots myself, a while ago, and people didn''t like them :( - a 6 from me, just for that.   So you are saying you would have given a higher score but someone else in some other challenge didn''t like your entry so now anything with roots in it you will penalize because of this?   You got it wrong. I gave it a higher score just because of that. If you look at your scores, most of the people scored this 6 and 5. I didn''t give it 5, but 6 just for the roots. I scored it higher than the average voter. Anyway, it is bizarre to consider MY comment unhelpful when I did provide you more feedback than a simple "nice colors". Yes, nice colors, but all too common and the border interferes with them. Another comment you found unhelpful is saying that the clouds would be better with more contrast. That''s true, yet unhelpful for you.', '2009-03-20 23:00:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(5393786, 770839, 28710, '<td valign="top">very nice look overall and I like the rhythm present in the waves.</td>', 'very nice look overall and I like the rhythm present in the waves.', '2009-03-20 23:09:29.000000', NULL, 0),
