(5393960, 772332, 28710, '<td valign="top">no offense meant, but I truly do not understand how this pic scored so well. Composition is decent, but the overall look is contrived and campy. The background is distracting and while the light/dark balance of the composition is passable, the rest of it is completely unremarkable, even amateurish. I don''t find her at all sexy. She looks bored to me.<br/> <br/>There are hundreds of better shots in this challenge.<br/> <br/>scratching my head.</td>', 'no offense meant, but I truly do not understand how this pic scored so well. Composition is decent, but the overall look is contrived and campy. The background is distracting and while the light/dark balance of the composition is passable, the rest of it is completely unremarkable, even amateurish. I don''t find her at all sexy. She looks bored to me. There are hundreds of better shots in this challenge. scratching my head.', '2009-03-21 06:25:03.000000', NULL, 0),
