(5394039, 772682, 100106, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eschelar:</b></div><hr/><i> this really is a remarkable shot. I put ya down for 10 during the voting and am shocked to see how low it is. sad indeed. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I appreciate your sentiment, truly I do. I knew going in it probably wouldn''t score well. But it didn''t matter. Simply for the fact of how many people enjoyed it (like yourself), commented and saved it as their fav. That to me, made it the "best" challenge and entry to date. Thanks again for your comment and also everyone else who made this by far the best experince on DPC yet.<br/> <br/>Sincerely,<br/> <br/>T.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-03-22 10:13:07.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by eschelar: this really is a remarkable shot. I put ya down for 10 during the voting and am shocked to see how low it is. sad indeed.   I appreciate your sentiment, truly I do. I knew going in it probably wouldn''t score well. But it didn''t matter. Simply for the fact of how many people enjoyed it (like yourself), commented and saved it as their fav. That to me, made it the "best" challenge and entry to date. Thanks again for your comment and also everyone else who made this by far the best experince on DPC yet. Sincerely, T.', '2009-03-21 09:06:58.000000', '2009-03-22 10:13:07.000000', 0),
