(5394352, 772428, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautifully peaceful, a wonderful image. Congrats on your great finish, William.</td>', 'Beautifully peaceful, a wonderful image. Congrats on your great finish, William.', '2009-03-21 14:03:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(5394357, 772175, 3020, '<td valign="top">Thank you all so much for your comments, I feel very touched. I will try to address a few points quickly...<br/> <br/>Her name is Squirt.<br/>The background noise was intentional, don''t ask me why I just liked it. :)<br/>The original title was going to be "Wicked Woof of the West" but I wasn''t sure my niece would like her pup called wicked. :)<br/>Squirt is a generally nervous looking little pup which is the look some of you are trying to describe, her large eyes play part of that. She didn''t seem to notice the hat at all.<br/>I actually did apply the burn tool to the eye to make the pupil stand out more, but maybe it could have used a little more. :)<br/>I have included a color copy in the images description for all of you.<br/>Thanks again and Cheers!<br/></td>', 'Thank you all so much for your comments, I feel very touched. I will try to address a few points quickly... Her name is Squirt.The background noise was intentional, don''t ask me why I just liked it. :)The original title was going to be "Wicked Woof of the West" but I wasn''t sure my niece would like her pup called wicked. :)Squirt is a generally nervous looking little pup which is the look some of you are trying to describe, her large eyes play part of that. She didn''t seem to notice the hat at all.I actually did apply the burn tool to the eye to make the pupil stand out more, but maybe it could have used a little more. :)I have included a color copy in the images description for all of you.Thanks again and Cheers!', '2009-03-21 14:20:33.000000', NULL, 0),
