(5394553, 771863, 24454, '<td valign="top">Wow!  This certainly would have been my most meaningful photo too.  Talk about a Whose Who among DPC''ers, huh?  What a BLAST it must have been hanging out with all those heavyweights (including YOU) But you didn''t have your tripod so you could get in it too?  Bummer. That''s the only thing that may have made it better:  to have Deb''s smiling face in it.<br/> <br/>What a great photo!  I tried to vote on all the photos in the challenge, but I didn''t quite make it.  I missed this one.  Darn.<br/> <br/>But nineteen 10''s, five 9''s, and forty-eight 8''s! Obviously, the photo meant alot to alot of other people too!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Wow!  This certainly would have been my most meaningful photo too.  Talk about a Whose Who among DPC''ers, huh?  What a BLAST it must have been hanging out with all those heavyweights (including YOU) But you didn''t have your tripod so you could get in it too?  Bummer. That''s the only thing that may have made it better:  to have Deb''s smiling face in it. What a great photo!  I tried to vote on all the photos in the challenge, but I didn''t quite make it.  I missed this one.  Darn. But nineteen 10''s, five 9''s, and forty-eight 8''s! Obviously, the photo meant alot to alot of other people too! ', '2009-03-21 19:45:21.000000', NULL, 0),
