(5399598, 771402, 63398, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jmsetzler:</b></div><hr/><i> "Is it the best image I have taken? Not even close; does it capture a slice of life I''m happy to share - Yes it does. "<br/> <br/>I wish more people looked at photography for this reason :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Ditto that!<br/> <br/>And love the word "Squiffy"!<br/> <br/>Wonderful, heartwarming entry!</td>', 'Originally posted by jmsetzler: "Is it the best image I have taken? Not even close; does it capture a slice of life I''m happy to share - Yes it does. " I wish more people looked at photography for this reason :)  Ditto that! And love the word "Squiffy"! Wonderful, heartwarming entry!', '2009-03-25 06:43:58.000000', NULL, 0),
