(5403658, 771819, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love how the trees look like an oil painting overlayed onto a photograph.  This must be a beautiful sight as you are travelling this road to your cabin.  Now you need to add a shot of the cabin and create a diptych!</td>', 'I love how the trees look like an oil painting overlayed onto a photograph.  This must be a beautiful sight as you are travelling this road to your cabin.  Now you need to add a shot of the cabin and create a diptych!', '2009-03-27 08:53:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5403975, 770432, 67258, '<td valign="top">Flawless, indeed - I actually gave this a 4 for the fact that I liked the concept.</td>', 'Flawless, indeed - I actually gave this a 4 for the fact that I liked the concept.', '2009-03-27 14:17:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5403977, 770698, 67258, '<td valign="top">She certainly looks a little gem - I really liked the way her body was turned away from the viewer, and that she was turned towards us - it somehow gives the feeling that the viewer has called out to her and she has turned to see who is calling.  A very pleasing portrait.</td>', 'She certainly looks a little gem - I really liked the way her body was turned away from the viewer, and that she was turned towards us - it somehow gives the feeling that the viewer has called out to her and she has turned to see who is calling.  A very pleasing portrait.', '2009-03-27 14:19:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5403978, 772267, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot, it evokes feelings of care-free summers.  I think it appeals to my romantic notion of the person I want to be...</td>', 'I like this a lot, it evokes feelings of care-free summers.  I think it appeals to my romantic notion of the person I want to be...', '2009-03-27 14:20:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(5403979, 771917, 67258, '<td valign="top">I remember thinking this might be yours when I voted.  The grasses intrigue me with the patterns they make - I wonder if they lie flat because of the weight of the snow that has rested on them, or because of flooding from the stream.  A really pleasing composition.</td>', 'I remember thinking this might be yours when I voted.  The grasses intrigue me with the patterns they make - I wonder if they lie flat because of the weight of the snow that has rested on them, or because of flooding from the stream.  A really pleasing composition.', '2009-03-27 14:23:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(5403983, 771049, 67258, '<td valign="top">I like this, not least because I am a cat lover.  I like the way the windows reflected in the bottom pane fly out from themselves.  I like the way the reflection of the trees appears to be the dream of the cat.  I like the way the reflection of the same building in the two different panes appears to be two different scenes.</td>', 'I like this, not least because I am a cat lover.  I like the way the windows reflected in the bottom pane fly out from themselves.  I like the way the reflection of the trees appears to be the dream of the cat.  I like the way the reflection of the same building in the two different panes appears to be two different scenes.', '2009-03-27 14:27:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(5403987, 771673, 67258, '<td valign="top">I voted this unjustly low when voting - I gave all photos at least two viewings, but for some reason although I looked at this, I didn''t really SEE it.  I really like the patterns of the snow on the frozen river.  The perfectly lit domed building peeking out provides the perfect foil to the wide vista.</td>', 'I voted this unjustly low when voting - I gave all photos at least two viewings, but for some reason although I looked at this, I didn''t really SEE it.  I really like the patterns of the snow on the frozen river.  The perfectly lit domed building peeking out provides the perfect foil to the wide vista.', '2009-03-27 14:31:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5404002, 772383, 67258, '<td valign="top">I looked at this for some time when I first went through the photos in the challenge.  It reminds me of myself, and that made me uncomfortable.  I see a feeling of anxiety, of concern; that the photo encourages some viewers to explain it in terms of their own experiences and character is a strength of the image and the way in which it is presented.  Thank you for entering it.</td>', 'I looked at this for some time when I first went through the photos in the challenge.  It reminds me of myself, and that made me uncomfortable.  I see a feeling of anxiety, of concern; that the photo encourages some viewers to explain it in terms of their own experiences and character is a strength of the image and the way in which it is presented.  Thank you for entering it.', '2009-03-27 14:46:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5404004, 771273, 67258, '<td valign="top">How cold that water looks!  The pose of the would-be surfer adds to the sense of coldness - he does look rather reluctant to join his fellow surfer!</td>', 'How cold that water looks!  The pose of the would-be surfer adds to the sense of coldness - he does look rather reluctant to join his fellow surfer!', '2009-03-27 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 0),
