(5404740, 772311, 86895, '<td valign="top">Oh, very surreal! The title is very fitting. Maybe a closer crop would help, my eye goes straight down the row of trees.  I like it, but it may not have been your objective.</td>', 'Oh, very surreal! The title is very fitting. Maybe a closer crop would help, my eye goes straight down the row of trees.  I like it, but it may not have been your objective.', '2009-03-28 02:15:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(5405522, 770792, 62642, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments, with the exception of whoever said "good luck on your brown."  Before fooling around with color, the brick was the only item that was purple before doing so.  Actually, it was the only photo I had easy access to that I hadn''t previously entered int a challenge.  I know it''s not the best thing in the world, but I wanted to participate.  Ha!  I can''t help but wonder what it would have scored if I had submitted it as the proper size.<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments, with the exception of whoever said "good luck on your brown."  Before fooling around with color, the brick was the only item that was purple before doing so.  Actually, it was the only photo I had easy access to that I hadn''t previously entered int a challenge.  I know it''s not the best thing in the world, but I wanted to participate.  Ha!  I can''t help but wonder what it would have scored if I had submitted it as the proper size. Thanks again.', '2009-03-28 17:51:50.000000', NULL, 0),
