(5457281, 771161, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh Peet!  This brings tears to my eyes.  Its not from sadness really - I think a better description would be that it brings tears to my eyes and a lump in my throat because of how intensely the emotion emanates from this photo!  He is so beautiful, and you have photographed him in such a deeply moving -- powerful -- way!   Even moreso since I have grown to adore him so much from our Facebook friendship!<br/> <br/>We live in such a fallen world where pure souls like Kosie have to suffer so undeservingly!   But his heart is so grounded in his "real" home -- his eternal home in the center of God''s heart so there is a hope deep inside him that nothing shakes.  This world has dealt Kosie and you who love him so much a terrible blow -- but one day, it WILL be made right!  And what I love about thinking about that day -- and I''ve shared this with him too -- is that I am going to get to enjoy dancing and hanging out with him never to suffer again -- forever!  <br/> <br/>THANK YOU for sharing this with me!  I missed it in the challenge and I''m so glad to have seen it.   It will stay with me long after I click away to go about other things!  But I''m putting it in my favorites so I can come back and look at it often!   (((  Hugs to you AND to your beautiful son!  ))) <br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh Peet!  This brings tears to my eyes.  Its not from sadness really - I think a better description would be that it brings tears to my eyes and a lump in my throat because of how intensely the emotion emanates from this photo!  He is so beautiful, and you have photographed him in such a deeply moving -- powerful -- way!   Even moreso since I have grown to adore him so much from our Facebook friendship! We live in such a fallen world where pure souls like Kosie have to suffer so undeservingly!   But his heart is so grounded in his "real" home -- his eternal home in the center of God''s heart so there is a hope deep inside him that nothing shakes.  This world has dealt Kosie and you who love him so much a terrible blow -- but one day, it WILL be made right!  And what I love about thinking about that day -- and I''ve shared this with him too -- is that I am going to get to enjoy dancing and hanging out with him never to suffer again -- forever!   THANK YOU for sharing this with me!  I missed it in the challenge and I''m so glad to have seen it.   It will stay with me long after I click away to go about other things!  But I''m putting it in my favorites so I can come back and look at it often!   (((  Hugs to you AND to your beautiful son!  )))  ', '2009-04-29 12:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(5458295, 771673, 35545, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if the white spots on the river are too exaggerated or not, because I''ve never see that much snow, but I do love the far shore and the brooding sky.  The Jefferson Memorial is perfect.</td>', 'I don''t know if the white spots on the river are too exaggerated or not, because I''ve never see that much snow, but I do love the far shore and the brooding sky.  The Jefferson Memorial is perfect.', '2009-04-30 00:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5463230, 770477, 90495, '<td valign="top">Creating supposed art where there isn''t any is an art form in itself and those, who by viewing supposed art, invent art in their minds for the purpose of being able to <i>see</i> art, are not <i>seeing</i> what is there in front of them but imagining it for fear of feeling left out for not <i>seeing</i> anything.<br/> <br/>That''s what I see.<br/> <br/>***note 26/08/09<br/> <br/>I must have been drunk<br/>Though I do not drink<br/>While I wrote this junk<br/>Did I bother to think?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-26 22:19:46.</i></td>', 'Creating supposed art where there isn''t any is an art form in itself and those, who by viewing supposed art, invent art in their minds for the purpose of being able to see art, are not seeing what is there in front of them but imagining it for fear of feeling left out for not seeing anything. That''s what I see. ***note 26/08/09 I must have been drunkThough I do not drinkWhile I wrote this junkDid I bother to think?', '2009-05-02 09:25:32.000000', '2009-08-26 23:19:46.000000', 0),
