(7227145, 772548, 60173, '<td valign="top">Ahh, a beautiful Maine fall. Great colors, as to be expected. I really like your composition. The high perspective makes me feel like I could be on that train, and the leading line of the tracks makes me feel like we''re going somewhere. It would be a really fat train, but it seems possible that a person on the train could have taken this photo. Though, I will say, watch out for that branch!</td>', 'Ahh, a beautiful Maine fall. Great colors, as to be expected. I really like your composition. The high perspective makes me feel like I could be on that train, and the leading line of the tracks makes me feel like we''re going somewhere. It would be a really fat train, but it seems possible that a person on the train could have taken this photo. Though, I will say, watch out for that branch!', '2014-06-11 13:32:28.000000', NULL, 0),
